window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4501,"title":"Chapter 4501: Another Natural Treasure appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4501: Another Natural Treasure appears","Editor: Henyee Translations","This old Venerate Tier could be considered one of Brother Monkey’s internal demons, having suppressed Brother Monkey for several thousand years.","—In his whole life, when had Brother Monkey ever suffered such a loss?","If it was not for the fact that the old Venerate Tier was still apprehensive that the Battle Saint Emperor had not died, and feared that this Saint Emperor would suddenly return, Brother Monkey probably would not have the possibility of revenge either. He would have long since been blasted into smithereens.","This naturally made Brother Monkey furious. However, the old Venerate Tier had long since fled, and after he became a Venerate, he did not know where to look for him.","Brother Monkey had really travelled far and wide to look for him, only to find him easily this tim.","Needless to say, after Ling Xi and Fu Tianxing returned, they must have told him about the old Venerate Tier’s appearance. How could Brother Monkey hold himself back? He tore a rip into space and rushed over at the first instant.","...","They didn’t take the old Venerate to heart. He was merely at the Pseudo Venerate Tier, so if Ling Han had enough time, he would be able to grind him to death. It wasn’t necessary for him to rely on the Energy Jade.","However, would the Ziwei Imperial Clan send someone over?","Forget it, who cares.","Right now, there was nothing much left to do on the Moonlight Planet. His daughter and son-in-law had already left.","After returning to Celestial Sea Planet, Ling Han continued to guide them in cultivating.","The large black dog and the others were presently rushing over. Even if Ling Han wanted to make his next move, he would first meet up with them.","Ling Han definitely wouldn’t use the Galaxy Network anymore. The Chang Clan was clearly able to control the Galaxy Network, and it wasn’t as transcendent as they made it out to be. Thus, if he logged in on the Galaxy Network, it would be equivalent to telling everyone that he was still alive.","This was a rare opportunity. He had just created a deception of his death, so how could his persona be destroyed so quickly?","A few days later, the large black dog and the others arrived.","They hadn’t been brought here by the Nine Mountains Saint. Did they really think that Saints could be ordered around as they pleased?","Hence, they spent a very long time on their way here.","This time, almost everyone who had come out of the Genesis World had returned. His old friends had all gathered, talking about their experiences over the years. They were all extremely rueful.","“Yi?” Brother Monkey’s eyes involuntarily lit up when he saw the seven babies.","“Brother Monkey, what did you discover?” Ling Han knew that there was something unusual about the seven babies. They didn’t need to cultivate at all, yet their abilities kept increasing.","“Natural Treasure!” Brother Monkey said.","Yi?","‘What are you talking about?’","“Them?” Ling Han pointed at the babies.","Meanwhile, the seven babies cocked their heads and looked at Brother Monkey, not afraid at all.","“That’s right.” Brother Monkey nodded. “Heavenly Dao is truly amazing. Old Sun has always thought that Numinous Treasures were all gourd-like items. I never thought that they would actually take human form.”","Hold on, Brother Monkey, the aspect you are complaining about is not mistaken. These seven babies all popped out of the gourd.","Ling Han’s expression was awkward. The creativity of Heavenly Dao was really limited, for Brother Monkey to guess so accurately.","“Strange, they seem to have suffered some kind of injury, so they turned back into their original form and were nurtured again,” Brother Monkey said.","The seven babies were at a loss, and could only look adorable.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head, and he said, “In the past, the Celestial Sea Planet was far larger than it is now, and its level was also higher. In the past, there were Saints stationed here, but this is a weak point that is connected to the Netherworld. In the past, Yin souls appeared in large numbers, leading to the death of Saints.”","“Perhaps, the babies participated in this battle, but in the end, they were severely injured, and had no choice but to transform into their original form, and be nurtured by the heaven and earth again.”","Brother Monkey nodded, “That is indeed very possible.”","He had not thought that the babies would have such origins. Though Ling Han’s deduction was not necessarily accurate, they were actually Natural Treasures, and were of the same level as the pearl in Ling Han’s hand.","No wonder they had all kinds of Mystical Powers the moment they were born.","Yi, their cultivation levels were always the same as his. Could it be that because the babies acknowledged him as their father, so there was a mysterious power taking effect?","In the case of Natural Treasures, the limit was Saint Grade!","Thus, once he became a Saint, his seven children would also become Saints?","This was awesome. Eight Saints had appeared all at once, and putting aside any mention of an Imperial Weapon, this was enough to crush any Imperial Clan.","Thinking about it, they were all very expectant.","Since he had nothing else to do, Ling Han bought a Galaxy Network connection device and put it on those people who had never connected to the Galaxy Network before, asking them to help him find out where any major auctions were held.","He had treasure fluid that could increase one’s life force in his possession. Uh, let’s call it Strengthening Fluid. He planned to sell it to those old Venerate Tiers and Sect Masters whose vitality was waning, in exchange for treasures or Celestial medicines that contained Celestial Qi.","Treasures could be exchanged for things to improve one’s own strength, and that was what it meant to make the most of everything.","There really was one!","Perhaps it was because Ling Han, Yang Yihuan and the others had dealt too great a blow to the Golden Generation, the various Imperial Clans decided to spend even more effort to nurture the Golden Generation. Thus, they would hold a super-large auction, inviting everyone in the universe to participate.","It was announced in the name of the Imperial Clans that this auction would definitely be fair and just, and there would definitely be nothing fishy going on.","Moreover, no matter what kind of criminal you were, as long as you brought treasures to participate, there would definitely be no one who would dare to harm you.","Everything could be discussed after the auction ended.","Looking at the time, it was still early. There was still more than a year.","It wasn’t that the Imperial Clans didn’t want to have it sooner, but rather that the universe was far too large. From the moment they received the news to the moment they rushed over, just how long would they need?","Even if there was the Galaxy Network, which was connected to the entire universe, in the case of Mystery Realms, the Galaxy Network was still cut off. Some would only receive the news after they came out.","Thus, setting a one-year preparation period was already considered very, very short.","Ling Han rubbed his hands in anticipation. He was naturally going to participate in this kind of gathering.","By doing this,it was equivalent to using the full power of the universe to help the Golden Generations increase their cultivation level, so that they could become Saints as soon as possible. Thus, Ling Han naturally had to make the most of his time. Otherwise, when the Golden Generations became Saints, it would still be relatively troublesome.","He discussed with Brother Monkey, and the two of them decided to set out after more than half a year.","“Oh, that’s right!” Ling Han told Brother Monkey about the black chains entwined around his fruit of cultivation. This person was the descendant of the Saint Emperor, and he himself was a Venerate Tier, so he should be very knowledgeable.","However, Brother Monkey was also very confused when he heard this. What the hell was this?","“Old Sun will go in and take a look,” Brother Monkey said, and his figure instantly shrunk. Xiu, he had entered into Ling Han’s mind.","Er, you are going to enter immediately after saying so? Aren’t you going to discuss this with me first?","What if I’m a clean freak?","Ling Han mocked for a while, then sighed. He had been seriously influenced by Jing Haoran.","After a while, Brother Monkey appeared again.","“Brother, this Old Sun doesn’t know either.” Brother Monkey shook his head, then said seriously, “But I’m afraid... it’s not good news.”","“What do you mean?” Ling Han asked.","“There’s a limit to how far these chains can go. However, your fruit of cultivation is constantly growing, so...” Brother Monkey stopped.","However, Ling Han knew that as the fruit of cultivation grew, the chains remained unchanged, so there were only two possibilities. Firstly, the chains would explode, and secondly, the fruit of cultivation would be restricted and unable to grow any further.","But it should be known that these black chains were formed by a heaven’s calamity!","When Ling Han had broken through, the heaven’s calamity had caused such a huge commotion, yet he hadn’t suffered any damage at all. Thus, he refused to believe that the black chains could easily explode."]},{"number":4502,"title":"Chapter 4502: Visitors from Baili Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4502: Visitors from Baili Clan","Editor: Henyee Translations","However, the problem was that if he wanted to break through to the fourth pinnacle level, he would have to let the fruit of cultivation grow to the extreme, and then turn it into four pillars that supported the sky.","If it continued to be trapped by the black chains, how would the fruit of cultivation evolve into the Fourth Extreme?","Ling Han frowned upon hearing this. He was far too freakish, yet he hadn’t committed any heinous crimes. Thus, the Heavenly Dao had placed a shackle on him, forever trapping him at the level of Sect Master?","This was the restriction of heaven and earth!","Ling Han was only troubled for a moment, before he immediately strengthened his resolve.","“So what if it is the shackles of heaven and earth? I will definitely be able to break them!”","...","“Furthermore, I have to break through the shackles of heaven and earth to become a Venerate Tier, so I would definitely be countless times stronger than the average Venerate Tier!”","In fact, after he became a Venerate, he would be even more awesome than when he became a Sect Master, and his ability to battle above his cultivation level was even stronger.","Instead, he was filled with anticipation. Fighting with the power of heaven and earth was endlessly enjoyable.","Because most of the Sect Masters of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire had already been killed, this was the moment when their ranks were at its weakest. Faced with such a great opportunity, even if Chen Fengyan did not want to borrow Brother Monkey’s power, it was still not to be missed.","He rose up, leading the Celestial Sea Planet to become independent, and took the chance to take the Moonlight Planet under his banner as well.","Tens of thousands of years ago, the Celestial Sea Planet was subordinate to the Moonlight Planet, and now the situation was reversed, which made Chen Fengyan feel very pleased.","This was their Chen Clan’s long-cherished wish and ambition.","He had taken in a subordinate planet, and there were too many things to do, so Chen Fengyan was so busy that he didn’t even have time to sleep. Naturally, he couldn’t care less about paying his respects to Brother Monkey every few days.","The moon hung high in the sky.","Chen Fengyan was still reviewing the memorials. There were so many things happening on the Moonlight Planet, and they involved the conflicts of interest of many forces, so he had to handle them carefully.","Although he was powerful enough to suppress them, he couldn’t rule a planet by himself. He needed the help of a large number of people. Thus, he had to deal with the balance of power.","This was probably the so-called art of an emperor.","‘Hmm?’","Chen Fengyan suddenly raised his head, and saw that two people had appeared in the palace at some unknown time.","At first, he thought it was Brother Monkey and Ling Han, but looking again, it wasn’t the two of them.","He couldn’t help but grit his teeth. What was going on?","He had just broken through to the level of Sect Master. In the surrounding galaxy, this was the strongest level of strength. He had initially thought that he could reign supreme for a while. He had not thought that there would be Brother Monkey and Ling Han first, and then these two people later.","‘Are you guys here to strike a blow to my pride?’","“Who are you people?” Chen Fengyan asked calmly. He was completely unafraid.","This was both the domineering aura of an emperor, and also because Brother Monkey and Ling Han were both on the Celestial Sea Planet. If anything really happened, rushing over to help would only take an instant.","The two people who had suddenly appeared were both middle-aged men who looked to be in their forties. However, the aura they exuded was extremely terrifying, and neither of them was inferior to Chen Fengyan.","They were all at the level of Sect Master!","The man in the red embroidered robes spoke first, and asked, “So you are Chen Fengyan?”","This was too arrogant!","Chen Fengyan suppressed the flames of rage in his heart. He also made a pressing motion with his hands, signaling for the guards to step back. If they stepped forward, they would only be seeking death.","“It’s me!”","“It’s good that it’s you.” The man in the red embroidered robes nodded, “My name is Baili Chuan, and I come from the Ziwei Imperial Clan.”","Imperial Clan!","Chen Fengyan’s heart involuntarily jolted. To say nothing of him, even the elites of the Holy Land would be moved upon hearing the words “Imperial Clan”.","For a long time, the Imperial Clan represented the authority of heaven and earth, and was publicly acknowledged as the strongest force, transcendent above all else.","The passage of time would weaken any force, and only the Imperial Clan was an exception.","It was as if they did not belong to this realm. They were high and noble, looking down as the rest of the universe prospered and declined.","Although Chen Fengyan was still furious, he suppressed his anger and asked, “Why have the two of you sought me out?”","The other man in green waved at Chen Fengyan and said, “We’re the ones asking you now, so you only need to answer.”","This attitude was too arrogant, and too disdainful!","Chen Fengyan wanted to flip out at this moment, but when he recalled the backgrounds of these two people, he forcefully suppressed the urge.","The Imperial Clan was such a colossal being.","He took a deep breath, and did not speak further.","Meanwhile, Baili Chuan completely did not take Chen Fengyan’s displeasure to heart. When the Imperial Clan did things, what need was there for them to care about the feelings of others?","They were divine dragons above the Nine Heavens, and the rest were mediocre, only worthy of looking up at them.","Now that they were willing to lower themselves, Chen Fengyan should be grateful and honored for the rest of his life.","“Originally, Moonlight Planet was chosen by the Ziwei Imperial Clan. If you take it without asking, that would be a great disrespect!” he said calmly, “However, since what is done is already done, I can’t be bothered to cause any more trouble.”","“How about this? As long as you obey obediently in future, you will still be the emperor. However, you need to guide your citizens to believe in this senior of our clan.”","He took out a portrait and unfolded it in front of Chen Fengyan, saying, “This is a portrait of Venerate Even Sun from our clan. He’s about to break through to the Saint Tier, so he needs your power of belief.”","Chen Fengyan shook his head without any hesitation, and said, “Impossible!”","Although Brother Monkey didn’t make any requests, Chen Fengyan had already made his decision. He wanted the citizens under his rule to worship Brother Monkey and provide him with power of belief.","Even if Brother Monkey didn’t need external power to break through to the Saint Tier, what about after becoming a Saint?","The power of belief could increase the battle prowess of Saints, and at certain times, it could even save their lives. Thus, he definitely had to leave a trump card for Brother Monkey.","Chen Fengyan’s refusal caught Baili Chuan and his companion by surprise. They both faltered upon hearing this.","Yi, shouldn’t it just be a matter of notifying him?","Next, they only needed to give Chen Fengyan some guidance on how to build a sacred temple and how to perform the ceremony of faith.","They had actually been rejected?","“Chen Fengyan, can you repeat yourself?” the man in green asked. There was a look of disbelief on his face.","His name was Baili Yi.","After Chen Fengyan said no, he had already calmed down. Since he had already decided to become hostile, he naturally wouldn’t be so cautious anymore. He said calmly, “You guys can leave now!”","“Chen Fengyan!” Baili Chuan shouted loudly. Did he think they were beggars? That he could chase them away with a wave of his hand?","Chen Fengyan’s expression became stern, and he said, “You’ve barged into my Imperial Palace, and I haven’t even settled scores with you yet. Yet, you’re acting so aggressive?”","“Haha, just a local emperor!” Baili Yi smirked coldly, “Fine, I will kill you, and then establish a new emperor. I don’t believe that every single one would be as stubborn as you!”","He reached over to grab Chen Fengyan.","“Humph! Let’s battle in the sky!” Chen Fengyan didn’t face this attack head-on. Instead, he charged into the sky.","If Sect Masters started a battle, the destructive power would be too great.","Baili Chuan and Baili Yi exchanged a glance before also soaring into the sky.","Chen Fengyan had only just advanced to the level of Sect Master. Meanwhile, one of them was a four-star elite, while the other was a six-star elite. To say nothing of the fact that they had both come from the Imperial Clan, even if they were just ordinary Sect Masters, they would still be able to easily kill Chen Fengyan.","Boom!","They entered into the distance, and Baili Yi moved again, grabbing out at Chen Fengyan.","“A mere One Star Sect Master, I can crush you to death with a single finger!”"]},{"number":4503,"title":"Chapter 4503: Impersonating the name of a dead person","paragraphs":["Chapter 4503: Impersonating the name of a dead person","Editor: Henyee Translations","Baili Yi was not exaggerating. He was a Four-Star Sect Master, and had also mastered the Imperial Technique. Though he had not cultivated the Imperial Scroll, his battle prowess far surpassed any ordinary Four-Star Sect Master.","Under the control of the Imperial Technique, the Regulations displayed 100% or even 200% of their might.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","In just a few moves, Chen Fengyan was completely at a disadvantage. He didn’t even have the power to parry, and could only dodge and evade.","However, Chen Fengyan wasn’t flustered at all. In fact, he wasn’t nervous at all. This was because he knew that powerful reinforcements would appear at any moment.","“Though your strength is overwhelmingly weak, your composure still makes me feel slight admiration,” Baili Yi said. Though he said it was admiration, there was only a lofty pride on his face.","...","“Heh, he should be stubborn!” Baili Chuan shook his head, “Hurry up and kill him. We have to find a representative as soon as possible, so Ancestor would not punish us.”","“All right!”","Baili Yi increased the intensity of his attacks. Boom, boom, boom! Fierce attacks rained down one after another, making it difficult for Chen Fengyan to even dodge.","Pu, pu, pu! Blood continued to pour from Chen Fengyan’s body.","His opponent was too strong, and he really could not hold up to him.","As time passed, Chen Fengyan also started to feel uneasy. ‘F*ck! Brother Monkey and Ling Han didn’t run away, did they?’","If he still took it head-on like this, he would really be courting death.","‘Still not appearing? Still not appearing!’","Chen Fengyan started to panic. Was there really no one here?","F***, he decided to run.","“Haha, you only know fear now?” Baili Yi smirked coldly, “It’s too late!”","He stretched out a palm, which turned into a colossal hand, wanting to crush Chen Fengyan to death.","Chen Fengyan was unable to dodge this attack.","Just as Chen Fengyan was about to lose hope, pu! A streak of light shot over, instantly blasting a hole into Baili Yi’s large hand. Although this palm strike had grabbed down, it had still allowed Chen Fengyan to easily escape from the hole that had been created.","“Did you feel like you’re going to die?” Ling Han appeared and asked Chen Fengyan with a smile.","‘Holy f*ck!’","Chen Fengyan was rendered speechless. This was definitely deliberate.","Ling Han must have been nearby all this while, but he only made a move when he was close to his limit.","How could they screw over their junior like this?","“En?” Baili Yi stared at Ling Han, his face filled with surprise. Wasn’t there only one Sect Master in the Dark North Nation? Why had another suddenly appeared?","“Who are you?” he asked.","“Ao, ao, ao, that’s your Grandpa Ling!” The large black dog appeared, his face filled with lofty arrogance. Then, he pointed at himself, “This is Grandpa Dog!”","“Grandpa Dragon is still the best!” The little azure dragon also appeared.","With a “snort”, the perverted pig was also carried over, but only gave a few humphs, showing that he had also made his presence known.","“If you don’t perform well, let’s do it again!” The large black dog and the little azure dragon instantly threw punches and kicks at the perverted pig.","The perverted pig’s face was bruised and battered. Now, the large black dog and the little azure dragon were both Spirit Transformation True Lords. Their abilities were no longer inferior to his, so his thick defenses wouldn’t be of much use.","“Lord Pig is here!” he humphed. What a bunch of b@stards. He had been courting girls, so why did they have to bring him along?","Baili Yi and Baili Chuan were both very confused. You mere Spirit Transformation True Lords act so awesome, but you are still far from being awesome, all right?","They both focused their gazes on Ling Han, feeling that this combination was very familiar.","“Do you need a hint?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Humph, who cares who you are? To dare ruin the matters of our clan, no one can save you!” Baili Yi declared coldly. He moved directly, and charged towards Ling Han.","This time, he was considerably more cautious. After all, Ling Han had shattered his attack with a single punch. He could not be underestimated.","Ling Han was unconcerned, and casually parried.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Judging from the situation, Baili Yi was completely on the upper hand, as if victory was in his grasp. However, he knew very well that though Ling Han was only on the defensive, his power was extremely deep. Merely the rebound caused his whole body to tremble violently.","It should be known that after advancing into Sect Master-level, the effects of power had further decreased, and Regulations was the true way to go.","Thus, the rebound caused his entire body to tremble violently. Just how strong was Ling Han’s power? Just how much stronger was he than him?","How could there be such a freakish Minor Advanced Tier?","“Who exactly are you?” Baili Yi shouted loudly.","“Alright, since you want to know so much, I’ll tell you.” Ling Han smiled, “I am Ling Han.”","“Hoho!” Baili Yi merely smirked coldly, not believing it in the slightest.","What a colossal joke.","Who didn’t know that Ling Han had already been smacked to death by the Fire Leaving Saint?","At that time, there had been a considerable number of Saints present, and they had all seen very clearly. With a single strike, Ling Han had not managed to tear a rip into space in time to escape at all, and was directly crushed into dust.","Just ask, which Sect Master would be able to survive the attack of a Saint?","To say nothing of a Sect Master, even Venerate Tier elites would die if it was them.","Thus, Ling Han was definitely already dead, as dead as could be.","“Young man, if you want to become famous, you don’t have to pretend to be a dead person!”","Ling Han faltered upon hearing this. Yi, he had spoken the truth, yet no one believed him?","In that case, what was the point of pretending? He could directly show his true appearance. In any case, others would only think that he was impersonating Ling Han.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “If you don’t believe me, then forget it. I can’t be bothered to explain. Moreover, you guys are going to become corpses anyway, so there’s no need to waste my breath.”","“Haha, where is your confidence coming from?” Baili Yi laughed loudly. Though he was no match for Ling Han in terms of power, he was not the slightest bit inferior in terms of Regulations! Furthermore, even if he was no match, there was still Baili Chuan, wasn’t there?","He used the Imperial Technique, and increased the intensity of his attacks, wanting to kill Ling Han forcefully.","Ling Han also lost his patience, and began to counterattack.","He did not need to use any secret techniques, and merely moved casually. However, he had already walked out on his own path of cultivation, and every move he made was an amazing move. If it was not for the fact that he was limited by his cultivation level, every move he made could be called Imperial Technique.","How could Baili Yi possibly endure this?","In just two or three moves, he was completely suppressed. That gap was not just a little bit, but rather absolute.","“Let me!” Baili Chuan could no longer sit still. This disadvantage was too obvious.","Meanwhile, Chen Fengyan was feeling rueful. Ling Han’s strength was truly terrifying. Though there was a gap of two stars between their cultivation levels, he knew himself well. Even if he was also a Three Star Sect Master, he would still be defeated by Baili Yi.","Without waiting for Baili Yi to withdraw from the battle, Baili Chuan had already charged over, launching an attack at Ling Han.","Even if it was two against one, who would dare speak badly of the Imperial Clan?","Boom! He unleashed his six-star strength, unleashing eight flashes of Regulations as he did so.","Impressive!","Chen Fengyan exclaimed in his mind. If it were him, he would probably be insta-killed if he faced this attack head-on.","Eight streaks of Regulations!","Ling Han shook his head, “I hate people who don’t abide by the rules the most!” He casually threw a punch at Baili Chuan.","Peng!","With this strike, Baili Chuan’s body instantly exploded.","W-what?","Chen Fengyan and Baili Yi were both transfixed with shock.","Hey, hey, hey, this was too ridiculous, wasn’t it?","That was a Six Star Sect Master, and he more so had an eight-star battle prowess. How had he been insta-killed?"]},{"number":4504,"title":"Chapter 4504: Imperial Son is defeated","paragraphs":["Chapter 4504: Imperial Son is defeated","Editor: Henyee Translations","Because he was too stunned, Baili Yi even forgot to make a move.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Huh? Why aren’t you fighting anymore? Attack! What are you standing around for?”","Attack your sister!","I am only a Four-Star Sect Master, and my battle prowess is only five stars, which is far inferior to Baili Chuan.","Are you playing around with me?","Though he had been at a disadvantage just now, he felt that the gap was just that little bit. How could it be possible that in Baili Chuan’s case, he had been insta-killed with a single punch?","...","Baili Yi’s whole body was trembling. Only now did he know that the “corpses” that Ling Han had just mentioned was not an empty boast, but rather that the latter really had such terrifying abilities.","However, he couldn’t figure it out no matter what. Ling Han was too young. Was there such a young and terrifying Sect Master in the world?","“Are you Yang Yihuan, or Myriad Dao?” he guessed repeatedly, “Or He Luo, Origin, Heaven Crushing?”","Ling Han sighed, and said, “I already told you, I am Ling Han! Ling Han!”","Baili Yi’s expression was filled with grief and indignation. He was about to die, yet the other was still toying with him, unwilling to reveal his true identity. It was clear that he wanted him to die without even knowing who his murderer was.","“You’ve gone too far!” he roared.","Ling Han also wore an aggrieved expression. ‘I f*cking told you!’","“I’m about to die from fury!” he humphed, and threw a punch. Peng, Baili Yi was instantly turned into pieces of blood and flesh.","Meanwhile, the large black dog, little azure dragon, and the pervert pig were all roaring with laughter. It was rare to see Ling Han suffer in such a way.","Meanwhile, Chen Fengyan gritted his teeth. He had already overestimated Ling Han. However, he still hadn’t imagined that Ling Han would be so powerful.","He was only a Three Star Sect Master, yet he could insta-kill Baili Chuan, who had an eight-star battle prowess.","Heavens, just how strong was Ling Han’s ultimate battle prowess?","“Little Han, you didn’t expect this, did you?” The large black dog patted Ling Han’s shoulder, “My condolences. Who asked you to put up an act of your own death?”","“That’s right. Even the Saint has confirmed it, and you’re a f****** dead man. Even if you tell the whole world that you’re not dead, no one would believe you.” The little azure dragon also hit him when he was down.","“Ang, ang.” The pervert pig humphed, and nodded continuously.","Ling Han lamented. Even if he publicly announced that he had not died, the Imperial Clans would definitely step out at the first instant to “clarify” that he was an imposter, in order to maintain the dignity of the Saints. Then, they would mobilize elites to kill him.","Thus, he could only wait until he was powerful enough to be unafraid of being hunted down by Saints. Only then would the whole world believe that Ling Han had really not died.","“You killed members of the Imperial Clan, so I’m sure they won’t let the matter slide,” Chen Fengyan said.","Ling Han nodded in understanding. The Ziwei Clan would most likely send elites over soon, and this time, it would most likely be Venerate Tier elites.","However, he had no choice but to make a move. Could it be that he would have to watch helplessly as Chen Fengyan died?","Who cares? Counter soldiers with arms, and water with an earth weir.","The group returned to the Celestial Sea Planet to cultivate and play around as usual. Since they couldn’t avoid it, they would face it calmly. What was there to worry about?","Sure enough, the deaths of the two Sect Masters enraged the Ziwei Imperial Clan.","How many years had it been? Someone actually dared to provoke the authority of the Imperial Clan?","If it was not for the fact that Ling Han was already dead, they would all suspect that the culprit was Ling Han.","(Ling Han: “...”)","No matter what, they had to find the culprit and bring him to justice, to show the might of the Imperial Clan.","Everyone in the world knew that the Imperial Clan couldn’t be offended. Whoever dared to offend them would die!","Thus, this precedent definitely could not be broken by the Ziwei Imperial Clan.","However, only two Sect Masters had died, so it was naturally impossible that Saints would be mobilized.","Venerate Tier was enough.","Furthermore, who had they sent out?","Imperial Son Tian!","A Golden Generation, even if he was only a Two Star Venerate Tier now, was enough to sweep aside all opposition.","After a few days, Imperial Son Tian arrived.","He arrived above the Celestial Sea Planet, unleashing a terrifying killing intent that enveloped the entire planet.","With his strength, he was completely capable of blasting Celestial Sea Planet into pieces. Furthermore, he was standing in the galaxy, so even if the planet exploded, he would still be able to calmly dodge the shockwave.","However, what the Imperial Clan wanted was the power of belief, so they naturally couldn’t destroy it like this.","Thus, he directly used his killing intent as a probe, so that the culprit would appear.","“Scram!” Who would’ve thought that the scene of the culprit panicking, tearing open the Void and fleeing didn’t appear? Instead, a disdainful and extremely domineering shout traveled over from Celestial Sea Planet.","This voice was imbued with a terrifying power, and traveled over at the speed of light, vibrating majestically in the galaxy.","Imperial Son Tian faltered upon hearing this. They had already sensed his aura, yet he still dared to act so wantonly?","He was a Golden Generation elite, and he was also a Two Star Venerate Tier. It could be said that even ordinary Nine Star Venerate Tier elites wouldn’t be able to suppress him. They could only send out a Saint.","However, just how many Saints were there in the world? Which of them would appear on the Celestial Sea Planet? More importantly, what Saint would not give face to the Imperial Clan?","“Who are you, sir?” Imperial Son Tian asked coldly. He did not act rashly. Though the other had only shouted, it made him understand that this mysterious elite was also a Venerate Tier.","No wonder Baili Chuan and Baili Yi had never returned.","“Humph, I told you to get lost, but you didn’t. Do you insist on having Old Sun make a move?” Shua, a figure streaked out from Celestial Sea Planet. His speed was astonishingly fast, and one could vaguely see that he actually had two flaming wings.","Phoenix Wings Divine Flight!","Brother Monkey held the metal rod in his hand, looking down on Imperial Son Tian, showing the kind of arrogance, as if even if a Great Emperor appeared, he would not be able to bend him to his will.","“It’s you!” Imperial Son Tian involuntarily choked.","How could he not recognize Brother Monkey?","The terrible defeat in a battle of equal cultivation levels was caused by Brother Monkey. At that time, he, Lin Xuan, and Imperial Son Ming had joined forces, yet they were still no match for Brother Monkey, leaving him with a strong psychological trauma.","Now that he had met Brother Monkey again, how could his aura not be greatly weakened?","‘F*ck! Why is Brother Monkey here?’","“Scram!” Brother Monkey was irritable, and without another word, directly brandished his staff in a strike.","This was Brother Monkey’s personality. If he could fight, he would definitely not waste time on nonsense.","Imperial Son Tian parried, but Brother Monkey’s natural talent was not inferior to his. Furthermore, Brother Monkey was a three star Venerate Tier elite. With this additional advantage of one star, it had become an insurmountable gulf.","Moreover, Brother Monkey even had a weapon forged from Saintly Material. How could this be a joke?","Under this series of attacks, Imperial Son Tian was completely unable to fight back.","“Monkey, you killed a member of the Imperial Clan. This matter will not end so easily!” Imperial Son Tian threw down these words, and began to flee.","Brother Monkey’s temper flared, and he immediately set off in pursuit.","He unleashed Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. His speed was even faster than Imperial Son Tian.","They fought and fought all the way, crossing almost half the universe. Thankfully, Imperial Son Tian was only slightly inferior to Brother Monkey. Otherwise, he would definitely have been killed.","In the end, the Imperial Son managed to escape back to the Ziwei Imperial Clan.","However, in this manner, the Ziwei Imperial Clan would definitely send out Saints.","“This time, even if I ask the old man to come out, the Baili Clan probably won’t call a ceasefire,” Ling Han said with a frown.","Though they too had a Saint on their side, the Nine Mountains Saint was only a One Star Saint, after all. Furthermore, the reason why the Imperial Clan was so domineering and forceful was because they possessed the Imperial Weapon.","How were they supposed to resolve this dilemma?"]},{"number":4505,"title":"Chapter 4505: Yahe Planet","paragraphs":["Chapter 4505: Yahe Planet","Editor: Henyee Translations","The Imperial Clan, the strongest force in the world, was definitely not just for show.","If Ling Han and Brother Monkey were only by themselves, they would have nothing to fear. If they couldn’t win, they could just run. In future, when they made a comeback, there would be plenty of chances for revenge.","But now, if they still had to drag a Majestic Empire with them, then in a head-on confrontation, how could they possibly be a match for the Imperial Clan?","This was like an egg smashing a rock, shattering at the slightest touch.","Thus, they could only let go of the Celestial Sea Planet.","There was nothing that could be done. Once a colossal being like the Imperial Clan had their eye on a certain planet, unless it was another Imperial Clan, what force would be able to face them head-on?","...","Retreat.","It was not just Ling Han’s own people. The members of the Chen Clan also had to retreat.","Two Sect Masters of the Baili Clan had died here, and as the owner of this place, Chen Fengyan definitely couldn’t stay out of this. Moreover, with how domineering the Imperial Clan was, if they couldn’t find the culprit, they would definitely kill him.","As a result, Chen Fengyan was forced to pack up his belongings and travel to other regions before he had even warmed up to his position as the ruler of a Majestic Empire.","He was still fine. He knew that as long as Brother Monkey and Ling Han were here, there would eventually come a day when they would make a comeback. He only felt a little regret that he had to leave Celestial Sea Planet which his predecessors had shed blood for, but those Imperial Princes were all extremely displeased.","They were really displeased.","Originally, they had already become second-generation young masters of the Majestic Empire, but now? Not only were they beaten back to their original state, they were even forced to flee to a foreign land. How could they accept this?","Especially when they found out that one of the main culprits behind this was actually Ling Han.","F***, it was this guy again!","However, they now knew that Ling Han was not only Chen Fengyan’s senior, but also a Three Star Sect Master. His cultivation level was higher than even their father’s.","So what they could not tolerate it? They still had to endure it!","At the same time, they were also extremely curious. How exactly did Ling Han cultivate? They were clearly about the same age, but why was there such a huge gulf between their cultivation levels?","Ling Han wouldn’t care about the reactions of these small fry. He set up the formation, and didn’t use the Transfer Formation here to avoid being examined by the Imperial Clan in the future, and subsequently traced down.","The large-scale migration began. Of course, Ling Han, Brother Monkey and Chen Fengyan were the last to leave.","They travelled from galaxy to galaxy, from the North Heavenly Realm to the East Heavenly Realm. Only then did this migration finally come to an end.","Not long after, the terrifying saintly might descended. The Ziwei Imperial Clan’s Saint arrived.","This was an unstoppable force. Ling Han and the others immediately used the Transfer Formation to retreat. If they were slightly later, the Saint would use his great power to restrict space. Even if they wanted to leave, they would not be able to.","As they travelled through the universe, they soon met up with the main troops.","Chen Fengyan had been an emperor for so many years, so he naturally knew what to do. There was no need for Ling Han and Brother Monkey to worry.","Counting the time, there were still eight months until the auction jointly hosted by the Imperial Clans would begin.","“It’s still a little early.”","“But we can go and join in on the excitement first.”","They decided to set off. In order to reduce the size of their target, only Ling Han and Brother Monkey would be going this time.","This disappointed the large black dog and the others. They too wanted to join in on the excitement of such a fun event.","Ling Han didn’t notice that some certain guys were whispering to each other every day. It was unknown what they were planning.","Brother Monkey tore open space and set off with Ling Han.","When the Venerate Tier elite moved, his speed was naturally much faster than the Transfer Formation. Furthermore, in the Void, Brother Monkey could also channel Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to increase his speed.","In a mere nine days, they had already arrived at Yahe Planet.","This was where the auction would be held.","Yahe Planet was a renowned medicinal planet. It was rich in all kinds of Celestial medicines, and in terms of cultivation, Celestial medicines were definitely the most valuable resource. Thus, it was very logical for the auction to be held here.","Though there were still eight months until the auction, there were already a great many people who had come here ahead of time. Furthermore, their cultivation level varied greatly. The weakest were only Foundation Building Tiers, those who had just stepped onto the Celestial Path, and there were stronger Sect Masters, and they were still those veteran Sect Masters that had grey hair and were declining in vitality.","The joint ban of the Imperial Clans had already taken effect. In the two years before or after the auction began, it was strictly forbidden for any kind of battle to take place here. Otherwise, they would become the public enemy of the Imperial Clans.","Precisely because of this, the incident of bullying and tyrannizing people on the Yahe Planet was stopped, which showed just how astonishing the intimidation power of the Imperial Clans was.","Although the auction hadn’t begun yet, there were still countless people who had set up stalls outside. Meanwhile, the old Sect Masters whose vitality was declining were all looking for alchemical pills everywhere, hoping to obtain natural treasures that could extend their lifespan and strengthen their vitality.","Ling Han was in no rush to make a move. The Strengthening Fluid was too valuable, and would definitely be fought over madly by the old Sect Masters, the Venerate Tiers, and even the Saints might make a move.","Hence, this would definitely have to be saved for the time of the auction, so that the value could be maximized.","However, he wasn’t idle either. He roamed around, planning to try his luck and see if he could pick up anything.","However, his present cultivation level was too high, and there were pitifully few Celestial medicines that could be of help to him. Not only did no one know where they grew, even if one was lucky enough to encounter them, the surrounding environment would definitely be extremely dangerous, and extremely difficult to harvest.","Thus, after walking around for a few days, Ling Han didn’t find anything.","Ling Han wasn’t discouraged or angry. He was someone who had obtained the fortune of the True Dragon, so how could his luck be bad?","However, after one month, two months, three months, he still did not encounter any good luck.","Thinking about it, it was normal. For a treasure that was on the level of Sect Master, or even higher level, who would take it out and sell it now?","It would definitely be left until the time of the auction, where everyone would fight over it. Only then would it be able to fetch a satisfactory price.","Right now, if Ling Han wanted to obtain a treasure of this level, he would definitely have to encounter someone that was blind. The chances were too, too slim.","Seeing that the auction was getting closer and closer, he also stopped thinking about picking up scraps.","He had best wait for a while longer.","When there was only a month left until the day of the auction, the number of people who had arrived at Yahe Planet suddenly increased explosively. Furthermore, they all came from extremely powerful backgrounds.","Not only had the younger generation come, but there were also a considerable number of older generations. Some came to support their juniors, while some came for themselves. If they obtained some astonishing natural treasures, allowing their cultivation level to break through, this was something that every cultivator would earnestly seek.","Thus, the most popular thing now was the arrival of this and that famous person.","“The Imperial Son Ming of the Golden Generation has arrived!”","“Hiss, that’s a Venerate Tier elite!”","“My ancestor has been stuck at the peak stage of Nine Star Sect Master for more than 10,000 years without breaking through. It looks like his lifespan is about to dry up, but this guy is only over 100 years old, and has already advanced into Venerate Tier. With this comparison, the gap is really too wide.”","“Heh, he’s the Imperial Son, so who can compare?”","“Yi, Imperial Daughter Xue has arrived.”","“She’s truly beautiful. If she wants to, she’ll have a place in the top ten of the Exquisite Leaderboard.”","“Hiss, how could this person have such great killing intent?”","“Heavens! Wherever he goes, passersby will fall!”","Everyone was stunned. Young prodigies appeared one after another. Some of them were really terrifying, and their aura was too shocking."]},{"number":4506,"title":"Chapter 4506: Wu Yue","paragraphs":["Chapter 4506: Wu Yue","Editor: Henyee Translations","Yahe Planet, talented people gathered.","Some had come for the auction, while others had come for fame. Now, how many prodigies had gathered here? As long as they could stand out, their names would immediately spread throughout the world.","That’s right. The Imperial Clans had set a rule that prohibited fights, but with so many people here, how could there possibly be no friction or argument?","Did they all have to just bear with it?","No.","There was a arena here that was especially used to settle personal grudges. In this place, battles and even slaughter could be carried out at will. The Imperial Clans would definitely not interfere to stop them.","...","—If they were afraid of losing or fear death, it was fine if they did not go to the arena. No one could force them.","A great many people that Ling Han had never heard of before all popped up. They were clearly unknown, yet possessed powerful strength, and rose to fame through one duel after another.","However, this kind of prodigy was only limited to prodigies, and was far from being freakish enough to make Ling Han think of them as a rival.","Merely in terms of strength in a battle of equal cultivation levels, there should be no one that could match him in this world. However, looking at history, it was not every generation of Great Emperor that was the strongest in their cultivation level. Take, for example, the Nine Suns Saint. He would frequently be able to defeat the Ancestral King Lingtian, yet the one to have the last laugh was not the Nine Suns Saint.","Thus, whether it was Origin, Myriad Dao, Yang Yihuan or He Luo, they all had the possibility of threatening Ling Han’s chance of becoming Emperor.","However, another few days later, there were more and more powerful prodigies. One of them even moved Ling Han.","For example, there was a young man whose whole body was exuding killing intent. He used a sword, and no matter what opponent he encountered, he would kill the other with a single strike. No one knew how strong his true strength was.","He called himself Wu Yue, but that was all. No one knew his exact origins.","The auction had not begun, but this Wu Yue had already become the person who received the most attention on the Yahe Planet.","He was really too strong. In a consecutive 23 battles, not only had he won all of them, he had killed his enemies with a single strike in every battle, appearing to be at ease.","The last few opponents were the Dao Childs of Holy Lands. Several thousand years ago, they had already cultivated to the peak stage of Nine Stars. However, breaking through to Venerate Tier was too difficult, and required a very long time to stabilize, so they delayed breaking through. However, after so many years, their battle prowess must have been tempered to an incredibly strong extent.","However, they were still insta-killed by Wu Yue.","What was even more shocking was the fact that he was actually only a Five Star Sect Master.","A Five Star Sect Master had insta-killed Nine Stars? Furthermore, Nine Stars that were at the level of Dao Child?","This was really frightening. No wonder when the news spread out, even the Imperial Clans were moved, and sent someone to contact Wu Yue, intending to draw him into the Imperial Clan.","Someone made a prediction; would the current Golden Generation be able to do the same?","The answer was that the Golden Generation Five Star Sect Master could insta-kill a Nine Star Sect Master. However, the opponent could only be an ordinary Sect Master. If the opponent was Dao Child-level, he could be killed, but definitely could not be insta-killed.","This stunned everyone. The Golden Generation had always been synonymous with being the strongest among their peers, yet now, they were forcefully outmatched.","Who exactly was this Wu Yue?","Wu Yue did not agree to any of the invitations from the Imperial Clans. Instead, he stated frankly that he already had a Master, and would never betray them.","Some Imperial Clans were still unwilling to give up, and questioned him closely about which sect he was from. Since they were not able to tempt Wu Yue, they could completely exert pressure on the latter’s sect. They did not believe that there would be any force in this world that could withstand the oppression of the Imperial Clans.","Wu Yue did not hide anything, and told them directly.","The Battle God Palace!","He was actually a seed of the Battle God Palace!","When the news spread out, everyone was shocked.","How was this possible?","A super genius whose battle prowess surpassed Golden Generation was actually a seed of Battle God Palace?","Hiss, what right did the Battle God Palace have?","That’s right. Even the Imperial Clans were unwilling to trifle with this force, not because it was powerful, but because they were wary of the assassination techniques of this force, which could not be guarded against. Furthermore, no one knew where their lair was, so it was impossible to get rid of all of them in one go.","However, the Battle God Palace’s strength was only in its assassination techniques. In a head-on confrontation, to say nothing of the Imperial Clans, even the Holy Lands wouldn’t be afraid.","In a one-on-one head-on confrontation, just see who would win?","Now, however, Wu Yue had appeared. His name was very ordinary, but his natural talent in cultivation had completely suppressed the Golden Generation.","How had the Battle God Palace nurtured him?","This confused everyone, but they didn’t mention recruiting Wu Yue again. If the Battle God Palace bore a grudge, it would be a very troublesome matter. After all, even the Imperial Clans were unwilling to trifle with such an opponent.","Merely looking at how the Battle God Palace had survived the era of various Ancestral Kings, it was clear just how tenacious this force was.","If they were in a different place and at a different time, even if they didn’t kill Wu Yue, they would still chase him away no matter what. Getting along peacefully with an assassin from the Battle God Palace was practically a joke.","But now, since the various Imperial Clans had all declared that no matter how heinous you were, there would be no one targeting you on Yahe Planet, then no matter how displeased they were, they could only swallow their anger.","Moreover, Wu Yue could even insta-kill a Nine Star Sect Master. There were really not many people that could threaten him.","When Ling Han found out, he couldn’t help but feel surprised. He had not thought that Wu Yue was actually a seed of the Battle God Palace.","Should he make a move and kill this person?","He was on the must-kill list of the Battle God Palace. Both sides were already mortal enemies. Either the Battle God Palace would kill him, or he would destroy the Battle God Palace.","This Wu Yue should be the most outstanding successor of the Battle God Palace. If he could kill him, that would definitely be a heavy blow to the Battle God Palace.","However, Wu Yue was really very strong. If Ling Han made a move, putting aside the question of whether he could kill him or not, he would definitely have to use his full strength. Then, his identity would definitely be exposed.","The auction hadn’t even begun, and his public persona had already collapsed?","Ling Han didn’t think that the Imperial Clans would keep their promise, and that they would only make a move after he left Yahe Planet. Instead, they would immediately kill him secretly.","With Purple Calamity Grains, he wasn’t too worried about his life, but in this way, his original intention of participating in the auction was completely ruined.","Forget it. He had to prioritize the overall situation first.","Ling Han thought. Since Wu Yue appeared in a positive manner, it meant that though he came from the Battle God Palace, he disdained from launching sneak attacks and killing people. Then, there should still be chances for them to meet again in future.","There was no rush, no rush.","Ling Han bought Celestial medicines and continued to refine alchemical pills.","Although it wasn’t on the level of Peak Grade, it could still be sold for a high price. Ling Han couldn’t possibly use Strengthening Fluid to trade for whatever good stuff he saw, right?","Time slowly crept by. Finally, the much anticipated auction was about to begin.","The auction this time was extraordinary. It could be claimed to be the highest level auction in the entire universe.","Thus, if one wanted to enter, they would either have to provide proof of astonishing wealth, or have to take out precious natural treasures. Otherwise, there was no need for those who were here simply to watch the excitement, as they would be occupying a spot for no reason.","Ling Han and Brother Monkey entered together. Merely the alchemical pills that Ling Han had concocted gave them the right to enter."]},{"number":4507,"title":"Chapter 4507: Trading for Celestial Qi","paragraphs":["Chapter 4507: Trading for Celestial Qi","Editor: Henyee Translations","The auction venue was huge.","This was necessary. Merely in terms of Imperial Clans, there were several dozen, and added with a great many Holy Lands, just how many people did these forces have? And there were even more lone cultivators. They were actually the main sellers. For example, the Imperial Clans would basically be buying items when they held an auction. At most, they would only take out one or two treasures to match the situation.","The auction was very simple. Though there was an auctioneer, he only had the effect of appraising and introducing the auction items. As for what price the auction item would be sold for, that was completely up to the seller of the auction item.","One could accept Dao Stones or trade it for something he wanted the most.","With so many people, it could be imagined that the number of auction items would be incredibly terrifying. It was unknown how long this auction would last.","It may not be impossible for the auction to take a few months, or even one or two years.","...","Very soon, the auction began.","The sellers took out their own items one after another, and handed them over to the auction venue, where the auctioneer would begin the auction according to their order.","That was because they had done a preliminary selection before entering. The auction items would definitely be valuable, and no one’s time would be wasted.","One after another, items were laid out. The auctioneer appraised them, and made his own judgement. Of course, his words could only be considered as reference, and not absolute.","Some people left in delight after selling their merchandise, while the merchandise of others ended up not being auctioned off.","The reason why they had not been auctioned off was not because there was no competition. Firstly, it was possible that the price was too low, and had not reached a level that would satisfy the seller. Secondly, the seller did not accept Dao Stones, but rather wanted to trade it for other treasures. No one else had provided it, so he could only choose to leave the item unauctioned.","For a few days, neither Ling Han nor Brother Monkey made a move.","Though these things at the beginning had their own value, it was not enough to tempt them.","However, there were really too many people.","All of them were waiting to take out their own treasures for auction. In fact, they might not even be able to do it in ten, or even a hundred years.","The organizer finally knew that this kind of auction was too torturous. Thus, after some discussion, the rules of the auction were changed.","The auction did not proceed like this, but rather was divided into several hundred sub-venues and auctions would be carried out at the same time. Additionally, if you wanted, you could also set up a stall. In any case, the highest bidder would win, and whether to sell or not would depend on the owner of the goods.","In this way, the process was naturally faster. Furthermore, from Spirit Transformation Tier onwards, the martial artists could form spiritual bodies. One could form five to eight, and that was very normal. Moreover, the divine sense for Sect Masters and above was incredibly powerful, enough to cover the entire auction area. It was completely capable of having intel on every auction area.","Thus, this would not cause any effect at all. The treasures that should cause a commotion would still cause a commotion.","The only disadvantage was that the person appraising the treasure would be flustered, and would have to go back and forth to appraise the treasure.","It was fine. The Imperial Clans had already gone to ask for more appraisers. This kind of problem would soon be resolved.","Ling Han also took out a drop of Strengthening Fluid and began the auction.","After the appraisal was made public, Ling Han was instantly surrounded by a large number of old Sect Masters and Venerate Tier elites. All of them had heated gazes, wanting nothing more than to swallow Ling Han whole.","Strengthening one’s physique and strengthening one’s blood and Qi were really too important for people like them who were at the end of their line.","Some people had already glimpsed the threshold of breaking through, but because the life force was seriously lacking, they did not dare to rashly make an attempt. Now that they had seen the Strengthening Fluid, how could they not be wild with joy?","However, there was only one drop, so they could only fight tooth and nail for it.","On the path of cultivation, only few people would benefit while the rest would lose out. After all, there were only so many resources.","“I need treasures that contain Celestial Qi, whether it is Celestial medicine, Celestial pill, or something else. I can accept all of them.” Ling Han stated his request, “I do not accept Dao Stones, no matter how many there are.”","With these words, a great many people were instantly disappointed.","These were treasures that contained Celestial Qi. This was too rare, and belonged to the category that could only be encountered by fortune but not sought. It could only be accumulated over a long period of time.","It was said that the Imperial Clan had a special method to capture Celestial Qi, but it was not something that could be obtained just because one wanted to. It was only a hundred times easier for them than other forces.","A great many people shook their heads and left, but there were still a dozen over people left behind. Clearly, they all possessed Celestial Qi.","“Come on,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“One portion of Celestial Qi, about four stars quality.”","“Two portions, both four stars in quality.”","“One portion, five star quality!”","Everyone began to place bids, and Ling Han was slightly disappointed. Though Celestial Qi could allow the fruit of cultivation to grow, the lower the grade, the less the fruit of cultivation would grow. Furthermore, it could also affect the quality of the fruit of cultivation, causing battle prowess to be inferior to other cultivators of the same level when they were in Venerate Tier.","Thankfully, he had also grasped the pill recipe for the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, which could elevate the Celestial Qi by another level. However, the higher the original grade of the Celestial Qi, the better.","“Hoho, I am willing to offer an eight-star quality Celestial Qi, but you only have a drop of treasure fluid, which is not enough to trade for it!” Suddenly, an elder spoke up. He was tall and sturdy, and even if two people were tied together, they may not be as wide as he was, but his whole head of hair was already grey, exuding an air of decay.","“Hiss, Crimson Venerate!”","“An old Venerate from the Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan. It’s said that he failed to break through to Saint Tier and severely wounded his life force.”","“No wonder he made a move.”","The people in the surroundings discussed in low voices, their expressions gloomy.","The Imperial Clan was really rich and imposing. The moment they opened their mouths, they immediately offered an eight-star Celestial Qi, which made them completely unqualified to compete.","Meanwhile, the Crimson Venerate wore a proud smile. To the members of the Imperial Clan, obtaining Celestial Qi was far easier than for others. In fact, they could even obtain the highest grade of Nine Stars, but to them, this kind of Celestial Qi was also incredibly rare, and would only be left to be used within their own forces.","The reason why the Golden Generation’s cultivation level progressed so quickly was naturally related to it. Otherwise, the cultivation levels of Sect Master and Venerate Tier could only be slowly accumulated with time.","In the eyes of others, an eight-star Celestial Qi was incredibly valuable, but for the Imperial Clan, they could only obtain one every few hundred years, at most. Only nine-star Celestial Qi would be able to move even the Imperial Clans.","The Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan!","Ling Han subconsciously felt disgust. However, it was now time to earn Celestial Qi, so it didn’t matter.","He thought for a moment, then answered, “Ten drops.”","A thought flashed in Crimson Venerate’s mind. Ling Han actually dared to bargain with him; what did that mean?","The other definitely had more than three drops of treasure fluid!","“Ten drops is still too little.” His expression did not change, and he shook his head.","“It’s about enough. It’s enough to help your blood and Qi reach the peak stage, and allow you to have the qualifications to attempt breaking through to Saint Tier again,” Ling Han said calmly.","Though the treasure fluid in his hand was measured in terms of “bowl”, when it was time to bargain, Ling Han naturally would not be reserved either. This concerned his own interests.","Moreover, why should he be generous to the Imperial Clans?","After a difficult negotiation, the deal was finally settled with twelve drops of treasure fluid.","Hehehe, both sides were very satisfied, and revealed a smile."]},{"number":4508,"title":"Chapter 4508: Great Profit","paragraphs":["Chapter 4508: Great Profit","Editor: Henyee Translations","In the eyes of Crimson Venerate, this was naturally a great profit for him.","Eight Stars Celestial Qi was indeed precious, but firstly, for the Imperial Clan, it could only be considered a rare item, and could not be considered a supreme treasure. Secondly, Eight Stars Celestial Qi was only Eight Stars Celestial Qi, which was still slightly inferior to top grade Nine Stars Celestial Qi. With this kind of Celestial Qi nurturing the fruit of cultivation, it was definitely not perfect enough.","Since that was the case, he was not afraid that Ling Han would resell this Eight Star Celestial Qi to Origin, Myriad Dao, and so on, to threaten the Golden Generation of their clan.","However, he didn’t know that Ling Han had mastered the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, which could improve the quality of Celestial Qi. Eight Stars Celestial Qi was actually Nine Stars Celestial Qi!","Otherwise, he definitely wouldn’t be able to laugh now. Instead, he would be crying.","—One day, when Ling Han’s identity was exposed, and also revealed that he had grasped means that could improve the quality of Celestial Qi, the expression of Crimson Venerate would definitely be very amusing.","...","Ling Han was very pleased. This was the first “nine stars” Celestial Qi that he had obtained, which meant that he could improve the quality of the fruit of cultivation to the optimal level.","He only had to use enough Nine Stars Celestial Qi to complete the forging of his foundations. Then, even if he used a One Star Celestial Qi to nurture it, as long as there was enough, it could still ripen the fruit of cultivation, and its quality was the strongest at that.","Of course, just to be on the safe side, Ling Han still had to get some more Nine Stars Celestial Qi to ensure that the fruit of cultivation would definitely grow to its prime.","“Hohoho.” Crimson Venerate strode off. He was already impatient, and wanted to immediately ingest the treasure fluid to recover his vitality, and once again attempt to break through to Saint Tier.","Becoming a Saint was the greatest thing in his life, because he was already close to the end of his lifespan. If he did not become a Saint, he would only become a dead man.","Ling Han smiled, took out another drop of treasure fluid, and said, “Come, come, come. Those passing by, don’t miss it.”","This caused the other Sect Masters and Venerate Tier elites to grit their teeth. Just how much treasure fluid do you have?","They all wanted to lower the price, but what if the competition wasn’t fierce enough, and others bought the treasure fluid, and Ling Han suddenly ran out of stock? Where would they complain about the injustice?","Thus, even though they knew that Ling Han might still have treasure fluid in his possession, they could only treat it as the last drop.","There definitely wouldn’t be a great amount of such precious treasure fluid. At most, there would only be a dozen or so drops.","However, not too long after, Ling Han had already sold more than 50 drops of treasure fluid, yet he was still shouting, causing those who had previously won the bidding at a high price to cry out at their loss. They were also very shocked. Why did Ling Han have so much treasure fluid in his possession?","After selling over a hundred drops, Ling Han closed his stall.","He couldn’t sell any more. The people now had all become smarter, and none of them were willing to compete at a high price. Instead, they would have Ling Han set a low price, and everyone would buy at this price.","How could Ling Han be willing to do this?","Let’s go, let’s keep these people hanging first.","He directly exited the auction house, and first went to concoct the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill. As for the treasure fluid, he handed it over to Brother Monkey, who would decide whether to continue selling based on the situation.","For Ling Han, concocting the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill was already a walk in the park for him. Thus, after a month, Ling Han had obtained ten cauldrons’ worth of alchemical pills.","Though they were all Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pills, the quality was completely different.","Some Three Stars Celestial Qi had been upgraded to Four Stars, while some Seven Stars Celestial Qi had been upgraded to Eight Stars. The most valuable was still the Eight Stars Celestial Qi that Crimson Venerate had provided. It was now a Nine Stars Celestial Qi!","“Exchanging alchemical pills for Celestial Qi, I will profit more and more!”","Ling Han said with a smile. He could improve the quality of the Celestial Qi, and a difference of one star in quality, even if it didn’t affect the quality of the fruit of cultivation, in terms of growth alone, the difference was at least ten times.","Thus, once he refined, he increased the value of the Celestial Qi by more than ten times.","He would only need to use some supplementary medicines. Though they were Celestial medicines, those Celestial medicines that did not contain Celestial Qi were much cheaper. They could also be bought with Dao Stones, and were completely on a different level from Celestial Qi-level treasures.","Ling Han returned to the auction. This time, he would sell some low-grade Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pills as appropriate, as well as concoct some Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pills for Brother Monkey. Otherwise, how could the Golden Generation have raised their cultivation level, while Brother Monkey was still stagnant?","He found Brother Monkey. In this one month, Brother Monkey had sold seventeen drops of treasure fluid, yet managed to obtain a portion of Eight Stars Celestial Qi for Ling Han!","Ling Han broke into a grin. If he had two portions of Nine Stars Celestial Qi, it should be enough to improve the quality of the fruit of cultivation to the optimal level.","He began to sell the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, but the sales weren’t very good.","That was because this was equivalent to Celestial Qi. Everyone used it as currency, so why would they still need to buy it?","They were willing to offer Dao Stones, but how could Ling Han be willing to accept it?","However, when Ling Han proposed that seven portions of Celestial Qi could be used to purchase a higher grade Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, a great many people were tempted.","As mentioned before, an equivalent amount of Celestial Qi of a higher grade would have an effect of at least ten times lower quality Celestial Qi.","‘Aren’t you an idiot?’","When encountering fools, no one would be reserved, and they all made their moves.","And just like that, Ling Han naturally obtained more and more Celestial Qi.","It had only been a day, and aside from the highest grade of Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, the others had all been sold out.","‘Invigorating! Again!’","Ling Han left the auction house, found a secluded place, and began concocting alchemical pills again. It was still a month’s time, and he had concocted another ten cauldrons.","The problem now was that he had enough Celestial Qi, but he did not have much time. He could only concoct one cauldron every three days, and this was the maximum efficiency. Furthermore, it was him, the Alchemy Emperor. If it was any other alchemist, the rate of pill completion would definitely drop drastically with the passing of time. It would be awesome enough to concoct two to three cauldrons in a row, so how could he possibly concoct ten cauldrons in a single go?","A perfect soul was not just an empty boast.","Ling Han entered the auction house for the third time. This time, he didn’t set up a stall to sell alchemical pills. Instead, he wandered around.","Some people might not need Celestial Qi, but they could possibly sell what Ling Han wanted.","In any case, the auction would continue for a very long time, so there was no need to worry.","He continued to roam around. However, even though there were all kinds of treasures, none of them were worthy of Ling Han’s attention.","Three days passed, and Ling Han finally arrived before a small stall.","There were all kinds of ancient items laid out on the stalls. Some were even stained with dirt.","That was deliberately not wiped off. The mud itself was exuding an ancient aura, which was used to show how old these ancient objects were.","Old things might not be anything valuable, but a great many people believed that old things were valuable!","Ling Han swept an eye over it, his eyes focused on a broken sword.","Ordinarily speaking, no matter how awesome a Spirit Tool was, once it was broken, its might would decrease greatly. In fact, it might not even be able to unleash its full power.","Thus, a damaged Spirit Tool was extremely cheap. At most, it could only be bought at a low price for sentimentality’s sake..","At the beginning, Ling Han had also thought so. However, after taking a second look, he discovered that this broken sword was exuding a faint energy fluctuation. However, the high quality of this energy fluctuation caused even him to be moved.","Hiss, he had encountered a treasure!"]},{"number":4509,"title":"Chapter 4509: Broken Sword","paragraphs":["Chapter 4509: Broken Sword","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han remained calm and collected as he picked up the broken sword. He then asked the stall keeper, “How much is this?”","The stall keeper was quite cunning, and said, “This is an auction. What item can you offer that would tempt me, or offer a high price?”","Sigh, what a profiteering merchant!","Ling Han sighed internally, then said, “10,000 Dao Stones.”","The stall keeper shook his head, “I do not accept Dao Stones.”","So arrogant.","...","However, this was normal. If one wanted to increase their strength, the Dao Stone was indeed the most useless.","Ling Han smiled, glanced at the stall keeper, and said, “You’re a Spirit Transformation True Lord. You’re not far from the Sect Master-level. I’ll give you the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill. There’s Celestial Qi in it, and it can help you rapidly increase your cultivation level in the future.”","The stall keeper was instantly moved. Though he had no use for this alchemical pill now, just as Ling Han had said, he did not need too much time.","This was an investment for the future, and the benefits could be seen and felt. It was definitely worth anticipating.","“How many Stars of Celestial Qi?” he asked.","Damn, he was really not easy to deceive!","Ling Han smiled, “Three Stars, I can give you ten.”","The stall keeper looked tempted, but felt that it was somewhat inappropriate to agree to Ling Han’s request so quickly. There... should still be a lot of room for raising the price.","“It’s a little too little.” He gritted his teeth, and suppressed the restlessness in his heart.","“Twenty portions of Three Star Celestial Qi,” a voice said, but it was not Ling Han.","‘F*ck! Someone’s trying to cut me off?1’","Ling Han turned his head, and his eyes narrowed slightly.","Wu Yue!","The person competing with him was actually the most outstanding seed of the Battle God Palace.","‘Very well, I haven’t settled accounts with you yet, yet you’ve already come to my doorstep.’","The stall keeper’s eyes lit up. This was an auction. If there was no one competing, wouldn’t it become an ordinary sale? How boring would that be.","He looked towards Ling Han, and naturally hoped that Ling Han would increase the bid.","Ling Han frowned, but still said, “Thirty portions.”","“Forty!” Wu Yue declared proudly, appearing to be very rich and imposing.","“Two portions of Four Star Celestial Qi.” Ling Han raised the bid again.","“Three portions.” Wu Yue raised his bid unhurriedly, as if he did not take Ling Han seriously at all.","How could the Battle God Palace be so wealthy?","Ling Han continued to increase the bid, and Wu Yue did not back down in the slightest either. It was clear that he was determined to get hold of that broken sword.","This stunned everyone in the area. Was this broken sword really so valuable that it actually needed 20 portions of Four Star Celestial Qi, no, it was already 30 portions of Four Star Celestial Qi to be traded for it?","The happiest person was naturally the stall keeper. He felt as if his heart were about to explode.","He decided that no matter who had bought this broken sword, he would immediately leave Yahe Planet after receiving the Celestial Qi.","Safety first.","When the price had been raised to four portions of Five Star Celestial Qi, Ling Han decisively gave up the bidding.","He did indeed think that this broken sword was worth studying, but such a high price was already very ridiculous. If it was not for the fact that the opposing bidder was a seed of the Battle God Palace, he might have stopped long ago.","As for now? He would just let the other party succeed.","Ling Han thought internally. In any case, there was no way he would spare someone from the Battle God Palace. Sooner or later, he would have to battle Wu Yue, so he would just let the latter keep the broken sword for the moment. This was not Celestial Qi that could be refined.","Wu Yue very happily paid four portions of Five Stars Celestial Qi, and obtained the broken sword. Then, he strode off, his eyes filled with contempt. He did not voice out any mockery as the victor of the bidding at all.","In his eyes, Ling Han wasn’t worth his time at all.","Meanwhile, Ling Han said slowly from behind, “You caused me to waste four portions of Five Star Celestial Qi!”","Yi, the one who had obtained it was clearly Wu Yue, so why did he say that it was a waste of his Celestial Qi?","Everyone was at a loss. Could it be that Ling Han was muddled with anger because he couldn’t compete?","Wu Yue was also taken aback, then came to his senses.","Ling Han was saying that he would die in Ling Han’s hands. Thus, now that he had spent Celestial Qi to buy the broken sword, he was actually squandering Ling Han’s spoils of battle.","This!","Even with Wu Yue’s temperament, he couldn’t help but feel anger rise up in him.","He stopped in his tracks, then asked, “Do you dare battle me?”","However, he didn’t turn around to express his disdain toward Ling Han.","Ling Han merely smiled, “Now is not the time.”","He still had to continue participating in the auction.","Wu Yue humphed and strode off.","The auction was still continuing. Ling Han and Brother Monkey continued to make their bids, turning the alchemical pills and treasures in their hands into more Celestial Qi. This was a positive cycle. Where there was Celestial Qi, more alchemical pills would be produced, and from there, more Celestial Qi would be exchanged.","However, concocting Celestial medicines was really too time-consuming. One cauldron would need three days, and even if Ling Han had to concoct Celestial medicines for a year, that would only be over a hundred cauldrons.","The auction lasted for a total of one year and three months.","Apart from Ling Han, who could maintain a positive cycle, the others left one after another after exchanging for the treasures they needed, leading to fewer and fewer people, and fewer and fewer treasures. In the end, the auction could no longer continue, and it could only be announced that the auction was over.","The elites left one after another. Those who had gained something had to return to cultivate in seclusion to digest their gains, and those who had not had any gains naturally had no need to stay behind. However, because of the declaration from the Imperial Clans, the Yahe Planet was still incredibly peaceful. No one dared to provoke them, and challenge the authority of the Imperial Clans.","However, the elites of the younger generation did not leave. A few Golden Generations joined forces and held a banquet, inviting the young prodigies to attend.","Ling Han didn’t receive an invitation. He didn’t reveal his true appearance, so he naturally didn’t have any reputation at all. How could he have received an invitation?","However, Brother Monkey had received it.","He was the descendant of the Saint Emperor, and he had more so beaten the Golden Generation into fleeing in disarray. Wasn’t it only natural that he had received an invitation?","But precisely because of this, he had clearly humiliated the Golden Generation, so why did they still invite him?","Being qualified was one matter, but inviting Brother Monkey to make Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian look miserable, what was going on?","“I reckon that Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian’s abilities have improved, so they want to use this opportunity to defeat Brother Monkey, to show the superiority of the Golden Generation,” Ling Han deduced.","Meanwhile, Brother Monkey brandished the metal rod, his expression completely unconcerned.","In Brother Monkey’s eyes, there was nothing to be afraid of even if his opponent was stronger than him. As the line of the Battle Saint Emperor, he had no reason to be afraid of battle.","“There are still seven days until the banquet... Brother Monkey, wait for me for three days!”","Ling Han began to concoct the Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill.","This was a Venerate Tier-level Celestial Qi, and added with the fact that this was his first time refining it, Ling Han was still very careful. Not only was he afraid of wasting the Celestial Qi, but also because of the issue of time.","He had to succeed in a single attempt. Otherwise, even if he succeeded in refining it, Brother Monkey may not have the time to digest the effects.","Thankfully, he had succeeded in a single attempt.","Ling Han took out the Celestial pill, and handed it to Brother Monkey, telling him to immediately consume it and refine it.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t be stingy toward his own people. What kind of raw materials were used?","Eight Stars Celestial Qi!","Thus, the Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill he concocted was also the highest grade.","Even if this was not enough to boost Brother Monkey’s cultivation level to another level, it would definitely allow Brother Monkey’s strength to improve greatly.","Brother Monkey didn’t stand on ceremony. After receiving these two extremely precious alchemical pills, he immediately began to refine them.","Ling Han didn’t stay idle either. He also started to ingest the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill."]},{"number":4510,"title":"Chapter 4510: Arrogant Wu Yue","paragraphs":["Chapter 4510: Arrogant Wu Yue","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han ingested the highest grade of Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill.","The Celestial Qi surged when one pill was consumed, immediately causing a qualitative change to take place in the fruit of cultivation.","Ling Han shockingly discovered that not only did his fruit of cultivation not grow larger, it was actually shrinking!","This Nine Stars Celestial Qi actually had a side effect?","No.","On the other hand, this was the awesomeness of the Nine Stars Celestial Qi. It expelled the impurities from the fruit of cultivation, making it incredibly pure.","...","Precisely because the impurities had been removed too much, the fruit of cultivation had become smaller.","Under the influence of the Imperial Scroll, in less than half a day, the medicinal effects of this alchemical pill were completely exhausted.","Again.","Ling Han took another pill. As expected, his fruit of cultivation hadn’t reached perfection yet, and was still shrinking further. What depressed him was the fact that the fruit of cultivation were shrinking, and the black chain was also shrinking. He couldn’t take this opportunity to remove it at all.","One pill after another, Ling Han continued to consume them. Right until the tenth pill, the fruit of cultivation finally stopped shrinking. Instead, it began to swell.","The impurities had been completely removed, and the fruit of cultivation had reached perfection. Thus, it began to grow again.","Calculating the time, there was not much time left until the banquet.","Ling Han stood up, and on the other side, Brother Monkey had also ended his cultivation.","Neither of their cultivation levels had increased, but being tempered by the Nine Star Celestial Qi, their battle prowess had definitely risen to a new height.","“Let’s go!”","They headed to the venue of the banquet. This was a tall mountain, and originally, anyone could set foot on it. However, it was now guarded by the Imperial Clans. Only those who had received invitations could ascend the mountain.","Ling Han didn’t have an invitation, but it didn’t matter. Brother Monkey did. How easy would it be for him to bring someone up?","The mountain was very high, and standing at the summit, the moon and stars were practically close to hand, and could be grabbed with a single hand.","There were a total of four hundred people invited to this banquet. Aside from the Imperial Sons, there were also the Dao Childs and Holy Daughters of the various Holy Lands.","However, it was definitely not just a Dao Child or Holy Daughter that could be invited. Otherwise, there were at least a few thousand Holy Lands in the world, so how could there only be a few hundred people here?","At the very least, only those who had reached the level of Sect Master would be qualified!","After all, almost all of the Imperial Sons had already advanced to this level. If they didn’t ascend this level, how could they be qualified to speak with the Imperial Sons?","Ling Han saw that Origin, Myriad Dao, and the others had also come. Yang Yihuan and He Luo were also here, as well as Chi Menghan. This Imperial Daughter was presently extremely depressed.","She didn’t know that Ling Han was actually still alive, so she was naturally heartbroken.","But for a beauty like her, who was comparable to the Imperial Daughters of the Golden Generation, she was naturally the ideal partner that all men dreamed of. The Imperial Sons approached endlessly, hoping to move her heart.","Moreover, Chi Menghan was currently at a state of great dejection, so seizing this opportunity would be the easiest way to capture her heart.","However, Chi Menghan wasn’t interested at all, and she was cold and indifferent to everyone. This caused everyone to feel as if they had been rebuffed.","“Hehe, what a proud snow lotus, I like her very much!” someone said, as he walked towards Chi Menghan.","This, how arrogant and direct!","Though everyone liked her very much, they were all very reserved, so how could they possibly say it out loud?","“Who is this person?”","When everyone saw him, their eyes narrowed.","Wu Yue, the strongest seed of the Battle God Palace.","Hiss, this guy was too arrogant, wasn’t he? He clearly came from the Battle God Palace, and everyone wanted to beat him up, yet he actually boasted shamelessly, daring to take liberties with the princess of the Donglin Imperial Clan!","Chi Menghan merely glanced coldly at Wu Yue, then withdrew her gaze, not planning to pay any regard to him at all.","Seeing that Wu Yue had been given a cold shoulder, everyone smiled. Now, let’s see how you will end up.","“He’s just a dead man, so what need is there for you to take him to heart?” Wu Yue’s expression was calm, as if he had not suffered the slightest blow. “Hehe, what do you mean by the strongest prodigy of all eternity? If he encounters me, I can teach him how to behave at any time!”","Chi Menghan immediately looked furious. Even if Ling Han died, she wouldn’t allow others to slander him.","“Celestial maiden Chi, let me help you!” An Imperial Son walked out.","Wasn’t this a good opportunity to curry Chi Menghuan’s favor?","This was naturally a Golden Generation. He was already an eight-star Sect Master. Otherwise, he wouldn’t dare to step out.","Wu Yue was completely unconcerned, and said indifferently, “Get lost, don’t seek your own humiliation!”","“You are really arrogant. Come, let us battle in the skies!” That Golden Generation immediately flew into the air, challenging Wu Yue.","He was an eight-star Sect Master. He was practically standing at the peak of this cultivation level, so what did he have to fear?","Wu Yue merely sneered, and with a tap of his foot, his figure instantly soared into the air. Then, he struck out with his sword.","The sword light soared into the sky, as if it were splitting open the heaven and earth.","The Golden Generation hurriedly parried with all his might, but he was in an extremely sorry state. In just a few moves, he was forcefully slashed down from the skies.","Peng!","He landed on the ground, raising a cloud of dust.","Hiss, an eight-star Sect Master, a Golden Generation, was actually defeated so quickly?","Everyone inhaled sharply. If that was the case, even if a Nine Star Sect Master, a Golden Generation, was to step forward, he would only be able to last a few more moves, at most. He would still be horribly defeated.","Heavens, this guy was only a Five Star Sect Master... Huh, a Six Star Sect Master!","It was clear that he had received great benefits at this auction. His cultivation level had increased by a notch.","Xiu, Wu Yue’s figure landed on the ground, revealing a disdainful expression, “I have warned you long ago!”","That Golden Generation’s expression was filled with humiliation and fury, as well as a sliver of fear. That was because if it was not for the fact that he still had the Substitution Seal on him, he would not have just lost, but would have died.","The gap in strength was too wide. He had nothing to say, and could only swallow this bitter pill.","This made the other Imperial Sons very displeased, but even if they mobilized a Nine Star Sect Master, there was no way he could be a match for Wu Yue, and if it was a Venerate... how could they bring themselves to ask a Venerate to deal with a Sect Master. So what if they won? It only meant that the Golden Generation was incompetent.","Wu Yue smiled faintly, then looked towards Chi Menghan, “Forget that man. In future, you only have to see me howl proudly in the storms!”","This was too arrogant!","“Wu, let me play with you.” Ding Shu walked out.","No matter what, he had once been Ling Han’s lackey, and Chi Menghan clearly had an “illicit relationship” with Ling Han. Thus, logically speaking, he should step out.","“You?” Wu Yue looked disdainful.","“Come battle!” Ding Shu soared into the sky.","Wu Yue brandished his sword in pursuit, and then began a fierce battle with Ding Shu.","They had only exchanged a few blows, and everyone looked stunned, because Ding Shu had actually fought Wu Yue to a tie.","Oh, no, he was slightly inferior, but the problem was that Ding Shu was only a Three Star Sect Master!","There was a gap of three minor levels, yet Ding Shu was only slightly at a disadvantage?","Hiss!","Gasps rang out in the area. This Ding Shu was really too strong, wasn’t he? With such a comparison, the Golden Generation was practically nothing but trash.","Even Wu Yue had not expected this. He was stunned for a moment, then broke into a smile, “I had not thought that you are quite strong. Very good, you are worthy of my full effort!”","His sword technique changed, and instantly, a terrifying offensive surged out.","“What!” Yang Yihuan and He Luo were both moved. “This guy has walked his own path!”","They exchanged a glance, both of them frowning deeply."]},{"number":4511,"title":"Chapter 4511: Sent Flying with a Single Punch","paragraphs":["Chapter 4511: Sent Flying with a Single Punch","Editor: Henyee Translations","Although Yang Yihuan and He Luo didn’t know Wu Yue, they could conclude that he was the same as them—an prodigy from ancient times that had been sealed by the Primordial Source Clay until now.","But with similar backgrounds, while they were still earnestly searching for their own path, Wu Yue had already walked out his own path. The gap was very obvious.","They called themselves prodigies, but they could not compare to the rookies now, nor could they compare to the “veterans” of ancient times. How could they endure this?","They knew that there were actually a considerable number of “old prodigies” like them, but they had completely no idea exactly how many there were.","In the skies, Ding Shu laughed loudly, and his offensive increased explosively.","He similarly walked out his own path, every move and style endlessly amazing.","...","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ding Shu was still slightly inferior, but his fighting spirit was high, and he used various clever moves. Though he was at a disadvantage, he was completely capable of holding on.","He may be outmatched, but it was definitely not a battle that could be decided in a few moves. Instead, it could drag on for a very long time.","The Golden Generation elites all wore solemn expressions.","How many of them had walked their own paths?","Zero!","However, if one wanted to become Emperor, walking out their own path of cultivation was a necessary condition.","—You have walked your own path, and may not be able to become Emperor, but if you do not walk your own path, you would definitely not be able to become Emperor.","Ling Han had died, and there was one less obstacle. However, looking at the situation now, it was not safe at all.","Even if Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian were already Venerate Tier elites, and had the absolute upper hand in terms of cultivation level, they still hadn’t walked their own path. Even if they reached the level of a Nine-Star Saint, they would only be trapped at this cultivation level forever, and wouldn’t be able to become Pseudo-Emperor.","If one didn’t become a Pseudo-Emperor, how could he become Emperor?","Die! Die! Die!","The Imperial Sons all had killing intent in their eyes. Since they were falling too far behind, they would get rid of these freaks, just like they had done to Ling Han.","If they could get rid of all their powerful competitors, then they could completely compete slowly and advance slowly. In any case, they were very young, so they had plenty of chances.","Ding Shu unleashed his ultimate moves one after another, but it could not be helped. The gap in cultivation level was a little too wide, and his battle prowess was still inferior. This was a shortcoming that could not be compensated no matter what.","After fighting for over 500 moves, Ding Shu decisively retreated from the battle.","Wu Yue didn’t give chase. He knew very well that though he had the advantage in battle prowess, if he wanted to defeat Ding Shu, he might need to fight another three to five hundred moves. Furthermore, he felt that Ding Shu still had a trump card that he had yet to use. Who knows, he may be able to turn the tables.","There was no enmity between them, and they were not fighting over any treasure, so what need was there for them to take the risk?","No one laughed at Ding Shu. Being able to exchange blows with Wu Yue while being three minor levels behind him, this was practically freakish!","“Even if Ling Han revives, can he compare to him?”","“Definitely no match!”","“That’s right. Though Ling Han is freakishly more talented than the Golden Generation Generation, at most, he is only on the same level as Wu Yue. How could he possibly compare to Ding Shu?”","“He’s the greatest freak!”","Everyone was discussing spiritedly, and they all agreed that Ding Shu was truly the strongest freak.","“Is there anyone else who wants to battle?” Wu Yue continued to provoke. He broke into a grin, revealing two rows of snow-white teeth. His eyes swept over everyone’s faces.","Origin, Myriad Dao and the others did not accept the challenge. They were only Three Star Sect Masters, and their abilities were equal to Ding Shu’s. Even if they stepped out to fight, the result would only be the same as Ding Shu’s.","Though this could cause them to become famous, when one had reached a height like they had, would they still care about this kind of empty reputation?","Becoming Emperor was the most important, and only then could one truly obtain a reputation that would last for all eternity.","“Is there no one?” A mocking smile curled up the corners of Wu Yue’s lips, “Too weak, isn’t there anyone that can fight?”","Ling Han shook his head, and strode out.","“Come, I’ll teach you how to call Grandpa.”","“It’s you!” Wu Yue stared at Ling Han, his gaze becoming harsh.","Previously, Ling Han had competed with him over the broken sword, causing him to sacrifice four streaks of Five Star Celestial Qi.","Though this was not all that precious to him, if the four streaks of Celestial Qi were used on him, his cultivation level may be able to rush up to peak stage Six Stars.","“Not bad, not bad. You actually dare to appear in front of me.” Wu Yue’s killing intent circulated, and he took the initiative to rise up, standing in midair.","Yi?","Everyone was surprised. Previously, it was the other person that had risen into the air first, while he was in no hurry. Yet now, he actually took the initiative to step into the air, showing how much killing intent he felt towards Ling Han.","They looked towards Ling Han. Who was this guy, that his ability to attract animosity was so strong?","If they knew that this was Ling Han, they wouldn’t have such doubts — it was normal for this guy to drive others to dying out of fury.","Chi Menghan, meanwhile, showed a strange expression. She looked towards Ling Han, and felt that this man gave her a familiar feeling.","Ling Han slowly rose into the air, walking step by step as if he was taking a stroll.","Too slow, too slow.","Wu Yue’s right hand gripped his sword. Seeing how Ling Han was so slow, he couldn’t help but grip the hilt of his sword tightly, his killing intent even stronger.","This was too despicable. Wasn’t this clearly playing around with him?","“You’ll soon find out what kind of price you’ll have to pay for doing this,” he said calmly. His tone was still very calm, but it couldn’t hide the deep killing intent in his voice.","Ling Han finally reached the same height as Wu Yue. He smiled faintly, and asked, “Have you wasted any of my treasures these past few days?”","‘Motherf*cker!’","Wu Yue looked furious. “You’ll soon become a corpse, and let’s see how you’ll still be able to talk cheeky at that time!”","He raised his sword and pointed it at Ling Han.","“When the sword rises, the winds and clouds rise!” he shouted lightly. Boom, endless Sword Qi spread out, striking towards Ling Han.","There were also Regulations among the Sword Qi, causing every flash of Sword Qi to be filled with destructive power.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and stretched out his right hand. Then, he grabbed out, and instantly, all the Sword Qi shattered one after another, no longer threatening in the slightest.","Yi? En? Ya?","Seeing this scene, everyone was surprised.","‘So powerful!’","Even if Wu Yue didn’t use his full strength, his strength was already publicly acknowledged. He was so strong that even the Golden Generation could only look up to him. Thus, even a casual strike from him should have boundless might, so how could it be so easily dispersed?","Could it be that this guy whose name was unknown was actually a super genius?","Wu Yue was also taken aback. He had not thought that Ling Han would be so strong.","“I’ve really underestimated you!” he said casually, but he naturally didn’t take it to heart. His figure charged out, and his sword swept out.","Ling Han clenched his hand into a fist and punched out, “I, on the other hand, have not!”","Peng!","With a single punch, Wu Yue and his sword were both sent flying.","‘F*ck!’","All of a sudden, everyone’s mouths were agape, completely incapable of believing this.","Fierce, this was too fierce, wasn’t it?","Wu Yue had already proven it with his abilities. Even a Nine Star Sect Master Golden Generation was no match for him. But now? Ling Han had sent him flying with a single punch.","This, this, this, with such a comparison, what was the Golden Generation worth?","They couldn’t even compare to trash!","Heavens, when had such a monster appeared?","If it was not for the fact that Ling Han was as dead as could be, one would suspect that this guy had disguised himself and appeared."]},{"number":4512,"title":"Chapter 4512: Fruit of cultivation, Mystical Power","paragraphs":["Chapter 4512: Fruit of cultivation, Mystical Power","Editor: Henyee Translations","In the distance, Wu Yue finally steadied his footing.","He looked at Ling Han, his face filled with shock.","Though Ling Han’s attack was incredibly fierce, he still managed to disperse it, and did not suffer any injury. However, what shocked him was that he was actually no match for a single punch from Ling Han.","How was this possible?","Even if it was the Nine Star Sect Master of the Golden Generation, he was unafraid, and saw him as a weakling. At most, he would only have to use a few more moves, and he would definitely be able to take him down.","However, Ling Han was indeed only at the level of Sect Master.","...","He inhaled sharply. Firstly, Ling Han had to be a seven, eight, or even nine-star Sect Master. Secondly, the latter’s natural talent should be comparable to Ding Shu. Otherwise, it was definitely impossible for him to have such might.","When he thought of this, a smile actually appeared at the corners of his lips, “Just because your cultivation level is higher than mine, you think you can bully me?”","Humph, he had grasped who knew how many secret techniques!","When Ling Han heard this, his expression became strange.","F***, he was actually being falsely accused like this?","My cultivation level is higher than yours?","‘I, a Three Star Sect Master, have a higher cultivation level than you, a Six Star Sect Master?’","Was there anyone like this? If he couldn’t defeat his opponent, he would say that his opponent’s cultivation level was higher than his. He would not admit at all that it was actually his own strength that was inferior.","Was this narcissistic, or an illness?","Ling Han shook his head. It didn’t matter. What was there to argue about with a dead person?","He charged out, his fighting spirit ignited and solidified.","Seeing that Ling Han didn’t deny it, everyone gave an ‘oh’.","No wonder this guy was so strong that even a freak like Ding Shu was dumbfounded. As it turned out, his cultivation level was much higher than Wu Yue’s. With this conversion, perhaps his aptitude was about the same as Ding Shu, or perhaps even worse.","This was more logical. How could there be so many freaks in this world?","Even so, this was still extremely astonishing. This meant that Ling Han’s talent was definitely above that of the Golden Generation.","When they thought of this, the Golden Generation elites all wore ugly expressions.","Initially, they represented the strongest in the world, but now? Generation after generation of new people appeared, causing them to lose all face. Furthermore, there were also “veterans”. All of them should have long since disappeared in the long passage of history, but now, they had crawled out again.","Becoming Emperor in this generation was so difficult!","Previously, they had said that the Golden Generation was the most likely to shatter the legend that the Imperial Clan could not possibly produce another Emperor, but looking at it now... Sigh, they were all going to fail.","This caused the Imperial Sons to burn with killing intent. Should they take advantage of this opportunity to eliminate all their opponents?","Boom!","The battle between Ling Han and Wu Yue pulled everyone’s thoughts back. Ling Han was still throwing punch after punch. It looked completely random and extremely casual, but its might was world-shaking.","In Wu Yue’s case, he channeled an extremely powerful sword technique. As the sword swept past, the heavens collapsed and the earth was destroyed.","Sect Master-leve already possessed preliminary strength that could destroy the heavens and earth, what more a supreme Sect Master like him.","It could not be helped. Though Wu Yue had walked his own path, he had only taken ten steps, at most. He could deal with Golden Generation, or even Ding Shu, but faced with Ling Han, the gap was too wide.","Hence, his path was still too inexperienced, and was not strong enough to oppose Ling Han. Then, Wu Yue could only borrow the secret technique of his predecessors.","However, this was an Imperial Technique!","“Is there such an Imperial Technique?” The Imperial Sons looked at each other in confusion.","There were only so many Imperial Clans in the world. Though every Imperial Son could not possibly grasp the Imperial Techniques of the other Imperial Clans, no matter what Imperial Technique they had, they still had some understanding of it, and knew the approximate might. This way, when faced with the competition from the other Imperial Sons, they would not be flustered, and have no idea how to deal with it.","However, they had absolutely no recollection of Wu Yue’s sword technique.","The Battle God Palace had actually mastered the Imperial Technique?","How was this possible!","They had never produced a Slaughter Emperor, and if one did not become Emperor, how could they possibly create the Imperial Technique?","Even Ling Han was slightly surprised. He had been to the Battle God Palace’s lair before, and he had also entered the inheritance tower before. However, he had only learnt the Saint Technique after ascending the tower. The most valuable item was the Strange Shadow Steps, but when it came to the Imperial Technique... there was absolutely no such thing.","Could it be that it was Wu Yue who had obtained this opportunity himself?","For example, Ling Han could be considered a disciple of Nine Suns Holy Land. Logically speaking, he couldn’t possibly learn Imperial Techniques, but in truth, not only did he learn Imperial Techniques, he also possessed Imperial Scroll!","Forget about it. Who cares where he had learnt the Imperial Technique? He would just beat him to burst!","Ling Han began to strengthen his offensive. As he threw a punch, sixteen flashes of Regulations appeared faintly.","Wu Yue wasn’t weak. He could unleash fourteen flashes of Regulations with a single strike, which was indeed slightly inferior, but not to the extent that he would be instantly defeated. The problem was, launching fourteen flashes of Regulations with a single strike was the limit of his battle prowess, and no one could maintain at their limit forever.","Thus, most of the time, Wu Yue could only blast out thirteen flashes of Regulations. It could not be helped. The soul could not possibly reach a state of perfection, so there would definitely be ripples.","However, Ling Han was different. He could unleash 16 flashes of Regulations with each strike, which was as steady as could be!","This caused everyone to grit their teeth.","How was this possible?","How could it be that your soul had reached a level of perfection?","That was impossible.","Thus, there was only one possibility, and that was Ling Han’s maximum battle prowess was not limited to sixteen flashes of Regulations. That was why he could maintain this kind of battle prowess all this while.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Without two Regulations, there would be a difference of two stars in strength. In the Sect Master-level, the gap of one star was practically impossible to breach, what more when it was two stars?","If it was another opponent, Wu Yue could still rely on the Imperial Technique, and could still rely on his own outstanding performance to compensate for the gap in battle prowess of these two stars, but against Ling Han?","Sorry.","On his own path of martial arts, Ling Han had already walked too far. Even if Ding Shu, Origin, and the others were added together, they may not be able to compare to him. In terms of battle experience, f***, just how many battles had the Genesis World’s Master experienced in his lifetime?","No matter how much Wu Yue struggled, he was still suppressed by Ling Han. He couldn’t see the slightest possibility of turning the tables.","“Damn it!” Wu Yue gave a humph, his eyes sharp, exuding a strong murderous aura.","He gave a loud shout. Weng, the Dao Fruit Tree manifested from his mind, and swayed above his head. On the fruit of cultivation, six golden veined patterns emitted a terrifying aura.","Yi!","All Sect Masters discovered that his Dao Fruit Tree had uncontrollably manifested out of his mind, and was similarly swaying above his head.","This!","Hiss, what was going on?","“This person should have grasped some kind of Mystical Power that can forcibly extract his opponent’s Dao Fruit Tree!”","“The fruit of cultivation has lost the protection of the physical body. Once it is hit, it’ll definitely be terrible.”","“However, this Mystical Power of his is a double-edged sword, and even his own Dao Fruit Tree has been taken out.”","“No, it should be that his Dao Fruit Tree possesses this kind of Mystical Power, so he can only summon it.”","Even the Imperial Sons exclaimed in shock. This Mystical Power was truly terrifying. If they faced it head-on, it was extremely possible that their fruit of cultivation would be crippled, causing their cultivation level to drop drastically.","So what if they had the Substitution Seal? His cultivation level had fallen back to the Spiritual Transformation Tier, so even if he had a few more lives, they would all be taken by a Sect Master.","“... Just look at his opponent!” One of the Imperial Sons’ eyes widened in shock.","What!"]},{"number":4513,"title":"Chapter 4513: Identity Exposed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4513: Identity Exposed","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone had just been stunned by how terrifying Wu Yue’s Mystical Power was. However, when they turned around, they discovered something even more terrifying.","Ling Han stood there calmly. Above his head... there was no Dao Fruit Tree!","F***, could it be that you are not Sect Master-level?","Otherwise, why hadn’t your Dao Fruit Tree been extracted?","You see, even the Nine Star Sect Master, Golden Generation, was no exception, and couldn’t control it at all, so what allowed you to accomplish the opposite?","This should have nothing to do with abilities, right?","...","“How is this possible?!” Wu Yue exclaimed in shock. His eyes widened in disbelief.","This was his natural talent and special ability. Even if his opponent’s cultivation level was higher and his abilities were stronger than his, it was useless. He would definitely be able to extract the Dao Fruit Tree.","With this move, he had defeated a great many people whose abilities were superior to his.","But why did it not work when it came to Ling Han?","‘Do you... have any rare treasures on you?’","Ling Han cracked a smile, “What is it? Is it very strange?”","“How could you possibly not be affected by me!” Wu Yue was completely unable to accept this. This was his natural talent and special ability.","Ling Han shrugged, and said, “Since you’re so insistent, I’ll cooperate with you.” He took the initiative to release his Dao Fruit Tree, which swayed above his head.","‘Holy f*ck!’","If Ling Han didn’t release the Dao Fruit Tree, and instead continued to fight with Wu Yue, then even if Wu Yue couldn’t accept it, he wouldn’t have any other negative feelings.","However, things were different now.","Ling Han took the initiative to release the Dao Fruit Tree. This was practically taking pity on him.","Just think of him, Wu Yue, who had been unhindered for so many eras, and had killed who knew how many prodigies. Why was it that in this generation, he would still be pitied by others?","This was a f*cking great humiliation!","Wu Yue was so angry that his face turned livid. With a furious roar, he slashed madly with his long sword.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them once again began an incredibly intense battle.","As the saying goes, those in the know may be confused, but those on the outside can see clearly.","Wu Yue was muddled with anger, but the people around him could see clearly. They all began to inhale sharply, their expressions as if they had seen a ghost.","On Ling Han’s fruit of cultivation, there were only three golden threads, and the third golden thread was clearly still a little light, not as deep as the other two.","What kind of Nine Star Sect Master was this?","Three Stars! Three Stars! Three Stars!","Ling Han actually, actually, was, a Three Star Sect Master!","‘F*ck!’","So what if it was the Golden Generation? They were all gaping in shock.","Just listen to the nonsense that Wu Yue was spouting!","What cultivation level is above yours? Open your damn eyes and take a look. Is this a Nine Star Sect Master?","Do you know how to count?","One, two, three!","Three golden patterns, this was the standard Three Star Sect Maste. Don’t say that you don’t even know how to count one, two, or three!","“Motherf*cker! He’s actually a Three Star Sect Master!”","“I’m about to go crazy!”","“A Three Star Sect Master is actually still so powerful. This is practically a fantasy story!”","“The first in history!”","“One of a kind!”","Everyone expressed their admiration. This was indeed strong to the point that no one could say anything.","Multiple praises spread into Wu Yue’s ears. At first, he didn’t notice it, and he soon forgot about it. In an intense battle, if he was distracted by other things, that would be a suicidal action.","However, as he listened to the discussions of the masses become more and more intense, he couldn’t help but ponder for a moment.","He was shocked.","Wu Yue looked at the top of Ling Han’s head. It was only a simple sweep of his eyes.","Then, he almost fell down from the skies in shock.","Three Stars, this was really a Three Star Sect Master!","Wu Yue’s face instantly flushed red.","Previously, he had confidently said that Ling Han’s cultivation level was definitely above his, but now?","Reality had slapped him right in the face!","It was so heavy that he wanted nothing more than for there to be a crack in the ground for him to crawl into.","No wonder everyone was discussing so intensely. He himself had become a huge joke!","Even if he couldn’t defeat him, that was fine. After all, which cultivator had never been defeated before? To say nothing of ordinary cultivators, even Great Emperors had been defeated when they were young.","However, this kind of mysterious confidence of his... was really too embarrassing.","Wu Yue’s face was completely red, and the killing intent in his eyes became even fiercer.","He turned this kind of humiliation into killing intent. As long as he killed Ling Han, everything would be resolved.","Yes, that would definitely be the case.","However, his battle prowess was inferior to Ling Han’s, and his natural skill had also been declared ineffective. How could he turn the tables?","Just by shouting like this?","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and unleashed his full battle prowess. Every punch was incredibly terrifying.","He hadn’t used the Destructive Energy yet. Otherwise, he would be able to beat Wu Yue to death in a matter of minutes.","However, this was his trump card, and it would easily expose his identity.","—Er, though his current identity was also close to collapsing.","“This person... who is he?”","“I can only think of one person.”","“Me too.”","“Ling Han!”","Everyone said. Aside from Ling Han, who else could be so freakish?","Moreover, how many such freakish prodigies were there in this world? Ding Shu, Origin, Myriad Dao and so on. They were really numbered. How could one of them possibly jump out of nowhere?","They all looked at Ling Han and recalled what Ling Han had said before. Having such a toxic mouth... it must be him. Otherwise, could there be a second person that could be both freakish and infuriating?","Even the Saint had confirmed Ling Han’s death?","The Saint’s vision must have blurred!","Saints did not represent absolute truth, and it was not definite that they would be correct.","Chi Menghan’s beautiful eyes lit up, and her whole person instantly glowed with a strong sense of life.","Ling Han didn’t die, Ling Han didn’t die, Ling Han didn’t die!","Wu Yue was completely at a disadvantage. It should be known that not only did Ling Han have the advantage in Regulations, the quality of his fruit of cultivation had also reached the highest grade under the tempering of Nine Stars Celestial Qi!","Boom! Boom!","Wu Yue was already powerless to continue, and was completely no match for Ling Han.","“I forfeit!” he said through gritted teeth. He was sullen, furious, yet helpless.","“Oh,” Ling Han replied with a nod. However, he continued to attack with his fists.","“You!” Wu Yue was both shocked and furious. Yi, why aren’t you adhering to the rules?","“Trash of the Battle God Palace, I’ll kill anyone of you I see!” Ling Han said coldly.","When the Battle God Palace attempted to assassinate him, had they greeted others and talked about adhering to the rules?","Then why did he have to adhere to the rules when it came to him?","Wu Yue roared in fury, hurriedly turning around to run.","However, someone with a similar cultivation level wanted to throw Ling Han off his tail?","‘Do you think that Phoenix Wings Divine Flight’s reputation as the world’s number one movement technique is undeserved?’","Boom, the fiery wings fluttered in the air. Ling Han intercepted him, and Wu Yue was completely unable to break free.","This time, Ling Han’s identity was undoubtedly confirmed!","Imperial Son Ming immediately opened his mouth in a baleful voice, and said, “Ling Han, battle is forbidden here. This is a joint decision of the various Imperial Clans. You actually dare to disobey, and in order to maintain order, I have no choice but to kill you on the spot!”","As he spoke, he immediately moved as well, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Shua, the shadow of a staff swept past, and it was as if ten thousand stars were crashing towards him at the same time. It was incredibly terrifying.","The Imperial Son Ming didn’t dare to face this attack head-on, so he could only dodge. The attack that he delivered naturally dissipated on its own.","Brother Monkey stood proudly in the air, his metal rod resting on his shoulders. He used one hand to pick at his ear. “You want to bully Old Sun’s brother? Ask the staff in Old Sun’s hand first!”","He looked down on all life, unmatched in his dominance."]},{"number":4514,"title":"Chapter 4514: Killing Wu Yue","paragraphs":["Chapter 4514: Killing Wu Yue","Editor: Henyee Translations","The Imperial Son Ming looked coldly at Brother Monkey, his expression baleful.","He was now a three-star Venerate Tier elite, and his cultivation level was not the slightest bit inferior to Brother Monkey. Thus, he was completely unafraid.","“Monkey, you’ve repeatedly protected this brat. Don’t you know that you’re digging your own grave?”","Meanwhile, Brother Monkey crooked a finger at him in an incredibly disdainful manner, “Cut the crap. If you want a fight, bring it on.”","Imperial Son Ming humphed, and charged towards Brother Monkey.","Boom! A palm struck over. He clearly hadn’t used any weapon, but a cold light seemed to be able to split open the heaven and earth.","...","Brother Monkey was unafraid, and greeted the attack with his staff.","Shadows of the staff flashed, possessing some Saint-level might.","The Imperial Son Ming had no choice but to yield. No matter how awesome he was, he would not be able to withstand an attack from the Saintly Material. That would definitely be enough to shatter his soul.","As soon as the battle began, Imperial Son Ming was at a disadvantage.","Everyone could clearly see that it was not only the weapon in Brother Monkey’s hands that was awesome, but more importantly, Brother Monkey’s use of Regulations was also superior to Imperial Son Ming.","For Imperial Sons like them, they could deliver ten Seven Star Regulations with a single strike, but this was the limit. It could not be the same every time. However, it could be seen very clearly that Brother Monkey had delivered ten Seven Star Regulations more times than Imperial Son Ming.","Thus, inferior in weapons, inferior in Regulations, wasn’t it very normal for Imperial Son Ming to be at a disadvantage?","Imperial Son Ming was unable to accept this.","His cultivation level was clearly the same, so why was he still inferior to Brother Monkey?","This was natural!","Previously, Brother Monkey had ingested the Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, and used the Nine Stars Celestial Qi to strengthen his cultivation level. And in the case of Imperial Son Ming, even in the Imperial Clan, the Nine Stars Celestial Qi was something that could only be encountered by chance.","He had indeed obtained it before, but he had not yet perfected his foundations.","Thus, this weakness would be magnified when encountering opponents of about the same level.","Hong, hong, hong! Everyone could only see Brother Monkey attacking madly, and Imperial Son Ming could only parry.","“Monkey, why should I be afraid of you?” Imperial Son Ming shouted loudly. With a battle cry, two pillars of light suddenly shot out of his eyes, as if they could even penetrate the Void.","This was his natural talent, the Void Eye. It was not only capable of seeing through beings hidden in the Void, but also had great destructive power.","Brother Monkey scoffed, and with a glare, actually shot out two rays of golden light as well!","Peng!","The pillars of light collided, and the light from Imperial Son Ming’s eyes immediately shattered. Meanwhile, the golden light shot out by Brother Monkey was like a hot knife through butter.","What!","Imperial Son Ming’s mouth moved, and he released a soundless exclamation of shock.","His Mystical Power was actually inferior to Brother Monkey!","“Take another strike from Old Sun’s staff!” Brother Monkey shouted loudly, wielding the metal staff and smashing over with great might.","Peng!","With a single strike, Imperial Son Ming was sent flying, blood spraying from all over his body.","He had no option but to face this strike head-on. He was instantly pummeled by the might of the Saintly Material, so much so that even his mother couldn’t recognize him.","Brother Monkey was just about to follow up on his victory and deal with this opponent, when he saw Imperial Son Tian step out and launch an attack at him.","In this way, Imperial Son Ming finally had a chance to catch his breath. After recovering slightly, he joined forces with Imperial Son Tian to battle Brother Monkey.","The two strongest Imperial Sons had already advanced into Three Stars. Thus, the might of their combined forces had already surpassed Brother Monkey.","However, they couldn’t maintain their strongest state forever, and their battle prowess fluctuated. On the other hand, Brother Monkey could maintain his battle prowess at its peak 70% of the time. In this way, even if Brother Monkey couldn’t win, he wouldn’t be at a disadvantage either.","All the Dao Childs sighed ruefully. Really, the era that belonged to the Imperial Sons and the Golden Generation had already passed.","And now, counting the prodigies, it should be Ling Han, Yang Yihuan, Ding Shu, Brother Monkey and the others.","Brother Monkey was battling against two Venerate Tier elites. On the other side, Ling Han was forcefully suppressing, and Wu Yue was also unable to hold on any longer.","Peng, peng, peng! Ling Han had prepared a powerful move, and shot out 20 flashes of Regulations with a single strike. This had completely exceeded Wu Yue Yue’s tolerance limit. With a single strike, he was torn into pieces.","However, his blood and flesh reformed, and he instantly recovered.","The Substitution Seal!","Ling Han was astonished. Could it be that the Battle God Palace had truly obtained the inheritance of a Great Emperor? Otherwise, it was said that without an Imperial Weapon, it would be impossible to create a Substitution Seal, which involved the Regulations of the highest level.","Wu Yue managed to save his life, and didn’t even dare to say a harsh word. He hurriedly tore a rip into the Void and tried to flee.","However, Ling Han’s Phoenix Wings Divine Flight had already caught up to him. When he threw another punch, Destructive Energy was already boiling on his fist.","Completely different!","Instantly, heaven and earth paled, and the Void trembled.","Even Ling Han himself was shocked. What was going on?","This was the first time he had cast this technique since obtaining the Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy. He had not expected that it would actually cause such a strange phenomenon.","He had just cultivated the complete form of Destructive Energy, when the heaven and earth were alerted, and sent down a punishment of lightning. A layer of shackles was placed on his fruit of cultivation, which could not be removed even now. This also caused him to feel apprehensive, and he no longer used Destructive Energy.","—There was indeed no need to use it.","But now, in order to overlook the Substitution Seal, he subconsciously used the Destructive Energy, which actually caused heaven and earth to pale?","Could it be that it was not recognized by heaven and earth?","Peng!","The Destructive Energy was unleashed, turning into a streak of light that shot towards Wu Yue.","The speed of this light could not be described. It was as if the moment it attacked, it had already reached its target.","Wu Yue had absolutely no time to dodge or parry. Because he had exchanged blows with Ling Han for so long, he was naturally very familiar with Ling Han’s battle prowess. He could not have imagined that Ling Hanji’s attack speed would reach such a high level all of a sudden.","Peng, Destructive Energy surged past, and Wu Yue instantly lost half his body, falling directly from the skies.","The strongest seed of the Battle God Palace had thus died.","This caused the pupils of the Imperial Sons to contract. They were certain that Wu Yue’s Substitution Seal definitely could not be used just once, but in truth, he had indeed been killed with a single strike from Ling Han.","That terrifying energy... did it possess an ability that even the Substitution Seal wouldn’t be effective against?","This was terrifying. This meant that when one faced Ling Han in future, he would not have the chance to start over at all.","“Ling Han, you really didn’t die!” Ding Shu and the others all shook their heads. They both felt relieved and rueful. Even the Saint hadn’t been able to kill him. This guy was really too terrifying.","“Ling Han!” Chi Menghan pounced over. Previously, when Ling Han was fighting, she couldn’t disturb him, but now, her worry, her depression, and surprise all burst forth in an instant.","Ling Han smiled as he pulled Chi Menghan into his arms. This was the first time he had admitted his relationship with Chi Menghan in public.","If anyone could guess what he was thinking, they would definitely go crazy with fury.","That was an Imperial Daughter, and one that was comparable to the Golden Generation. Her being able to take a fancy to you was the good fortune that you had accumulated over eight lifetimes, and you are actually making excuses, putting on airs?","Sigh, they had been fed a public display of affection!","The Imperial Sons, the Dao Childs, and the others all wanted nothing more than to chop Ling Han up. A supreme Celestial Flower had been plucked by Ling Han just like that; this was too despicable!","‘Hmm?’","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s mind, and he sent a message through divine sense to Brother Monkey, “A Saint is about to arrive. We should retreat!”"]},{"number":4515,"title":"Chapter 4515: Slightly setting back a Saint","paragraphs":["Chapter 4515: Slightly setting back a Saint","Editor: Henyee Translations","Brother Monkey nodded, and with a wave of the metal rod, the two Imperial Sons were forced back. Then, he used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and quickly landed beside Ling Han.","He tore a rip into space, and immediately left with Ling Han.","Before entering into the Void , Ling Han smiled at Chi Menghan. They still had a lot of time. Wait for me at the Donglin Imperial Clan.","Chi Menghan also nodded, her gaze resolute.","In the instant that Ling Han and Brother Monkey disappeared, a saintly might spread out. Space was torn apart, and a green-robed old man walked out.","The Ziwei Clan’s Divine Fluid Saint.","...","He sensed for a while, and did not need anyone to remind him. Immediately, he stretched out his hand towards the location where Brother Monkey had torn a rip into space, “Want to run?”","Boom, his large hand directly shattered space, reaching directly into the Void.","However, after a while, he frowned and retracted the large hand, only to see that half of it was missing.","Hiss!","When everyone saw this, their hearts trembled.","The Saint’s attack had actually been blocked?","The Divine Fluid Saint withdrew his Dao Manifestation, only to see a faint trace of blood on his left hand.","This caused everyone to feel even more apprehensive. The Saint had actually been injured.","Heavens, Ling Han and Brother Monkey actually had the ability to injure Saints, though it was only a slight injury.","They really could not understand. No matter how heaven-defying Brother Monkey was, he was only a Three Star Venerate, after all. He was still a million miles away from Saint Tier, so how could he possibly wound a Saint?","This was practically a dream!","If these people knew that Ling Han had the Energy Jade in his possession, and the attack that exploded was equivalent to the explosion of a great planet, they would not think it to be such a strange thing.","Ling Han knew that the Saint would catch up to him, so he had left behind three Energy Jades in advance. As a result, the Divine Fluid Saint indeed started to pursue him. He immediately detonated the three jades, creating a terrifying explosion in the Void.","This was the explosive might of three great planets, and furthermore, they had all exploded at the same point. Even the Saint would frown at this.","Sure enough, this blocked the Divine Fluid Saint’s advance.","“What, Ling Han actually didn’t die?” The Divine Fluid Saint’s expression instantly became incredibly cold. He couldn’t help but think of Baili Chuan, Baili Yang, and the others of his clan who had been killed.","Brother Monkey’s figure was among them, so the other mysterious Sect Master... must be Ling Han!","Damn it, damn it.","The Divine Fluid Saint flew into a thunderous rage. However, what could he do? Ling Han and Brother Monkey had already disappeared into the distance. Even though he was a Saint, he wasn’t omnipotent.","Furthermore, Ling Han’s death had been confirmed by the Saints, and not just one!","This time, even Saints had also suffered a great humiliation. How humiliating.","However, at the same time, he also found this to be inconceivable. At that time, he had also been present, and he was very sure that when the Fire Leaving Saint had attacked him, Ling Han definitely had not torn a rip into space and fled.","Just how had he managed to survive the attack of a Saint?","The Divine Fluid Saint racked his brains, yet he couldn’t figure it out no matter what.","...","Ling Han and Brother Monkey continuously traversed through the Void. After reaching the level of Sect Master, Ling Han’s tolerance of the pressure of the Void was naturally countless times stronger. He was unafraid even if he had to traverse continuously for a few months.","It wasn’t long before they returned to their temporary residence.","The empress and the others all approached him. It had been close to a year since they had last seen each other.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He had gained a lot this time, and the amount of Celestial Qi he had obtained was astonishing.","—This was the combined effort of all the Imperial Clans, mobilizing the resources of the entire universe, so it was naturally awesome.","Ling Han was overjoyed, yet at the same time, he was also slightly depressed.","His persona had crumbled too quickly.","You see, he had pretended to be dead very well, but on his first appearance, his disguise had been exposed. This was practically incredible.","Was he really that lacking in acting skills?","Ling Han reflected on his actions, shaking his head and sighing.","He didn’t bother about this first. Since he had obtained so much Celestial Qi, he naturally had to take advantage of the opening to madly increase his cultivation level.","Ling Han continued to concoct alchemical pills, tempering the Celestial Qi that he had obtained again, elevating it to another level.","This took him a whole two years and seven months, but the longer he spent on alchemy, the more it meant that his gains were great.","Then, both he and Brother Monkey began to take alchemical pills to level up.","Four Stars, five Stars, six Stars!","Ling Han increased cultivation by three minor levels in one go, causing even him to grit his teeth. The sudden increase in his cultivation level wasn’t necessarily a good thing either. He had to be careful of having weak foundations. Otherwise, there might come a time when he couldn’t hold up to his cultivation level, or there would be some aftereffects.","Hence, by the time he reached the level of Six Star Sect Master, even though he still had a few Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pills that he had not ingested, Ling Han planned to take his time. He had to stabilize his cultivation level first.","On the other side, Brother Monkey’s improvement was slightly smaller. He had advanced into the Four Star Venerate Tier.","It couldn’t be helped. The higher the cultivation level, the more resources were needed to advance one level. It was already very difficult to advance to the next level, and this was still because Ling Han had spent more resources on Brother Monkey.","“Yi, where’s Old Black and the others?” Ling Han came out of seclusion, and discovered that he did not see the large black dog, the little azure dragon, or the pervert pig.","Previously, when he had returned, he had not seen these three troublemakers either, but he had not taken it to heart. Now that he had concocted alchemical pills and cultivated in seclusion for close to three years, there was still no sign of those three guys, which made him both curious and slightly worried.","“Not long after you went to Yahe Planet, the three of them also ran off. They said that they were also going to attend the auction, and there was no news from them after that,” the empress said.","Yi?","Ling Han faltered upon hearing this. These three idiots had also gone to Yahe Planet? However, he hadn’t seen them!","Furthermore, the auction had long since ended. It had already been three years, so no matter how slow they were, they should have returned by now.","Could it be that something had happened?","However, the universe was vast, so how were they supposed to find a mere three people?","Ling Han decided to wait. If these three guys didn’t return in another year, he would take a trip to Yahe Planet.","He continued to predict his own path of cultivation, and as his cultivation level improved, he took a few more determined steps.","Brother Monkey’s improvement was also gratifying. He had successfully created his own path.","As the bloodline of the Battle Saint Emperor, Dao would be attained through battle. Brother Monkey was also extremely bellicose, so it was very easy for him to walk his own path.","However, Brother Monkey had only touched a sliver of it now, so he began to cultivate in seclusion. He had to stabilize this step. Otherwise, it was very likely that his path of cultivation would collapse.","After a year, Ling Han had more or less stabilized his cultivation level. He consumed the remaining Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pills, but the amount was too little, and it was not enough to support him to advance to the next level.","Inside his body, countless dimensions had been nurtured by the Celestial Qi, and they were all incredibly powerful and full of vitality. There were more than ten times more living beings that had stepped onto the path of cultivation, and elites like Celestial Kings had also increased several times over.","However, the Heavenly Venerable Tier was a barrier that only a rare few could cross, and was practically unchanged.","Ling Han shook his head. He decided to look for the large black dog and the others.","Another year had passed, and there was still no news.","Ling Han set off. This time, he was travelling alone, so his speed was slightly slower. However, he could continuously use Transfer Formation, so his speed was still astonishingly fast.","He arrived at Yahe Planet. After circling around a few times, he still couldn’t find any clues about the large black dog and the others.","Helpless, he could only return.","However, he had just returned, when he received news that the large black dog and the others had actually sent out a call for help!"]},{"number":4516,"title":"Chapter 4516: Calling for help","paragraphs":["Chapter 4516: Calling for help","Editor: Henyee Translations","The large black dog and the others had contacted through the Galaxy Network, but the person they had contacted was naturally not Ling Han — Ling Han had long since stopped using the Galaxy Network. Instead, it was Ji Wuming.","Previously, when Ling Han had returned to the Celestial Sea Planet, he had given some people Galaxy Network connection devices. The large black dog and the others had also added the accounts of these few people to their contact list in case of emergencies.","Now, it was really useful.","Ling Han checked the message that the large black dog and the others had left behind. This was a verbal message, and it was intermittent, showing that the signal there was not good.","“Little Han... we’re trapped... a wolf pack...”","The description was vague, but fortunately, the galactic coordinates could still be recognized.","...","This was the only message.","Ling Han was astonished. Had the large black dog and the others been surrounded by a wolf pack?","Besieged for three to four years?","He didn’t hesitate and immediately set off, following the galactic coordinates.","After spending two months, he was already close to these coordinates. However, he could not advance any further.","That was because the teleportation to that planet had already been banned.","Why?","Ling Han asked for the reason, and found out that from four years ago, everyone who had been teleported to that planet had disappeared.","If they were alive, there was no sign of them. If they were dead, there was no sign of their corpses.","It was also because of this that the teleportation to that planet was completely closed off.","Yi, it was after the large black dog and the others were teleported here that they suddenly disappeared from the face of the earth?","However, the Cold Sealed Planet in front of him wasn’t a dead planet a land of peril, that no one could set foot on. In reality, it was completely calm there. It was just that the Transfer Formation couldn’t be used. Otherwise, something would definitely happen.","A Venerate Tier had attempted this before. They had attempted to tear a rip into the Void to reach Cold Sealed Planet, but what was the result?","He immediately fled out of the Void, saying that there was an unknown power in the Void. He didn’t dare to advance any further, fearing that something big would happen.","As time passed, Cold Sealed Star Planet became more and more famous. Now, a considerable number of forces had come to investigate, wanting to find out the reason.","Ling Han did not use the Transfer Formation either. Instead, he flew over physically, heading towards Cold Sealed Planet.","Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was unleashed. He stepped on the threads of Regulations in the stars, and his speed was extraordinarily fast.","Merely seven days later, he arrived above Cold Sealed Planet.","Looking down from space, this planet was completely white, as if it was covered with white snow, and that was why it was called the Cold Sealed Planet. However, the Cold Sealed Planet was actually not cold at all. It was just that the majority of the land was covered with white sand, so it looked white.","Ling Han descended, and his divine sense spread out. He immediately began to communicate with the ley lines.","The strength of his divine sense had increased again, and it had reached a state of perfection. Communicating with the ley lines was extremely easy for him.","In just an instant, the ley lines of the Cold Sealed Planet seemed to have become an extension of his body.","Ling Han explored this planet. What elites were there, and what level they were? All kinds of information instantly appeared in his mind.","After a while, he revealed a puzzled expression.","This planet... was really very normal, and also very ordinary.","He went to make some queries, and sure enough, the overall level of cultivation of this planet wasn’t very high. The strongest elite was only Spirit Transformation Tier. Of course, because something strange had happened, recently, Sect Masters, or even Venerate Tiers had arrived, wanting to find out the reason.","However, as long as he didn’t tear open the Void, everything was normal here. It could not be any more ordinary.","Ling Han stayed for a month, yet he couldn’t find anything.","What could he do?","He decided to take a risk and take the initiative to teleport himself. He wanted to see if he would be teleported to the large black dog and the others.","Since the large black dog and the others could still send out a signal, which meant that they were temporarily fine, it should not be a hopeless situation.","He would do as he said.","Ling Han tore a rip into space, then stepped in without hesitation.","Instantly, he felt a powerful pulling force, pulling him towards the left.","If he fled now, Ling Han could still leave, but he had entered into the Void to find the large black dog and the others, so it was naturally impossible for him to go the opposite direction.","He let nature take its course, and allowed this power to guide him, speeding up in the Void, faster and faster.","It was really too fast, so fast that Ling Han couldn’t even see his surroundings clearly.","However, aside from the chaotic flow of energy, there was nothing else in the Void. There was no difference whether one could see clearly or not.","Not long after, Ling Han felt another power surge over, causing him to suddenly fall out of the Void.","Yi, where was this place?","Ling Han looked into the distance. He was presently in space. This seemed to be a vacuum, and he could not see any stars in the distance.","However, this place was not dark, because he was standing on a nebula, and this nebula was presently exuding a gentle light.","Strange, why would the nebula give off such a heavy and solid feeling, as if it was the ground.","There naturally couldn’t be ley lines on the nebula. Ling Han sensed for a while, then shook his head dejectedly.","However, if that was the case, he should be able to leave easily.","What about the large black dog and the others?","Why were they trapped?","Ling Han looked ahead. There were layers of fog in the nebula, which blocked visibility and divine sense, so he could only sense a very small area nearby.","He only hesitated for a moment before heading into the depths of the nebula.","He had come to look for the large black dog and the others, so how could he give up now?","As he walked, Ling Han had already entered deep into the area of fog. It was hard to differentiate which direction was ahead, which direction was behind, which direction was right, and which direction was left.","Even for Ling Han, he soon had no choice but to admit that he had lost his way.","This was too shocking. He was a Sect Master, and he had actually lost his way?","Ling Han wanted to soar into the sky, but after leaping 3000 meters into the air, he fell back down heavily. He was actually unable to fly.","“Many Regulations are missing here, so I can’t fly,” Ling Han murmured.","He didn’t panic. Instead, he continued to advance.","This fog turned ocean-like. After a while, he actually discovered “land”, as if it was a lone island in a sea of fog.","It wasn’t big. The longest point was only about 0.5 km, and the narrowest point was only about thirty meters.","Ling Han stepped onto it, and carefully searched for a while, but did not find anything.","He was just about to leave, when he heard a series of footsteps. Then, he saw three people rush onto the island in a very sorry state.","These three people were an old man, followed by a young man and woman.","They were all injured, and their clothes were also slightly damaged. There were also traces of blood, as if they were being hunted down.","When they saw that there was a person standing here, the three of them were obviously taken aback. However, they immediately ignored Ling Han and hurriedly rushed towards the center of the “island”.","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han looked behind the three of them, and could vaguely see a considerable number of black shadows swaying.","Wolves!","These black shadows quickly revealed their true forms. As it turned out, they were white wolves.","There really were wolves?","Ling Han recalled the message from the large black dog, saying tha they had been trapped and there was a wolf pack. Now, a wolf pack had really appeared.","His eyes swept over them. There were a total of nineteen white wolves, and they were all True Self Tier-level.","Of course, this was no concern to him, but the old man and the others couldn’t be unconcerned. Even the strongest old man was only in the True Self Tier."]},{"number":4517,"title":"Chapter 4517: Digging Three Feet Under the Ground to Search","paragraphs":["Chapter 4517: Digging Three Feet Under the Ground to Search","Editor: Henyee Translations","The old man and the others didn’t pay attention to Ling Han, and hurriedly ran towards the most central area of the “island”, trying to distance themselves from the wolf pack as much as possible.","The young man glanced at Ling Han and didn’t say anything. On the other hand, when the woman passed by Ling Han, she kindly reminded, “Hide further inside. It’s too dangerous here!”","Ling Han smiled, and followed the three of them.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Those white wolves only stepped onto the edge of the “island”, as if they had reservations about the land. However, they did not stop here. Instead, they immediately launched an attack, shooting streaks of light over.","Thankfully, though these white wolves were True Self Tier-level, because of the distance, the old man had the chance to calmly parry. Furthermore, when they arrived at the very centre of the “island”, it was as if this place was a natural fortress, and the pillars of light were blocked for no conceivable reason.","Yi?","...","Ling Han was very curious. What was going on here?","“Brat, hurry up and thank my great-grandfather!” the young man said to Ling Han, his expression filled with arrogance.","Now that they were standing here, he would be considered to have escaped danger, and this also allowed him to recover, so he could bother about other matters.","Ling Han chuckled, and nodded at the old man, “Thank you, old mister.”","The old man looked at Ling Han with slight confusion in his eyes, because he really couldn’t see through Ling Han’s cultivation level.","However, Ling Han was so young. How could it be that his abilities were superior to his?","Er, it should be that this young man had cultivated some kind of strange cultivation technique, and that was why he could not see through his cultivation level. It must be so.","When he thought of this, he naturally showed a hint of pride.","He was in True Self Tier, which was very strong, all right?","The woman, on the other hand, was very kind, and said, “My name is Ning Yufen, and this is my older brother, Ning Haidong, and my great-grandfather, Ning Bian. This Young Master, how should I address you?”","Ling Han pondered for a moment before revealing his true name.","However, Ning Bian and the others didn’t look shocked at all. It was as if they had never heard of Ling Han’s name before.","This was normal. There were really too many people with the same name in this world. They would not link this Ling Han with that Ling Han whose name shook the whole world.","To say the least, with their level, it was very likely that they had no knowledge of Ling Han’s battle merits at all, so there was no reason for them to be shocked.","In their eyes, Ling Han was just an ordinary young man.","“When was Young Master Ling dragged here?” Ning Yufen asked. Then, she took the initiative to relate, “The three of us initially wanted to go to the Highest Heaven Planet. We were just about to teleport two more times, but in the end, we encountered some chaotic turbulence here, and actually ended up here.”","Was this a space vortex?","Ling Han didn’t think so. However, he didn’t say it out loud. Instead, he said, “A few of my friends have disappeared here, so I came to take a look.”","Pu, Ning Haidong immediately spluttered in laughter, shaking his head with a disdainful expression.","Wasn’t it?","He didn’t even have much strength, yet he actually dared to take the initiative to run over?","He had never seen such a stupid person!","Yet a thought flashed in Ning Yufen’s head, “In that case, Young Master Ling has not been in this place for too long?”","“That’s right.” Ling Han nodded.","Ning Yufen instantly looked pleased, “Then, the people outside should already be aware of the strangeness of this place?”","“That’s right.”","“That’s great, then we would be saved!” she exclaimed, clapping her hands.","Ning Haidong’s reaction was much slower. After a long while, he finally smiled and said, “With so many people paying attention, it will definitely attract the attention of elites. At that time, we will be able to break out of this strange land and escape!”","He did not think that this place was all that frightening. It was just that there were some white wolves that he disliked very much.","Ling Han glanced at this young man, and felt that these three people had better luck.","Just think, what cultivation level did the large black dog and the others have?","All of them were Spirit Transformation Tier True Lords!","However, they also mentioned a wolf pack, obviously thinking that the wolf pack was terrifying and a threat to them.","Thus, there must still be a Spirit Transformation Tier, or even Sect Master-level wolf pack here.","“Hey, hey, hey, what’s with that expression?” Ning Haidong’s eyes were sharp. He could sense that Ling Han was smiling, as if he was mocking him.","“Brother, we’re all in the same boat; we should not target each other!” Ning Yufen hurriedly advised.","Ning Haidong was quite obedient towards this younger sister of his. He humphed at Ling Han, and did not speak any further.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t take such a minor character to heart. He was curious. There were clearly wolves roaming around here, but why were there so many “islands” that one could use to avoid danger?","Were these man-made?","With a thought, he began to dig.","“Hey, what are you doing?” Ning Bian and the others all got a scare, especially Ning Haidong, who directly jumped up and pointed angrily at Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled and said, “If we can figure out why the wolves don’t dare to set foot on this land, perhaps we’ll be able to travel unhindered here.”","When Ning Bian and the others heard this, they were all stunned. ‘Oh, that’s right. This is a very simple logic, so why didn’t they think of it?’","Out of habit, while they searched for a way out here, if they encountered a wolf pack, they would run, and search for “islands” to hide.","However, why didn’t they think about what might be on the “island”? It was this thing that made the wolf pack afraid. Thus, as long as they dug it out, wouldn’t they be able to chase away the wolf pack?","Thus, Ning Haidong immediately began digging as well. If there really was such a treasure, they definitely could not allow it to fall into Ling Han’s hands.","They dug, but after digging for close to three hundred meters, they still found nothing.","Ning Haidong was the first to give up. He sneered, and said, “This place is strange. It’s not as simple as you think!”","If one could obtain treasures by digging into the ground, and scare off the wolf pack, that would be too easy.","Ling Han didn’t pay any heed to this, and he continued to dig.","Once he set his mind on something, he would usually not turn back even if he ran through a wall.","2000 meters, 3000 meters, 4000 meters... Ning Bian and Ning Yufen had already stopped, and only Ling Han was still digging.","After digging another 1500 meters, Ling Han suddenly felt a terrifying aura. It was incredibly sharp, and it shot out from the ground. He managed to dodge in time, but still managed to slice off a corner of his clothes.","Even if there was still a slight distance between them, and it had not sliced into his body, his skin was still burning with pain.","Hiss, what exactly was buried underneath?","Ling Han didn’t dare to dig any further. If this aura exploded completely, he would definitely be in trouble.","As he saw it, it was either a powerful person below, or a terrifying weapon, and that was why even a sliver of aura exuded was incredibly terrifying.","He thought for a moment, then returned to the top.","This could possibly draw a fatal calamity to him, so he naturally could not continue.","Seeing Ling Han return empty-handed, Ning Haidong couldn’t help but sneer.","Humph, what kind of limelight had he been in? Now, it had turned into him being embarrassed, right?","Ling Han looked around, and the wolf pack around him had not dispersed.","He decided not to wait any longer, and instead continue onwards.","—A mere True Self Tier wolf pack, could they stop him?","Ling Han strode forwards."]},{"number":4518,"title":"Chapter 4518: Subdued","paragraphs":["Chapter 4518: Subdued","Editor: Henyee Translations","Yi, have you gone mad?","Ning Yufen and the others were all astounded. They had never seen such a person before. Taking the initiative to court death?","Could it be that because he had been mocked by Ning Haidong, it had incited the pride that was typical of youth?","“Young Master Ling, don’t be angry!” Ning Yufen reminded.","Yet Ling Han merely smiled. He had only met these three by chance, and had no obligation to help them tide over their difficulties.","He had his own mission. He had to find the large black dog and the others first, and then consider other matters.","...","Ning Yufen still wanted to chase after him, yet she saw that the white wolves had already launched an attack. Ning Bian pulled her back.","“Humph, let this kind of ungrateful person fend for himself,” Ning Haidong said coldly.","Before he had even finished speaking, the white wolves’ attacks had already landed on Ling Han.","However, the following scene caused Ning Bian and the others to go numb with shock.","Ling Han was completely unscathed!","How was this possible!","They all gaped, as if they had seen a ghost.","Ling Han strode forwards, and had already reached the edge of the “island”. His eyes swept over them, and he asked calmly, “Are you still not getting lost?”","These white wolves seemed to have sensed Ling Han’s aura, and all of them released low howls of “wuwuwu”. However, there seemed to be a proud and aloof trait in their blood. They clearly knew that Ling Han was not to be trifled with, but they still did not retreat. They merely dug their claws, appearing very irritable.","“I gave you guys the chance, so don’t blame me,” Ling Han said with a shake of his head.","In a situation when there was no animosity between them, he did not mind giving others a chance, even if it was a fierce beast.","However, if they remained stubborn, he wouldn’t be hesitant or soft-hearted either.","Ling Han waved his hand, and the Regulations transformed into Sword Rays. As the sword swept past, the entire wolf pack was instantly annihilated.","‘F*ck!’","Ning Bian and the others were rendered completely speechless. Just what kind of abilities were these?","He was freakishly awesome!","Ling Han didn’t give the three members of the Ning Clan any chance to make up for their mistake. He activated his movement technique and rapidly left.","He didn’t pay them any regard at all.","Ning Bian and the others naturally beat their chests and stamped their feet in regret.","This was a young elite. If they could follow him, they may be able to find the way out.","“Humph, show off!” Ning Haidong muttered softly.","You clearly have such strong abilities, yet still dodged with them. What else could it be but showing off?","Pa, he instantly received a slap on the head. It was Ning Bian who had slapped him. The old man was very angry.","Meanwhile, Ning Yufen said faintly, “Brother, just based on your previous attitude, if it was any other person, they would have long since killed you, right? This Young Master Ling can be considered extremely magnanimous, and you should be grateful.”","Ning Haidong still wanted to argue, but when he thought about how the gap between the two of them was as wide as the gap between heaven and earth, what was the use of verbal attacks?","...","Ling Han strolled slowly. To say nothing of a True Self Tier-level wolf pack, even if it was a Venerate Tier-level wolf pack... he still had some confidence that he could deal with it.","Why?","He had the Great Emperor Horn, and this was extraordinarily effective against the Wolf Tribe. Even the Imperial Son could not resist it.","Thus, he was confident that he could make even Venerate Tier-level wolves wag their tails and beg for mercy at his feet.","Thinking about this scene, he was still slightly expectant.","After walking for a while, he discovered another “island”, but he still did not have the slightest sense of direction. Even for paths he had already travelled, he was unable to form a map in his mind. It was as if there was an indescribable power affecting him, that he could not resist.","Not long after, the wolf pack came again.","It was still white, but much weaker. It was only Cauldron Forging Tier-level.","Ling Han didn’t make a move at all. Killing a wolf pack of this level couldn’t temper battle prowess.","He directly streaked past. Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was used, and even a Venerate Tier elite wouldn’t be able to catch up to him. At most, they would be evenly matched with him in speed.","Where exactly were the large black dog and the others?","Ling Han walked around, but he had no sense of direction at all. He could only walk around randomly.","Several days later, he actually encountered Ning Bian and the others again.","The three of them were unlucky, and were hunted down by the wolf pack again, and this time, their luck was really too bad. The wolf pack was Spiritual Transformation Tier-level, and they couldn’t even dodge, and would only be insta-killed.","However, they were also very fortunate to have encountered Ling Han at this time.","Ling Han didn’t hesitate. With a wave of his hand, the wolf pack was annihilated.","This allowed Ning Bian and the others to survive a calamity, and they were even more stunned by Ling Han’s strength.","This was too terrifying.","It was only a single move, and in a single move, he had insta-killed a dozen over Spiritual Transformation Tier-level fierce beasts. This strength was illogical.","‘You’re so young, so how did you cultivate?’","“Thank—”","Ning Yufen had just managed to say one word, when Ling Han had already flown away.","This place was far too large, so much so that one would lose all sense of direction. Thus, it would be far too difficult to find the large black dog and the others.","But no matter how difficult it was, so what? How could he not find them?","Old Black and the others didn’t have the Great Emperor Horn. If they encountered a Sect Master-level wolf pack, and didn’t have any “isles” to take refuge on, then it would be hard to say what their situation would be.","The only thing that made Ling Han feel at ease was that these three guys had all cultivated Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and their speed was comparable to cultivators and fierce beasts that were one level higher than them. Thus, this would greatly increase their ability to survive.","They definitely had to hold on until he arrived.","After wandering around aimlessly for a few more days, Ling Han finally encountered the Sect Master-level wolf pack.","There weren’t many, only seven, but it was equivalent to seven Sect Masters acting in unison. This was already terrifying enough.","Ling Han’s interest was piqued, and he raised his fist to greet the incoming attack.","However, he was too disappointed. The seven ferocious wolves were completely not enough for him to fight. In a few punches and kicks, he had eliminated all of them.","So weak?","No, he was too strong!","Ling Han sighed, and continued onwards.","This was a super labyrinth. It was clear that there was no obstruction in any direction, yet no matter how hard he tried, he could not walk out.","Another three days passed, and Ling Han suddenly felt a powerful aura approach.","This was... a Venerate Tier-level great beast!","Ling Han’s heart immediately clenched. He looked to his right, and a shadow appeared in the fog. Then, it slowly became clear, revealing a white wolf that was about nine meters tall.","Venerate Tier elite!","However, Ling Han wasn’t nervous. So what if it was a Venerate Tier-level great beast? As long as he used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, even a Venerate Tier-level great beast would only be able to eat dust behind him.","There was only one, but wasn’t a Venerate Tier-level great beast enough?","This fierce beast stared at Ling Han, and slowly bared its mouth, revealing giant fangs that were like divine blades.","Ling Han smiled, “Doggy, sit!”","The ferocious wolf was furious. Though it was a fierce beast, being able to become a Venerate Tier, it naturally still had some intelligence. It could completely understand Ling Han’s contempt and mockery, which made it feel that its pride had been provoked.","Hence, it immediately waved its claws, and delivered a paw strike at Ling Han.","Ling Han bounced off his feet, and rapidly dodged. Then, he took out the Great Emperor Horn, and blew it strongly.","His Spiritual Power suddenly dropped drastically, but a soundless wave also spread out.","The vicious beast’s claw instantly froze in midair, then withdrew. It pounced quickly to Ling Han’s feet, and rubbed its head against Ling Han’s leg. Boom, Venerate Tier-level power reverberated.","If this was any other Sect Master, he would definitely be directly shattered by this fierce beast acting spoiled. However, just how strong was Ling Han’s physique? He forcefully withstood it.","However, it really hurt a little!"]},{"number":4519,"title":"Chapter 4519: Finding Old Black","paragraphs":["Chapter 4519: Finding Old Black","Editor: Henyee Translations","Not bad, he had obtained a Venerate Tier pet.","The Great Emperor Horn was truly heaven-defying.","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and pressed it down on the head of the ferocious wolf.","This ferocious wolf was much taller than Ling Han. Thus, Ling Han couldn’t reach it even if he stretched out his hand. However, the ferocious wolf lowered its head on its own accord, allowing Ling Han to easily touch it.","Ling Han searched the divine sense of the vicious wolf.","Though this fierce wolf was Venerate Tier-level, its memory was incredibly simple.","...","Ever since it could remember, it had lived in this fog, and to it, this fog was the best tonic, allowing it to endlessly increase its cultivation level.","And that was that.","Ling Han was astonished. A mighty Venerate Tier-level beast had been living in this sea of fog all this while, feeding on the fog and continuously improving its cultivation level?","However, vicious beasts were vicious beasts, after all. Thus, when outsiders invaded, they would instinctively attack.","In the memories of this fierce wolf, it had already killed no less than a few hundred people.","There was one thing that pleasantly surprised Ling Han, and that was the ferocious wolf would not get lost in this sea of fog.","In this way, there was hope that he could find the large black dog and the others. There was no need to search for a needle in a haystack.","“I’ll give you a name.”","Ling Han pondered for a moment before replying, “I’ll call you Mantis Shrimp.”","The fierce wolf didn’t care. Its intelligence was pitifully low, and it didn’t know the difference between a shrimp and a wolf at all.","“Mantis Shrimp, let’s go.”","Ling Han jumped onto the wolf’s back, and had the fierce wolf bring him to find the large black dog and the others.","Though the ferocious wolf did not know where the large black dog and the others were, the advantage was that it would definitely not lose its way. In other words, there was no need for them to take the wrong path.","That was enough.","Ling Han rode the fierce wolf, and searched around in this sea of fog.","After a few days, he had a rough impression.","The width of this sea of fog was about three days’ journey, and its length was about the same. However, if he wanted to search every area, that would not take three or six days’ time, but would take an astonishingly long time.","He hoped that the large black dog and the others wouldn’t run around randomly.","Ling Han thought to himself.","After a whole two months, Ling Han finally found the large black dog and the others.","He had not even seen the large black dog from afar, when he heard the large black dog making a fuss.","“You guys, are you planning to kick me to the curb after I’ve outlived my usefulness?” The large black dog’s arrogant voice rang out.","Ling Han frowned upon seeing this. Had Old Black been bullied?","Riding the fierce wolf, he slowly walked forwards.","There was an “island” ahead of them, and there were a great many wolf corpses lying around the island. Their injuries varied, with saber wounds, sword wounds, and claw marks. Clearly, they had died at the hands of different people.","However, the ferocious wolves were not completely eliminated. There were still about seven roaring on the sidelines.","On the “island”, the large black dog, the little azure dragon and the pervert pig were facing off against 11 cultivators. They were surrounded, and all of them were injured, appearing to be in a very bad situation.","“Hand over the Imperial Technique that you all possess. Otherwise, you can all go and be fed to the wolves!” A cultivator smirked coldly.","Ling Han gave an ‘oh’ in understanding.","These people coveted the Imperial Techniques that the large black dog had on them. Indeed, Imperial Techniques could drive anyone crazy.","However, he hadn’t expected that the biggest threat to the large black dog and the others wasn’t the wolf pack. Instead, it was the cultivators who had been trapped here.","Ling Han’s expression was baleful. Under his control, the fierce wolf beneath him moved quietly, revealing his tall figure in the fog.","Because of the angle, Ling Han, who was seated on it, was not seen by anyone. Thus, everyone could only see the appearance of a massive white wolf, exuding the aura of a Venerate Tier elite.","All of a sudden, everyone felt an immense pressure.","“There’s no need to be afraid. Fierce wolves can’t possibly reach the island!” A martial artist in a long green robe comforted everyone. “Just in time. This is a Venerate Tier-level great beast, and it can easily tear Spirit Transformation True Lords into pieces.”","“If you guys still don’t hand over the Imperial Technique, we’ll chase you guys out!”","“There is no need to leave the island. As long as you leave the central area, you will all be killed by the fierce wolves!”","“So, if you don’t want to die, hand over the Imperial Technique immediately!”","The eyes of these people were burning. The temptation of the Imperial Technique was really too great. Furthermore, this could be considered a natural Mystery Realm. In future, if they killed others to keep them quiet, who would know that they had obtained the Imperial Technique?","The large black dog spat, “Do you think Grandpa Dog doesn’t know that once we hand over the Imperial Technique, you will kill us to keep us quiet!”","“Heng, heng!” The pervert pig nodded continuously.","Meanwhile, the little azure dragon raised its head high, and said, “If worse comes to worst, we’ll just have a battle! Even if we suffer some injuries, and our battle prowess declines, if you guys want to kill us, you’ll have to pay an exorbitant price. I wonder which of you is prepared to die with us.”","These words were very clever. They both expressed their determination to fight to the death, and also incited conflict the relationship between those eleven people.","Those who died... would have died for nothing.","Who would be such a fool?","However, these eleven people seemed to have reached an agreement, and faced with this kind of provocation, not one of them was moved.","The matter was not easy to deal with.","Yi?","The large black dog and the others faltered at the same time. This was because they had received a divine sense transmission. A look of pleasant surprise instantly appeared on their faces, and they immediately retracted their divine sense.","“I’ve decided that even if I die, I won’t let you succeed!” the large black dog suddenly said in a righteous voice.","“Let’s go!” The little azure dragon also charged toward death with a generous expression.","“Heng, heng!” The pervert pig was disdainful. ‘You guys are all actors.’","The large black dog and little azure dragon turned around, then grabbed the perverted pig and headed out of the island.","What was going on?","Everyone was dumbfounded. In their impression, the large black dog and the others were all extremely afraid of death, so why were they suddenly so determined?","“Let them go!” One of them smirked coldly, “Once the fierce wolves attack, let’s see if they won’t flee back in a sorry state, and beg for mercy.”","Everyone nodded in agreement. If there were only seven Spiritual Transformation Tier-level wolves, the large black dog and the others might still have a chance of survival. However, now when there was another Venerate Tier-level wolf?","What a joke. To be able to escape from the eyes of a Venerate Tier-level beast, this was practically a fantasy story, all right?","One step, two steps, three steps, the large black dog and the others had already walked far out of the central area, but all the fierce wolves were just sitting by and watching, and not one of them attacked.","Yi, what was going on here?","The eleven people in the center of the island were all shocked. They could not accept this at all.","Could it be that the three of them were also beasts, so... there was differential treatment?","However, forget about that dog. Shouldn’t wolves eat pigs?","Their temperament had changed drastically. Had they become vegetarian?","When they arrived at the borders, the large black dog stopped, then turned around, “Sons of a b@stard, do you still want Grandpa Dog’s Imperial Technique?”","This?","Everyone gritted their teeth. They could not accept this reality at all.","Someone tried to walk out, but he had just walked out of the safety zone, when he saw a fierce wolf open its mouth, and spit out a silvery light that attacked him.","That person hurriedly retreated, shrinking back into a safe area.","He was completely stupefied!","The wolf pack hadn’t become vegetarian, so what was going on?"]},{"number":4520,"title":"Chapter 4520: Get out","paragraphs":["Chapter 4520: Get out","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ɲ”Sons of a b@stard, are you shocked?” The large black dog laughed loudly, “Who is Grandpa Doǥ? Dogs are the leader of the Wolf Tribe. My bloodline is noble, and naturally superior to Wolf Tribe!”","What bullsh*t!","Previously, you had also been hunted down by the wolf pack and fled in a sorry state, all right? Why didn’t I see you act so pretentious at that time?","However, everyone was confused. Why didn’t the wolf pack attack the large black dog and the others now?","“Trash like you actually dare to threaten Grandpa Dragon!” The little azure dragon was not the type to spare others verbally either, and pointed at everyone. “Now, it’s Grandpa Dragon’s turn to flip out!”","“Come, bite these b@stards in front of Grandpa Dragon to death!”","...","Unfortunately, the wolf pack still only surrounded the “island”, and not one of them obeyed the command to attack.","The little azure dragon couldn’t help but fly into a rage out of humiliation. This was bullying him too much.","“Haha, Four-Legged Snake, you can’t do it!” the large black dog mocked.","“Are you guys done yet!” Among the eleven people, a middle-aged man in a yellow shirt shouted in a deep voice, “What kind of tricks are you playing? Let’s be clear, what’s the point of doing this?”","The large black dog humphed, and said, “Grandpa Dog has never been one to suffer losses. Since you’ve forced us out, I’ll let you suffer the consequences of your own actions!”","“Hahaha!” The eleven people all laughed loudly.","Though they did not know why the wolf pack did not attack the large black dog and the others, when the eleven of them joined forces, their battle prowess was far superior to the large black dog and the others. Otherwise, they would not have dared to force them previously.","“What right do you have to chase us out?” These people asked with a grin.","“Leave it to me,” a voice rang out from the body of the Venerate Tier-level wolf.","Yi?","These people were all shocked. What? A ferocious wolf that had gained intelligence had actually appeared?","Once it developed intelligence, it would no longer be a fierce beast, but a Demonic Beast!","Demonic Beasts and cultivators were no longer hostile. They could actively cultivate, and could use the celestial technique. In fact, after revealing their true form, their defense, attack power, and speed were all considerably superior to cultivators of the same cultivation level.","A Venerate Tier-level great beast, just how terrifying was that!","Next, this fierce wolf slowly lowered its body, as if it was crawling.","This piqued everyone’s curiosity. Could it be that this ferocious wolf was bowing to them?","Use civility before resorting to force?","Er!","This was truly strange and hilarious. A Venerate Tier-level great beast was prostrating in front of them in respect?","However, the following scene shocked them so much that their eyes almost popped out of their heads.","There was actually a person seated on the back of this giant wolf!","Only now did they know that it was not the giant wolf that had gained intelligence, but rather the person on top that had spoken.","But this was even more shocking to them.","That was a Venerate Tier-level fierce beast, and precisely because it was a fierce beast, it could not possibly have any kind of reverence, so how could it possibly be taken as a pet beast?","Inconceivable! Unbelievable!","“Little Han!” The large black dog and the others all rushed over. “Brat, you’ve finally received the message that we sent out!”","What, they knew each other!","Everyone finally understood why the wolf pack didn’t attack the large black dog and the others.","That was because there was someone ruthless, that even a Venerate Tier-level giant wolf was his pet beast.","All of a sudden, they were all trembling.","After offending such a ruthless person, did they still have a way out?","Ling Han nodded, then sneered, “Aren’t you guys very capable? Why did you guys ask me for help?”","“Hehehe.” With how shameless the large black dog and the others were, how could they possibly care? They all showed a shameless smile.","Ling Han was only saying this, so how could he really reprimand them?","However, these eleven people in front of him?","Ling Han opened his mouth, and said, “Are you still not getting out?”","These people were too despicable. They should have been in the same boat, but when they charged into a safe area, they were kicking the large black dog and others to the curb. They were even coveting the Imperial Techniques that the large black dog and the others possessed. This kind of action made Ling Han very angry.","The world was already dark enough, so couldn’t there be a little more light?","The eleven people exchanged looks, and all shook their heads.","What a joke. If they went out now, wouldn’t they be torn into pieces by the fierce wolves?","That would be courting death. They were not idiots.","“Sir, don’t go too far!”","“Your cultivation level definitely won’t surpass ours. It’s just that you have a special method to tame beasts!”","“So, as long as we don’t leave the safe zone, even if you have a Venerate-level beast pet, you won’t be able to threaten us.”","These people whispered among themselves, then spoke to Ling Han, one after another.","Was they still going to resist stubbornly?","Ling Han shook his head, and strode towards the heart of the island.","The 11 people all looked alert. They couldn’t see through Ling Han’s strength at all, so they naturally didn’t dare to be careless.","Ling Han made a tapping motion with his finger. Peng! A person’s head instantly exploded into a cloud of blood.","‘F*ck!’","Seeing this scene, the remaining ten all felt a chill run down their spines.","Heavens, this was a Sect Master elite.","Though there were ten of them, against Sect Master-level?","Sorry, they would definitely be insta-killed.","Seeing Ling Han raise his hand again, the ten people were instantly scared out of their wits, and they all rushed out of the island.","They fled very separately. In this way, even if they were pursued, there would definitely be a few that could escape alive.","As for who would be able to escape, that would have to depend on luck.","However, they had forgotten that there was also a Venerate Tier great beast here!","The giant wolf pounced on them one by one. With only ten jumps, it had bitten all ten of them to death.","When a Venerate Tier elite made a move, there was naturally no doubt about the end result.","“This is really venting my anger!” the large black dog said hatefully. Previously, they had been fighting side by side with these people, yet in the end, they had been bitten in the back. Anyone would explode in anger at this, what more when it was the large black dog.","“Let’s go. Let’s think of a way to leave this place.” Ling Han beckoned with his hand, signaling the large black dog and the others to sit on the back of the wolf.","“Hehe, thank you for your hard work!” The large black dog even greeted the giant wolf.","The giant wolf withdrew its Venerate Tier-level intimidation, and the seven ferocious wolves immediately turned around and fled.","The Wolf Tribe had a strict hierarchy. A Venerate Tier-level wolf was completely capable of making a low-level wolf commit suicide. Thus, the seven wolves naturally fled as if they had been granted amnesty.","Ling Han also commanded the giant wolf to charge forward.","He didn’t need to know the direction. It was fine as long as this giant wolf didn’t get lost. They would definitely be able to walk out of the sea of fog as they headed forwards. At that time, they would be able to leave safely.","The giant wolf streaked through the air. Its speed was incredible, and it was as if it were a beam of light.","After all, this was a Venerate Tier.","The Venerate Tier-level wolf cleared the path for them, so they naturally advanced smoothly. After walking for two days, the giant wolf suddenly stopped.","Yi?","Ling Han looked ahead, and a figure could vaguely be seen.","He was curious, because he had not commanded the giant wolf to stop.","Could it be that the person in front of them was so powerful that even the giant wolf felt apprehensive?","A Venerate Tier elite?","Or even a Saint?","At this time, the figure in front of him was approaching, and very soon, a young man appeared in front of Ling Han.","Because of his position, he was looking up at Ling Han, but there was an incredibly confident expression on his face. He did not feel insignificant because of this at all.","“Who are you?”","“Who are you?”","The two of them asked each other at practically the same time."]},{"number":4521,"title":"Chapter 4521: Di Wuji","paragraphs":["Chapter 4521: Di Wuji","Editor: Henyee Translations","The young man revealed a smile, and said, “As the owner of this place, I think I should be qualified to ask about your origins, right?”","What, he was the owner of this place?","Ling Han was internally stunned. Just how inconceivable was this?","However, he actually believed his words more than he disbelieved it.","Why?","Because of the giant wolf’s reaction.","...","This young man was a Sect Master. He was 100% sure of this. Thus, the fact that the giant wolf had taken the initiative to stop was definitely not because of the young man’s strength, but because this giant wolf recognized him.","The problem was that he didn’t find any information about this young man in the giant wolf’s memories. It seemed like it was purely instinctive for this giant wolf to feel reverence.","Interesting.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Previously, there had already appeared such rulers of lands of peril like the sea of blood and the Yin River. Could it be that one of them would also appear here?","“My name is Ling Han.” He smiled slightly.","“Ling Han?” The young man revealed an astounded expression, then smiled as well. “I’ve heard of you, but according to rumors, you’re already dead.”","Ling Han laughed loudly, “The rumors also say that I’m shameless!”","The large black dog, little azure dragon, and pervert pig all rolled their eyes. ‘You are really very shameless. That has absolutely nothing to do with the rumors!’","The young man opposite him nodded, and said, “I am Di Wuji.”","Di?","There was only one surname of ‘Di’, and that was the Wolf Tribe Demon Emperor!","Yi, this place was filled with wolves, and there were even Venerate Tier-level great beasts... could it be? This was the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan?","“Dare I ask, Brother Di, what is this place?” Ling Han asked calmly.","Di Wuji smiled faintly, “Brother Ling should have guessed a little. However, this place is not the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan, but rather another related place. I would like to know, why is Brother Ling actually able to control the Wolf Tribe?”","He naturally knew how ferocious his wolf pack was. Aside from his own bloodline that could suppress them, there was no way anyone else could control them.","Ling Han’s mind whirred. This wasn’t the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan?","However, there were countless wolves here, and even he had lost his sense of direction. Could it be that it was not because of a Great Emperor-level formation?","Aside from the Imperial Clan, where else would there be Emperor-level formations?","Moreover, he dug three feet into the ground, and a terrifying aura seeped out from the ground, easily injuring him.","So, this place was actually not the Imperial Clan of the Demon Wolf Race?","Obviously, Di Wuji could not possibly tell him the full truth. Otherwise, the latter would not have avoided this topic.","Ling Han smiled, and opened his mouth to say, “Oh, I have a natural special ability, and am skilled in controlling all beasts.”","He deliberately swept an eye over the large black dog, the little azure dragon, and the perverted pig. How could these three guys not understand? Immediately, they all put on respectful expressions.","“Woof!”","“Ang!”","“Gu!”","The barking of a dog, the roar of a dragon, and the squealing of a pig seemed to be expressing their submission to Ling Han.","Di Wuji: “...”","He suddenly felt like he was about to go crazy.","‘You’re not playing by the rules, are you?’ Although these three guys were all in the form of beasts, it was clear with a single glance that they were Demonic Beasts and not ferocious beasts.","The so-called Beast Control Proficiency was practically non-existent!","“Hehe, the rumors are not false. You are indeed very shameless!” Di Wuji sighed.","Ling Han put on a serious expression, and rebuked righteously, “Who said that? Who said that? I want to reason with him. How can he insult me behind my back like this!”","The large black dog and the others all chuckled. If you weren’t shameless, there wouldn’t be anyone shameless in this world.","Di Wuji shook his head, and did not linger on this topic. Instead, he asked, “Brother Ling should have a horn on you, right?”","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han tensed. No outsider knew that he possessed a horn.","In fact, even after he had used the horn to control Di Luo, the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan was still completely baffled, and did not know what was going on.","But when it came to Di Wuji, why had he immediately guessed it correctly?","He had long since suspected that the Great Emperor Horn was most likely forged from the bones of the Wolf Emperor, and that was why it could overlook the precious tool of the Wolf Tribe and be effective even on the Imperial Son.","However, the strange thing was that the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan didn’t seem to know about the Great Emperor Horn at all. Instead, in the case of Demon Race, he revealed the secret of the Great Emperor Horn with a single word.","F***, could it be that this Di Wuji had come from the ancient era, so he knew a great many secret techniques of the Wolf Tribe that would not be passed on to others?","“Of course not!” Ling Han’s mind whirred, but his answer was without hesitation. “What’s the use of this horn? It can actually control the Wolf Tribe?”","Di Wuji chuckled, “This horn was refined from a bone that my father extracted from himself. It has a natural suppressive effect on the Wolf Tribe.”","My father!","The large black dog, little azure dragon, and perverted pig all looked at each other in shock.","This guy... was the son of the Wolf Emperor?","Heavens!","Though the Golden Generation was claimed to be close to the level of the Great Emperors in the past, they were all beaten up later on. They were even looked down on by Yang Yihuan and the other “old prodigies”, and thought that it was them that were flattering themselves; they were far inferior to the Great Emperors of the past.","But now, the person standing in front of them could possibly be the son of a Great Emperor?","This was an existence similar to the little azure dragon and the little red bird. Moreover, he seemed to have been developing secretly all this while, hidden in this Mystery Realm. There was no shortage of cultivation resources, unlike the little azure dragon, who had lost his father before he was even born.","Ling Han nodded, “So you are the son of the Great Emperor!”","Di Wuji did not deny it, but rather asked, “Brother Ling, could you return the horn to me? Of course, I will take out some treasures as compensation for Brother Ling.”","“What treasure?” Ling Han asked directly.","Now that things had come to this, if he continued to say that he did not have the Great Emperor Horn on him, that would really be bullying.","Thus, he directly expressed his stand.","Di Wuji thought for a moment, “Brother Ling is presently a Sect Master, so how about I bestow seven portions of Eight Stars Celestial Qi on Brother Ling?”","Celestial Qi was indeed something that Ling Han was in desperate need of. Furthermore, if it was Eight Star Celestial Qi, he would be able to boost it to Nine Stars with some pill refinement.","The problem was, being able to elevate the quality of the Celestial Qi was Ling Han’s ability. Then, seven portions of Eight Star Celestial Qi would have to be traded for a treasure that had been personally refined by a Great Emperor?","Ling Han was definitely at a disadvantage, and a huge disadvantage at that.","His expression became serious, and he said, “Brother Di, you’re far too unfilial!”","Yi, this turn of events is really too sudden, isn’t it?","A muscle twitched in Di Wuji’s cheek. Then, he muttered, “What part of me is unfilial?”","“Since that horn was left behind by Brother Di’s father, to say nothing of the fact that it itself is a treasure, even if it was just a broken shoe, it would still be worth Brother Di spending everything to exchange for it!” Ling Han said seriously, his face filled with anger.","“The more Brother Di spends on this relic, the more it proves Brother Di’s filial piety, don’t you agree?”","Di Wuji couldn’t help but be speechless.","How was he supposed to deal with this?","If he agreed, then he would just have to wait for Ling Han to make an exorbitant demand. But if he didn’t agree, wouldn’t that confirm his reputation as an unfilial son?","He shook his head, and said, “Brother Ling, your eloquence is truly admirable.”","That was right.","The large black dog, little azure dragon, and pervert pig all nodded internally. However, the large black dog immediately interrupted, and said, “Brother, in this life, filial piety is the most important thing!”","Brother?","A muscle twitched in Di Wuji’s cheek. Though he was a member of the Wolf Tribe, he was not a family member at all with a despicable dog like you who was wearing iron underwear and looked indecent at first glance, all right?"]},{"number":4522,"title":"Chapter 4522: Attack","paragraphs":["Chapter 4522: Attack","Editor: Henyee Translations","The large black dog’s expression was filled with sincerity, as if he really considered Di Wuji as one of his brothers.","Best scenario was for Di Wuji to also return to his wolf form. They could rub their noses, and wag their tails. They would be truly in harmony.","Di Wuji’s expression was ugly.","His shrewdness could be considered extremely deep. After all, he was the son of a Great Emperor, so how could his self-restraint be weak? Moreover, he had experienced one era after another, so how could that kind of accumulation be something that ordinary Imperial Sons could compare to?","However, at this moment, he felt like he was about to go crazy.","Ling Han and the large black dog were both f*cking unpredictable. He had lived for so long, but he had never seen this kind of character.","...","He took a deep breath, and said, “Ten portions of Eight Star Celestial Qi.”","Ling Han immediately looked displeased. With a wave of his hand, he said, “Brother Di, you are really too unfilial towards your father, Lord Wolf Emperor! I hate unfilial people the most!” He turned around and glanced at the large black dog and the others, “Let’s go.”","F***!","Di Wuji finally couldn’t bear it any longer, and his expression changed drastically, as he exclaimed, “Brother Ling, don’t forget, that was originally belonging to our Di Clan!”","“Brother Di, you’re wrong to say that,” Ling Han said with a serious expression. “The surname of the Emperor isn’t written on that horn. Moreover, I didn’t steal or snatch it. I obtained it with my own abilities, so it naturally belongs to me.”","“Going by Brother Di’s logic, as long as it is something that belongs to me, I can get it back. Then, I will sell something to you, then take it back, then sell it to you, and then take it back...”","In a single breath, he said ‘sell it to you, then take back’ many times. Then, he paused, and looked towards the large black dog, “How much does he owe me now?”","The large black dog put on an act, counting them off one by one with his toes. Then, he said, “There would have to be over a hundred thousand portions of Celestial Qi.”","Ling Han nodded and said, “Then let’s give him a discount. Rounding off the number, let’s charge him a hundred thousand.”","Di Wuji was finally enraged. A vein was popping on his forehead. Boom, a frightening aura surged out, and the images of seven stars actually appeared behind him, exuding a frightening pressure.","This Imperial Son was no pushover!","Ling Han’s heart immediately clenched. This guy was definitely on the same level as Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling, and so on. In fact, he was even stronger than them. He was comparable to Ding Shu, Myriad Dao, and others at the same cultivation level.","However, Ling Han was completely unafraid. By now, he was already a six-star Sect Master. To say nothing of being invincible against all Sect Masters, er, in truth, he was not too far off either.","“Ling Han, this is your final warning. Don’t force me!” Di Wuji was obviously suppressing his anger before saying this.","“Brother, what’s wrong with you? Why are you so furious? Sigh, if you have a problem, just say it. On the basis that we share the same blood, Grandpa Dog will definitely help you! But you have to say it. If you don’t say it, how would Grandpa Dog know?”","“Although you keep looking at Grandpa Dog with such urgency, you really have to say it out loud.”","“If you don’t say it, Grandpa Dog won’t be able to read your mind. How can I know?”","“So, are you going to say it or not?”","The large black dog’s mouth was full of nonsense, and very tongue-twisting.","Di Wuji’s face was red, green and black, changing continuously.","Now, he really wanted to kill someone, oh no, kill a dog!","“Humph, you guys are courting death!” he shouted lightly, and the aura of his bloodline surged, affecting that Venerate Tier-level giant wolf.","His bloodline could suppress any member of the Wolf Tribe by nature. This was the ability of the son of the Great Emperor.","However, that giant wolf was also being controlled by the Great Emperor Horn. This was similarly supreme control.","Unless the Wolf Emperor came back to life, it would be hard to decide who was stronger between these two types of control.","Thus, the giant wolf was in a difficult position.","Who should he listen to?","Unfortunately, though it was Venerate Tier-level, its intelligence was only on the level of a five-year-old child. This really made things difficult for it!","When Di Wuji saw this, he couldn’t help but frown.","He had indeed thought of this possibility, but before witnessing it with his own eyes, he always wanted to give it a try.","Though this move was ineffective, it was fine. His strength could crush everything. Worse come to worst, he would just have to deal with it himself.","He stretched out a hand, and grabbed out at Ling Han.","Weng, weng, weng! One after another, Regulations manifested, and there were a total of... eighteen of them!","Impressive!","Even if this guy was a nine-star Sect Master, his natural talent in cultivation was still inconceivably high. He really could match Ding Shu and the others.","Merely in terms of battle prowess, this was the strongest Sect Master that Ling Han had seen so far — that kind of Venerate Tier suppressing Sect Master didn’t count.","Unfortunately, his opponent was Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly and replied with a punch of his own.","Boom, with a punch, nineteen Regulations formed!","What!","Di Wuji’s eyes instantly widened in shock.","How was this possible?","Nineteen six-star Regulations? This was practically unbelievable!","He was a nine-star Sect Master, so even if Ling Han’s cultivation level was the same as his, he still had one more Regulation than he did.","In other words, Ling Han’s natural talent in cultivation was higher than his.","He could not believe it.","Who was he?","He was the son of the Wolf Emperor, and he had received special attention from the Great Emperor since a young age. In fact, he had even changed his fate!","Thus, in a battle of equal cultivation levels, he should be invincible.","And now, there was actually someone that was even slightly more freakish than him. Though there was only a gap of a single star, inferiority was inferiority, and there was no excuse for it.","Instantly, his killing intent blazed madly.","He definitely had to kill Ling Han.","In terms of Regulations, he was indeed slightly inferior to Ling Han, but battle prowess wasn’t completely determined by the number of Regulations. Just like how power was the most important attribute of a cultivator, but it wasn’t absolute.","“Demonic Wolf Devours the Moon!” Di Wuji shouted loudly, his figure rapidly enlarging. Then, he opened his massive mouth, and was about to swallow Ling Han.","Ling Han humphed upon hearing this. ‘Who cares about your cultivation technique? My fist is invincible, and it can shatter everything!’","Boom!","He had already walked out his own path. Every punch and kick was comparable to the Imperial Technique.","The terrifying power of the punch swept over, and the Regulations turned into an endless number of God Tools, forcibly shattering that massive mouth.","Di Wuji returned to his original form, and there was some blood at the corner of his lips.","His ultimate move had been shattered with a single punch from Ling Han, so it naturally backfired on him. However, he was strong enough, so this only caused him slight injury.","This stunned him.","The Demon Wolf Devouring Moon was an Imperial Technique. As long as he swallowed his target, a large amount of blood essence would be deprived from his body, causing his battle prowess to drop drastically. He only had to do it a few times, and he would definitely be done for.","This move could be said to have been tested time and time again. It had killed who knew how many powerful opponents.","However, faced with Ling Han, this Imperial Technique was actually easily resolved.","“I have underestimated you.” Di Wuji nodded. Looks like he could not defeat Ling Han with such a simple move.","He humphed, and once again charged towards Ling Han. The seven stars behind him solidified, as if they were the reflection of the heavens, infinitely boosting his power.","Peng!","Ling Han exchanged a blow with Di Wuji, and a frightening power assailed him, instantly sending him flying.","Hiss, what strong power!","Ling Han steadied his footing, and felt a boiling sensation in his chest. He almost threw up blood.","He was astonished. Even if his cultivation level was inferior to Di Wuji’s, there was only a gap of three minor levels, at most. However, in terms of the power gap of this attack, it was at least 10 stars and above."]},{"number":4523,"title":"Chapter 4523: Power of Seven Stars","paragraphs":["Chapter 4523: Power of Seven Stars","Editor: Henyee Translations","When one had reached the Spirit Transformation Tier, especially Sect Master-level or above, the importance of power would have to give way to Regulations. It would definitely be Regulations that would decide the battle prowess of a cultivator.","Though that was the case, if the Regulations were of the same level, but the power gap was equivalent to the gap between Venerate Tier and Sect Master?","This was definitely a crushing defeat!","Ling Han could feel that Di Wuji’s power had surpassed him by at least 10 stars, just like how a Venerate Tier was attacking him.","However, how could a Sect Master possess such powerful strength?","Ling Han looked at the seven starsbehind Di Wuji. They had already completely solidified, and were exuding a terrifying aura.","...","The problem must lie here.","When he saw how Ling Han was staring fixedly at the stars behind him, Di Wuji smiled proudly, “This is my father using his supreme might, forcibly refining the seven great stars and placing them into my body. They can endlessly provide me with power.”","F***!","The large black dog, little azure dragon, and pervert pig all paled at the same time. This was too freakish.","It should be known that if a star exploded, even Venerate Tier elites would be forcefully shattered.","From this, it could be seen just how much terrifying power a star contained.","Of course, this wasn’t an explosion. Instead, it was a continuous flow of power, so it was definitely much weaker. However, there were a total of seven stars, so the power supply together was naturally extremely terrifying.","He believed that this was still because Di Wuji was only a Sect Master, and could only sustain a limited amount of power. Otherwise, if he advanced into Venerate Tier, he would definitely be able to sustain even more power, and the power that he blasted out would be even more terrifying.","—So what if my Regulations are slightly inferior to you? My power is definitely overwhelming!","Ling Han revealed a blazing fighting spirit. In a battle of equals, he had always been invincible. Even if Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling, and the other ancient prodigies appeared, and there was also the competition with Origin, Ding Shu, and the others who were similarly Genesis World’s rulers, he was still invincible among his peers.","Even if Ding Shu and the others wanted to battle him, without the advantage of three or four minor levels, there was no way they could exchange blows with him.","Now, however, Di Wuji possessed overwhelming power. He was completely outmatched, and this instead stimulated his intense fighting spirit.","‘Come!’","Ling Han released a battle cry, and the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was used. His speed was extremely fast, and he circled around Di Wuji. Then, he shot out punch after punch.","He used his strengths and avoided his weaknesses, and did not confront Di Wuji head-on. Instead, he used his advantage in speed, and blasted out Regulations, which turned into divine light to attack this powerful opponent.","Di Wuji was astounded, “True Phoenix’s movement technique? You are quite lucky, to actually have obtained True Phoenix’s inheritance!”","This was a precious technique that even his father very much wanted to see. Unfortunately, he still lacked a sliver of fate to witness it.","“However, you want to defeat me just like that?” He smiled faintly, and his eyes suddenly widened. He shouted loudly, “Freeze!”","Weng! The seven stars lit up at the same time, unleashing a devastating power.","Instantly, the air around them became incredibly heavy. Boundless power had even solidified.","Ling Han’s speed rapidly decreased. Seven stars took effect at the same time, causing the space around him to become incredibly frozen. Even Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was greatly affected.","There was nothing else that could be done. Di Wuji’s power had definitely advanced into the level of Venerate Tier, and now, with his overwhelming power that was superior to Ling Han’s cultivation level by a major tier, he was naturally capable of affecting Ling Han.","“Hahaha!” Di Wuji laughed loudly, and delivered a palm strike towards Ling Han.","Boom, endless power reverberated, compressing layer by layer. It had even solidified, and could be seen clearly with the naked eye.","Because Ling Han’s speed was limited, he did not manage to completely dodge this blow. After being swept by it, his whole person was instantly sent flying.","Terrifying!","Ling Han fell onto the ground, and with a ‘wah’, he threw up blood madly.","The large black dog, the little dragon, and the pervert pig all looked anxious. They believed that in a battle of equal cultivation levels, Ling Han would definitely be able to crush Di Wuji.","But who asked him to be the son of a Great Emperor? Seven stars had actually been refined into his body!","In truth, if Di Wuji had advanced into Saint Tier, then this kind of advantage in power would completely disappear, because a single strike from a Saint would be able to easily destroy a star. This gap was too wide, so the power of seven stars was naturally meaningless.","However, at the Sect Master-level, or even Venerate Tier-level, these seven stars could greatly increase Di Wuji’s power, and cause a crushing blow to his opponent.","Ling Han was only able to vomit blood and not be insta-killed with a single strike. That was because he had cultivated the Heavenly Dragon Emperor’s Scroll, and could disperse another portion of the power of the attack.","If it was any other Sect Master? They would have been insta-killed long ago, all right?","This could not be considered Di Wuji’s own battle prowess, but who asked him to have a Great Emperor as his father?","“Four-Legged Snake, why are you so weak?” the large black dog asked the little azure dragon.","The little azure dragon was rendered speechless. His father died before he was even born, and it’s my fault?","“Ling Han, your natural talent is indeed amazing. However, in front of the accumulated power of a Great Emperor, what are you worth?” Di Wuji’s expression was filled with pride.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “This isn’t your strength. Besides, I haven’t lost yet!”","He stepped out, and threw another punch.","This time, he used the Seven Star Regulations, though there were only two slivers.","Di Wuji smirked coldly. This was really too foolish. He clearly knew that his power was overwhelming, and still wanted to confront him head-on?","‘You were killed by your own stupidity.’","He delivered a palm strike, extremely casual, but with the boost of terrifying power, the might of this strike was boundlessly strong.","Ling Han did not dodge or retreat, and shot out this punch grandly, turning into a giant golden fist that blasted towards Di Wuji at an extraordinarily fast speed.","Peng!","The golden fist landed on the palm strike, and was instantly shattered by the vigorous power.","Even if you had one more Regulation, so what? If the power gap was too wide, you would still be overwhelmed.","However, after the colossal fist crumbled, a streak of shattered light continued to blast towards Di Wuji.","What!","Di Wuji was taken aback, his eyes almost popping out in shock.","How was this possible?","Ling Han’s power clearly hadn’t changed, and the number of Regulations was still nineteen. So, why was the power of his punch soaring? Why was it able to pierce through his attack?","Xiu, this punch had already arrived.","He was completely unprepared, and was too confident. Thus, he did not manage to dodge in time, and was hit head-on.","“Wu!” He instantly gave a muffled humph, opened his mouth, and spat out a mouthful of blood. A bloody hole shockingly appeared in his abdomen. It had been created by the shattered power of Ling Han’s fist.","Looking again at Ling Han, he was also sent flying by the vigorous power, and similarly spat out a mouthful of blood.","This blow could be considered to have wounded both sides.","“Good job!” The large black dog, the little azure dragon, and the pervert pig all cheered loudly, instantly becoming excited.","—You, Di Wuji, are depending on the power of the Great Emperor, but Ling Han is truly capable.","With such a comparison, it was clear who was superior.","Di Wuji’s eyes shone brightly. He lowered his head to look at the wound, then said darkly, “So, it turns out that you have actually grasped a sliver of the Seven Star Regulations!”","It was precisely because the level of Regulations was too high, so even if there was only a sliver, it still managed to break through his attack, and cause damage to him.","Freak, how could there be such a freak?"]},{"number":4524,"title":"Chapter 4524: The Saint Corpse appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4524: The Saint Corpse appears","Editor: Henyee Translations","Di Wuji’s killing intent blazed even brighter.","This kind of opponent was unimaginable to him. Could even the Great Emperors of the past compare to Ling Han?","Thus, Ling Han definitely had to die. Otherwise, a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to become Emperor would appear in this era, and it was also very likely that it would be snatched away by Ling Han.","Becoming Emperor was the ultimate dream for these supreme prodigies, and they were willing to risk their lives for it.","“Die!”","Di Wuji aggressively charged over. Even if Ling Han had grasped a little bit of the Seven Star Regulations, so what? His power had an absolute advantage, and he could crush him.","...","Ling Han released a battle cry, and exchanged blows with Di Wuji.","His attack was very simple, and that was to use his own path of martial arts, as well as the Seven Star Regulations, to clash head-on with Di Wuji.","In terms of power, it was naturally Di Wuji who had won, and in terms of piercing ability, it was Ling Han who had gained an absolute advantage. This was the Seven Star Regulations, and against a Sect Master, he similarly had a crushing advantage.","Thus, neither of them dodged or evaded, exchanging blows head-on, which naturally caused great injury to both of them.","The shockwaves of the terrifying power blasted out, and the Seven Star Regulations turned into a blade that possessed boundless destructive power. The large black dog and the others had no choice but to retreat, not daring to face its might at all.","It couldn’t be helped. Though the little azure dragon was also the son of a Great Emperor, and had astonishing natural talent in cultivation, he was only a Spirit Transformation Tier, after all.","His cultivation level was far too inferior, so much so that he couldn’t withstand these attacks at all.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","With every exchange of blows, Ling Han and Di Wuji were both throwing up blood continuously, their injuries extremely severe.","In terms of attack power, the two of them could be considered evenly matched. They were both extremely strong, and in terms of defense, Ling Han was actually stronger, but it was just enough to compensate for his inferiority in attack power.","Thus, if they traded injuries for injuries like this, the final result would be both sides suffering heavy losses, or even perishing together.","At this time, it was up to the recovery ability.","Ling Han channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique, and his injuries were immediately under control. Combined with his powerful physique, he could completely become an undying cockroach.","Though Di Wuji also had healing techniques, every Great Emperor had their forte. For example, in the case of the Wolf Emperor, he preferred to attack. Thus, the Imperial Technique that he had created was more inclined towards attack.","In any case, the Great Emperors were all invincible in the universe. Whether their attack was stronger or weaker, or how powerful their recovery abilities were, it didn’t matter. This was completely dependent on the personality of the Great Emperor.","The gap between Imperial Techniques was relatively small, but after fighting for a long time, this gap was apparent.","Di Wuji was so stunned that he discovered that if this continued, he would lose!","‘F*ck! He would actually lose?’","He frowned deeply. This kind of conclusion had really disappointed him too much, and also dealt too much of a blow.","This was equivalent to having a Great Emperor help him cheat, yet he was still inferior to a cultivator at the same cultivation level. How could he accept this?","He gritted his teeth, and the seven great stars lit up brightly at the same time, emitting a blinding light.","Then, boom, a ray of light shot out, turning into a supreme divine light that slashed towards Ling Han.","This speed was too fast, and there was no way to dodge at all!","Ling Han didn’t dare to be careless, because when he faced these seven great stars, it couldn’t be considered a battle at the same cultivation level at all. Instead, he was fighting against a Venerate Tier, or at least a Pseudo Venerate Tier.","Thus, with a single thought, Purple Calamity Grains immediately formed a defense.","Peng!","The attack landed on Ling Han’s body, and a blinding light flashed.","A smile instantly appeared on Di Wuji’s face. Though this attack had not improved on the level of Regulations, in terms of power, it was equivalent to a Three Star Venerate Tier.","Ling Han was definitely going to die if he faced this attack head-on.","However, in an instant, a figure charged out of the light.","Who else could it be but Ling Han?","Di Wuji had not thought of this at all. This was completely impossible.","Peng, Ling Han’s punch had already arrived. Even if he leaped out of the way to dodge, and dodged the front of the fist, the terrifying power and Regulations still landed on him.","Di Wuji gave a muffled humph, and was instantly sent flying.","He was throwing up blood madly, his eyes filled with both shock and confusion.","Why had Ling Han not died?","This was illogical!","Ling Han smiled calmly, “You have the means of a Great Emperor, so how could I not have a trump card?”","Aside from Purple Calamity Grains, he also had a Pseudo Imperial Weapon, Destructive Energy, and so on.","Di Wuji glared at Ling Han. At this moment, he really did not know what to say.","As the son of the Great Emperor, his battle prowess was already incredibly powerful. Add to that the techniques of the Great Emperor, to say nothing of being invincible among his peers, even if his opponent’s cultivation level actually surpassed him by a major tier, he still had the ability to save his life.","But now, faced with Ling Han, he did not have the slightest bit of confidence.","In fact, this opponent had even more tricks up his sleeve than he did.","He took a deep breath, and suddenly cut open his finger, squeezing out a drop of silver blood.","“F*ck! Idiot!” the large black dog immediately exclaimed. “You’ve clearly bled so much, so why are you still cutting your finger and squeezing out blood?”","When Di Wuji heard this, he almost couldn’t help but throw up blood.","However, he was also a little confused. That’s right. He had already bled so much, so why did he still deliberately cut his finger? Could it be that he was too used to it, that he did not think too much about it at all?","He flew into a humiliated rage, and shouted, “That’s not important. What’s important is that you all have to die!”","He seemed to have activated some kind of special ceremony, and was muttering under his breath. Then, a terrifying aura suddenly spread out from not too far away.","Boom, the sound of something shattering rang out. Then, not too far away, a figure suddenly appeared, supporting both heaven and earth.","This was... Ling Han was astonished.","He knew that there was an “island” not far away, and he was certain that the sound just now should be the ground shattering, and that figure crawling out from underneath.","Previously, he had already excavated the island, but he had not dug to the bottom. He was shocked by a powerful aura, and did not dare to continue digging.","He suspected that there was an elite buried underneath, or perhaps it was a deadly weapon. By the looks of it now, it should be the former.","Boom!","Right at this moment, that figure had already walked over. With a single step, the ground trembled violently.","It was only one step, and that figure was already close enough, revealing its true appearance.","This was a giant ape that was as tall as three hundred meters. There were bone chains around its neck, and it was wrapped in a layer of armor. It held a spiked club in its hand. Upon a closer look, this staff was forged from white bone.","However, there was a wound on his chest that had directly pierced through his heart.","Saintly might!","Ling Han was immediately certain that this definitely wasn’t a Venerate Tier. Venerate Tiers weren’t that powerful.","However, this Saint Ape was already dead. It was a walking corpse.","But a starving camel was still bigger than a horse. So what if he had died? He could still unleash his saintly might, and it was no issue for him to insta-kill Ling Han.","F***, Di Wuji was actually capable of summoning a dead Saint?","Ling Han’s heart jolted. This place was indeed no different from the sea of blood and the Yin River. Then, there should be Saint corpses buried beneath those “islands”, right? That was why the wolves were afraid, and dared not set foot here.","Hiss!","Without the slightest hesitation, he grabbed the large black dog and the others. Then, he used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to rapidly flee.","Fight my a*s, even a Saintly corpse had appeared.","The corpse of the Saint Ape was a little dumb. This was understandable. After all, it had already died.","He was under the control of Di Wuji, and only then did he raise a giant hand, which struck out at Ling Han.","His arm was only a few hundred meters long, but just how terrifying wasSaint-level battle prowess?","The force and Regulations intertwined, turning into a monstrous demonic hand that set off in pursuit of Ling Han."]},{"number":4525,"title":"Chapter 4525: Another ocean of Saint corpses","paragraphs":["Chapter 4525: Another ocean of Saint corpses","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han’s speed was very fast. Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was the fastest movement technique in the world.","However, it was a Saint that was attacking him.","Even if he had long since died, and was a corpse, he was still faster than him. The attack had already reached him.","Ling Han did not hesitate in the slightest, and immediately threw out a few Energy Jades. Then, he channelled Purple Calamity Grains to take this blow from the Saint head-on.","His heart ached. If he was attacked by a Saint, the Purple Calamity Grains would not be able to take effect after a few times.","However, if he was about to lose his life, what was the point of discussing anything else?","...","Boom!","That demonic hand very quickly crashed into the Energy Jades, and immediately detonated the jades. A terrifying wave of energy surged out, surging in all directions.","So what if this was a sea of fog? At present, it was equivalent to two Saints exchanging blows, so how terrifying would the shockwave created be?","Ling Han only felt his body tremble, and was instantly sent flying by a massive force.","This speed was too fast, and the distance of 5,000 km had passed in an instant.","Thankfully, he channelled the Purple Calamity Grains. This could block the attack of a Five Star Saint, and was enough to ensure his safety.","He discovered that the four of them had been directly sent flying out of the area of the sea of fog, and were standing all alone in space.","Run!","Ling Han did not hesitate in the slightest, and turned to leave.","He didn’t dare to tear open space. If he entered the Void, he might be forcefully sucked into the sea of mist again.","Yi?","He saw a terrifying aura attack from the sidelines, instantly approaching above the sea of fog.","A Saint!","F***, there was an ambush outside as well?","That’s not right.","Ling Han immediately discovered that this Saint was alive. He had manifested his Dao Manifestation, which was even larger than a planet. With a single step, he could cover millions and millions of km, and that was why he could arrive in an instant.","It was not targeted at him, but rather because he was interested in the matter of those that had teleported to the Cold Sealed Planet going missing. It was because of this that he had deliberately come to investigate.","Ling Han immediately covered himself, the large black dog, and the others with the hide of the Void Beast. He naturally didn’t want to be discovered by the Saint and captured for questioning.","This was a Saint that was dressed in white robes. His hair was also silvery white, and it hung down to his waist, making him appear sage-like.","“Humph, so it is this sea of fog that is causing trouble!” the Saint said to himself. He stretched out a palm, and shot out towards the sea of fog.","However, before his attack had even reached its target, a demonic hand suddenly shot out from the sea of mist. This hand was as large as a planet, and it was about to strike the Saint.","Boom!","The two of them exchanged a blow, creating a terrifying shockwave.","Ling Han and the others were instantly sent flying into the depths of the universe by the shockwave. Thankfully, they were still very far away. Thus, though the aftermath was strong, Ling Han was completely capable of dispersing it.","In the distance, the sea of mist was rapidly shrinking in size. However, the Saint was still standing tall and upright. He was incredibly huge, and could be seen clearly.","The silver-haired Saint unleashed another barrage of attacks. However, multiple Saint corpses that were riddled with fatal wounds leaped out of the sea of mist, one after another. They instantly surrounded the silver-haired Saint, ganging up on him.","Boom, a terrifying aura surged over in wave after wave. Ling Han did not linger around, and after being pushed far enough away, he immediately tore a rip into space, and fled with the large black dog and the others.","It was very likely that the silver-haired Saint was in a perilous situation.","Ling Han sighed internally. He could see that there were several dozen Saint corpses that had jumped out. Merely with their numbers, they could overwhelm him.","Previously, the Saint corpses in the sea of blood were clear proof of this. Even if a great number of Saints brought the Imperial Weapons with them, they would not be able to withstand it.","Ling Han appeared on the nearest planet. He brought the large black dog and the others, and continuously used Transfer Formation to travel back to the main base.","And now, another danger zone had appeared, where a great number of Saint corpses were buried.","And this time, it was actually related to the Wolf Emperor!","This was set up by the Wolf Emperor when he was alive?","What on earth was he trying to do?","Ling Han returned. Coincidentally, Brother Monkey had also come out of seclusion. He hurriedly told Brother Monkey about the matter.","When Brother Monkey heard this, he pondered for a moment, then said, “When Old Sun has advanced into Saint Tier, I will sweep aside all opposition.”","Er, Brother Monkey, I know you’re very domineering, but don’t be so brainless, all right?","However, upon further thought, this kind of thing was not something that could be solved through discussion. There were too many secrets in this world, so they could only wait quietly for the truth to surface on its own, and what they could do was to increase their cultivation level as much as possible.","“Buddha Doga must know,” Ling Han murmured.","Unfortunately, if Buddha Doga wanted to tell him, would he have waited until now?","‘Forget it, I’ll cultivate!’","Ling Han had Ji Wuming help him out, and spread the news on the Galaxy Network, that he wanted to sell some Strengthening Fluid in exchange for high-level Celestial Qi.","—In the previous auction, Ling Han had indeed used a portion of the Strengthening Fluid to trade for the Celestial Qi. However, the majority of it was obtained with low-level Celestial Qi after refining the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, using money to make money.","Now that he had finished eating the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pills, he naturally had to think of another way.","At the same time, he took out the broken sword.","Previously, it was precisely because of this broken sword that he had first become enemies with Wu Yue. Afterwards, after he had killed Wu Yue, this broken sword naturally became his spoil of battle.","Previously, he had not had the time to study it, and only now did he remember.","However, after studying it for a long time, he did not discover anything.","He could only sense a very obscure yet very powerful fluctuation in the broken sword.","“If there’s a chance in the future, let the old man take a look.”","Ling Han put away the broken sword and turned his attention to cultivation.","After Ji Wuming released the news, it wasn’t long before someone replied, saying that they were interested in the Strengthening Fluid.","After a round of bargaining, the two sides reached an agreement.","Ling Han brought Ji Wuming with him and traversed a considerable number of galaxies, arriving at a great planet. Then, they began the transaction.","Of course, he couldn’t arrange it on his own planet. He had to be careful.","After consecutively completing a few business deals, Ling Han and Ji Wuming finally left. Then, he began to concoct alchemical pills.","He left behind a few alchemical pills, and used them to continue trading for Celestial Qi. That was because he did not have much Strengthening Fluid left, and could not redeem much Celestial Qi. However, if he had the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, it could allow him to maintain a positive cycle.","Unfortunately, there was pitifully little Celestial Qi that could be traded for now. He finished the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pills, but he was still some distance away from the peak stage of Six Star Sect Master.","He continued to search for buyers on the Galaxy Network. Whether it was the Strengthening Fluid or the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pills, he would be happy to sell them as long as there was someone willing to use Celestial Qi to trade for them.","A few days later, he successfully concluded a deal, and hurriedly set out with Ji Wuming.","This rendered Ji Wuming speechless. He still had to cultivate, so why was Ling Han always looking for him?","Ling Han chose a new planet. He had just completed his transaction, and was just about to leave, when he suddenly felt an eerie aura assault him.","He had been to many dangerous places, and there were indeed some places that were incredibly cold. It would not be strange even if a Spirit Transformation Tier or even Sect Master were to freeze to death.","However, he was certain that this eerie feeling was completely different.","In fact, he was actually quite familiar with it.","The Netherworld’s aura!","He immediately tensed up, and did not come to his senses at the first instant. That was because he felt that this was inconceivable, and his brain had ruled out this possibility.","What was going on? Why did the aura of the Netherworld appear here?","He activated the ley lines, and when he checked, he couldn’t help but reveal a shocked expression."]},{"number":4526,"title":"Chapter 4526: Second Yin soul invasion","paragraphs":["Chapter 4526: Second Yin soul invasion","Editor: Henyee Translations","In this world, there was the Living Realm and the Netherworld.","The Living Realm was resided by living people, while the Netherworld was resided Yin souls—the two sides didn’t offend each other.","However, perhaps it had been too long, or perhaps it was for some other reason. In short, the Netherworld and Living Realm were actually showing signs of merging.","In the Living Realm, there were many weak points. In these weak points, the Living Realm and the Netherworld were only separated by layers of thin barriers, and elites could easily break through these barriers.","The Celestial Sea Planet of the past was a tragic example. A great number of Yin souls invaded, and even caused a Saint to die because of it.","What had Ling Han seen?","...","At the connecting point to the Netherworld, a large amount of Yin Qi was seeping out, and correspondingly, countless Yin souls were flying out!","They were extremely fragile under the sunlight, and would be turned into dust with a single beam of light. However, the surging Yin Qi was also transforming the environment. Yin Qi covered the sky, blocking the sunlight.","Although the yin souls would still be restricted in the Living Realm, without the direct sunlight, the Yin souls’ survival ability and mobility would also be greatly improved.","One after another, mortals were possessed by Yin souls, turning into walking corpses.","In just an instant, the number of deaths numbered in the millions and millions.","Was this a unique phenomenon, or... had the Netherworld beings’ invasion begun again?","Ling Han did not hesitate. Immediately, with Star Steps, he appeared at that most initial connecting point.","By now, the surrounding area had already been completely transformed by the Netherworld. Ling Han discovered that his control over the Regulations was rapidly decreasing.","If he couldn’t use the Regulations, his battle prowess would naturally decline correspondingly.","Seeing the appearance of living beings, the Yin souls that came out of the connecting point immediately whistled towards Ling Han.","Ling Han humphed and threw a punch.","Peng!","Instantly, large amounts of Yin souls instantly disintegrated in midair.","He was a six-star Sect Master now, so just how terrifying was the power of his punch?","However, the endless Yin souls continued to charge forward, not taking death to heart at all. They had not developed intelligence, and merely instinctively wanted to seize a physical body.","“Come!” Ling Han beckoned with his hand, and instantly, streaks of Earth Qi surged out, turning into Earth Dragons that blocked the connecting point.","Just how powerful was the power of a planet? However, the planet itself would not show its might, and had to be activated either by a Formation Master or formations.","Now that the Earth Qi had transformed into dragons, it had become a killing ground, and any Yin soul would shatter at the slightest touch.","At this time, the elites on this planet also flew over.","Some people were completely unaware of the Netherworld and Yin souls, and were completely confused about the situation. When they saw that Ling Han was standing there alone, they thought that it was his doing, and immediately rebuked him.","Additionally, there was no shortage of experienced people here. They immediately stopped them and explained.","“What, this is the connecting point of the Netherworld?”","“Then what do we do?”","Everyone could clearly see that the Yin souls that wreaked havoc everywhere possessed the unique trait of ignoring power attacks. Only high-level energy could injure them, and once they possessed someone, that person would be a dead man.","Boom!","Right at this moment, the Earth Dragons that had sealed off the connecting point were actually shattered in unison. Yin souls as tall as nine meters walked out, exuding a powerful aura.","Sect Master-level!","Not just one, but seven.","The overall level of cultivation of this planet was not very high, and the strongest was only Sect Master-level. Seeing seven Sect Master-level Yin souls appear all at once, it naturally caused everyone’s expression to change.","The invasion of the Yin souls was not something that they could withstand at all. They had best flee.","So what if the sky collapsed? There would always be someone taller to hold it up.","Ling Han humphed, and immediately charged out. As he brandished his fists, peng, peng, peng! One punch was enough to kill one, and the seven great yin souls were immediately destroyed.","With another wave of his hand, the Earth Dragons appeared once more.","F***, this was too powerful, wasn’t it?","Everyone’s eyes widened in disbelief.","Ling Han’s move naturally allowed everyone to see clearly that he was also a Sect Master.","However, as a fellow Sect Master, his strength was too inconceivable.","“He must be the Dao Child!”","“That’s right, only a Dao Child would have such strong battle prowess!”","Quite a number of people said conceitedly, using the worldview that they had knowledge of to explain Ling Han’s strength.","Ling Han said darkly, “I need Xuanlong Iron, Cloud Smoothstone, Heavenly Square Metal...” He recited a long list of ingredients.","Everyone exchanged looks. ‘What do you mean?’","Was he trying to extort them?","Hiss, you can’t play around like this. Taking advantage of a crisis to make a demand, this was really too despicable.","Ling Han frowned, and said, “What nonsense are you thinking? I want to set up a formation and lock this connection point!”","Only now did everyone know that they had misunderstood Ling Han. They all felt apologetic.","The survival of the planet concerned the interests of every single one of them. Thus, they immediately moved, delivering the materials that Ling Han needed.","Ling Han immediately began to create formation foundations.","With him here, he naturally could guard this connecting point. However, he could not possibly stand guard here forever, and the moment he left, the Earth Dragons would lose his support, and very soon, they would completely exhaust their Earth Qi and disappear.","Thus, he needed to set up a formation, extract the power of heaven and earth to lock this connecting point.","With the strength of his Spiritual Power, he was actually already capable of setting up a Venerate Tier-level formation, but firstly, there was a shortage of time and insufficient materials, and secondly, he had not grasped the corresponding formation, so he had only set up a Sect Master-level formation.","If the Yin souls that rushed out were only Sect Master-level at most, then this formation would be enough.","Firstly, the Yin soul’s battle prowess was inferior to cultivators of the same cultivation level in the first place, and secondly, this was the Living Realm, after all!","When the Yin soul came to the Living Realm, its battle prowess would definitely be affected, and drop by more than one or two levels.","Not long after, the formation foundations were completed.","After Ling Han had planted the formation foundations, he used his powerful Spiritual Power to stimulate the ley lines. Boom, instantly, every formation foundation emitted light, intertwining to form a super great formation.","Previously, when the Earth Dragons had sealed off the area, there were still a few scattered Yin souls that could rush out, but once the great formation was activated, there would definitely be none that could escape.","Though there were still Yin souls here, without the subsequent replenishment, every time they killed one, there would be one less, so there was no need to worry.","After doing all this, Ling Han hurriedly returned with Ji Wuming. He didn’t want a fire to start in his own backyard.","Thankfully, the planet they were on was unscathed, and had not been invaded by the Yin souls.","However, if one were to take a look through the Galaxy Network, they would discover that the invasion of the Yin souls was not an isolated event, but rather a frequent occurrence.","News of Yin souls invading was revealed from various places in the universe, and in the case of the Mountain Sea Heaven, it was even worse. The doors to the Netherworld had opened once more, and countless Yin souls rushed out, attacking cities and plundering lands.","Wherever they occupied, the air would be dense and baleful. The environment was changing drastically, developing to become more like the Netherworld.","This was a serious threat to all living beings. With the Imperial Clans as the leader, they once again joined forces with the Holy Lands of the universe, forming an alliance to fight against the Yin souls.","However, the Living Realm was like a sack that was riddled with holes. Previously, it would have been fine as long as it was not filled with water. It looked like the universe was peaceful, but now? It seemed like Yin souls would run out from every place, causing great chaos in the world."]},{"number":4527,"title":"Chapter 4527: Arriving at Mountain Sea Heaven again","paragraphs":["Chapter 4527: Arriving at Mountain Sea Heaven again","Editor: Henyee Translations","The Netherworld’s second large-scale invasion began, and the universe descended into chaos.","Thankfully, this kind of experience had happened a few dozen years ago. Thus, under the leadership of the Imperial Clans, the various forces in the universe began to resist in an orderly manner.","The Lord of the Blood Sea and the other supreme elites didn’t appear. Correspondingly, Buddha Doga also didn’t appear. It was as if they had reached a tacit agreement—neither side would send any top-notch elites.","Not only did Pseudo-Emperor-level elites not appear, but even Saint-level elites didn’t appear.","Thus, though this was a super large-scale invasion, and it was not just limited to the Mountain Sea Heaven, in terms of danger level, it was actually not as dangerous as the first time.","It was as if the Netherworld wasn’t worried at all, and they were planning to advance slowly and steadily.","...","Ling Han was extremely worried.","The first time the Yin souls invaded, a Yin Saint had said that they were all chess pieces on the chessboard, and were only at the mercy of others.","Using a Saint as a chess piece, and in fact, using the Netherworld and Living Realm as a chessboard, what kind of huge game was this?","These were truly troubled times.","Ling Han sighed. The peace of the two realms that Buddha Doga had fought so hard for was now in shambles again.","Now, there were cries of anxiety from all over the universe. Though the battle prowess of Yin souls had been weakened in the Living Realm there were really too many of them, so the pressure was really great.","The Saints didn’t dare to step out.","If the Living Realm sent out a Saint, then the Netherworld would also send out the Yin Saints accordingly. Furthermore, all of them were unafraid of death. If they were no match, a good few of them would rush forwards to self-destruct by burning the holy flame. So what if they were Saints? They would still be dragged down with them!","Thus, at present, only those with battle prowess on the level of Venerate Tier were rampaging unhindered in the Two Realm Battlefield. This seemed to be a state of tacit agreement from both sides.","The Living Realm was waiting for the birth of a new Emperor. As long as a new Emperor appeared, they would naturally be able to suppress the chaos of the universe. The Netherworld and Yin souls would be no problem at all.","As for what the Netherworld beings were waiting for... only the mighty figures of the Netherworld would know.","In short, a rare peaceful situation had appeared in the Living Realm. All the races and forces had set aside their old grudges and grievances, and joined hands to fight against the Yin souls.","The most important battlefield was still the Mountain Sea Heaven.","The other battlefields were only small skirmishes, and the connecting point between the two Realms jhere was too small. The powerful Yin souls couldn’t come out at all. As long as they set up a formation and sent someone to stand guard, they would basically be fine.","But the Mountain Sea Heaven was different. There was a massive hole torn in this place. To say nothing of Saints, even a Great Emperor would probably be able to pass through — otherwise, with how strong a Great Emperorwas, a sliver of his aura would be able to shatter the passageway.","Thus, the number of Yin souls that came out of the Mountain Sea Heaven was naturally the highest, and the number of Venerate Tier-level Yin souls was chillingly high.","The Imperial Clan Alliance issued a notice, calling on all those who had ambitions to head to the Mountain Sea Heaven to resist the Yin souls.","This was not for nothing. Killing Yin souls itself would be rewarded by heaven and earth. Of course, the number of kills definitely had to be large. If one only killed a few dozen or a few hundred, heaven and earth would not be moved.","Additionally, the Imperial Clan Alliance would also tally everyone’s battle merits, and based on their battle merits, they could redeem items from the Imperial Clan Alliance.","The range of things that could redeemed was wide. There were cultivation techniques, celestial techniques, Celestial medicines, formation techniques, pill recipes, and so on. As long as you had enough battle merits, you could basically redeem anything.","—Except for the Imperial Scroll and the Imperial Technique. This was definitely a secret that would not be passed on. There was no way that the Imperial Clans would be so generous.","At present, all the elites in the world were heading towards the Mountain Sea Heaven. Killing the Yin souls itself would be rewarded by the heaven and earth, and they would also be rewarded by the Imperial Clans, so why not?","The large black dog and the others were also restless, urging Ling Han and the others to set off.","Ling Han didn’t waste any time. He continued to run around, setting up formations everywhere and sealing off the connecting points of the two realms. He still hadn’t caught his breath yet.","“All right, there is one last place. After we have set up the formation, we will set out to the Mountain Sea Heaven,” Ling Han said.","This caused the large black dog and the others to cheer.","A few days later, Ling Han had also dealt with the last place.","He didn’t shoulder the safety of the world, and he was only a six-star Sect Master. He didn’t have that much power yet, but within the range of his abilities, Ling Han still wanted to do his best.","“We can’t go to the Mountain Sea Heaven like this,” Ling Han said.","The large black dog nodded, “Little Han has made too many enemies. If we run over like this, we would definitely be killed by the Imperial Clans!”","To hope that the Imperial Clans would prioritize the bigger picture, and repay evil with good, and fully nurture Ling Han to become Emperor?","What a joke. Even if they were afraid of the words of the public, they would still secretly kill Ling Han.","The little azure dragon immediately sneered, “Old Black, you speak as if you don’t have many enemies!”","The large black dog had a toxic tongue, and his enemies were no less than Ling Han’s.","“Heng, heng!” The perverted pig rolled his eyes, meaning that , ‘Four-Legged Snake with a cheap mouth like you is not much better, b@stard.’","All of a sudden, the four of them fell silent.","They should not accuse each other of things they themselves were guilty of; the four of them were the type to attract animosity. Even if there weren’t 10,000, there would be 8,000 that wanted to kill them.","“Disguise!”","“Definitely!”","“Let’s go.” Brother Monkey walked over with his staff. His expression was filled with indifference.","Everyone set out.","Resisting the Yin souls this time not only concerned everyone, but killing the Yin souls would also reap tangible benefits. Thus, as long as one’s cultivation level was on the Celestial Path, they would all be mobilized.","There were too many people, so Brother Monkey couldn’t transport them with him.","Thus, most people still used Transfer Formation, and everyone would meet up outside of Mountain Sea Heaven.","A dozen over days later, Brother Monkey brought Ling Han, the large black dog and a few others to the Purple Gauze Planet outside the Mountain Sea Heaven.","From here, there would be occasional flashes of light in the universe, which was incredibly dazzling, and the area that the Mountain Sea Heaven was originally in had become a mass of black, and was still spreading out in all directions.","The Purple Gauze Planet was a bridgehead at the front lines. Here, there were official troops established by the Imperial Clan Alliance, as well as freedom fighters who were unwilling to be restrained, and were only willing to keep to themselves.","But it was all right. As long as they were there to kill Yin souls, they could ride the warship into the universe every day, and battle with the Yin souls there.","If one wanted to obtain battle merits and redeem treasures from the Imperial Clans, they could obtain a small item for free. After wearing it, one could absorb a portion of the power of the Yin soul when the wearer killed the Yin soul.","This item would automatically calculate the Yin soul’s power based on the strength of the Yin soul’s power, and from there, calculate the battle merits.","Of course, because he had absorbed a portion of the power of Yin soul, the heaven and earth reward that he could receive from wearing it would also be slightly lesser, but it was really lesser by a very small amount, and could be ignored.","Ling Han and the others all went to collect a small item like this. They decided to enter the universe by ship on the second day, and battle with the Yin souls.","A day passed very quickly. Ling Han, Brother Monkey, and the others all queued up and boarded the warship.","—They had disguised themselves, and planned to hide their identities. Of course, they would keep a low profile as much as possible.","Of course, Ling Han believed that with Brother Monkey’s temper, he would definitely be exposed in less than three minutes in a fight.","Thus, Brother Monkey, Ling Han, and the others were not on the same warship, to avoid dragging Ling Han and the others down with him."]},{"number":4528,"title":"Chapter 4528: Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 4528: Battlefield","Editor: Henyee Translations","In any case, Brother Monkey was a Venerate Tier elite. Furthermore, it was unknown whether the Battle Saint Emperor was still alive or dead. No one knew whether this old Saint Emperor would suddenly charge back from the edge of the universe one day.","Thus, as long as Brother Monkey did not commit any heinous crimes, then no matter how displeased the Imperial Clans were, they would only have to swallow their anger.","He was strong enough to do as he liked, and did not need to have too many reservations.","If Ling Han and the others separated from Brother Monkey, Brother Monkey would be able to do as he liked.","After bidding farewell to Brother Monkey, Ling Han and the others boarded the warship and flew into the universe.","Their journey was very simple. There was only Ling Han, the large black dog, the little azure dragon, and the perverted pig. They were either Sect Master-level, or Spirit Transformation True Lord. It could be said that they represented the strongest battle prowess on Ling Han’s side.","...","Ling Han had sent the seven babies to protect the empress and the others. These people would come via Transfer Formation, so they naturally would be slightly slower.","The warship soon entered into the universe, and seeing that the battlefield ahead was getting closer and closer, the atmosphere on the ship also became tense all of a sudden.","“Haha, a bunch of new recruits!” someone mocked. “It’s not that I want to say this, but if you guys are so nervous, you’ll definitely die in less than ten minutes on the battlefield.”","This made everyone even more nervous. This involved their own life and death, so who wouldn’t be nervous?","“This big brother, do you have any experience to impart?” Someone who was thick-skinned immediately asked.","The person from before put on a laidback expression, and said with a smile, “How could there be any experience? It’s just a chaotic battle. Most of the time, you don’t even know where the attacks are coming from. Therefore, you have to find a small team first, and cooperate well.”","Everyone nodded, and went off to find their teammates.","Meanwhile, the veteran soldier shook his head. This was a last-minute effort, so how could they cooperate?","With the assault of the Yin soul army, these people would definitely flee for their lives.","However, those who managed to survive would be useful. They could be recruited into the official troops, firstly, to familiarize themselves with the terrible battle, and secondly, to know that only by gathering together for warmth would they be able to survive, and only then would they truly obey commands.","He was one of the eyes and ears, discovering valuable freedom warriors.","His eyes swept over them, and he faltered slightly.","He saw four people who were different from the others. Not only did they not converse with the others to form a team, but there was not the slightest bit of nervousness on their faces, as if they were not going to battle the Yin souls, but rather going for a picnic.","You guys are really too relaxed, aren’t you?","He nodded internally. These four people either had astonishing abilities, or had too high an opinion of themselves, and did not realize at all how terrifying Yin souls could be.","However, he did not speak out of turn, because he was only an observer.","It wasn’t long before they neared the edge of the battlefield.","The warship stopped, and did not go too deep. If they went any further, the warship would be attacked. This was only a transport ship, and did not have too strong a defense.","“Everyone, leave the ship!” one of the sailors shouted.","Some people immediately jumped out of the ship’s deck and rushed into the battlefield, but there were also some people who looked afraid.","It was possible that they had come with hot blood in their hearts, and had lofty aspirations, wanting to establish an outstanding meritorious service.","However, after they really came here, they surveyed the surroundings and realized that this was practically a living hell!","The entire battlefield was covered with corpses. Some were complete, and some were incomplete. Severed arms, legs, and heads covered this area, causing one to feel apprehensive just by looking at them. Those with weaker mental endurance were about to throw up.","As a result, a few women on the ship had already begun to vomit. Even two men couldn’t hold themselves back.","Ling Han nodded at the large black dog and the others. The four of them leaped out at the same time, heading towards the battlefield.","“Let’s move separately.”","The four of them were too strong. If they gathered together, they would be too eye-catching.","Ling Han charged into the battlefield, and instantly, four Yin souls charged towards him.","They were merely Cauldron Forging Tier-level, so they weren’t even qualified to have him attack them..","Ling Han strode forwards, and the four Yin souls rushed over, immediately shattering into pieces.","He was slightly disappointed. Although there were many Yin souls here, there were none that could reach Sect Master-level. Furthermore, there was a mixture of cultivators fighting.. There were Yin souls, as well as living beings. When he attacked, he would definitely have reservations, and could not kill all of them together.","This place was clearly not suitable for him. He had to go ahead.","As he passed, Ling Han didn’t hold back either, killing all the Yin souls in his way.","He advanced forwards, and the level of Yin soul gradually increased. True Self Tier, or even Spirit Transformation Tier, appeared.","This was still not what Ling Han wanted.","He advanced further. In this area, whether it was the living cultivators or the Yin souls, their numbers were considerably lesser. They were all Sect Master-level.","Ling Han looked ahead. There were still Venerate Tier-level battles there.","The Imperial Clan Alliance adopted a strategy of setting up layers of defenses, sparing the weak and concentrating on the strong. The Venerate Tier elites stood at the front lines, followed by the Sect Masters, the Spirit Transformation Tier, and so on. With this kind of selection, the Yin souls were also separated.","The strongest elite had been blocked at the first line, and then the Sect Master was at the second line. Coincidentally, they both had their own opponents.","Although there were many Sect Masters in the Living Realm, living beings needed to rest, so they couldn’t battle all the time. Thus, the Sect Masters had to be divided into several groups. One group would attack, and the others would rest.","Then, they still had to leave behind a portion of people for mobility. This group would have to go wherever they needed reinforcements, and also to prevent the Yin souls from suddenly increasing the intensity of their offensive.","On the other hand, the Yin souls didn’t need to rest, and they wouldn’t be injured either. They could battle continuously, and added with their absolute advantage in numbers, in this kind of war, even the Sect Masters of the Living Realm would have to match at least two Yin souls at the same time.","Thankfully, the Yin souls’ own battle prowess was slightly inferior, and added with the fact that this was the Living Realm, which had weakened a portion of their abilities, the Sect Masters of the Living Realm would still be able to hold on if it was one against two.","However, the battles were still as intense as before. Occasionally, there would be people who were severely wounded, or even killed.","After all, Yin souls were not idiots either. Why do I have to fight two against one evenly? Can’t I fight four against one, or ten against one?","Both sides suffered heavy casualties, but the Yin soul army was unafraid of death, while the Living Realm army couldn’t be so unafraid of death. Thus, their morale was far inferior.","At this rate, how many days could the Living Realm last?","Thankfully, the Imperial Sons also joined the battle, especially the Golden Generation. Similarly Sect Masters, they were too strong, and it was not impossible for them to fight a hundred alone.","They moved unhindered, invincible.","Ling Han also charged out. In his eyes, these Yin souls represented treasures that could increase his cultivation level.","He was very reserved, and did not use his full strength, but he was too strong. He could still kill a Yin soul with a few punches and kicks, as easily as could be.","After killing several thousand Yin souls, he finally received a reward from heaven and earth. An incredibly pure energy surged into his body, causing the sixth golden thread on his fruits of cultivation to become slightly deeper.","Invigorating!","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. Going by the rate of killing Yin souls, he would only need about ten days to advance to seven stars.","However, after fighting for only four days, the Yin soul army suddenly withdrew.","Ling Han had no choice but to retreat back onto the warship."]},{"number":4529,"title":"Chapter 4529: Into the depths","paragraphs":["Chapter 4529: Into the depths","Editor: Henyee Translations","The warship was almost empty.","In the past, there had been a ship full of people, but now, there was only one third of them!","Furthermore, this was also the total number of people that this warship had transported from the Four Heavenly Realms. In other words, out of the people from the four Heavenly Realms, only one third was left.","Just how high was the casualty rate?","It could not be helped. This warship was carrying new recruits, and they had completely not been baptized by war, so how could they not suffer heavy casualties?","However, those who survived would rapidly grow. If they did not die after a few great battles, they would be able to become elites.","...","On the ship, everyone was silent. Some were numb, some were excited, and some were terrified. These were all normal reactions.","That veteran soldier was still observing, and had memorized the appearances of these survivors.","The warship returned to the Purple Gauze Planet.","Everyone went to rest and reorganize. The Yin souls would make a comeback soon, and by then, they had to face it in their best condition.","After disembarking from the warship, the sun was shining brightly.","Everyone was filled with the feeling of having survived a calamity. Bathing in the sunlight, feeling that they were still alive, a great many people cried out.","“Haha, I’ve advanced by a minor level!”","“Though I have sustained a considerable injury, the internal injuries that I have sustained in the past have disappeared!”","“My martial arts foundations have become even more solid!”","Multiple voices rang out, filled with excitement.","As long as they didn’t die in battle, they would definitely be able to obtain benefits.","Ling Han, the large black dog, and the others also left. They found a place to rest and reorganize.","If they battled against Yin souls, the stronger they were, the greater their gains would definitely be. Thus, the large black dog and the others were all overjoyed.","In the face of such pressure, even the pervert pig had no choice but to stay alert and fight seriously, because he did not want to die.","One day, two days, five days, and very soon, ten days had passed, but the Yin souls actually did not launch a new wave of attacks.","No one breathed a sigh of relief. Instead, they all became even more nervous.","The longer they accumulated power, the more terrifying the explosion of the Yin soul invasion would be in the next wave of attacks. Thus, there was a large rock weighing down on everyone’s chest, and it was getting heavier and heavier.","On the seventeenth day, masses of Yin souls suddenly rushed out of Mountain Sea Heaven.","It had begun!","On the Living Realm’s side, the Venerate Tiers, the Sect Masters and the Spirit Transformation Tier True Lords all rushed into space at the first instant. They didn’t need to take a warship; that would only delay their progress.","The others couldn’t. They had to use the warship as a means of transportation. After all, the minimum requirement for flying physically was Core Formation Tier, but this kind of speed was too slow. By the time they flew into the depths of space and faced off against the Yin souls, the battle might be almost over.","This time, Ling Han didn’t waste any time and immediately shot into the air.","It was not only Purple Gauze Planet. From the seventeen planets surrounding the Mountain Sea Heaven, elites flew out to meet the Yin souls.","Ling Han hadn’t used the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. This was far too eye-catching. If it wasn’t a life-and-death situation, he definitely would not use such an ultimate technique.","He was using the Imminent Skyline. Although it was a Saint Technique, its speed couldn’t be considered slow either.","But in this way, he was inferior to those Imperial Sons. They all rushed in front of him, and were the first to face the yin souls.","Ling Han frowned. He was always suppressing his abilities, so how could he compare to the Imperial Sons?","Since one had entered into battle later, and the efficiency of his slaughter was low, he would definitely kill a great many fewer Yin souls.","Now, the top prodigies were all fighting with all their might, striving to be at the forefront. In that way, the possibility of becoming Emperor was naturally higher.","They had no choice but to compete, because there were really too many prodigies of this generation, such as Ding Shu and Origin. Which one of them did not have the aptitude to become Emperor?","Thus, once Ling Han fell too far behind, then even if he was more freakish, he could only sit by and watch another become Emperor.","“This won’t work.”","Ling Han shook his head, but what could he do?","He couldn’t help but turn his gaze even further away.","What if he intercepted them there?","He was indeed at the level of Sect Master. Theoretically speaking, he couldn’t possibly be a match for Venerate Tier.","However, against a Yin soul, he had a crushing advantage.","Destructive Energy!","Thus, even if he encountered a Venerate Tier Yin soul, he would not be afraid. In fact, he could even kill it.","“All right, I’ll go there!” Ling Han was filled with confidence, because even if he was besieged by Venerate Tier Yin souls, or even encountered the Yin Saint, didn’t he still have the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and the Purple Calamity Grains?","This gave him great confidence.","He would do as he said.","After venturing deep into the battlefield, he didn’t linger in battle at all. When he arrived at the Sect Master-level battle area, he immediately used the Strange Shadow Steps and continued forward.","Very soon, he had passed through the Sect Master-level battlefield, and arrived at the area where the Venerate Tiers were battling.","He saw Brother Monkey, who was wielding a metal rod that was radiating with golden light. He was invincible.","Very good, Brother Monkey should have gained a lot. His abilities improved rapidly.","Ling Han smiled knowingly, and continued onwards.","Very soon, he had also passed through the Venerate Tier-level battlefield. There were many Yin souls here, and their abilities varied greatly, from Foundation Building Tier to Venerate Tier-level.","Ling Han appeared. This time, he had no scruples.","This is my battlefield, my world!","Boom, he threw a punch, and nineteen streaks of Regulations shone. Instantly, a massive vacuum appeared ahead of him.","All the Yin souls that were in the path of his attack were all turned into ashes.","When they saw a living being, they didn’t need anyone to command them, and the nearby Yin souls all charged over with a whistle.","Ling Han humphed as he unleashed his murderous aura. Pa, pa, pa! The Yin souls in the surrounding area were instantly annihilated.","The efficiency of this massacre was too high.","However, those that he had insta-killed naturally could not possibly have Yin souls that were too strong. Thus, Ling Han had temporarily not received any reward from the heaven and earth either.","Yin souls completely had no concept of death, and pounced one after another.","After battling for a while, Ling Han felt a powerful aura approach.","This was a Yin soul of the level of Sect Master.","It bared its fangs and brandished its claws, appearing incredibly fierce.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and with a punch, this Yin soul died.","Ling Han, who had reached the level of a six-star Sect Master, found it truly hard to find a match for himself among Sect Masters. Most opponents would only be insta-killed by him.","Someone like Di Wuji was really too rare. Furthermore, it was not that his own strength that was really strong enough to stand against Ling Han.","Die! Die! Die!","In just over ten minutes, Ling Han began to receive rewards from heaven and earth. His cultivation level began to increase, and the golden patterns on the fruit of cultivation became deeper and deeper.","“Going by that logic, I would be able to reach peak stage Six Stars in two days, at most!”","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. Fighting like this was more fun.","‘Hmm?’","A solemn expression appeared on his face. This was because he could sense an incredibly powerful aura that far surpassed his own.","Venerate Tier!","He looked into the distance, and saw a Yin soul that was as tall as three hundred meters was rapidly approaching. It had the body of a goat, its horns golden, and actually had a sacred air about it.","When the Venerate Tier arrived, how would a Sect Master be able to block him?","Ling Han gave a loud shout, and made the first move. He shot out a punch, and Destructive Energy boiled.","Faced with a Venerate Tier-level existence, his two slivers of Seven Star Regulations were not enough at all. Thus, he completely abandoned them and used all his Spiritual Power to stimulate the Destructive Energy."]},{"number":4530,"title":"Chapter 4530: Seven Star Sect Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 4530: Seven Star Sect Master","Editor: Henyee Translations","Boom!","The Destructive Energy was unleashed, turning into a ball of light that was even darker than darkness itself. At an incredibly fast speed, it blasted towards the Venerate Tier Yin soul.","The Venerate Tier Yin soul had never imagined that Ling Han’s attack could be so fast. At this moment, it was already impossible for it to dodge. It could only clasp its front hooves in front of its chest.","It didn’t matter. It could easily block the attack of a mere Sect Master.","However, when the force of the punch arrived, this Yin soul finally realized that the situation was not good.","Its defense was completely useless in front of this energy.","...","Peng!","The Destructive Energy surged past, and that Venerate Tier-level Yin soul was instantly destroyed.","If others saw this, their eyes would definitely pop out in shock.","That was because though the Yin soul’s battle prowess was not strong, its defense was very high.","This was not reflected in the strength of their physique, but rather that they could immediately heal after being injured. Of course, their battle prowess would also decrease accordingly, and had to be compensated by devouring other Yin souls.","Hence, killing Yin souls was very troublesome, and they needed to be shattered bit by bit.","But in front of Ling Han, this Yin soul was killed with a single punch, and directly turned into ashes.","Yet Ling Han was completely unconcerned. He squinted his eyes, feeling the arrival of the rewards from heaven and earth, circulating in his body, making him feel incredibly pleased.","‘Come, again!’","He released a battle cry, and the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was used, traversing among the Yin souls.","There was no need for him to make a move at all. He only had to channel the Destructive Energy onto the phoenix wings, and wherever he passed, an absolute vacuum would appear in the Yin soul masses.","This destructive power was really strong enough to destroy the heavens and earth.","The Yin souls naturally could not possibly sit by and watch him slaughter like this. Very soon, another Venerate Tier Yin soul arrived, and launched an attack at him.","Even if the Yin soul’s attack was weaker, it was still Venerate Tier-level after all!","Ling Han didn’t dare to face it head-on, and simply used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. ‘In any case, you can’t catch up to me.’","However, wherever he passed, it was still a feast of slaughter.","Taking advantage of being unexpected, he would still blast out Destructive Energy towards the Venerate Tier-level Yin soul, but after suffering a loss once, the Yin soul would naturally be on guard, and dodge at the first instant, causing Ling Han to be unsuccessful.","It was fine.","Ling Han chuckled. He couldn’t trick elites of Venerate Tier, but Sect Master-level Yin souls would not be able to escape even if they wanted to.","He killed to his heart’s content. No one, no, no soul could stop him.","...","And in the distance, the elites at the Venerate Tier and Sect Master battlefield all discovered that the pressure on them was becoming lighter.","Yi?","Yin souls were clearly still surging over like floodwaters, but strangely, the number of Sect Masters and Venerate Tiers among them had decreased considerably, greatly reducing their pressure.","What was going on?","The battle had only progressed for a day, and the Yin soul troops were about to retreat?","That’s not right.","This time, they had held back for more than half a month. That should have been a very powerful wave. Why were there signs that the battle would end after a day?","They had never imagined that someone was standing in front of them, attracting the pursuit of a great many Venerate Tier-level Yin souls, and in the case of Sect Masters, those in this direction were more or less dead.","Ling Han wasn’t nailed to a single spot. He continued to move around, circling around the Mountain Sea Heaven, trying to attract as much aggro as possible.","He was also very careful. In front of a Venerate Tier Yin soul, he could still come and go as he pleased, and even had the ability to counterattack. However, once a Yin Saint made a move, he would definitely be in trouble.","Thus, he was always prepared to face a powerful enemy with the Purple Calamity Grains.","What surprised him was that the Yin souls seemed to really be very well-behaved. No matter how many Sect Masters he had killed, and even three Venerate Tiers had been killed, no Yin Saint appeared to stop him.","After battling for three days, Ling Han received enough rewards from heaven and earth, advancing his cultivation level to peak stage six stars.","At this time, there was no way for him to retreat.","This was because he had already revealed himself. If he ran back with a large group of Yin souls, who wouldn’t recognize him?","The good days had just begun, and there was absolutely no way that Ling Han would want to destroy his disguise so quickly.","He definitely had to maintain his composure!","It didn’t matter. His cultivation level could no longer increase, but the rewards from the heaven and earth were in all aspects. Spiritual power, physique, life force, and so on could all continue to improve.","This battle lasted for a whole nine days.","The Yin souls finally announced the withdrawal of troops, and the remaining Yin souls immediately retreated back to the Mountain Sea Heaven.","Ling Han breathed a sigh of relief, and also went back.","He used the Strange Shadow Steps to hide himself. With his present strength, even Venerate Tiers might not be able to discover him.","—As the number one assassin organization, the Battle God Palace was indeed quite capable.","Ling Han did not return directly to the Purple Gauze Planet. Instead, he boarded a warship.","He wanted to break through on the warship.","Coincidentally, this was the warship that he had boarded for the first time.","The veteran soldier was slightly surprised to see Ling Han.","That was because he had not seen Ling Han board the ship.","“He should have boarded another warship,” he said to himself, and came up with an answer himself.","However, as a freelance soldier, being able to survive two battles, this ability and survivability was very good.","He walked over, sat beside Ling Han, and asked, “How should I address you, brother?”","Ling Han glanced at him, “Ji Wuming.”","This sounded like a fake name. Who would be called “Wuming”1?","However, the veteran soldier didn’t care. It didn’t matter what Ling Han’s name was. He only wanted to strike up a conversation.","“Brother Ji, to be able to survive two great battles, your survivability is truly amazing,” he complimented.","Ling Han smiled and said, “It’s nothing. As long as you hide in the back during battle, you can do the same.”","‘Holy f*ck!’","The veteran soldier instantly lost his cool, feeling incredibly awkward.","What difference was there between you and a f****** deserter?","And he was still so self-righteous? Was that very honourable?","The veteran soldier was rendered speechless. If this kind of person joined the official army, wouldn’t he be bringing disaster to others?","He stood up and left.","Ling Han smiled, and began to prepare to break through to the Seven Star Sect Master-level.","He had been engaged in bloody battles these past few days. Moreover, the advancement of his cultivation level had come from the rewards of heaven and earth, so it was only natural that he hadn’t suffered any side effects. After accumulating his cultivation for half a day, he was already confident that he could achieve victory.","Breaking through to seven stars!","The warship had already returned to port, and everyone disembarked one after another. However, Ling Han was still in seclusion, so he naturally did not move.","No one paid attention to him, because they had already heard from the veteran soldier that Ling Han was a coward. After entering the battlefield, he would hide at the back and take advantage of the situation.","This kind of person... who would pay attention to him?","No wonder no one had seen him during the battle.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t care. His mind was completely focused on breaking through.","Two days later, Ling Han suddenly opened his eyes.","The Dao Fruit Tree had grown by a significant amount again, and a seventh golden thread had also appeared on the fruit of cultivation.","Seven stars.","Ling Han strode forwards. He had not even disembarked from the ship, when he saw a large number of cultivators rush over, and board the ship, one after another.","Needless to say, it was definitely the Yin souls that had launched another attack.","Alright, there was no need for him to disembark. He could directly head into space.","Ling Han stood with his hands clasped behind his back, looking towards space. With his present vision, he could vaguely see the boundless number of Yin souls in space.","Just how long was this war going to continue?","Seeing his solemn expression, the people on the ship all scoffed.","‘F*ck! You’re an army deserter, so why are you pretending to be so compassionate?’"]},{"number":4531,"title":"Chapter 4531: Robbery","paragraphs":["Chapter 4531: Robbery","Editor: Henyee Translations","The warship arrived; charge!","Ling Han strolled slowly. After reaching seven stars, he could fire out 20 flashes of Regulations with a single strike.","What kind of concept was this?","In the past, on the Imperial Path, the greatest test for a Sect Master was only to deliver twenty flashes of Regulations with a single strike, and this was still the result of a Venerate Tier suppressing his cultivation level.","Judging by the situation that Ling Han had seen, to say nothing of Golden Generation, even such ancient prodigies like Yang Yihuan and Di Wuji could only fire eighteen Regulations with a single strike, at most.","Yet when Ling Han was now a Seven Star Sect Master, he had already reached the limit of twenty flashes of Regulations.","...","Obviously, he would definitely be able to break this limit.","Among those on the level of Sect Master, there was really no one that was his match.","He still charged to the front lines, harvesting Yin souls, and obtaining the rewards of heaven and earth, rapidly increasing his cultivation level.","This time, he again attracted the pursuit of a great many Venerate Tier elites.","However, even if he had increased his cultivation level by a minor level, there was no qualitative change in his battle prowess. It was impossible for him to directly possess strength that could match Venerate Tier-level. Thus, he could only focus on roaming around and fighting, finding opportunities to kill enemies.","This battle lasted for a whole ten days.","Ling Han could pat his chest with certainty and guarantee that there was definitely no one who had gained more than he had.","Whether it was the number or quality of Yin souls he had killed, he was definitely the undisputed number one.","It could not be helped. He had Destructive Energy, which was a super weapon against Yin souls.","As for Ding Shu and the others?","Indeed, they also possessed Destructive Energy, but firstly, it wasn’t complete, and secondly, they didn’t have a life-saving trump card like Ling Han, who dared to venture deep into this area to battle.","Thus, it was definitely Ling Han who was the most awesome.","He had no intention of publicizing it at all, and was silently making a fortune.","The battle ended, and Ling Han returned to the warship, sitting quietly.","He hadn’t contacted the large black dog and the others for so many days, and he was sure that the empress and the others had already arrived. Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry. As long as these people weren’t aggressive, they could completely handle the battle with ease.","It should be known that the seven babies had been sent by him to protect the empress, Hu Niu, Ling Xi, and the others, so how could anything possibly happen?","Seeing Ling Han come back alive again, the people on the ship all thought him shameless.","After wave after wave of battle, the “veterans” were further reduced in number. With every battle, a large number of people would die in battle, so how could the people on this ship be an exception?","Precisely because of this, they looked down even more on Ling Han.","Everyone else was fighting and bathing in blood, but what about Ling Han?","He hid at the back and was a shameful deserter.","If it was not for the fact that everyone was completely exhausted after the battle, and only wanted to have a good rest, it was probable that some impatient and hot-tempered people would throw Ling Han off the ship.","Half a day later, the warship returned to the Purple Gauze Planet. Everyone disembarked one after another, looking for a place to rest. Additionally, some people had also accumulated enough battle merits, and could redeem treasures from the Imperial Clans.","Ling Han took a look. His merit points had reached 20 million.","He didn’t know how many merits others had, but based on the number of Yin souls he had killed and their high level, this number should be extremely shocking.","Let’s go and take a look at the Imperial Clans and see if I can redeem a few portions of Celestial Qi.","Though his advancement was fast enough, he did not mind at all if it could be faster. Furthermore, if he had no use for it, couldn’t he give it to the empress and the others?","“Hey, stop right there!” Ling Han had not taken a few steps, when he was stopped.","He looked over, and there were a total of three people blocking his way. All of them had their chests bared, looking like hooligans.","Yi, there were actually ruffians here?","Seeing that Ling Han had stopped, one of them said, “Hand over the scoring device.”","The so-called scoring device was a small item used to tally battle merits. The Imperial Clans did not give it this name. It was unknown who had called it that first, and when it spread out, it became publicly acknowledged.","Realization dawned on Ling Han. This scoring device was not tied to the identity of the wearer. Thus, others could completely take it, and use the battle merits inside to redeem treasures.","Hehe, you guys have also progressed with the times, huh? The transition is quite fast.","Ling Han smiled, and said, “All right.”","He was extremely cooperative, and handed over the scoring device.","The three of them faltered upon hearing this. So smoothly?","“This guy is a deserter, so it’s normal for him to be afraid.”","“Moreover, he definitely doesn’t have many battle merits, so he doesn’t care.”","“Pei, how unlucky.”","The three of them shook their heads. However, Ling Han had already handed over the scoring device, so they were no longer interested in making things difficult for Ling Han. They turned around and left.","Ling Han didn’t stop them, and he simply counted in his mind. One, two, three, four...","In the distance.","“Let’s see how many points that brat has,” one of them said. They had snatched something, so they should at least see how much it was worth.","The person holding the scoring device nodded. No matter how small the ant’s leg was, it was still meat.","Let’s take a look.","He picked up the scoring device and looked at it. Involuntarily, he couldn’t help but gape, “F*ck, my eyes must have blurred.”","He kneaded it a little, then looked again.","Nothing had changed.","Twenty, over twenty million!","“Hey, what nonsense are you spouting?” the person beside him asked. Then, he snatched the scoring device over, and his eyes swept over it. “F***!”","The third person wore a dumbfounded expression. ‘What’s wrong with you people?’","It was just a scoring device; was there any need for you guys to make such a big fuss?","“What are you two playing at? I’m warning you, don’t team up to trick me.” He also grabbed the scoring device. With a look, the corners of his mouth instantly twitched madly.","“We—”","“We’re rich!”","In an instant, the three of them exclaimed at the same time, stomping their feet in excitement.","More than 20 million battle merit points, this was a huge sum that drove them crazy.","F***, in future, I’ll buy two alchemical pills at a time, eat one, and throw the other one away!","The same was true for Spirit Tools. He could hold one in his hand, and another at his waist.","For no other reason than the fact that he was rich!","After a moment of excitement, one of them suddenly shivered, “No, we have to return the scoring device.”","“Are you crazy?” the other two shouted at the same time, looking at him like he was an idiot.","Over 20 million battle merit points!","That person forcefully suppressed his greed, and analyzed, “Just think, what kind of strength would be needed to be able to obtain more than 20 million points?”","This... the remaining two immediately fell silent, and then looked terrified.","That’s right. It was not that they had not been on the battlefield before, but after three battles, the battle merits that each person had obtained was only slightly over a hundred points.","From this, it could be seen just how many Yin souls had to be killed to achieve a battle merit of more than 20 million, and just how strong a Yin soul would have to be to be able to accomplish that?","This kind of person... must be a supreme elite, whose abilities far surpassed them.","“Had he just found this?” one of them whispered. “If he really was that powerful, why did he give us the scoring device?”","“How could it have been picked up?” The first person shook his head, “For such an elite, how could he lose something?”","True.","“It should be that guy that is deliberately testing us. If we are greedy...”","The three of them stopped talking, their eyes filled with fear.","“Let’s go back.”","“M-hm.”","The three of them obediently returned, and saw that Ling Han was still standing where he had been, a faint smile on his face.","This caused their hearts to clench, and they increasingly felt that they had done the right thing. Otherwise, if they fled with the scoring device, they would probably not be far from becoming corpses."]},{"number":4532,"title":"Chapter 4532: Storm of Redemption","paragraphs":["Chapter 4532: Storm of Redemption","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Please, please spare us, Lord.” The three people respectfully returned the scoring device to Ling Han.","Ling Han caught it, and smiled faintly, “What is it? Have you suddenly turned over a new leaf?”","He wasn’t afraid of these three people fleeing at all. With how powerful his divine sense was, where could these three people run to? Moreover, didn’t he still have control of the ley lines?","“It’s all because of your brilliance, Milord!” A large man said with slight excitement, “Under Milord’s brilliance, we finally repented, and thought that our actions were too inappropriate!”","‘F*ck! You’re far too shameless!’","His two companions gritted their teeth. They had not thought that the other would say such mushy words. This made them want to throw up.","...","Ling Han smiled brightly, and said, “Flattery will never be denied. Come, flatter me more. Who knows, if I’m in a good mood, I won’t call you guys to account.”","“Lord, you are like the red sun in the skies, shining wherever you are!”","“Your divine might is invincible, and wherever you go, Yin souls will all be turned into ashes!”","“With your participation, this battle will definitely be recorded in history, and shine for all eternity!”","“...”","The three of them hurriedly began to curry favor. In any case, they would do whatever was mushy. If they spoke too much, they would naturally have immunity, and would not keep thinking of throwing up.","Ling Han smiled sheepishly, and interrupted them, asking, “What are your names?”","“Liu Xing.”","“Feng Xingwang.”","“Gu Taihua.”","The three of them hurriedly announced their names, and at the same time, there was also some hope in their eyes. If they could get Ling Han’s support, would they be able to do as they liked in the future?","“The next time the Yin souls invade, come find me at the warship number 754,” Ling Han said, then strode off.","“Thank you, Lord!” Liu Xing and the others were overjoyed. They had really gotten a powerful backer.","Ling Han walked all the way, and soon arrived at the treasure exchange office set up by the Imperial Clan Alliance.","For the convenience of the cultivators at Purple Gauze Planet, there were many such exchange places. However, for first-timers, they could only choose what they wanted to trade for first. Then, the staff here would deduct your battle merits, and make you wait for a few days. Then, they would bring the redemption items from the headquarters, and hand them over to you.","Thus, this redemption office was not very big. In fact, there were only two staff members, one old and one young, and they were both men.","Seeing that the young man was busy, Ling Han found the old man. From the looks of it, this old man should be the person-in-charge of this place, and the young man was only his subordinate.","“If you want to redeem something, make your choice first. Once you’ve made your decision, hand the scoring device over to me.” Without waiting for Ling Han to speak, the old geezer directly handed over a small ball, appearing to have no patience.","Ling Han picked up the small ball and probed it with his divine sense. Instantly, images spread out in his mind. They were all introductions to various natural treasures, God Tools, alchemical pills, and so on. At the bottom was the merit points that were needed to redeem them.","He was only interested in Celestial Qi, and kept searching. Not long after, he discovered a page of Celestial Qi.","From One Star to Eight Stars, but One Star Celestial Qi only needed a million battle merits, while Eight Star Celestial Qi needed as much as fifteen million.","Theoretically speaking, if Celestial Qi was one level higher in quality, its value was more than ten times higher. Thus, if One Star Celestial Qi could be redeemed with a million battle merits, then in conversion, the redemption value of Eight Star Celestial Qi would be overwhelmingly high.","This was clearly unsuitable.","No matter how precious Eight Star Celestial Qi was, it should still be something that could be touched, right? However, one couldn’t reduce the value of One Star Celestial Qi to a level that everyone could redeem according to the ratio. In that case, even the Imperial Clans would become poor.","Thus, they could only set a high price.","1,000,000 merit points was something that most people could only see but not reach. Only a very small number of elites could achieve this, and 10,000,000 merit points and above was enough to drive anyone to despair.","Aside from Imperial Sons, Origin, Ding Shu, and the others, how many other people could reach this level?","If it was them, wasn’t this what they should deserve in the first place?","Thus, the Imperial Clans were actually very thorough in their considerations. It seemed fair, but in truth, it was not fair at all.","However, they had overlooked Ling Han.","Ling Han found this strange. Why didn’t he see Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling, or He Luo?","With their strength, they could not only kill Yin souls to increase their cultivation level, they could also earn some merit points to redeem treasures, so why didn’t they?","He thought to himself, but did not hesitate. Instead, he placed the ball and the scoring device on the table, and said, “I have decided. I will choose Eight Star Celestial Qi!”","Pu!","The old man spluttered, his face filled with shock.","You’ve probably lost your mind, haven’t you?","Eight Stars Celestial Qi! How many battle merits did it need to be redeemed?","15 million!","Even if you had been killing Yin souls since birth, and continued to do so until you died, being able to accumulate a million battle merits was already very impressive, and you actually dared to ask to redeem Eight Stars Celestial Qi that was worth 15 million merit points?","Hehe, was he an idiot?","“Shoo, shoo, shoo!” The old man waved his hand, his expression extremely unfriendly. He thought that Ling Han had either gone mad, or was deliberately toying with him.","Ling Han frowned, and said, “According to the rules, I’ll choose the items to redeem, and you’ll be responsible for deducting the battle merits. Also, to tell me when I’ll come and retrieve the items. Why don’t you follow the procedure?”","“Hahaha!” The old man couldn’t help but laugh loudly, but there was no hint of a smile on his face, “Brat, are you really going to make a big fuss out of this? Then I might as well tell you. To dare to play around with a member of the Imperial Clan, that is a crime punishable by death!”","There were still some other cultivators at this redemption point. When they saw the two of them suddenly start arguing, they all cast their gazes over.","The old man gave a simple explanation, which immediately caused everyone to laugh loudly.","Who didn’t know the price of Eight Star Celestial Qi?","Those were some of the most expensive items among the redeemable items, and could instill fear in others just by looking at them.","If it was a Venerate Tier elite, or a Golden Generation elite that had come to redeem it, then everyone could still accept it, but you, an average-looking brat, hoho, this was practically a joke.","“Have you gone mad?”","“Dreaming about being a peerless elite for too long, he even deceived himself!”","“Brat, your mother told you to come out to help. After the fight, you should go home.”","A considerable number of people began to mock him, feeling that an extreme character like Ling Han was really rare.","Ling Han also smiled, and said, “Hurry up, deduct the battle merits. I’m still busy!”","Pu, this naturally drew ridicule from the masses again. Tsk, tsk, tsk. This guy actually made a joke sound so serious; it was indescribably funny.","“All right, I would really like to see what kind of ‘shocking’ battle merits you have obtained.” The old man humphed, and picked up the scoring device from the table.","He emphasized the word “shocking”, which naturally caused a great many people to roar with laughter.","Some people looked at Ling Han with eyes filled with pity. Sigh, what was the point? Running in front of so many people and embarrassing yourself; does your mother know about this?","“F***!” The old man picked up the scoring device, and with a sweep of his divine sense, he couldn’t help but curse. His face was filled with shock.","‘Holy f*ck!’"]},{"number":4533,"title":"Chapter 4533: Beat Him to Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 4533: Beat Him to Death","Editor: Henyee Translations","More than twenty million battle merit points?","F***, who could believe this!","The old man was immediately dumbfounded, and the expression on his face seemed to have frozen.","Yi, what was going on here?","Everyone was curious. You only took a look at the scoring device; how did you become like this?","Could it be that it was poisonous?","...","Otherwise, no matter how low his battle merits were, there was no need for him to have such an expression, right?","Er, heaven-defyingly high battle merits?","Hey, hey, hey, don’t live in a dream. How could there be such a possibility?","“What are you standing around for?” Ling Han knocked on the table, his expression impatient.","Only now did the old man come back to his senses, and looked at Ling Han with a confused and uncertain gaze.","More than 20 million battle merit points, how did this guy get it?","He was certain that even if it was the Golden Generation, their current battle merit value would only be over a million, at most. Compared to Ling Han, this was only a fraction.","Thus, how could he believe that a nameless nobody had actually defeated the Golden Generation? Moreover, it was a crushing defeat!","However, this was indeed a scoring device issued by the Imperial Clan Alliance.","What method had this brat used to change his score?","Or could it be that this brat’s luck was heaven-defying, and he had picked up the scoring device that had been left behind by a supreme elite?","As for how the latter could have happened, he did not know, nor did he care. It was enough for him to know that there was just a sliver of a chance.","In short, these 20 million battle merits definitely couldn’t have been earned by Ling Han.","He was absolutely certain of this.","A smile appeared on his face. It was time for him to make a fortune!","This smile was immediately withdrawn. The old man’s expression immediately became stern, and he shouted loudly, “Good one, brat, you actually dare to steal someone else’s scoring device. Do you know that this is a serious crime!”","‘What? Stolen?’","Everyone exchanged looks, and came to a sudden realization.","The score on the scoring device was definitely very high, and did not match Ling Han’s strength at all. That was why the old man was first stunned.","Ling Han was well aware of this, and he said calmly, “Next, are you going to detain my scoring device, and spare me this once on account of my first offense?”","“Spare you? Hehe, in your dreams!” the old man balefully said.","His name was Pei Kuo, and he belonged to the Crimson Rainbow Imperial Clan. Of course, he was only a peripheral character in the clan. Otherwise, he would not have fallen to the level of guarding the exchange point.","However, if he took advantage of others, who would dare to say anything against him?","More than 20 million battle merit points could be exchanged for a lot of treasures for him.","Ling Han couldn’t help but chuckle, saying, “You’re even more black-hearted than I expected.”","Not only did he want to snatch his battle merits, he even wanted to punish him.","Hehe, did he think he was an easy target to bully?","“Guards! Guards!” Pei Kuo shouted loudly. Though he was also a True Self Tier, as a dignified member of the Imperial Clan, how could he possibly make a move personally? This would be too demeaning of his status.","Very quickly, two guards came in. They were both in the Core Formation Tier.","“Capture this evil criminal and send him to the Public Order Office!” Pei Kuo pointed at Ling Han.","The two guards immediately raised the spears in their hands and aimed them at Ling Han.","As guards, they were treated fairly well. These two spears were both Spirit Tools, and under their control, the tip of the spears glowed. If Ling Han showed the slightest sign of resistance, they would attack him without mercy.","Ling Han shook his head, and asked with a smile, “Why am I not the slightest bit surprised?”","“Obediently follow us, so you won’t suffer. In fact, you might even lose your life,” a guard said.","Ling Han moved, grabbing out at that guard.","“How dare you!” The two guards activated their Spirit Tool without hesitation. Xiu, xiu, two streaks of green light immediately shot towards Ling Han.","However, when the green light reached Ling Han, it automatically crumbled, and Ling Han had already grabbed one of the guards. With a toss, he threw that person out. He did the same thing, and threw out the other guard.","—These two guards were lying outside just like that, unable to get up again.","Hiss!","Everyone was stunned. At first, they had thought that Ling Han, who was average-looking, should be a nameless nobody. No one had thought that his strength would actually be so strong, capable of toying with Core Formation Tiers in the palm of his hand.","Was this a high-level Core Formation Tier, or... a True Self Tier?","If he were a True Self Tier, he would already be qualified to be called an elite.","Pei Kuo was also slightly surprised. He had not thought that Ling Han’s strength was far beyond his expectations.","A thought flashed through his mind. Could it be that this battle merit was really obtained by Ling Han?","However, it was only an instant, and he immediately shook his head.","Impossible!","Even the Golden Generation had only obtained over a million battle merits. What right did Ling Han have to surpass the Golden Generation?","Was there any law? Was there any logic?","“Humph, no wonder he dared to be so arrogant. As it turned out, he still has some abilities!” Pei Kuo sneered, and stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han.","He was slightly irritated. He was a member of the Imperial Clan, and to have him lower himself to personally make a move on him was practically demeaning him!","Pa!","A crisp sound rang out, and Pei Kuo’s face had already sustained a solid slap.","Yi, what was going on?","Everyone was a little stunned. When had Ling Han made his move?","Who had seen it?","Pei Kuo himself was also very confused. He looked at Ling Han, then flew into a humiliated rage, and once again launched an attack.","Pa, another slap, crisp and loud.","F***, another slap?","Everyone turned to look at Pei Kuo, and saw that both his cheeks were very swollen. There was a hint of purple in the green, and a hint of black in the purple. It was as if they were filled with congested blood, and could spurt out at any moment.","When they looked at Ling Han again, their gazes were different.","Two consecutive slaps meant that Ling Han’s strength was far superior to Pei Kuo’s.","But it should be known that Pei Kuo was a True Self Tier!","To be able to toy with the True Self Tier in the palm of his hand, what kind of cultivation level would that have to be?","“You, how dare you!” Pei Kuo was about to cry. He was a member of the Imperial Clan, and he was already so old, yet he had been slapped in public. How could he accept this?","“Heh, you know how to feel wronged?” Ling Han said with a cold chuckle. Pa, pa, pa! He continued to slap, saying, “Then why didn’t you consider the consequences when you tried to swindle me and even send me to prison?”","“Only you can harm others, and others are not allowed to resist?”","“What kind of logic is that?”","Pa, pa, pa! Ling Han’s hands didn’t stop, and they continued to deliver slaps.","Pei Kuo was slapped so hard that blood was spurting from his mouth and nose. Soon, his teeth were also sent flying, and his whole face was even smashed, revealing ghastly white eyes, his two eyeballs practically popping out.","How tragic!","Yet Ling Han did not feel the slightest bit of sympathy. F***, if it was not for the fact that he was very strong, wouldn’t he really have been scammed, and suffer injustice for nothing?","Who would pity him?","He had brought this upon himself!","“Since you’re so shameless and want no face, I’ll help you slap it off!”","Everyone inhaled sharply. Things had progressed to this point, so how could they not understand?","—Pei Kuo probably saw that Ling Han’s merit points were high, and misunderstood that he did not have much strength or background, so he wanted to rob him of his merit points. In the end, he just had to kick an iron plate.","Thinking of this, everyone felt like they had a common enemy, because this kind of thing could possibly happen to them as well.","“Beat him to death!” It was unknown who called out. This drew the resonance of a great many people, and they all called out.","C"]},{"number":4534,"title":"Chapter 4534: Take them all down","paragraphs":["Chapter 4534: Take them all down","Editor: Henyee Translations","Right at this moment, someone from the Imperial Clan arrived.","When a member of the Pei Clan had met with an accident, it was naturally the Crimson Rainbow Imperial Clan that had come.","“Stop!” The visitor was a middle-aged man, but his abilities were much, much stronger than Pei Kuo’s.","He was a Spiritual Transformation Tier.","That was enough.","Yet Ling Han acted as if he had not heard anything, and continued to thrash him madly.","...","“I told you to stop!” The middle-aged man felt slightly embarrassed.","He was a Spirit Transformation True Lord. Furthermore, he came from the Imperial Clan, which had a natural glory. Even if he went to the Holy Land, who wouldn’t treat him as an esteemed guest?","Now, he had already spoken, but there was actually someone who would not listen?","Ling Han still ignored him, and continued to slap him.","The middle-aged man couldn’t hold himself back any longer. He immediately lashed out, grabbing at Ling Han.","Pa, a crisp sound rang out. It was obviously that familiar sound of a slap to the face.","However, this time, Ling Han did not slap Pei Kuo, but rather the middle-aged man.","What was going on?","Everyone was dumbfounded. If it was Pei Kuo, he was ultimately only a True Self Tier. Though he could be called an elite, above the True Self Tier, there were still a considerable number of cultivation levels.","However, a Spirit Transformation True Lord was also sent flying by a slap from Ling Han?","This!","There were indeed three levels above the Spirit Transformation Tier—Sect Master, Venerate Tier, and Saint Tier—and there was no need to count the Great Emperor Tier. Only one would appear in a single era, so there was no point to keep track of it.","So, did Ling Han belong to the cultivation level of Sect Master, Venerate or Saint?","How was this possible!","He was too young, and furthermore, his appearance was average. How could there be such a prodigy?","However, facts speak louder than words. Ling Han was now working left and right, using his left hand to slap Pei Kuo, while his right hand was slapping the middle-aged man, both without delay.","This time, the Pei Clan was completely humiliated.","After another while, someone from the Pei Clan finally came.","This time, it was naturally a Sect Master. He was a middle-aged man who looked to be in his fifties. He was wearing a white robe, and every single hair on his head was combed neatly.","“Pei Guangchen!” someone said in a low voice, revealing the identity of this person.","“Hiss, more than ten thousand years ago, that Pei Guangchen that stirred up the winds and clouds?”","“I remember that there was a person called Pei Guangchen who challenged the Dao Child of the various great Holy Lands in a row, and never lost. Afterwards, he was hunted down by the Venerates of the seven Holy Lands, and only then did his identity as an Imperial Clan elite was finally exposed.”","“The Imperial Son of the previous generation of the Pei Clan!”","Everyone whispered among themselves, all of them looking fearful.","The Imperial Clan was already frightening enough, what more when it was the Imperial Son!","Meanwhile, Ling Han was astonished. An Imperial Son, who was already so old, was only at the level of the Sect Master?","He immediately laughed in spite of himself. If every Imperial Son could charge up to Venerate Tier or even Saint Tier, then the strength of the Imperial Clan would really be too exaggerated.","In truth, it was also very difficult for the Imperial Son to reach Saint Tier. This would need power that was accumulated for a great many generations.","Otherwise, since Saints could live for millions of years, and generation after generation of Imperial Sons continued to become Saints, just how astonishing would the number of Saints in every Imperial Clan be?","Sect Maste-level was indeed a little weak, but it was acceptable.","Pei Guangchen looked coldly at Ling Han, his eyes filled with killing intent.","To humiliate the Imperial Clan like this, no matter what, Ling Han’s only fate was death.","Furthermore, the image of the Imperial Clan could not be tarnished, what more when if this matter spread out, it would affect the image of the whole Imperial Clan Alliance.","Who else would fight with all their might?","You see, not only would his battle merits be coveted by others, he himself would also be beaten and killed.","Thus, he definitely had to push all the blame onto Ling Han, insisting that he was a petty thief.","“Kneel,” Pei Guangchen said coldly. As the previous Imperial Son, he was naturally extraordinary. He had long since cultivated to the level of nine stars, and his battle prowess far surpassed the level of Dao Child.","He was filled with confidence. If he made a move, Ling Han would definitely have to bow down to him.","Ling Han smiled calmly, “Is this the attitude of your Pei Clan, or the Imperial Clan Alliance? Your people want to steal my battle merits, and when they did not succeed, you all jump out in waves to help him?”","“Haha, this kind of behavior is really shameless!”","“If you can’t bear to part with the treasures, then don’t hypocritically come up with some scoring device!”","“How embarrassing!”","When these words fell, a great many people nodded. At first, they had not known the truth, but now, they were all on Ling Han’s side.","They felt as if they were experiencing it themselves!","Some people didn’t mind making things worse, and turned on the connection device, broadcasting live on Galaxy Network.","All of a sudden, the number of people paying attention skyrocketed.","A great many people were protesting online, expressing their support for Ling Han.","Who wouldn’t be furious if this happened to them?","Of course, there were also some people who were curious about Ling Han’s identity. Who was this guy? He clearly looked ordinary, but his abilities were quite strong.","“No matter how strong he is, there is no way he could match Imperial Son.”","“Though Pei Guangchen’s talent is inferior to those Imperial Sons of the present generation, he must have cultivated to nine stars long ago. Dao Child of the same cultivation level is far from being his match, so how is that person supposed to block him?”","“Using his life?”","Everyone thought that Ling Han’s path of resistance would end here.","The higher-ups of the Imperial Clans were also paying attention to this matter. They were very angry. Their subordinate had actually done such an unreliable thing!","But now that things had come to this, what else could they do?","“Guangchen, execute that person immediately. Don’t let him make any more comments. At present, the entire Galaxy Network is paying attention to this matter!” A mighty figure communicated a command to Pei Guangchen through divine sense.","Pei Guangchen nodded, and showed a cold smirk, “Making an enemy of the Imperial Clan, I really don’t know where you get your courage from?”","He moved, launching an attack at Ling Han.","Pa!","It was only a single punch, and Pei Guangchen immediately sprawled out on the ground, his limbs twitching continuously.","“If you’re strong, you’re naturally courageous,” Ling Han said calmly. His voice was filled with arrogance.","However, he had displayed absolute strength, so who would care if he was showing off or not?","There was only endless admiration.","Heavens, even the Imperial Son of the previous era had been knocked down with a single punch. These abilities were nature-defying!","Ling Han stretched out a foot and placed it on Pei Guangchen’s head. He asked calmly, “Who are you going to send next? Venerate Tier?”","No one responded.","Now, the matter was getting bigger and bigger, and the whole universe was paying attention. If they still sent out a Venerate Tier, then the whole world would really be in chaos.","If Pei Guangchen could kill Ling Han, then Ling Han’s strength would only be so-so. How could he possibly obtain a battle merit that would make others dumbfounded? However, even Pei Guangchen was easily defeated, and Ling Han’s strength had been completely proven.","This kind of strength was still not worthy of such a high battle merit?","You Imperial Clans are really too much of a bully, isn’t it?","Only a while later, an old Venerate Tier from the Pei Clan came, but did not make a move. Instead, he politely apologized to Ling Han, promising that he would severely punish Pei Kuo.","Ling Han smiled, and very decisively let them go.","There was no way that he would really commit murder. Otherwise, it would give the Imperial Clans an opportunity, and they would send Venerate Tiers or even Saints to kill him.","At present, everyone in the world was on his side, and the Imperial Clans would also have to be wary of the mouths of the masses.","After all, Saints needed the power of belief. If they broke their word, who would still believe in the Imperial Clans?","The Venerate Tier from the Pei Clan had also brought over a portion of Eight Star Celestial Qi, which he personally handed over to Ling Han. He didn’t need to wait for a few more days.","When he came into contact with Ling Han, he also used his divine sense to scan Ling Han."]},{"number":4535,"title":"Chapter 4535: Defense","paragraphs":["Chapter 4535: Defense","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han was far too powerful, far too powerful.","Thus, the Venerate of the Pei Clan was naturally suspicious of his identity, and thought that it was possible that it was Ling Han in disguise.","If they confirmed that it was Ling Han, they would move quietly, kidnap Ling Han, and search for all the secrets on him before killing him to prevent him from leaking the secret.","However, with the help of the Soul Forming Technique, the Venerate couldn’t see anything off at all.","Ling Han took the Celestial Qi and immediately left.","In the meantime, he changed his appearance three times, moving with Strange Shadow Steps and Star Steps, and finally, he even used the Void Beast hide to conceal himself.","...","In this way, if he would still be targeted by others, then he would have no choice but to accept it.","—In public, it was impossible for anything to happen to him, because if anything happened, it would naturally be blamed on the Imperial Clans. For the present war situation, this would be too great a blow to their morale.","“Here’s another Nine Stars Celestial Qi.” Ling Han smiled. This should be able to help Brother Monkey create the strongest pillars of Fourth Extreme.","Of course, to concoct the Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill was naturally no big deal for him.","Now, a great many people were discussing him.","Who exactly was he? And what cultivation level was he in?","“I’m guessing that it’s highly possible that he’s a Venerate.”","“En, otherwise, how could he have subdued Pei Guangchen with a single move?”","“He had initially wanted to keep a low profile, but he never thought that he would be bullied by a minor character.”","“Haha, let everyone know about this. Don’t underestimate minor characters. Who knows, they might be just wanting to show off.”","For the moment, no one suspected that it was Ling Han in disguise.","This matter naturally made Ling Han even more displeased with the Imperial Clans, but he immediately set it aside. He first concocted the Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, and then handed it over to Brother Monkey, helping him cultivate his cultivation level to perfection.","After waiting for a few days, the Yin souls attacked again.","Ling Han arrived at the warship that he usually boarded. Then, he saw Liu Xing, Feng Xingwang, and Gu Taihua.","“Lord Ling!” When they saw Ling Han, they paid their respects.","Ling Han nodded and boarded the ship first. Liu Xing and the others hurriedly followed behind him, automatically positioning themselves as servants.","Today, the warship was still filled to the brim.","There were the “veterans” that had survived the last few battles, as well as the rookies that had just joined, and the rookies still did not know the cruelties of battle. They were discussing excitedly over there.","“Rookies, don’t be too excited. When we get to the battlefield, you will realize just how cruel that place is,” an elder said.","The rookies were naturally unconvinced. They were hot-blooded, young, and full of confidence.","However, after hearing the seniors talk about the specific process of the few battles, these rookies were all moved. Some of them even revealed looks of fear.","After a few battles, out of four full ships of people, now, there were actually only fifty people left of the initial number.","Just how cruel was this?","“However, if you guys can learn the true essence of a certain person, to say nothing of surviving three battles, even three hundred or three thousand battles wouldn’t be a problem,” a veteran suddenly said slowly.","“What?” The rookies were all curious.","The veteran from before pointed at Ling Han, “There, this is the one.”","“Hahahaha!” All the veterans laughed loudly.","This was naturally a sarcastic remark. It was a mockery of Ling Han’s escape every time.","Liu Xing and the others were enraged. He actually dared to slander their Lord!","However, seeing Ling Han remain calm and collected, they forcefully suppressed their anger.","The rookies didn’t know, and a few of them were even asking Ling Han for guidance out of curiosity.","They had all come to obtain benefits and battle merits, so who would want to die?","Ling Han hadn’t even spoken yet, when a few veterans couldn’t help but laugh loudly, revealing the “truth”.","This instantly made the rookies feel ashamed.","F***, so he was a deserter. No wonder it was said that he could survive three hundred battles, or even three thousand battles.","The funny thing was that the level of people on this ship was too low, so there was not a single person that had Galaxy Network’s connection device. Otherwise, with Ling Han’s current level of popularity, there would definitely be people that would recognize him.","—That was suspected to be a Venerate, and you guys actually dare to mock him; are you tired of living?","Liu Xing finally couldn’t bear it any longer. He slammed a hand on the table and stood up. “All of you, shut up!”","“Hahaha!” The rookies were still laughing loudly. They didn’t recognize Liu Xing, so they were naturally unafraid.","However, a great many seniors recognized Liu Xing and the others, and they all shut their mouths.","These three people were not to be trifled with. All of them were in the Ultimate Dao Foundation.","“Try and laugh again!” Seeing that Ling Han didn’t object, Feng Xingwang and Gu Taihua both stood up and shouted at the rookies.","“We’re laughing, so what does it have to do with you guys?” A rookie was stubborn.","“Shh, they’re not to be trifled with!” A veteran kindly introduced Liu Xing and the others.","These three guys specialized in picking Foundation Building Tier cultivators to rob, yet nothing happened all this while. This was proof of strength.","After hearing about Liu Xing and the others’ “great achievements”, the rookies all cowered.","Perhaps there were some among them whose abilities were not inferior, but it was better to have less trouble, so what was the point of attracting trouble?","However, no one understood why Liu Xing and the others would stand up for Ling Han.","Could it be that this was their new underling?","However, what was the point of taking in such a deserter?","They did not speak on the way, and everyone was very silent.","It wasn’t long before the warship arrived at its designated location.","But right at this moment, something happened.","“Not good, a great yin soul is approaching us!”","“Fire! Fire!”","The terrified voices of the sailors were suddenly heard. Everyone rushed onto the deck, and what they saw caused their expressions to change.","There was a Yin soul that was as tall as three hundred meters charging towards them, and on the way, there was also a warship that had already been destroyed. It floated in space, corpses and wreckage everywhere, a ghastly sight.","“This is... Sect Master-level Yin soul!”","“Heavens, how did such a great monster get here?”","“We’re done for, we’re done for!”","Everyone’s expressions were ashen. It was said that Yin souls did not have strong battle prowess, but that was only relative.","If a Sect Master made a move, they would definitely be annihilated in an instant.","The warship that had been destroyed in the distance was clear proof of this. It must have been the doing of that great yin soul.","A great many rookies were crying. This was really dying before they had even gained any benefits.","Only Liu Xing and the others were slightly calmer. They all looked at Ling Han. This guy had earned more than 20 million battle merits, and who knows, he may be able to deal with a Sect Master-level Yin soul.","Ling Han was also a little surprised. Under the layers of defense, there were actually still some that slipped through the net?","In an instant, that great yin soul had already charged over, and shot out a punch.","They were done for!","Everyone closed their eyes. The Sect Master-level aura surged. This was a fatal blow.","Peng, there was a loud bang, but they didn’t feel the arrival of doomsday,?","They all opened their eyes, and then saw a scene that caused their scalps to go numb.","—This great yin soul had already been blasted into pieces, and there was presently a person that was slowly withdrawing his fist.","Ling Han!","Heavens!","At this moment, everyone didn’t know whether they should be excited, grateful, ashamed, or something else. They were all dumbfounded, and didn’t know how to react at all.","“You guys just wander around nearby,” Ling Han said to Liu Xing and the others.","“Yes, Lord Ling!” Seeing Ling Han move with their own eyes, Liu Xingxing and the others naturally worshipped Ling Han to the core. When they agreed, even their backs were straight.","When everyone saw this, they were all filled with extreme regret."]},{"number":4536,"title":"Chapter 4536: Crazy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4536: Crazy","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han leaped out of the warship and used the Imminent Skyline, which was extremely fast.","He was willing to give Liu Xing and the others a chance. That was because he hoped that everyone could do their best in the matter of fighting against the Yin souls.","Though the power of a mere few people was limited, if everyone in the world was willing to step out, so what need was there to worry about Yin souls being indestructible?","As usual, he charged into the innermost depths, and began to reap kills.","His abilities had advanced to another level, and even if there was no qualitative change, Ling Han’s battle prowess had still increased considerably. Killing Yin souls was even easier for him.","This was mainly because he had previously been stuck at the peak stage of Six Stars and didn’t break through. Thus, the rewards from heaven and earth had become a boost to his soul and physique. This was also a huge benefit.","...","For example, stimulating Regulations and high-level energy required Spiritual Power.","The stronger the Spiritual Power, the faster the Regulations would be stimulated, and the more high-level energy there would be, and the more destructive power it would have on Yin souls.","Ling Han had no qualms. The Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was used, and he shuttled through the Yin souls. His fiery wings fluttered with Destructive Energy, and Yin souls would die at the slightest touch. There was absolutely no doubt about it.","If a Saint didn’t appear, he was unstoppable.","So what if it was a Venerate Tier? They wouldn’t be able to catch up to him at all, and it was possible that he would counterattack and take advantage of the opening to kill them instead.","To say nothing of the fact that Ling Han had resolved the battle single-handedly, at least under the premise that the Yin Saint did not appear, he had really dealt with a great number of Sect Master-level Yin souls, and held back one third of the Venerate-level Yin souls.","It would not be an exaggeration to say that this kind of merit was great.","Unfortunately, no one knew.","Ling Han didn’t mind. He didn’t do this to make his name resound throughout the world, but rather because the invasion of the Yin souls would affect everyone, and he was duty-bound to do so.","His deeds, whether good or bad, would be left for future generations to judge. At present, he only wanted to live on, and live well.","This battle lasted for more than half a month.","With a large number of rewards from heaven and earth, Ling Han’s cultivation level had already reached the middle stage of Seven Stars. At this rate, Eight Stars was already not far away.","He returned to the warship. At this moment, everyone was looking at him with reverence.","This was an awesome character that could kill Sect Masters with a single strike.","Who would dare disrespect such an elite?","The hierarchy of cultivation was cast in iron.","Ling Han didn’t say anything. He simply walked to a corner and sat down, closing his eyes to rest.","Meanwhile, Liu Xing and the others stood behind Ling Han. They stood proudly, as if they were guarding their king.","No one would be ashamed of their moves to court favor. On the contrary, everyone was incredibly envious.","Being able to follow by the side of such an elite was a good thing that could not be obtained even if one begged.","In the future, as long as they talked about today’s battle, they would naturally have a share of glory as they had once followed behind a certain someone.","Ji Wuming!","Though he was nameless, it was destined that his name would spread throughout the world.","The warship returned, and the legend about Ji Wuming began to spread like crazy. This made Ji Wuming, who had just arrived, feel very stifled.","If it was another person, they would probably be very happy, being able to bask in the glory.","But with how proud Ji Wuming was, how could he possibly take advantage of this kind of situation?","It must be Ling Han!","With Wuming as his name, there were pitifully few of them, and added with the fact that his surname was Ji, and his strength was so heaven-defying that if it was not Ling Han, who else could it be?","After Ling Han disembarked from the warship, someone immediately approached him.","Golden Generation, Xu Jianshan.","“Brother Ji, I have long heard of you,” Xu Jianshan was very polite, and clasped his hands in greeting towards Ling Han.","‘What have you heard about me for a long time? Even my name and appearance are fake.’","Ling Han cracked a smile, “I am very famous now, am I not?”","Xu Jianshan couldn’t help but be taken aback. You are indeed very famous now, but there is no need for you to say it yourself, right?","He was a little embarrassed, but still nodded, and said, “Brother Ji’s name is indeed world-renowned now.”","“Then wouldn’t it be an honor for you to meet a celebrity like me? Is your heart thumping wildly?” Ling Han asked again.","Xu Jianshan was instantly confused.","I am an Imperial Son, and a Golden Generation at that. When my name was known all over the world, who knew which corner you were playing with mud in.","What honor would I have?","Why was this person so shameless? He took his words at face value, and was acting narcissistic now?","Xu Jianshan decided that he could no longer follow Ling Han’s train of thought. Otherwise, he would be led astray by Ling Han.","He didn’t continue the topic, and said, “Brother Ji, have you heard of Ling Han?”","‘Here it comes!’","Ling Han knew that even though he had disguised himself very well, there would definitely be members of the Imperial Clans who would suspect that he was Ling Han. Thankfully, he had only dealt with Pei Guangchen, and the latter could not compare to these Imperial Sons of the present generation.","Thus, only a few Imperial Clans were suspicious.","Ling Han nodded, “Of course I’ve heard. This person has also thrashed the Imperial Sons before, and it can be said that he is on the same level as me. We are both exceptional heroes.”","F***, was there any way to praise oneself like this?","Xu Jianshan’s expression was ugly. After being stunned for a moment, he asked, “Where has Brother Ji come from?”","“Source Sea Planet, Eight Clouds Mountains,” Ling Han said, then smiled, “Are you investigating my background?”","“Hehe, the White Feather Clan hopes very much to be joined by Brother Ji. Would Brother Ji be interested?” Xu Jianshan extended an invitation to Ling Han.","Ling Han pondered for a moment.","Xu Jianshan only thought that Ling Han was considering, and did not rush him. He merely waited quietly.","The Xu Clan had only become suspicious of Ling Han, so they had placed Ling Han under their surveillance. If this person was really Ling Han, he would definitely give himself away.","After a while, Ling Han finally opened his mouth and said, “Do you feel honored? Do you feel like your heart is thumping?”","Xu Jianshan faltered upon hearing this, and the corners of his mouth involuntarily twitched.","He had only thought that Ling Han was considering whether he should join the Xu Clan or not. He had not thought that Ling Han’s thoughts were so incredibly strange, that he was actually considering the question that had been asked to him previously.","“Brother Ji, isn’t it a little inappropriate for you to pretend to be stupid like this?” he asked in displeasure.","“Yi, it was you who didn’t answer my question first, so why are you saying that I’m inappropriate?” Ling Han countered.","Xu Jianshan was instantly rendered speechless. That was indeed the case.","After being taken aback for a moment, he finally said, “Brother Ji’s great name does indeed make me feel slightly honored.”","“Is your heart—”","“Brother Ji!”","Seeing that Ling Han was still entangled in this problem, Xu Jianshan couldn’t help but call out loudly, feeling an indescribable madness.","Why did he feel a great desire to hit someone?","“Oh.” Ling Han shook his head, his expression filled with disappointment. “So you’re not excited at all. Sigh, this really makes me sad.”","Don’t make it sound so misleading!","Xu Jianshan clenched his fists tightly. He really wanted to give this guy a beating first.","However, the Imperial Clans had already reached a consensus. Due to the huge commotion caused by the previous incident, nothing could happen to Ling Han. From a certain aspect, he was even a banner that stabilized the morale of the army.","Thus, Xu Jianshan could only tolerate it.","“Not interested,” Ling Han said again.","Xu Jianshan was at a loss. What was he uninterested in?","Then, realization dawned on him. Ling Han had said that he was not interested, because he did not intend to join the Xu Clan.","‘So, you were joking with me just then, weren’t you?’","“Brother Ji, are you not going to consider for a little longer?” His words were very polite, but his tone had become cold and menacing.","The Imperial Clans have never accepted “no”; no one would dare!","Meanwhile, Ling Han’s expression was filled with curiosity, and he continued to ask, “You really don’t feel like your heart is beating wildly?”","‘Holy f*ck!’","Xu Jianshan was about to go crazy."]},{"number":4537,"title":"Chapter 4537: Stray shots have no eyes","paragraphs":["Chapter 4537: Stray shots have no eyes","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xu Jianshan looked coldly at Ling Han, killing intent flickering in his eyes.","‘Are you toying with me, a dignified Golden Generation, like a monkey?’","“Brother Ji, do you know how most people die?” He quickly suppressed his anger, and asked Ling Han calmly.","“Died of stupidity?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“No, he couldn’t control his mouth, and died due to his own vulgarity,” Xu Jianshan said balefully.","Ling Han nodded, “Then you must control your mouth. At such a young age, don’t risk your life.”","...","This!","Xu Jianshan couldn’t help the veins on his neck popping. F*ck, that was an insult to you, all right?","How could Ling Han be so stupid that he couldn’t even tell?","Impossible, he could cultivate to the level of Sect Master, and even Venerate Tier, so how could he be such an idiot?","Thus, the other party was still teasing him.","Xu Jianshan suppressed the urge to forcefully make a move. Nothing could happen to Ling Han now. Countless pairs of eyes were watching. To say nothing of the fact that the Imperial Clans could not make a move, even if someone wanted to make a move on Ling Han, they would have to turn around to protect him.","Why?","Because once something happened to Ling Han, everyone would think that it was the doing of the Imperial Clans. Then, the hearts and morale that had been painstakingly gathered would disperse.","“Brother Ji, you have to know that in a battle with Yin souls, the slightest mistake could result in death.” Xu Jianshan said slowly, “Furthermore, stray attacks have no eyes on the battlefield. If they hit Brother Ji, hoho, that would not be good.”","This was a blatant threat. Though he did not say a single word, his meaning was very clear. If you do not concede or cooperate, then when you go to the battlefield one day to fight a bloody battle with Yin souls, you may be “accidentally wounded” by your own people and die.","Ling Han looked coldly at Xu Jianshan. He definitely would not accept threats!","So what if they were Imperial Clans? How many Imperial Sons had he killed?","“Hehe, then you have to be careful as well. Stray shots have no eyes, and it is possible that anyone could be hit.” Ling Han smiled.","It was clear that they could no longer continue this conversation.","With a cold wave of his sleeve, Xu Jianshan strode off.","Ling Han didn’t stop him. Since the other party threatened to find a chance to kill him on the battlefield, he would return the favor.","Did he think that he wouldn’t kill him?","Time passed quietly, and another ten days later, the Yin soul army made a comeback.","Ling Han boarded the warship, but the moment he boarded, he discovered that the atmosphere was a little strange.","With a sweep of his gaze, he immediately discovered the reason.","—Xu Jianshan. He was shockingly here as well.","This was the Imperial Son of the Golden Generation, and his cultivation level was at Sect Master-level. Thus, who wouldn’t be stunned by his appearance here?","Ling Han turned his gaze to the four elders behind Xu Jianshan.","These four people were expressionless, their expressions cold, as if they were carved from wood. However, Ling Han could tell from the vague aura exuding from them that these four old men were all Sect Master-level, and it was very possible that they were all Nine Stars.","Ha, this was too arrogant, wasn’t it? To publicly use five elites to besiege and kill him?","However, these people had absolutely no idea that his present battle prowess was enough to sweep aside all opposition at the level of Sect Master. To say nothing of five Sect Masters, even if there were fifty or five hundred of them, they would still be completely annihilated in front of him.","Xu Jianshan naturally saw him as well, and said calmly, “Brother Ji, you can still reconsider.”","Ling Han didn’t say anything. He simply cracked a smile, and killing intent appeared in his eyes.","Xu Jianshan shook his head, “Too bad!”","Ling Han had caused the Imperial Clans to suffer such a great humiliation. His only fate would definitely be death, but they could not publicly persecute him. Thus, if Ling Han were to die on the battlefield, they would be able to draw a clear dividing line between the Imperial Clans and his death, and at the same time, boost their morale. It could be claimed to be the best of both worlds.","Since Ling Han didn’t agree to join the Xu Clan, there was nothing more to say.","‘Die.’","The atmosphere on the ship was extremely tense. The Imperial Son had arrived, and though he did not say anything, even if this kind of existence was just standing there, it would still exert a great pressure on others.","Finally, after sailing for a while, they had arrived at the edge of the battlefield.","“Charge!”","Everyone rushed out and joined the battle.","Ling Han turned around to take a look. Xu Jianshan and the four elders were both standing there without moving.","“Brother Ji, please,” Xu Jianshan said very politely. “The Imperial Clans owe you a favor, so the five of us will protect Brother Ji from the Yin souls.”","Tsk.","Ling Han didn’t pay any heed to this. He strode forward.","Xu Jianshan immediately followed, and behind him, four elders followed like shadows.","It wasn’t long before Ling Han arrived at the Sect Master-level battlefield. However, he didn’t stop, and he continued to advance.","This caused Xu Jianshan and the others to be stunned.","Yi, why haven’t you stopped yet?","If they continued onwards, that would be the battlefield for Venerate Tier-level. Even if they went forwards, and were accidentally hit by stray attacks, they could still possibly be severely wounded.","That’s right.","Realization immediately dawned on them. Ling Han must have been afraid of being ganged up on by them, so he took the risk, wanting to use this kind of method to make them retreat in the face of difficulties.","“Chase!” Xu Jianshan only hesitated for a moment, then immediately waved his hand.","As long as they were careful, they would definitely be fine.","The five of them advanced cautiously. Waves of Venerate Tier-level fluctuations of power would occasionally spread over, making them feel on edge.","Dangerous, too dangerous.","Meanwhile, Ling Han was extremely relaxed. He had already walked this path many times. Furthermore, with his strength, even if he was really swept by a Venerate Tier-level shockwave, he was completely capable of dispersing it.","After a while, he walked out of this area.","Behind him, Xu Jianshan and the others all breathed a long sigh of relief, feeling that their backs were wet. As it turned out, unknowingly, they had broken out in a great amount of cold sweat.","But after an instant, they became nervous again.","Because this place was too deep into the territory of Yin souls, there were a great many Venerate Tier and Sect Master-level Yin souls. Staying here for even a second was extremely dangerous.","However, Ling Han didn’t give them any time to hesitate as he strode forward.","Damn it!","“Give chase! We definitely can’t let him return alive!” Xu Jianshan said through gritted teeth.","Killing Ling Han was a mission that had been assigned to the Xu Clan. As a member of the Imperial Clan, how humiliating would it be if he couldn’t even kill a minor character?","Moreover, wasn’t Ling Han in front? If there was a powerful Yin soul, he would be the first to encounter it.","Once they confirmed Ling Han’s death, they could immediately turn around and flee.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Yin souls barraged him, Ling Han was already brandishing his fists in battle, and the speed of his advance immediately slowed.","“Catch up to him and end the battle as soon as possible,” Xu Jianshan said.","He could no longer delay, or it was really possible that he would be in danger.","The four old men all nodded. The five of them sped up, and set off in rapid pursuit of Ling Han.","At this moment, Ling Han didn’t advance any further. Instead, he turned around and looked coldly at Xu Jianshan and the others.","“I have to say, your courage is truly amazing. In order to throw us off your tail, you actually dared to come here,” Xu Jianshan stated calmly. At the same time, the four elders had already dispersed, surrounding Ling Han.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Why can’t it be that I wanted to kill you guys, so I deliberately led you guys here?”"]},{"number":4538,"title":"Chapter 4538: Counterattack","paragraphs":["Chapter 4538: Counterattack","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xu Jianshan faltered for a moment before roaring with laughter.","He shook his head, “Who do you think you are?”","Are you a Venerate?","If you weren’t a Venerate, what right do you have to be so arrogant?","There were five of them, and all of them were Nine Star Sect Masters. Furthermore, he was a Golden Generation. It could be said that with him as the leader, and the support of the four great Sect Masters, this kind of battle prowess would definitely surpass Sect Master-level. If he was alone, who could compare to him?","Ling Han led them into a trap?","...","What a joke. Even if a sheep led a lion into a trap, how could it be a match for a lion?","“Die!” he shouted loudly, and charged towards Ling Han.","He was afraid that something would happen if he stayed too long. After all, there were too many Yin souls here.","The four old Sect Masters naturally wouldn’t hesitate either. They immediately followed after him.","“As a dignified Golden Generation, do you still need to bully me with numbers?” Ling Han said with a smile as he retreated backward.","“Humph, who would have the time to waste on you?” Xu Jianshan smirked coldly, not falling for Ling Han’s provocation.","However, with Ling Han’s retreat, countless Yin souls instantly enveloped them, causing Xu Jianshan and the others to be heavily surrounded. Of course, Ling Han was the same. The number of Yin souls he faced was even more.","“Scram!” Xu Jianshan shouted loudly. He shot out punch after punch, and brilliance shot into the skies, lighting up this dark universe.","As expected of the Golden Generation. He used Regulations, and not a single Yin soul could withstand a single blow from him.","If Venerates didn’t appear, who could rival him?","He continued to charge forward, rapidly closing the distance between him and Ling Han.","“You want to use the Yin souls to impede us? Hehe, I have to say, you are very bold. However, in front of absolute strength, what meaning is there to it?”","Yin souls, could they stop him?","This was absolutely impossible!","On the other side, though the abilities of the four old Sect Masters were slightly inferior, they were still members of the Imperial Clan, after all. Their battle prowess far surpassed the average nine-star Sect Master, and they similarly charged over, continuing to maintain the position of encircling the two of them.","They gradually shrunk the encirclement, and watched as Ling Han was like a turtle in a jar.","“Ji Wuming, do you regret it now?” Xu Jianshan asked balefully.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “My name is not Ji Wuming.”","Xu Jianshan could also guess. After all, his name was Wuming. This was too deliberate.","“No matter who you are, you will not be able to escape death today!” He charged over, and delivered a palm strike straight at Ling Han’s face. Sixteen streaks of Regulations turned into sharp blades, interwoven with high-level energy, wanting to slice Ling Han in half with a single strike.","At the same time, the four old Sect Masters also launched fierce attacks, preventing Ling Han from breaking through from any angle.","However, did Ling Han want to break out of the siege?","He raised his fist, and in an instant, shot out four consecutive punches, heading towards the four old Sect Masters respectively.","Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng!","With every punch, an old Sect Master would explode, turning into a rain of blood that filled the skies. Huge amounts of energy exploded, annihilating the Yin souls in the surroundings.","‘F*ck!’","Xu Jianshan’s attack came to an abrupt stop, his eyes filled with terror. In fact, even his body was trembling slightly.","The four old Sect Masters had actually been obliterated with a single punch?","How was this possible!","He could barely believe his eyes. This was too much of a shock to his tolerance level.","If he moved, he would indeed be able to defeat those four old Sect Masters, but it was definitely not something that could be done in a single move, and it was even more impossible that he could insta-kill them.","Hiss, what kind of colossal gap in strength was this?","“You, who exactly are you?” If it was not for the fact that a Venerate had confirmed that Ling Han was Sect Master-level, he would have suspected that the latter was a Venerate.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “I thought you didn’t care?”","Xu Jianshan gritted his teeth, “With how strong you are, you are definitely not some nameless character!”","“See, see, see. Just now, I wanted to reveal my identity, yet you refused to know. Now, you’re asking me again. Tell me, aren’t you despicable?” Ling Han asked.","A thought flashed through Xu Jianshan’s mind, and he blurted out, “You are Ling Han!”","Putting aside abilities, there should be no one other than Ling Han who had such a toxic tongue.","Ling Han’s expression was filled with disappointment. Why was it so easy to guess his identity?","“Does this count as my character crumbling?” he murmured. Er, if it was only Xu Jianshan, then he would just kill him to keep the secret. He could still use Ji Wuming’s identity to continue killing Yin souls and earn battle merits.","“Ling Han, you are really outrageously bold!” Xu Jianshan said balefully, “The whole universe is looking for you, yet you are strutting around, and actually came all the way here on your own.”","Ling Han wagged his finger, and while he was at it, threw out a punch, destroying a great number of Yin souls that were attacking him, “Wrong, wrong, wrong. The only people who cannot tolerate me are only Imperial Clans like you all. You all... cannot represent the people of this world!”","Xu Jianshan also casually waved his hand, destroying a large number of Yin souls. His eyes flickered.","If they fought, he was definitely no match for Ling Han. Thus, he definitely couldn’t face him head-on.","However, in terms of speed, Ling Han had grasped Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and in a situation when their cultivation level was equal, how could he compete with the world’s number one movement technique in speed?","Moreover, the environment here was already half-Netherworld. He couldn’t contact the elites of his clan, so it was impossible for him to call for reinforcements.","Thus, he had to run back, running until he could send out a signal.","Once a Venerate arrived, it would be Ling Han’s turn to flee for his life.","He no longer hesitated, and immediately turned around, his heart filled with humiliation.","He was a Golden Generation, synonymous with being invincible among his peers. Only he could look down on others. When had he ever fled in such a panic?","However, a figure flashed, and another person appeared in front of him. Flames danced wildly, exuding a soaring fighting spirit and killing intent.","Ling Han.","Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, the world’s fastest speed.","Xu Jianshan humphed lightly, and hurriedly launched an attack at Ling Han.","He knew how difficult it was to escape this time, so he was also mentally prepared for a bloody battle. If necessary, he would not hesitate to pay a certain price.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and also threw a punch, blasting towards Xu Jianshan.","This punch was too fast.","Peng!","Xu Jianshan was instantly sent flying, and countless Yin souls took advantage of the opening to pounce over, wanting to snatch his physical body.","“Scram!” Xu Jianshan roared loudly. His whole body exuded a blazing Sword Ray, which instantly destroyed all the Yin souls that had pounced towards him.","Pu!","However, he was still throwing up blood madly, appearing very miserable.","It was mainly because Ling Han’s punch was too domineering, directly wounding his organs. This had already caused him great injury, and he still had to forcefully endure his injuries before launching another attack, which naturally caused his injuries to worsen.","Thankfully, he was a Golden Generation, and his physique was extremely tough. Otherwise, he would be ten times worse off now.","Without another word, Xu Jianshan immediately began to run again.","With a flash, a person appeared again in front of him.","Naturally, it was still Ling Han.","“Still running?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","Xu Jianshan gritted his teeth, his gaze slightly panicked.","He knew that Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was fast, but before personally experiencing it, he had not thought that it would be so fast to such an astonishing extent.","This was practically enough to make one lose all hope.","“Ling Han!” he said heavily, yet did not know what else to say.","Beg for mercy?","That was impossible. He had come to kill Ling Han, and hoped that Ling Han would repay evil with kindness? Didn’t he know that this guy would not blink an eye at killing Imperial Sons?","He didn’t want to die at all, but what should he do?"]},{"number":4539,"title":"Chapter 4539: Saintly Bone","paragraphs":["Chapter 4539: Saintly Bone","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Do you regret it?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Humph, do you want me to beg for mercy?” Xu Jianshan smirked coldly, “Impossible. There are no cowards in the Imperial Clans!”","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “No need to be stubborn. Your eyes have already betrayed you.”","Xu Jianshan shouted loudly, and once again began to flee.","As long as he could flee to a place where there was a signal, he would be able to contact his family, and it would only take an instant for Venerates to rush over to help.","Thus, he definitely couldn’t give up. As long as he didn’t die, there was still hope.","...","But in front of Ling Han, no matter how much he struggled, it was all in vain.","Every time he broke out of the siege, Ling Han would always appear in front of him at the first instant. He would throw a punch, and send him backwards.","He charged dozens of times, yet shockingly discovered that he was actually just circling around in the same spot.","This!","At this moment, he finally lost all hope.","The gap in strength was too wide, and his speed was completely inferior. How could he escape?","Xu Jianshan roared in fury. Boom! Imperial Blood surged.","He was really going all out. Even if he had to die, he was going to die a vigorous death.","Ling Han nodded, and said, “Seeing as you’re so prepared, I’ll give you a quick death.”","Boom, he threw a punch, and Destructive Energy surged.","Without a doubt, Xu Jianshan was instantly sent flying, but to Ling Han’s surprise, Xu Jianshan didn’t turn into a shower of blood.","It was not that Ling Han was violent, but rather that the force of his punch was really too overbearing, and it was very difficult for him to reserve power.","But look at Xu Jianshan. Though his whole body was gushing with blood, he surprisingly did not die.","This was very shocking.","Under the influence of Destructive Energy, even Substitution Seal was ineffective. Moreover, Ling Han’s battle prowess was far above Xu Jianshan’s, so why hadn’t he died?","Yi?","Ling Han looked at Xu Jianshan’s chest. It was completely mangled, revealing his bones, but his 24 ribs were all exuding a faint silvery light, exuding an indescribable majesty.","“Saintly bones!” Realization dawned on him.","No wonder Xu Jianshan had not been killed by him. As it turned out, his bones had reached Saint Tier!","No, it was not that his bones had reached Saint-level, but rather that he possessed a sliver of Saint-level genes. However, because Saint-level was really too powerful, even a tiny bit was enough to save Xu Jianshan’s life.","When one reached the level of Venerate Tier, the Substitution Seal would be ineffective. Thus, the Imperial Clans had used other methods to strengthen their protection of the Imperial Son.","—Previously, he had not used it, because what person in this world would be so outrageously bold as to dare make a move on the Imperial Son?","Now that the Imperial Sons had died one after another, the Imperial Clans no longer dared to have any thoughts of getting lucky, and fully armed the Imperial Sons.","Xu Jianshan himself was also slightly surprised. He had not thought that he would actually survive this punch.","As it turned out, the trump card that the clan had laid out for him was actually so awesome!","Why hadn’t he been told earlier?","True, if he had been told earlier, he would have had a way out, and would not have the determination to die in battle.","And now, after a life-and-death struggle, Xu Jianshan could actually vaguely see his own path of cultivation.","All this while, the journey of the Imperial Sons had been too smooth-sailing. Their natural talent was astonishingly high, and their background was also frightening, so no one dared to trifle with rhem. There was also a good thing like the Substitution Seal, so there was absolutely no need for them to worry about any life-threatening danger.","But in truth, death was also an experience. Without experiencing the spiritual test of a moment of life and death, how could one possibly develop an indestructible willpower, and how could one possibly walk on his own path of cultivation?","Thus, even though it was only for an instant, Xu Jianshan could vaguely see a completely new path.","This was his path of martial arts, and it may not be possible to walk it, but there was still a path to walk after all.","He could feel that the barrier to his cultivation level had loosened, and breaking through to the Fourth Extreme was close at hand.","“Hahaha!” He couldn’t help but laugh loudly. This was really a double blessing. Not only had he glimpsed the path of cultivation, he had also pushed aside the barrier to break through.","“Ling Han, I really have to thank you!” he said, but his tone was incredibly baleful.","After advancing into Venerate Tier, the first thing he had to do was kill Ling Han.","“Hehe, you had best give up!” Ling Han shook his head, and continued to attack.","He had only glimpsed a sliver of hope for a breakthrough, but he was still a million miles away from a true breakthrough. Even if he was to go into seclusion now, he wouldn’t be able to achieve it without at least a year and a half.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The Destructive Energy bombarded Xu Jianshan repeatedly, causing the flesh and blood on his body to fall off layer by layer.","Ling Han saw that Xu Jianshan’s backbone was like a great dragon, thick and sturdy.","Looking closely, this backbone was actually formed from the overlapping of two bones.","Realization dawned on him, “So you have implanted a Saint-level backbone! Hehe, what great power!”","The bones of Saints were naturally made of Saintly Material. In that case, how could Xu Jianshan’s bones not be tough when he implanted the Saintly bones into his body and slowly absorbed the Saintly Particles within them to strengthen his own bones?","This was easy to say, but in actual practice, it was incredibly difficult.","That was because if it had the word ‘Saint’ in its name, it was too powerful.","If a Sect Master ate the Saintly medicine, not only would he not get any benefits, it was even more likely that he would burst from the overwhelming power.","It was the same for Saint Bones.","If it was implanted into one’s body, the saintly might would be activated, and the latter would only die immediately.","Unless... this Saintly bone had the same bloodline as the one that it had been implanted in. Then, through fusing the bloodline together, there was indeed a chance that the Saintly bone would hibernate, and one could slowly absorb the Saintly Particles.","In other words, these Saintly bones could only come from elites of the clan.","Just this fact alone was enough to eliminate how many forces?","More importantly, the backbone was a great dragon in the human body. It supported the main trunk of the body, and possessed an incredibly important position. Even if Saints could regrow their severed limbs, how many years would it take for them to recover after plucking out this great dragon in the human body?","Thus, what Saint would be willing to hand over their spine?","Even if it was the Imperial Clan, they could only use it on the Golden Generation. After all, this price was too great, too great.","“Ling Han, you can’t kill me! And once I break through to Venerate Tier, it will be the time of your death!” Xu Jianshan declared coldly.","Ling Han shook his head, “I forgot to tell you. I was the one who killed Lin Xuan.”","What!","Xu Jianshan was instantly shocked. Lin Xuan’s cultivation level was Venerate Tier-level, and the height of his natural talent could be ranked in the top three even among Golden Generations.","He had actually been killed by Ling Han?","However, after a moment of distraction, Xu Jianshan regained his composure, and exclaimed, “I don’t believe it!”","“What does it have to do with me whether you believe it or not?” Ling Han said with a smile. He brandished his fists and charged forward, saying, “I’m simply telling you a fact.”","Under the heavy punches, Xu Lianshan retreated continuously.","His body had already absorbed a portion of the Saint-level particles, so his bones were incredibly sturdy. Even Ling Han was unable to break through them. However, the Destructive Energy was not to be trifled with either. It still managed to cause great damage to Xu Jianshan through his bones.","Originally, this would have been resolved with a single punch, but now? It had become a blunt blade that was slowly damaging him.","At this rate, Xu Jianshan would still be unable to escape death, but before he died, he could hold on for a period of time, and in this period of time, he would be tortured even more.","And it just so happened that he himself was the one who had caused it."]},{"number":4540,"title":"Chapter 4540: Nine Star Sect Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 4540: Nine Star Sect Master","Editor: Henyee Translations","The more Xu Jianshan fought, the more flustered he became. His injuries were becoming more and more severe, and had already reached a point where it was difficult for him to recover.","The reason why he was still persisting was because he was really too defiant.","The pride of the Imperial Son and the pride of the Golden Generation made him grit his teeth and persist, determined to fight to the last moment.","Thus, he had also suffered greatly. He was beaten up for a whole half an hour, and only then was he slowly worn to death.","When he died, he didn’t even look human anymore.","Ling Han was speechless. He indeed didn’t want to torture Xu Jianshan, but who asked him to be too difficult to kill?","...","“These people from the Imperial Clans really have a lot of tricks up their sleeve.”","Ling Han felt rueful. Seven great stars had been refined into Di Wuji’s body, and once they exploded, his power would directly soar to three stars, or even five stars Venerate Tier-level, and in Xu Jianshan’s case, Saintly bones had been implanted into his body.","The example of Di Wuji might be more special, because it was very possible that this kind of technique was the doing of a Great Emperor, but there was no Great Emperor in this world now, so this kind of technique could not be replicated.","But something like Xu Jianshan should not be rare.","In other words, it would be extremely difficult to kill those Imperial Sons in the future.","“Sigh!” Ling Han shook his head. Unless he could advance into Saint Tier, this would definitely have some effect on him.","“Why are you always causing trouble for me?”","Ling Han studied Xu Jianshan’s corpse for a while. He had a feeling that there was a vague terrifying fluctuation in that Saintly bone inside Xu Jianshan’s body.","“Strange, I seem to have sensed this kind of fluctuation somewhere.”","“Oh, that’s right!”","Ling Han took out the broken sword. Occasionally, there would be an obscure fluctuation emanating from within, which was exactly the same as the Saintly bones.","“It’s not as simple as the aura of a Saint.”","“As for the details, I still have to ask the old man.”","Ling Han wanted to take away Xu Jianshan’s Saintly bones, but discovered that he could not.","This Saintly bone was like a sharp Divine Sword. If he touched it, the only result would be that he would be riddled with wounds.","This was not the Saintly medicine. Though the grade of the Saintly medicine was high, it did not have any destructive power, but this was different. It was showing off its full strength.","Sigh!","Ling Han sighed, unable to take it away.","So be it if he couldn’t retrieve it. In any case, he didn’t like bloody bones either.","Ling Han shook his head, and continued to battle with the Yin souls.","Right until the Yin soul army retreated, did he return to the warship.","Seeing that only Ling Han had returned, everyone was incredibly stunned.","Where was the Imperial Son?","Could it be...","None of them dared to think further. That was really too terrifying.","But did Ling Han really dare?","They did not know, and did not want to know either. The waters here were really too deep. Even if they knew just the slightest bit, it would bring a fatal calamity to them.","The warship safely returned to the Purple Gauze Planet. At present, it was still very calm. However, very soon, the matter of Xu Jianshan’s disappearance would spread out, and then his death would be discovered. Naturally, the culprit would have to be found.","Ling Han was definitely the first suspect. Xu Jianshan and the others had gone to hunt him down, and now that he had returned, Xu Jianshan and the others had died. If they didn’t suspect Ling Han, who would they suspect?","“I really want to see just how shameless the Imperial Clans can be.”","At present, he was a flag that everyone was staring at. If he collapsed, everyone would guess that it was the doing of the Imperial Clans.","Thus, it was absolutely impossible for the Imperial Clans to make a move on him in public. No matter how much they suspected that he was the culprit who had killed Xu Jianshan, they could only investigate in secret. They could either use the Yin souls to kill him, or create the illusion that he had been killed by the Yin souls.","As expected, the news of the deaths of Xu Jianshan and the others quickly spread out, but the Xu Clan was extraordinarily calm. In fact, they did not even send anyone over to question Ling Han, and acted as if nothing had happened.","Several days later, the Yin souls once again began their attack.","Ling Han still went to battle, reaping the rewards of heaven and earth, and while he was at it, after he had saved up 15 million merit points, he immediately went to redeem Eight Stars Celestial Qi.","His cultivation level was soaring madly.","He was at the middle stage of Seven Stars, at the late stage, then at the peak stage. Then, he began to break through.","Eight-star Sect Master!","In a short few months, he had soared from a six-star Sect Master to an eight-star Sect Master. Ling Han had to admit that though it was possible that the yin souls barraging the Living Realm would have extremely far-reaching effects, for the moment, he had really profited, and it was a great profit at that.","In terms of ability to kill Yin souls, no one was stronger than him. Even Venerates couldn’t compare.","—Even if they could be compared, how many rewards of heaven and earth would a Venerate need to take a step forward? It would definitely be 10 times or even 100 times more than him, right?","As the Yin souls continued to invade, Ling Han’s cultivation level continued to advance rapidly.","He broke through to the middle stage of Eight Stars, the late stage, and the peak stage.","Nine-star Sect Master!","Ling Han was very pleased. He had finally arrived at the end of the Minor Advanced Tier.","Now, he only had to kill a few more Yin souls, and advance his cultivation level to peak stage Nine Stars. Then, he would be able to break through to the Fourth Extreme and become a Venerate.","If he became a Venerate, what need would he have to fear everyone in the world?","So what if a Saint moved? If he was no match, he could completely flee.","He was filled with anticipation. He only had to advance another step further, and he would truly possess the preliminary qualifications to directly oppose the Imperial Clans.","Of course, if the Imperial Clans sent out Saints, or even the Imperial Weapon, he would definitely have no option but to flee. However, unlike now, there was no need for him to change his identity anymore. He could walk around the world with his original appearance.","Subsequently, he was extremely expectant of every battle, and was getting closer and closer to the Venerate Tier.","Nine Stars middle stage, late stage, peak stage!","That was enough.","Ling Han planned to immediately break through to Venerate Tier. If he became a Venerate, the efficiency of killing Yin souls would increase by who knew how many times.","However, he shockingly discovered that he... could not break through.","Why?","He hadn’t even begun, so how could he have concluded that it was impossible?","The reason was because of those chains on the fruit of cultivation.","If he wanted to become a Venerate, he would have to let the fruit of cultivation transform into the Fourth Extreme. However, the problem was that his fruit of cultivation was now tightly bound, so how could it transform into the Fourth Extreme?","Ling Han kept trying, wanting to break through these shackles.","However, he hadn’t been able to do so when he had been a One Star or Two Star Sect Master. Now that he was a Nine Star Sect Master... he couldn’t do so either.","These were the shackles that the heaven and earth had placed on him. As punishment for the Destructive Energy that he had cultivated to a complete state, they could not be broken at all!","Ling Han used his Spiritual Power to take human form, attempting to tear off one of the links. As long as he could tear off one, he would naturally be able to tear off the second, the third, and so on.","However, it was useless even if he exhausted his Spiritual Power.","It could not be severed!","He tried to use Destructive Energy. This thing could destroy everything, but the shackles were firmly embedded in his fruit of cultivation. Without waiting for the shackles to shatter, his fruit of cultivation would be destroyed first.","Without the fruit of cultivation, then what was the point of breaking through to Venerate Tier? His cultivation level would drop to Spiritual Transformation Tier.","After several attempts, Ling Han had no choice but to admit that he was really helpless against these chains.","Could it be that he would be stuck at the level of a nine-star Sect Master for the rest of his life?","True, he was definitely the strongest Sect Master in history, but what was the use?","Was he qualified to contest for the imperial throne?","There was no need for a Saint. Even if a One Star Venerate made a move, if he were to face them head-on, he would only be able to ensure his survival, at most.","No, there was always a way out. There would definitely be a way out!"]},{"number":4541,"title":"Chapter 4541: Trapped","paragraphs":["Chapter 4541: Trapped","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han sat quietly, a myriad of thoughts running through his mind.","He knew that the punishment of the Heavenly Dao would be a trap, but he had never imagined that it would be a trap to this extent.","Not allowing him to break through?","No, there was always a way out. Furthermore, Heavenly Dao had always been the fairest, and would definitely not set up a complete dead end.","Even if there was only a slim chance, or even an extremely slim chance, there would definitely be a sliver of hope for a way out.","After pondering for a day, Ling Han finally made a decision.","...","‘Since you won’t allow me to break through, I’ll continue to improve my cultivation!’","At first glance, this was very contradictory.","He was already stuck at the level of Nine Star Sect Master, so how was he supposed to improve his cultivation level?","That’s right. The fruit of cultivation was restricted, and could not evolve into the Fourth Extreme, but what if his Nine Stars cultivation level was raised to Ten Stars?","There was no need for him to evolve the fruit of cultivation, as he could skip over the difficult problem of being trapped by the black chains.","And with his present Spiritual Power, he could not tear open the chains. Then, when he advanced into Ten Stars, or even Eleven or Twelve Stars?","One day, his strength would reach the level of severing these shackles.","As for the problem of how to break through into Ten Stars when Nine Stars was already the peak stage of Sect Master-level, Ling Han temporarily did not consider the problem. He firmly believed that there would be a limit to break through whichever cultivation level he was at. How could it be that he could not break through to Ten Stars of Sect Master-level?","He definitely could.","“Alright, since I can’t break through to the Venerate Tier, I’ll aim for Ten Stars!”","Ling Han changed his mind, and attempted to break through to Ten Stars.","However, in terms of breaking through, it was actually more difficult to reach Ten Stars.","That was because there was no precedent for this at all. In fact, he did not even know if it would work.","What if Ling Han couldn’t reach such a height even if he was beaten to death? Then, if Ling Han forcefully attempted to break through, wouldn’t he be asking for trouble? In fact, wouldn’t he even cause himself to go mad?","However, the Fourth Extreme was locked to him, so was there any other way?","Ling Han was definitely unwilling to be stuck at the level of Sect Master for the rest of his life — even if there were actually not many people in this world whose strength was superior to him.","He wanted to become the strongest, and only then would he be able to sweep aside all opposition from the Imperial Clans.","Forgiving? Hehe.","He would avenge himself, and this was his true belief.","Ling Han cultivated in seclusion for seven days, yet he couldn’t make heads or tails of the situation.","“Continue to kill Yin souls.”","“My path walked out through battle, and it can only be perfected through battle.”","Ling Han entered into space and began to battle Yin souls.","Right now, the only thing that could exert pressure on him was a Venerate Tier-level great yin soul.","He had his eye on this kind of existence.","Just like before, he ventured deep into the territory of the Yin souls, and then began a massacre.","Very quickly, a Venerate Tier Yin soul charged over, and delivered a palm strike towards Ling Han.","“Good timing!” Ling Han shouted loudly, and charged forwards fearlessly.","Peng!","With a single strike, Ling Han was instantly sent flying.","So what if he was a Nine Stars Sect Master? In front of a Venerate, he was still no match, even if it was a weak Venerate like a Yin soul.","But so what? A Venerate Tier would crush a Sect Master, without any additional conditions.","Unless!","“I can break through to Ten Stars!”","Ling Han’s eyes were burning. At present, he could deliver 22 six-star Regulations with a single strike. Though he was still no match for Venerate Tier, he had a feeling that as long as there were a little more Regulations, he could completely compensate for the qualitative gap with quantity.","That was because he had tried. 22 flashes of Six Star Regulations were already capable of contending against a sliver of Seven Star Regulations, and when he accumulated enough power and shot out 25 flashes of Six Star Regulations, he would be able to defeat that sliver of Seven Star Regulations.","Thus, theoretically speaking, as long as he grasped enough Six Star Regulations, he would indeed be able to stand against Venerates, but this number... would be astonishingly great.","It might have to be thirty, forty, or even more.","Ling Han didn’t know how many six-star Regulations he could unleash with a single strike if he could break through to Ten Stars. However, no matter what, he had to continue on this path.","Fight, fight, fight!","Gritting his teeth, he suppressed the boiling sensation in his chest, and immediately charged back, clashing head-on with that great yin soul.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","With every blow, Ling Han was undoubtedly sent flying. In fact, he spluttered out blood, and it was as if all the bones in his body were about to break. It was indescribably painful.","However, he immediately channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique, and after recovering for a short while, he charged back again.","The other Yin souls weren’t idle, and they also took advantage of the opening to attack, wanting to seize his body and replace him!","“An!” Ling Han called out the Six Characters Bright King Curse. His powerful spiritual power turned into an incredibly terrifying offensive power through this Buddhist Sect secret technique, and masses of Yin souls collapsed like snow meeting boiling water, instantly turning into dust.","He battled fiercely, fought bloody battles, and fought hard, forcing himself onto the line between life and death. If there was even the slightest mistake, and he would be consigned to eternal damnation.","Under such circumstances, he didn’t even consider using Purple Calamity Grains, so he could force out his potential.","Limits were broken at the moment of life and death.","However, even when the Yin souls withdrew their troops, Ling Han still had no gains.","He couldn’t see any opportunity to break through at all.","Ling Han didn’t give up. Breaking through to Ten Stars was the only path he had thought of at this moment. No matter how difficult it was, he was determined to continue on.","He did not return, and directly hid himself in the Void. As he meditated and cultivated, he waited for the next wave of attacks from the Yin souls.","Fight! Fight again!","Time and time again, Ling Han stood at the front lines, killing who knew how many Yin souls. He kept collecting rewards from heaven and earth. In fact, one day, heaven and earth suddenly stopped rewarding him.","He was startled. As it turned out, his physical body and soul had both reached perfection, and his cultivation level had also been stuck at nine stars, and could not possibly increase any further.","Thus, the heaven and earth didn’t know how to reward him either.","Er, how many Yin souls had he killed?","Ling Han didn’t know, but he would occasionally check the scoring device. The number on the scoring device stopped at 99 billion and a series of nines — it had reached the extreme of the scoring device, and was no longer taken into account.","In just a short while, Ling Han put this problem aside, and continued to battle.","With his personality of not turning back even if he ran into a wall, and since this was his only choice, then no matter what, he had to persevere to the end.","‘Come! Come! Come!’","Ling Han battled madly. He didn’t even use Destructive Energy anymore, and simply used his own path of martial arts to kill Yin souls.","Half a year, a year?","Ling Han didn’t know how much time had passed, but on a certain day, his eyes suddenly lit up, as good fortune befell his soul.","So... that was the case!","He was filled with pleasant surprise, because he had finally found inspiration to break through to Ten Stars.","Weng!","Right at this moment, a terrifying might swept over.","F***, it was Saint-level.","A large hand stretched out, covering heaven and earth. Endless dark veined patterns flickered, grabbing out at Ling Han.","The Yin Saint made his move.","Ling Han didn’t hesitate at all. He immediately channeled Purple Calamity Grains to form a protective shield, then spread Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to speed up.","Peng!","He sustained an attack from the Yin Saint, and the protective barrier formed by the Purple Calamity Grains immediately shattered. A powerful blast pushed him forwards, causing him to continue speeding up.","The power of a Saint was too terrifying. It actually caused Ling Han to accelerate inconceivably even at such a high speed.","However, the attack from the Yin Saint was also neutralized by Ling Han, and in the case of Purple Calamity Grains... it had completely lost its vitality.","After blocking the Saint’s attacks several times, it had finally reached its limit."]},{"number":4542,"title":"Chapter 4542: Inspiration","paragraphs":["Chapter 4542: Inspiration","Editor: Henyee Translations","Why had the Yin Saint suddenly moved?","Could it be that because he had killed too many Yin souls, even the Yin Saint and the Saint could no longer bear it?","Or... could it be that the battle had escalated, and it was the turn of the Saint-level power to make a move?","Ling Han merely sprinted quickly. No matter what the reason was, in the face of Saint-level power, his only option was to flee.","Thankfully, the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was already very fast in the first place, and added with the fact that he had been struck by the Saint, his speed had increased even further. There was absolutely no need for him to worry about the Yin Saint catching up to him.","Ahead of him, the Venerate Tier-level battle area was already close at hand.","...","This time, Ling Han did not have the time to bother about his identity being revealed. With a flap of his fiery wings, he did not have the slightest intention of slowing down or concealing himself. Instead, he communicated through divine sense, “Run, the Yin Saint has moved!”","Though there were Venerates from the Imperial Clans here, aside from them, there were also Venerates from a great many other forces.","Thus, Ling Han could ignore the life or death of the Venerates from the Imperial Clans, but he couldn’t allow the other Venerates to die with them.","“Ling Han!”","“Yi!”","Seeing Ling Han flit past like a wild horse that had escaped its reins, everyone was extremely shocked. They had not thought that Ling Han would actually appear here.","However, they all shuddered upon hearing this.","The Yin Saint had moved?","Hiss, not good, a major event!","They hurriedly ran after him. At this moment, they all chose to believe Ling Han.","On this kind of matter, they were sure that Ling Han would not speak carelessly.","Immediately, large swathes of Venerates fled as well. At the same time, the members of the Imperial Clans also contacted their own Saints. At this time, they naturally had to ask Saints to come out and suppress the situation.","After Ling Han delivered the news, he immediately tore a rip into space and left.","He could not continue staying here.","When the Saints arrived, he wouldn’t be able to leave.","Would the Imperial Clans spare him?","Hehe, wasn’t this just a joke?","He had to flee now that the Saints hadn’t arrived!","He entered into the Void and continued to use Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to increase his speed.","Half a day later, he finally came out of the Void. Then, he adjusted his position, and descended towards the planet closest to him.","He hurriedly went to investigate the situation.","Sure enough, a large number of Yin Saints entered the battlefield, escalating the scale of this battle. With the powerful push of these Yin Saints, the territories occupied by the Netherworld rapidly expanded. The areas around the Mountain Sea Heaven, such as Purple Gauze Planet and others, had all fallen.","The majority retreated, continuing to build a line of defense, while a great many did not manage to retreat in time. Naturally, they were killed by the Yin souls — even if they were not killed, their physical bodies would be taken, and it would be no different from death.","Ling Han hurriedly made contact with the large black dog and the others. Thankfully, they had not lost any members. Only a few of them had been slightly injured, but it was no big deal.","He breathed a sigh of relief. As long as they were still alive, everything was fine.","Ling Han didn’t return at the first instant. Instead, he hurriedly went into seclusion.","He had grasped a sliver of inspiration for his breakthrough, so he naturally could not miss it. Otherwise, who knew when he would be able to grasp it again.","Seven days later, he exited seclusion.","He had not broken through to Ten Stars, yet could clearly see a path ahead of him.","Ling Han returned to meet up with the empress and the others.","When everyone saw each other, they all felt fortunate that they had survived a calamity.","“How’s the situation now?” Ling Han asked. He had only used the connection device when he had contacted the large black dog and the others. Usually, he would not be using the Galaxy Network, so he was naturally unable to grasp the latest situation.","“The various Imperial Clans and Holy Lands have all mobilized Saints. Even the Imperial Weapons have been moved over, temporarily suppressing the situation.”","“Buddha Doga did not appear on our side. However, the Netherworld also didn’t send out the Lord of the Blood Sea and the others.”","“Thus, we were caught off guard by the Netherworld’s concentrated troops. However, now that the Netherworld’s battle line has spread out, we also have to face a situation of shortage of manpower.”","Everyone was talking at once.","Under the wave of attacks from the Yin Saint’s concentrated power, the defensive line of the Living Realm was instantly torn apart, but now, the Netherworld army’s advance was also stopped. After all, if the Yin Saint directly entered into the Living Realm, even the Yin Saint’s strength would fall drastically.","The Netherworld had to wait, and allow the Yin Qi to expand outwards, so that the Living Realm would continuously transform into the Netherworld. At least, it had to be half-way open, and only then would they be able to proceed to the next step.","Similarly, the Living Realm also had to race against time. Otherwise, starting a battle in a place that was half-Netherworld and half-Living Realm would also be disadvantageous to them.","Thus, one wanted to transform the environment into the Netherworld, while the other wanted to transform it into the Living Realm. This had become the focus of contention.","For the moment, one side would not be able to push the other side out, and the other side would not be able to chase the other side back, so they were stuck in a stalemate.","If there was no stronger power intervening, it was obvious that this stalemate would continue for a very long time.","Ling Han nodded. The situation was temporarily stable. As for how things would develop afterwards, it was actually not up to them to worry. It would depend on how the Master of Yin River and the others would play their cards.","“Yi, your cultivation levels are all improving so quickly!”","Ling Han was slightly surprised. This was because the empress, Hu Niu, and the others had all advanced to the level of Sect Master. Meanwhile, the large black dog, the little azure dragon, and the perverted pig had all reached the level of Nine Stars. They had already caught up to his cultivation level.","Not only that, but even though Ji Wuming and the others had started later and progressed slower, they had all advanced into the True Self Tier by now. Their speed was astonishingly fast.","“Hold on, just how long have I been battling with Yin souls for?”","He only found out after asking for a while. As it turned out, he had actually battled Venerate Tier-level great yin souls for a whole twenty-three years!","Heavens, it had actually taken so long!","Ling Han couldn’t help but grit his teeth. After battling for a whole twenty-three years, he finally grasped a sliver of inspiration to break through to Ten Stars.","In terms of absolute lifespan, 23 years wasn’t a long time. However, in these 23 years, Ling Han was always hovering on the border between life and death. If he had made a mistake at any step, he would be consigned to eternal damnation.","If it was another person, to say nothing of 23 years, they would not be able to last even 23 days.","—Just let any Sect Master try to withstand Venerate Tier-level attack, and they could become ghosts at any time!","Most importantly, even in such a state, Ling Han had only managed to grasp a sliver of inspiration.","From this, it could be seen just how difficult it was to break through to Ten Stars.","“Since it’s all in the past, all of this isn’t important anymore. What’s important is that I have a chance of breaking through to Ten Stars!”","Ling Han decided to continue his seclusion, to charge up to Ten Stars in a single stroke.","“Little Han, you’re actually a Nine Stars Sect Master?” The large black dog and the others found this inconceivable.","With how freakish Ling Han was, he should have long since broken through to Venerate Tier.","Ling Han nodded, anddidn’t deny it.","“This isn’t good!” the little azure dragon said. “The current Golden Generation has all advanced into the Venerate Tier, and those like Ding Shu and Origin have all broken through to the Venerate Tier. Their battle prowess is extremely terrifying.”","Ling Han, whose battle prowess had once reigned supreme among the younger generation, couldn’t even squeeze into the top ten now, what more leading the masses. How could this not make people sigh?","Ling Han explained. The fruit of cultivation was trapped by the shackles of heaven and earth, so he was unable to break through to the Fourth Extreme.","This caused everyone to frown. What could they do? What could they do now?","“It’s fine,” Ling Han said with a smile. “I already have some confidence that I can break through toTen Stars. Worse come to worst, I’ll charge up to Twelve Stars, or even Fifteen Stars. One day, I’ll be able to break through these shackles!”","Seeing how confident Ling Han was, everyone could only believe him and nod."]},{"number":4543,"title":"Chapter 4543: Ten Stars!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4543: Ten Stars!","Editor: Henyee Translations","The only benefit brought by the invasion of the Yin souls was that the rate of cultivation of the Living Realm cultivators increased to another level.","Originally, it would have taken a few hundred years, or even several thousand, or even tens of thousands of years to reach this level, but now, with the rewards from the heaven and earth, they had reached this level in just over twenty years.","And the well-known figures of the younger generation would take advantage of this opportunity to once again widen the gap between them and the others.","The stronger one’s strength, the more Yin souls one could kill, and the stronger one would become. From there, it would stimulate the rapid increase of one’s cultivation level, and widen the gap between them and others.","Elites would become stronger.","Those like the Golden Generation, Ding Shu and Origin all became Venerates, only inferior to Saint Tier, and could be claimed to have boundless glory.","...","However, Ling Han, who had once been the most outstanding, had fallen behind.","—Because Ling Han had previously escaped to report the news, and was witnessed by a great many Venerates, everyone was clearly aware of Ling Han’s present cultivation level.","Sect Master, a Nine Star Sect Master.","What, it had already been more than twenty years since the invasion of the Yin souls, and the top prodigies had all become Venerates, but Ling Han was actually only Sect Master-level?","He had fallen behind, he had seriously fallen behind!","What was going on here?","No one knew, but the Golden Generation elites all smirked coldly. They had announced that while those without true background could laugh for a while, it was ultimately impossible for them to laugh for the rest of their life.","See, when one had reached this level, their true colours would be revealed.","Ding Shu, Origin and the others were also surprised. Logically speaking, how could the barrier of the Fourth Extreme be able to stop Ling Han?","In terms of comprehension ability, they were all masters of Genesis World, so they should be equally matched.","However, they had all broken through, and only Ling Han was left behind. What was going on here?","Now, the well-known figures of the Golden Generation, such as Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian, had all become Seven Star Venerates. Their cultivation level progressed frighteningly quickly, and in the case of Ding Shu and the others, they had already advanced into Three Stars.","Thus, even if Ling Han had now broken through to Venerate Tier, there was already a considerable gap between him and the top young prodigies.","Faced with the clamoring of the Imperial Sons, the large black dog couldn’t help but reveal the “truth”.","“Little Han’s freakish talent has attracted the jealousy of the heavens. The fruit of cultivation is trapped by the shackles of heaven and earth, unable to manifest the Fourth Extreme!","It reported its misfortunes, but not its good news. It was clear that Ling Han had already begun to cultivate in seclusion again, attempting to break through to Ten Stars This was a deliberate smoke bomb. As the saying goes, in times of danger, one’s true nature would be revealed. Whoever treated you well and who treated you badly could be clearly seen at this time.","“Sigh, what a pity!”","“So Ling Han’s strength has attracted the jealousy of the heavens!”","“That’s right. Previously, Ling Han had indeed displayed his fruit of cultivation. There were black patterns like chains on it, and I had initially thought that it was because he had cultivated some secret technique. I had not thought that it was actually the shackles of heaven and earth.”","“It’s over. Being punished by the heaven and earth, he’s definitely done for.”","“Sigh, such a prodigy is originally the king tier of king tiers, yet now he’s actually going to be eternally trapped at the level of Sect Master?”","“This time, the Golden Generation elites are going to be happy. They’ve finally lost a powerful enemy!”","This caused heated discussions, and Ling Han’s fruit of cultivation bearing the shackles of heaven and earth had indeed been witnessed by others, but no one had discovered what it was at the time.","Now that the truth was revealed, everyone naturally believed it. This indeed explained the problem of Ling Han being unable to break through to the Venerate Tier. After all, it was too illogical.","The heaven and earth was punishing him, so no matter how freakish you were, so what?","Once this kind of conclusion was reached, the Imperial Clans finally felt completely at ease.","Ling Han was done for. It was impossible for him to continue contending for the throne.","Thus, there was no need to rush to kill Ling Han now. They could completely have the Golden Generation elites personally kill him, and reclaim the glory that they had lost.","“Now, it is only up to Ding Shu, Origin and the others.”","“A new Emperor will definitely be born among the Golden Generation, Ding Shu and the others.”","“I wonder who it is.”","“No matter who it is, I only hope that a new Emperor will be born soon, and raze the Netherworld to the ground.”","“Yes, yes, yes!”","Because the situation had temporarily stabilized, the Imperial Sons began to play tricks again, issuing invitations to Ding Shu, Origin, and the others, to have a competition of prodigies.","In fact, they had even sent out an invitation to Ling Han.","Why had they invited Ling Han?","When the news spread, everyone was in an uproar.","It was clear that the Imperial Clans were humiliating Ling Han.","Weren’t you very awesome? Weren’t you once the strongest prodigy?","What is it? You can’t do it now?","‘Are you coming or not?’","If he didn’t come, that would be admitting defeat, and a slap to his own face! But if he came, then a sparring match would still be a slap to his face.","“Ling Han has already been crippled, so why are the Imperial Sons still clinging onto him?”","“He, why don’t you think about it? Merely in the open, just how many Imperial Sons have died by Ling Han’s hand? Added with the fact that there are still a great many that we don’t know about?”","“Thus, it can be said that the Imperial Sons hate Ling Han to the core!”","“I’ve also heard that at this gathering, the Donglin Imperial Clan will also choose a good husband for their Imperial Daughter, Chi Menghan.”","“Hiss, isn’t Chi Menghan Ling Han’s lover?”","“Precisely so, and that is why it is even more humiliating.”","“That’s right. His cultivation level has been eternally locked at the level of Sect Master, and his lover is going to marry someone else. Who wouldn’t go crazy in his place?”","“It can’t be helped. Who asked that Ling Han to be too brilliant in the early stages? Once he falls off the pedestal, there would definitely be countless people wanting to step on him.”","“Let’s take a look. When will the banquet be held?”","“Oh, because all the Imperial Sons have their own matters, it is scheduled to be held a year and a half later.”","“Where will it be held?”","“Xuanwu Planet.”","“Let’s go, let’s go, let’s quickly go there. When the time comes, we definitely have to witness this kind of gathering with our own eyes.”","Though it was still early, there were already a great many people that had set out on their way, fearing that they would miss out on the excitement.","And as the person involved, Ling Han was completely focused on breaking through to Ten Stars.","His accumulation of power was actually already enough. After battling bloody battles with Yin souls for 23 years, and even to the extent that the heaven and earth couldn’t reward him, just how much was this accumulation?","When he grasped a sliver of inspiration, the door to a new world had actually opened up to him.","He sat as still as a rock, but spiritual light flickered endlessly.","Right, right.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face, his expression filled with confidence.","That was enough.","Beginning to break through to Ten Stars!","Once, twice, thrice. Continuous failures did not discourage Ling Han. It should be known that previously, he had fought bloody battles for 23 years without a clue. Thus, what were these few failures worth?","A year’s time quickly passed.","Ling Han’s comprehension bloomed like a flower, blooming endlessly.","Kuang!","Thunder suddenly boomed in the heaven and earth, and endless dark clouds began to intertwine, as if doomsday had descended.","The heaven’s calamity had arrived!","On Ling Han’s fruit of cultivation, the tenth golden streak was faintly discernible.","Now that the heaven’s calamity had descended, he definitely had to survive this. If he did, he would become the unprecedented Ten Stars Sect Master, and if he failed, it was unknown if he would still have the chance to charge up again.","After all, this was a life-or-death charge in his strongest state. It was hard to say whether he would be able to reach this kind of state in future.","Xiu, the heaven’s calamity transformed into human form and appeared in Ling Han’s mind.","“Scram!” Ling Han’s divine sense also took human form, charging towards the heaven’s calamity without hesitation.","F***, it had restricted his fruit of cultivation, and now it still wanted to ruin his plans?","He will kill it!"]},{"number":4544,"title":"Chapter 4544: Sparring","paragraphs":["Chapter 4544: Sparring","Editor: Henyee Translations","It was as if Ling Han had gone mad, and the human figure formed by his divine sense attacked endlessly.","Peng, peng, peng! The punches landed on the heaven’s calamity figure, rendering it completely unqualified to attack. It could only take a beating.","Ling Han hadn’t broken through to the Venerate Tier, so the heaven and earth tribulation had to be restricted to the level of Sect Master.","At this level, was there anyone that could match Ling Han?","Hence, he was the only one who could make a move.","In a short while, the heaven’s calamity figure was completely dispersed by him, turning into a Celestial Qi that nourished Ling Han’s fruit of cultivation.","...","Yi?","Ling Han discovered that the amount of Celestial Qi was a little shocking, causing his tenth golden thread to rapidly deepen.","He had just stepped onto Ten Stars yet he had suddenly arrived at the middle stage of Ten Stars. Then, he advanced into the late stage like a hot knife through butter. In fact, he was even close to reaching the peak stage.","He had only destroyed the heaven’s calamity once, so how could the benefits be so great?","Just how difficult was this heaven’s calamity?","Ling Han faltered for a moment before coming to a sudden realization. This was because he had killed far too many Yin souls previously. However, heaven and earth had no rewards for him, so the rewards could only be accumulated as a debt to him.","—The heaven and earth would be heartless, and the fairest. You are too strong. The heaven and earth would impose shackles on you, and also leave you with a sliver of hope, and whatever is owed to you, it would definitely repay.","Peak stage of Ten Stars!","In a mere ten days, Ling Han had advanced from breaking through to Ten Stars to peak stage. This speed was chillingly fast.","Ling Han tried to sever his shackles again, but he still couldn’t.","Fine then, he would break through again!","Ling Han did not hesitate in the slightest, and began to charge towards Eleven Stars.","He refused to believe this.","The difficulty lay in Ten Stars. This was a level that no one had ever set foot on before. In fact, if it was not for the existence of the shackles of heaven and earth, Ling Han would not have thought of breaking through to Ten Stars either.","In fact, even if he wanted to break through his limits, he probably didn’t have such strong tenacity, to still refuse to give up after failing so many times.","Thus, one’s potential really had to be forced out sometimes.","The most difficult part had already passed. It was as if he had stepped onto the position of Venerate Tier, and now, from the position of One Star Venerate to breaking through to Two Stars, how difficult would that be?","In just three days, he had completed his breakthrough.","This time, the divine lightning of heaven and earth didn’t descend.","However, there was a mysterious energy surging in Ling Han’s body, helping him increase his cultivation level.","Ling Han knew very well that this was still the reward from heaven and earth. It had not been used up yet!","Another ten days passed, and he had reached the peak stage of Eleven Stars.","He once again attempted to sever the shackles, and discovered that they were slightly loosened.","Fine, you won’t open it, right?","‘I’ll continue to break through!’","Another four days passed, and Ling Han successfully advanced into Twelve Stars. Then, the rewards from heaven and earth were still continuing, helping him reach the middle stage of Twelve Stars.","This time, the rewards from heaven and earth had finally been used up.","Ling Han’s eyes suddenly snapped open. Boom! A terrifying aura surged out, causing even the Void to tremble.","“How... strong am I now?”","He was extremely curious. Theoretically speaking, reaching Ten Stars was equivalent to breaking through to the Venerate Tier. In that case, he was now equivalent to a three-star Venerate.","But the problem was, could such an analogy be used?","Ling Han spread open his hand, and with a light wave, 90 streaks of Regulations instantly appeared, intertwining with each other in an indescribable sequence.","“90 flashes!”","Even Ling Han himself was stunned. After crossing over the threshold of Ten Stars, his grasp of Regulations had actually increased exponentially.","“Furthermore, with Regulations intertwining, it seems to have increased my battle prowess further.”","Ling Han murmured to himself.","Previously, when the attack was delivered, the Regulations were only effective in terms of numbers. If there were too many, the attack would be strong, and if there were too few, the attack would be weak. There was nothing else.","But now, the 90 flashes of Regulations were intertwined in some indescribable manner, causing Ling Han to instinctively feel that the might of this was stronger than merely compounding the 90 flashes of Regulations, and it was not just by a little bit either.","“I’m really curious. Who should I find to spar with?”","Ling Han came out of seclusion. When the news came out, the empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog and the others all came over.","“Little Han, you’ve finally come out of seclusion!” the large black dog said smugly. “Look, Grandpa Dog is already a Venerate!”","Oh, indeed, it was not only the large black dog that had advanced into Venerate Tier. The little azure dragon and perverted pig had also advanced into Venerate Tier, and continued to maintain their lead in Ling Han’s group.","“How is it?” the little azure dragon asked.","Ling Han nodded, “I’ve surpassed Nine Stars!”","Hearing these words, everyone was instantly excited, joy on their faces.","Although Ling Han hadn’t reached the Venerate Tier yet, breaking through to Ten Stars was already a magnificent feat.","— Throughout the ages, how many Venerates were there in this world? But Ten Star Sect Master... was there one?","“Little Han, come, come, let Grandpa Dragon test out your current strength,” the little azure dragon said, its eyes extremely bright.","He had always been inferior to Ling Han, and now that he had finally gotten the chance, he naturally had to take advantage of the opportunity to trample on Ling Han.","Of course, their friendship would definitely not be shaken because of this.","Ling Han smiled, “Sure!”","“Don’t worry, Grandpa Dragon will use my power carefully,” the little azure dragon said casually, expressing that it would be more careful. It wouldn’t go to the extent of hurting or even killing Ling Han.","The two of them shot into the sky, and the others followed, watching the battle from afar.","“Father!” Ling Xi crossed her arms over her chest, revealing a worried expression.","After all, a Sect Master was battling against a Venerate. Even if Ling Han was freakish and broke through to Ten Stars, he was still a major tier away from the Venerate Tier, after all.","“Don’t worry, Master definitely won’t lose!” Fu Tianxing said with absolute certainty.","In his heart, Ling Han was an invincible god of war.","“Mhm!” Ling Xi nodded in agreement.","“Ling Han will win!” the empress interjected with absolute certainty.","This was an even firmer belief. Not only would he not lose, he would win!","“Niu’s Ling Han will definitely win!” Hu Niu nodded as well.","The little azure dragon heard them clearly, and couldn’t help but cry out loudly, “Little Han, Grandpa Dragon originally only wanted to defeat you, but now, I’ve decided to give you a beating.”","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Then you would have to have that kind of strength.”","“Take this!” the little azure dragon roared. It launched an attack, and energy surged. 30 six-star Regulations appeared at the same time, attacking Ling Han.","He knew that Ling Han had already been able to use 22 Regulations when he was still a Nine Star Sect Master. Thus, now that he had broken through to Ten Stars, his battle prowess would definitely explode greatly. He directly used 30 Regulations.","—He was a Venerate Tier, so it was naturally no issue for him to deliver 30 six-star Regulations with a single strike.","Boom, the terrifying energy turned into a massive dragon claw, interwoven with Regulations, that blasted towards Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled, and similarly shot out a punch. 30 flashes of Regulations also intertwined.","However, upon a closer look, the Regulations of the little azure dragon were only plain and unchanged, but Ling Han’s Regulations were intertwined with some kind of rhythm.","Peng!","The dragon claw immediately shattered, and a massive fist continued to smash towards the little azure dragon.","“F*ck!” the little azure dragon immediately exclaimed in astonishment.","How was this possible?","The others were also stunned. It was clear that the number of Regulations on both sides was the same, so why was it Ling Han that had the upper hand now?","This gap was not just a little bit.","The little azure dragon merely launched another attack. This time, he directly used the power of Venerate Tier, which naturally dispersed Ling Han’s attack with ease."]},{"number":4545,"title":"Chapter 4545: Strong to the point of heaven-defying","paragraphs":["Chapter 4545: Strong to the point of heaven-defying","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Again!” The little azure dragon was unconvinced.","He thought that the reason why he was no match for Ling Han when the Regulations were the same in number was because Ling Han had becomea Ten Stars Sect Master. This had broken through the limits of Sect Master-level. Thus, in the use of the six-star Regulations, Ling Han definitely had an advantage.","Thus, he could only invest more Regulations into battle.","Boom! He unleashed another attack, which similarly transformed into a dragon claw. However, this time, it was entwined with 40 Six Star Regulations.","F***, forty flashes should be enough to crush you, right?","Ling Han, on the other hand, did not increase the number of Regulations. He still greeted this with 30 Regulations.","...","He wanted to know just how great a boost his Regulations would be when they intertwined.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow. This time, the Regulations clashed, and both attacks were destroyed.","They were evenly matched!","What!","Everyone was stunned. This, this, this, in a situation when there was a whole gap of ten Regulations, it was actually still a tie?","It should be known that the difference of a single star was the difference of a single Regulation, so the gap in battle prowess was incredibly obvious.","Now that there was a gap of ten flashes, it was actually a draw?","What kind of joke was this!","“You freak!” the little azure dragon said through gritted teeth.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “How about it? Your uncle is still your uncle, right?”","“I don’t yield!” The little azure dragon unleashed its third attack. This time, the number of Regulations on its claws increased to as many as fifty.","Ling Han was unafraid, and increased the number of Regulations to forty.","Peng! With a single strike, all the manifestations of Regulations were once again destroyed.","“You monster!” the little azure dragon cursed again, and then increased the number of Regulations to 60.","Ling Han greeted it with fifty flashes, dispersing it once more.","The little azure dragon increased the number by 70, and Ling Han dispersed the attack with 60. He increased it to 80, and Ling Han resolved the strike with 70.","Again?","There was no more. Even if the little azure dragon was a Venerate Tier, and was so freakish, it was only a One Star. The limit of his attack was 80 Six Star Regulations.","It was a tie!","Everyone was once again stunned. On the level of Six Star Regulations, Ling Han was actually not inferior to Venerate Tier.","This was practically... indescribably awesome.","“Brat, do you really have the battle prowess of a Venerate?” The little azure dragon was stunned. It charged out, and this time, it used the Seven Star Regulations.","There was only one.","Ling Han had also only used ten flashes of Six Star Regulations, but they were interwoven together, exuding an indescribable charm.","The little azure dragon was furious. “Little Han, you’re looking down on Grandpa Dragon too much!”","Ten Six Star Regulations to exchange blows with him?","Peng!","However, with this strike, the Regulations of both sides were once again annihilated.","What, what?","It had really been resolved.","Everyone’s eyes were dumbfounded, as if they had been struck dumb.","Ten six-star Regulations could match one seven-star Regulation?","This was completely unrealistic!","Because for people like the Golden Generation, which one of them hadn’t grasped more than ten Regulations when they were at Sect Master-level? To say nothing of them, even the Dao Child wouldn’t find it difficult to do so.","But the problem was, who could match a Venerate? Even if it was only a One Star Venerate?","None, there was definitely no one.","Thus, Ling Han was practically a monster!","“All right, Grandpa Dragon wants to see your limit!” The little azure dragon made its move again. As long as Ling Han could block it, it would continuously increase its battle prowess, right until Ling Han couldn’t hold on any longer.","Two Seven Star Regulations, three, four... eight!","The little azure dragon was already going all out. Eight streaks of Seven Star Regulations were his limit, but even so, Ling Han was still able to move with ease, maintaining a tie all this while.","“I’m done fighting! I’m done fighting!” the little azure dragon said gloomily.","A One Star Venerate Tier was actually unable to defeat a Sect Master in a head-on confrontation. No matter what the reason was, this was incredibly humiliating.","The large black dog and the others were also stunned. Aside from Brother Monkey, the little azure dragon was the top elite among them. Now, it was actually unable to defeat Ling Han, which showed how freakish this Sect Master was.","“Freak!”","“Freak!”","Everyone said, but all of them bore expressions of delight.","Ling Han, the king tier had returned!","So what if he hadn’t broken through to Venerate Tier? His battle prowess was on the level of Venerate Tier!","And when Ling Han broke through to Venerate Tier, just how strong would he be?","They didn’t dare to imagine it, but it was worth looking forward to.","“Little Han, just what level has your limit reached?” The large black dog and the others were all curious.","Ling Han smiled, and shot out a strike. 90 Regulations shone at the same time.","‘F*ck!’","Everyone was speechless. There was no shortage of Sect Masters among them, and for those like the large black dog, they had also come from the ranks of Sect Masters, so they naturally knew the level of Sect Master well.","Twenty flashes of Regulations was the limit!","Are you f****** planning to break through 100?","“Ten Stars, so awesome?” the large black dog murmured. Then, he scratched his head in extreme regret, “If I had known, Grandpa Dog should have broken through to Ten Stars as well.”","Ling Han shook his head, “I am not Ten Stars, but rather Twelve Stars.”","When these words fell, everyone was even more stunned, the corners of their mouths twitching.","Charging up to Ten Stars was done for the first time in history, but Ling Han, on the other hand, directly broke the limits of Eleven Stars and Twelve Stars","Thus, they could compete with anyone, but definitely not with Ling Han. That would only be seeking a blow to their pride, and seeking to displease themselves.","“Since Little Han is so awesome, we can now go to the Imperial Clans’ appointment,” the large black dog said.","“What appointment?” Ling Han asked. He still didn’t know about this.","The large black dog related the matter to Ling Han, and Ling Han couldn’t help but raise a brow.","Oh, they had deliberately hosted a banquet so he would embarrass himself?","However, what was going on with the Donglin Imperial Clan? Seeing that he would be eternally trapped at the level of Sect Master, they decisively dumped him?","He was sure that this was definitely not Chi Menghan’s original intention. It was just that she couldn’t win in the argument.","Thus, merely for this reason, he had to go to this appointment, what more when he also had to slap the Imperial Clans in the face while he was at it.","The Imperial Clans said it in a very frank and forthright way, and absolutely guaranteed Ling Han’s safety. No Saint would definitely make a move, and touch a single finger of his.","Since the announcement had been made all over the universe, then, at least in the course of this banquet, the members of the Imperial Clans would not send out Saints.","Was Venerate Tier not enough?","This was a grand event to humiliate Ling Han, and to pick up the pride and confidence that the Golden Generations had lost. Then, it was up to them whether they wanted to kill him or skin him.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Come, let’s go to Xuanwu Planet.”","“Let’s go, let’s go, let’s go!” The large black dog and little azure dragon were both people who wanted nothing more than for the world to be in chaos. When they heard that they were going to make trouble by slapping the faces of the Imperial Clans, they were all excited.","Meanwhile, the perverted pig retreated. Lord Pig didn’t want to go at all. You guys had best forget the existence of Lord Pig.","However, Ling Han stretched out a hand and picked it up.","B@stard, b@stard.","Ling Han did not have the empress and the others follow him. This time, he was going to slap their faces. Though the Imperial Clans guaranteed that they would be absolutely safe when attending the banquet, but what about afterwards?","He still had to be careful.","Now, the little azure dragon, the large black dog, and the perverted pig were all Venerates. The speed at which they tore open space was far faster than the speed at which they traveled through the Transfer Formation, and in Ling Han’s case, he was at a disadvantage because his cultivation level hadn’t increased, and he couldn’t use the Seven Star Regulations. Thus, in terms of crossing the Void, he was no match for the large black dog and the others.","It didn’t matter. The large black dog and the others would bring him along."]},{"number":4546,"title":"Chapter 4546: The feast begins","paragraphs":["Chapter 4546: The feast begins","Editor: Henyee Translations","The four “people” traversed through the universe, heading towards Xuanwu Planet.","With their speed, it only took them eleven days to reach this planet.","How lively!","This was the first impression that the four of them had. Most of the people here were young people, and their cultivation levels varied. There were cultivation levels ranging from Foundation Building Tier to Spiritual Transformation Tier, but there was a lack of Sect Masters. After all, those who could cultivate to Sect Master-level at such a young age naturally belonged to the category of the strongest prodigies of the current generation.","Were they all here to watch the excitement?","Ling Han gritted his teeth. These people were really too idle, weren’t they?","...","“Little Han, looks like you’re very popular. So many people have come to see you,” the large black dog said.","“To see you make a fool of yourself,” the little azure dragon added.","“Hu, hu!” The pervert pig laughed.","A vicious expression appeared on Ling Han’s face, and he said, “Are the three of you asking for a beating?”","In the whole world, only he would dare to say such words to Venerates, and only he would have that kind of strength and confidence.","The large black dog and the others all covered their mouths and laughed. It was really rare to see Ling Han suffer.","There were still about three months’ time until the grand feast hosted by the Imperial Clans.","Alright, they could only wait.","“Where’s Brother Monkey?” Ling Han asked.","“Brother Monkey went to a dangerous place to find natural treasures, hoping that they can help you break through the restrictions of heaven and earth,” the large black dog said seriously.","Brother Monkey!","Ling Han felt a warmth in his heart. Even though this world was realistic, materialistic, and in such a chaotic state, there were still sincere people like Brother Monkey, who brought him a sliver of sunshine and some warmth.","“What cultivation level is Brother Monkey at now?” he asked again.","“Eight-star Venerate Tier.” The little azure dragon pondered for a moment, then said, “In any case, Grandpa Dragon can’t beat him.”","Brother Monkey’s aptitude was also at the level of the Golden Generation. It would be strange if the little azure dragon could defeat him.","However, though an eight-star Venerate was practically the strongest below Saint Tier, Brother Monkey had gone to a desolate land of this universe. Who knew what kind of dangers he would encounter.","“I hope Brother Monkey can return safely,” Ling Han said. In truth, he was already confident that he could break through to Venerate Tier. There was absolutely no need for Brother Monkey to take such a risk.","The four of them discussed cultivation. Though Ling Han’s cultivation level was slightly inferior, he had long since formed his own path. Not only was he qualified to discuss dao with the large black dog and the others, he could even turn around to guide them.","This Sect Master was probably the only one in the world who could guide Venerates.","The little azure dragon already saw its own path, so it wouldn’t be difficult for it to walk it out. However, the large black dog and the perverted pig were slightly inferior. At least, they were still at a loss.","Day after day passed, and the four of them improved.","Finally, three months had passed, and the day for the Imperial Clan banquet was already close at hand.","At this moment, a large number of Imperial Sons arrived.","It was not just the Golden Generation, but also the Silver Generation and the ordinary Imperial Sons. Though Ling Han had killed batch after batch, the number of Imperial Clan elites was still considerable, so there were naturally even more that were alive than dead.","Now, these Imperial Sons were all in high spirits.","Yin souls invaded, and though it caused great damage to normal people, those like the Imperial Sons belonged to the category of benefiting from the invasion. Every single one of their cultivation levels had improved greatly.","Right now, the Golden Generation elites had all advanced to the Venerate Tier. Meanwhile, the Silver Generation elites were all standing at the same level as the high-ranking Sect Masters. In fact, even the ordinary Imperial Sons had quite a number that had successfully attained Sect Master-level.","By now, it was already the younger generation that would be taking the lead. As long as anyone could advance into Saint Tier, it would mean the full beginning of the replacement of the older generation with the younger generation.","Ding Shu, Origin, Myriad Dao and the others had also received invitations, and had all come here.","What made them luckier than Ling Han was the fact that they all had the backing of an Imperial Clan, which caused the Imperial Sons to clearly be envious and have killing intent, yet they did not dare to use their powerful background to snipe Ding Shu and the others.","If Ling Han wanted to, he could have married Chi Menghan many years ago. In that way, he would have the backing of the Donglin Imperial Clan. The other Imperial Sons would only be able to battle him in the open.","However, if he were to marry Chi Menghan under such circumstances, it would be equivalent to asking for help from the Donglin Imperial Clan. He would definitely have to pay a price.","How could Ling Han be living under someone else’s roof?","To him, the purpose of cultivation was freedom. How could he possibly give up a portion of his freedom for the sake of survival in exchange for the help of the Imperial Clan?","Now, it was indeed slightly more difficult for him, but wasn’t his growth better than anyone else’s?","Only after experiencing hardship and cold could plum fragrance be tempered1.","Another few days later, the banquet of the Imperial Clans began.","This wasn’t a one-day event. Instead, it would be held continuously for half a month. During this time, there would be martial arts competitions and spars, and the climax was when the Donglin Imperial Clan chose a husband for Chi Menghan.","For an Imperial Daughter like Chi Menghan, who possessed aptitude that was comparable to the Golden Generation, there would definitely be a queue of Imperial Sons who wanted to marry her.","The Donglin Imperial Clan was powerful enough by itself, so they definitely didn’t want to simply form an alliance through marriage with another Imperial Clan. Instead, they needed the person that would form a matrimonial alliance with Chi Menghan to be someone who could become Emperor!","Now that there were so many prodigies, it seemed like many people had hopes of becoming Emperor. Thus, the Donglin Imperial Clan needed to carefully consider and observe.","This banquet did not set up any barriers for those who came. Anyone could attend, but if they did so, they would only be able to stand in the outer circle. If they wanted to watch the sparring match from a close distance, or if they wanted to become acquainted with the Imperial Sons, they would first have to prove their own strength.","Otherwise, if just anyone could enter into the inner circle, the grade of this banquet would be endlessly dragged down.","Ling Han and the others arrived at the outer circle first.","The banquet was held in a valley. It was surrounded by mountains on all sides, and there was only one path through which one could enter. Anyone could stand at the top of the mountain and look down into the valley. As long as one had stepped onto the Celestial Path, this bit of distance was naturally no problem.","If one wanted to enter the valley and participate, they would at least have to have the cultivation level of Sect Master.","...The hierarchy of martial arts was the strictest. If a group of Sect Masters and Venerates spar with each other, would Spirit Transformation Tiers and True Self Tiers be qualified to participate?","Thus, most people were watching from the top of the mountain. In any case, there was no obstruction to their vision. Furthermore, the Sect Master and Venerate Tier-level battles usually took place in the skies, and they were actually closer.","On the first day, the atmosphere was harmonious. The Imperial Sons were all very polite, and no one made a move. On the second day, one spar after another officially began.","Actually, it was not just the Donglin Imperial Clan. There were also a few Imperial Clans that wanted to choose a husband for their Imperial Daughter. Thus, the Imperial Sons all worked hard to perform. Putting aside whether they were willing or not in the end, being able to gain the notice of other Imperial Clans was equivalent to a massive affirmation.","When one had reached heights like they had, they naturally were all aiming for the position of Emperor, and if one wanted to become Emperor, natural talent and luck were both necessary.","Affirmation from others had a boost to luck, and would mysteriously have an effect on it.","At first, everyone only watched the battle quietly, and then discussed who was stronger, but by the fifth day, the topic of conversation had changed to Ling Han.","“Yi, why hasn’t Ling Han appeared yet?”","“That’s right. Does he really not dare to come?”","“Hehe, who would be so stupid? He clearly knows that he would be embarrassing himself, yet still came here to make a fool of himself?”"]},{"number":4547,"title":"Chapter 4547: Ling Han appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4547: Ling Han appears","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone discussed spiritedly. On one hand, they hoped that Ling Han would appear, but on the other, they felt that it was impossible for him to appear.","“Little Han, shouldn’t it be time for you to take the field?” the large black dog asked.","“That’s right. You should take the field now; it’s time to show off and slap people’s faces,” the little azure dragon clicked its tongue. He loved to show off the most, but unfortunately, he couldn’t become the main character in the end.","“Heng, heng.” The lecherous pig was laidback. It only wanted to quietly look at the beauties, and when it was in the mood, it would go and tease the girls.","As for battle or whatnot, it was completely uninterested.","Ling Han smiled and said, “As the main character, I’m naturally going to be the climax. You guys go first.”","...","“All right. Grandpa Dragon is going.” The little azure dragon’s eyes shone brightly. Being in the limelight in front of everyone was his greatest hobby.","Xiu, he immediately leaped out, and headed towards the valley.","“Tsk, it’s another person who doesn’t recognize his own abilities at all.” Seeing the young man that the little azure dragon transformed into heading into the valley, a considerable number of people shook their heads.","There was a formation set up in the valley, and there was a layer of energy that could not be seen with the naked eye that formed a barrier. At least, only someone with the strength of Sect Master could pass through.","And those “VIPs” that were supposed to go to the valley had naturally arrived long ago. Those who were now charging towards that energy barrier were all people who were blindly confident in themselves, so they naturally would be looked down upon by others.","However, the little azure dragon was like a hot knife through butter, and the energy barrier couldn’t stop him at all.","That was because he was a Venerate.","“Yi!” “En?” “Ah!”","Everyone exclaimed in shock. They didn’t expect the little azure dragon to be so powerful.","F***, you clearly could have entered into the valley to attend the main banquet, so why did you have to stay here for five days?","Show off!","Peng! The little azure dragon landed on the ground, purposefully creating an extremely heavy sound of impact, instantly drawing everyone’s attention.","He enjoyed this kind of scene of being the center of attention very much. He bared his teeth in a grin, “Weren’t you guys waiting for Little Han? Grandpa Dragon is here!”","“So it’s you, Four-Legged Snake!” A Golden Generation sneered. The Imperial Clans had naturally investigated all the people by Ling Han’s side, and knew that the dog and snake by his side were very powerful. As for Brother Monkey, there was even less need to mention him.","“Pei, I’m a dragon, a True Dragon!” The little azure dragon immediately jumped up. “You country bumpkins are all blind!”","These words successfully caused the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters to reveal expressions of killing intent. In terms of ability to attract animosity, the little azure dragon was actually not much inferior to Ling Han.","“Where’s Ling Han? Why doesn’t he dare to show himself?” the Golden Generation asked. What was the point of tangling with the azure dragon?","The little azure dragon crossed its arms over its chest, appearing to be very detestable. “He has some matters to attend to, so he’ll come later. So, Grandpa Dragon will first beat the crap out of you guys, and then it’ll be Little Han’s turn.”","The Golden Generation laughed loudly, and said, “Merely a Four-Legged Snake, you are truly boastful!”","Do you think you are Ling Han, Ding Shu, Yang Yihuan and the others?","Moreover, Ling Han had already been crippled. He was eternally trapped at Sect Master-level, and had already withdrawn from the battle for the throne.","The little azure dragon roared and charged at the Golden Generation. “Watch how Grandpa Dragon smashes your stinky mouth!”","F***!","The corners of everyone’s mouths twitched. ‘If we’re talking about bad mouths, it seems like you’re the one more fitting for that label.’","The Golden Generation was unafraid. With a leap, he passed through the energy barrier and stood proudly in the air.","It was naturally impossible for him to battle with the little azure dragon in the valley. If he did, it would cause chaos below.","The little azure dragon didn’t say another word. Flapping its fiery wings, it set off in hot pursuit of the Golden Generation.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The two of them battled fiercely. Frightening power reverberated, and the collision of the Seven Star Regulations created a brilliance that filled the skies.","That Golden Generation was also a One Star Venerate. As he delivered a strike, he could also deliver eight Seven Star Regulations, which was equal to the little azure dragon.","Since the Regulations were equal in level, then it would depend on whose power was stronger, and who had mastered the celestial technique better and was more agile in its use.","The little azure dragon had the advantage.","Who was he?","Young Son of the True Dragon, cultivated the Heavenly Dragon Emperor Technique, whose power far surpassed an Imperial Son!","And in terms of the celestial technique, the Imperial Techniques that he had mastered were not few in number. It was completely not inferior to the Imperial Son.","The moment the little azure dragon gained the upper hand, it immediately became smug and began to mock his opponent.","“Brat, you are too inferior.”","“No, no, not even 30% of Grandpa Dragon’s strength has been forced out.”","“Sigh, just hurry back and eat milk for a few more years before coming back.”","One after another, words of mockery came, and the Golden Generation’s face flushed bright red.","When had he ever seen such an opponent?","Just because you have the upper hand, so be it. What was the point of being so smug?","Moreover, you still haven’t won yet.","The little azure dragon didn’t care. His philosophy was not only to defeat you physically, but also to attack you spiritually.","The two of them battled fiercely. Though the Golden Generation kept unleashing his ultimate moves, the little azure dragon was not inferior either. It parried every move, and maintained its advantage firmly all this while, forcing the Golden Generation to admit defeat.","“Hahaha, too weak, really too weak.” The little azure dragon waved its hand, and said, “Is there anyone stronger? In a battle of equal cultivation levels, Grandpa Dragon will definitely beat the crap out of him!”","Everyone was extremely speechless.","You did not gain a crushing victory, so what need is there for you to be so proud? If it was really a life-and-death battle, it was not certain who would emerge victorious.","However, though the little azure dragon was arrogant, it was also incredibly cunning.","—A battle of equal cultivation levels!","He emphasized this point, and definitely had not been overwhelmed by victory.","He was a One Star Venerate, so if a Two Star or above Venerate were to defeat him, that would be an unjust victory.","They had never seen such a despicable person. He had said everything there was to say, and he had taken all kinds of advantages.","“Humph, this is a sparring match. It’s fine as long as the major tier is equivalent. How can you be so picky!” Another Golden Generation stepped out. He was Han Yun, from the Jade Drop Imperial Clan.","“If you can’t afford to play, then scram!” He moved directly, his large hand spreading out, turning into a monstrous demonic hand.","Three Star Venerate!","The little azure dragon didn’t dare to face him head-on, so it hurriedly used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to flee.","Against such an opponent, whether it was on the level of Regulations or power, the little azure dragon was at a clear disadvantage, and its opponent was the Golden Generation, so how rich was his battle experience?","The little azure dragon had no choice but to withdraw from the battle.","With a gap of two minor levels of cultivation level, he had really tried his best.","A hint of pride appeared on Han Yun’s face. This was the territory of the Imperial Clans. Was this a place where you could come and cause trouble?","“Alright, let’s continue.” He turned around and said to everyone with a smile.","Everyone chuckled as if they didn’t care about the little azure dragon.","On the mountain, the little azure dragon’s figure descended, and said angrily to Ling Han, “No, no, Grandpa Dragon wants to immediately return and cultivate in seclusion. I must catch up in cultivation level! If my cultivation level is the same, then that b@stard wouldn’t be qualified to act smug in front of Grandpa Dragon.”","He wasn’t exaggerating. In a battle at the same cultivation level, the Golden Generation was truly no match for him.","Ling Han nodded and said, “I’ll avenge you.”","“Go on!” The large black dog said, “Grandpa Dog will support you spiritually.”","“We have to snatch your wife back!”","“Charge!”","The large black dog and the others all egged him on.","Ling Han shook his head. These bad friends.","He smiled, and leaped towards the valley."]},{"number":4548,"title":"Chapter 4548: Sent flying with a smack","paragraphs":["Chapter 4548: Sent flying with a smack","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Another guy that is going to seek his own humiliation.”","“There are too many such people, there is no need to pay attention to them.”","“Yi!”","Seeing Ling Han leap down, many people thought that he would immediately be sent flying back. However, Ling Han didn’t seem to encounter any obstruction at all, and directly landed in the valley.","“F***, another show-off.” Someone was indignant.","“No, he doesn’t need to show off,” the person beside him said slowly.","...","“Why?”","“Because he is Ling Han!”","When the news spread out, everyone looked pleasantly surprised and expectant.","Wasn’t the reason why so many people had come here just to see Ling Han?","This was the publicly acknowledged number one prodigy of the past. Even the Golden Generation could only gape behind him.","However, this kind of young king tier had actually attracted the jealousy of the heavens, and was eternally trapped at the level of Sect Master. How could they not sigh in pity?","A great many people still did not believe that this was real, and wanted to witness it with their own eyes.","Was Ling Han still the Ling Han of the past?","“I never thought that he would really dare to come!”","“Just this courage alone is worthy of his title as the strongest king tier.”","Everyone was filled with anticipation. Would they be witnessing the fall of the king tier, or the return of the king tier?","“Ling Han, though you will forever withdraw from the stage of history, I have to say, you do have some courage,” an Imperial Son said.","Niu Zhengyang of the Demon Ox Imperial Clan, Silver Generation.","Since when did even the Silver Generation dare to shout in front of him?","Ling Han couldn’t help but chuckle. His cultivation level had only been temporarily restricted to the level of Sect Master, and his cultivation level hadn’t dropped. So, why did the Silver Generation think that they could act superior in front of him?","To say nothing of the fact that you are only Sect Master-level, even if you had advanced into Venerate Tier, Ling Han was confident that he would be able to defeat a large number of them.","“Scram!” Ling Han said calmly. There was not a sliver of anger in his voice, only indifference.","The Silver Generation didn’t even have the right to anger him now. If they found him annoying, he could just crush them to death. There was no need to waste time.","“You!” Niu Zhengyang pointed at Ling Han, veins popping on his face.","He, an Imperial Son, a Silver Generation elite, was actually berated and ignored like a wild dog!","“You are already a cripple, and you still dare to be arrogant?” he shouted loudly, and charged towards Ling Han.","It should be known that ever since Ling Han, Ding Shu, Yang Yihuan, and the others had beaten the Golden Generations to the grouns, the Imperial Clans had begun to rearm their Imperial Sons. The old Saints of their clan did not hesitate to sacrifice themselves, extracting the great dragon of their backbone for their descendants to refine.","Not only did the Golden Generation enjoy such a good thing, but even the Silver Generation enjoyed it.","Thus, he also possessed the backbone of a Saint. He would absorb Saintly Particles every day, strengthening his bones and greatly improving his defenses.","This was only the first step. If it took a little longer, when all the bones in his body were filled with Saintly Material, his blood and flesh would also absorb these particles, and further increase his strength.","This strike was imbued with saintly might, so who could block it?","For Imperial Sons like them, the appearance of Ling Han, Yang Yihuan and the others was actually a good thing, forcing the clan to spare no expense to nurture them.","Thus, he didn’t take Ling Han seriously now. Firstly, he was strong, and secondly, Ling Han was crippled, so he naturally looked down on him.","Boom! With a single strike, he completely ignored the massive damage that his attack would cause.","It was fine. Ling Han had already appeared, and the next step would be battle.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I told you to scram, yet you didn’t. You’re truly asking for a beating!”","Carelessly, he sent out a palm strike.","Everyone could clearly see that the attacks that Niu Zhengyang and Ling Han delivered each carried fourteen flashes of Regulations. In terms of Regulations, they were completely equal.","En, now it would depend on whose power was stronger.","“It must be Ling Han.”","“That’s right. He has cultivated Body Art as well. Furthermore, he is incredibly strong, far surpassing Imperial Son!”","Everyone nodded, thinking that since the Regulations were equal in number, then it must be Ling Han who would win.","Peng!","Their attacks collided, and as expected, Ling Han’s attack was like a hot knife through butter.","However, everyone was stunned. A great many people directly stood up.","How was this possible?","Ling Han indeed should be stronger, but in a situation when Regulations were equal, how could his advantage be so great?","With a single strike, Niu Zhengyang’s attack was crushed. This gap in strength was really too wide, wasn’t it?","The attack arrived at an incredibly fast speed.","Niu Zhengyang was instantly sent flying. Like a rolling gourd, he rolled several hundred meters on the ground before finally coming to a stop after crashing into a rock.","His body was riddled with wounds.","If it was not for the fact that a Saint Bone had been implanted into his body, he would definitely have died by now.","However, it was precisely because Ling Han had guessed that these Imperial Sons were presently implanting Saintly bones in their bodies, that he had been so heavy-handed.","He wanted to play slowly. How was he supposed to play if he scared them off all of a sudden?","Everyone was extremely confused.","How was this possible?","In a situation when Regulations were equal, even if Ling Han’s power had an absolute advantage, he shouldn’t have suppressed him so completely.","You see, Niu Zhengyang’s attack had been completely crushed, including the fifteen flashes of Regulations that he had shot out.","They were all six-star Regulations, and their numbers were also equal. How could such a one-sided situation possibly happen?","On the other side, Niu Zhengyang stood up with great difficulty. His face was filled with disbelief.","They were both Nine Star Sect Masters, yet he was actually no match for Ling Han?","He was a Silver Generation!","Were they still going to fight?","His heart was beating like a drum. If he chose to continue the battle, he had no confidence, but if he chose not to, previously, he had spoken so confidently, and now that he was afraid to fight, it was equivalent to slapping himself in the face.","After thinking for a long time, he still decided to battle.","Because Saintly bones had been implanted in his body, and because of Saintly Particles, from a certain aspect, he could release a sliver of saintly might. Thus, this was where his hopes of victory lay.","“Ling Han!” he shouted loudly, making a comeback.","Boom, another fourteen flashes of Regulations surged out.","Ling Han smiled, and flicked out a finger. This time, he had only shot out a mere ten Regulations.","However, the intertwining of his Regulations was like a tight rope.","Peng!","It was only a single strike, and Niu Zhengyang’s attack was broken through. The backlash from the attack exploded on his chest, cutting out a deep wound, revealing even the white of his bones.","There was complete silence!","This was too inconceivable.","10 Six Star Regulations had destroyed 14?","‘Are you joking?’","Everyone was dumbfounded, feeling that Ling Han’s freakishness had surpassed the truth of cultivation.","Even Ding Shu, Origin and the others were gaping widely, appearing to be in extreme disbelief.","This was completely unacceptable to them.","Something that was absolutely impossible had actually happened right in front of their eyes.","In history, there had indeed been weaker prodigies who had defeated stronger prodigies. However, it had never been heard that fewer Regulations could defeat more Regulations.","The heaven and earth were just. As long as they were of the same level, the higher number of Regulations would definitely be the victor. There was no doubt about it.","‘Why? Why?’","Niu Zhengyang trembled in fear. With the protection of his Saintly bones, he was temporarily safe from any danger to his life. However, faced with Ling Han’s inconceivable battle prowess, he was truly terrified. He couldn’t muster up the slightest bit of fighting spirit.","C"]},{"number":4549,"title":"Chapter 4549: A mere Sect Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 4549: A mere Sect Master","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han smiled faintly, “What is it? Not fighting anymore?”","Niu Zhengyang gritted his teeth, but still said, “I forfeit!”","He had no choice but to admit defeat. This opponent was too freakish.","He had lost!","Everyone sighed internally. Though Ling Han was going to be eternally trapped at the level of Sect Master, this person was really freakish. In battle prowess of the same cultivation level, Ling Han was definitely invincible. In fact, even if a Great Emperor came back to life, he may not be a match for him in a battle of equal cultivation levels.","This was because they had never heard of anyone being freakish enough to have their cultivation level sealed by heaven and earth, unable to advance any further.","...","However, this was a deliberate misdirection from the large black dog. Ling Han hadn’t been sealed by heaven and earth because he was freakish. Instead, it was because he had obtained the Destructive Energy.","“Humph!” A Golden Generation sneered, “Ling Han, don’t think that we don’t know that you have already cultivated a sliver of Seven Star Regulations!”","What!","Hearing these words, everyone was stunned.","Ling Han had actually cultivated a sliver of Seven Star Regulations?","It should be known that when there was a gap of a level between Regulations, that was an absolutely one-sided suppression.","Thus, even if Ling Han had only cultivated a sliver of the Seven Star Regulations, he was still able to crush the Six Star Regulations. It was unreasonable.","No wonder Niu Zhengyang had been horribly defeated just now. So that was the case.","Everyone came to a “sudden realization”. Actually, the logic was very simple.","No wonder Ling Han was envied by the heaven and earth. As it turned out, he had cultivated the Seven Star Regulations when he was only at the level of Sect Master. Who else would be imprisoned if not you?","Yet they were very wrong. The reason why Ling Han had cultivated a sliver of the Seven Star Regulations was because he had obtained enough Imperial Origin, allowing him to see even higher level Regulations in advance.","Ling Han looked towards this Golden Generation, and asked with a smile, “Do you want a battle?”","This Golden Generation was Yi Taishu of the Blood Flame Imperial Clan, a One Star Venerate.","His expression was filled with pride, “Do you know that I am a Venerate?”","“So what?” Ling Han was completely unconcerned.","“Haha!” Everyone laughed loudly.","So what?","Venerate Tier could crush Sect Master; this was the truth of martial arts.","No matter how freakish you were, so what if you had cultivated a sliver of Seven Star Regulations? He had cultivated the true Seven Star Regulations, and it was not just one.","Hence, this gap was indescribably wide.","In a head-on confrontation, Ling Han would definitely be killed with a single strike.","“You’re only being stubborn because you’ve mastered the True Phoenix’s movement technique,” Yi Taishu said calmly. “If you face my attack head-on, hoho, you’ll definitely die.”","Ling Han cracked a smile, “What if I don’t die?”","“Not die?” Yi Taishu shook his head resolutely, “Impossible!”","He wasn’t an ordinary Venerate, but rather a Golden Generation. His battle prowess was comparable to a seven or eight star ordinary Venerate. Just how overwhelming was this?","“Come, how about we make a bet?” Ling Han cracked a smile.","“As you wish.” Yi Taishu wasn’t in a rush to make a move. Ling Han had suppressed the Golden Generation too powerfully at that time, and had practically beaten the Golden Generation into a useless generation. Thus, he also wanted Ling Han to embarrass himself enough.","You want to make a bet, and you want to make a big deal out of it? Fine, go ahead.","“If I take a blow from you, you have to give me a portion of Eight Star Celestial Qi,” Ling Han said.","“Then what if you can’t withstand it?” Yi Taishu asked balefully.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Then I’m going to die. If I die, everything on me will be yours.”","“All right,” Yi Taishu nodded.","“Wait.” Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, “I haven’t finished yet. If I win, you only lose a streak of Celestial Qi. If I lose, I lose my life. This is unfair!”","“What are you going to do?” Yi Taishu asked patiently.","“Every time I parry a blow from you, you will lose to me a portion of Eight Star Celestial Qi,” Ling Han said with a smile. How could he miss out on such a good opportunity to screw others over?","Hehe, you’ve gone crazy from wanting Celestial Qi, haven’t you?","But do you have the life to take it?","“Agreed,” Yi Taishu agreed. It didn’t matter. Even if he couldn’t kill Ling Han with a single strike, Ling Han would definitely die with two more strikes.","A dead man, so what if he was given Celestial Qi?","Could the battle begin now?","“Wait!” However, right at this moment, another person spoke up.","Imperial Son Ming!","This was the most powerful Golden Generation. Years ago, he had been on the same level as Imperial Son Xuan and Imperial Son Tian. Now that Lin Xuan had died, it had become him and Imperial Son Tian that were the most outstanding. He was already a seven-star Venerate.","Hence, once he spoke, even Yi Taishu had to give him face, and looked towards him.","“Let’s add some more stakes,” Imperial Son Ming said. “Isn’t the Donglin Imperial Clan looking for a son-in-law? Let’s start from this battle. The victor... has the chance to become the son-in-law of the Donglin Imperial Clan.”","He didn’t dare to force an Imperial Clan to submit to him. Thus, even if one of them won, he would only have a chance. However, this was already enough, and it could give Ling Han immense pressure and humiliation.","If you lose, you will lose your beloved forever!","“Agreed.” An old Venerate from the Donglin Imperial Clan nodded in agreement.","“I disagree!” Chi Mengshan immediately shouted. “I only have one brother-in-law, and that is Ling Han!”","However, the moment these words left her mouth, she was suppressed, and could only moan in pain.","Chi Menghan, meanwhile, was sitting upright, completely expressionless.","“Since that’s the case, let’s begin,” Imperial Son Ming said.","Ding Shu, Origin and the others were all paying close attention. They knew Ling Han very well, and knew that since this guy had appeared, he must have a trump card up his sleeve.","But what exactly was it?","What kind of trump card could allow him to fill the gap in cultivation level of a major tier?","“Ling Han, do you have any last words?” Yi Taishu asked balefully. Boom! The Venerate Tier aura was completely unleashed, solidifying into waves that undulated in waves.","Ling Han smiled, and raised his hand, “Rise!”","Boom, an Earth Dragon instantly appeared out of thin air.","At this, everyone “understood”.","Ling Han was also a Formation Master, and a grandmaster at that.","However, was this really possible?","“Ignorance!” Yi Taishu charged over in large strides, and shot out a punch. Peng, the Earth Dragon was instantly blasted into bits.","Ling Han raised his hand again, and another Earth Dragon appeared.","Peng! However, Yi Taishu had only struck once again, and the Earth Dragon crumbled once more.","“Two servings of Celestial Qi, thanks for the business,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Yi Taishu was completely unconcerned. So what if you earned 10,000 portions? In the end, you would still become a corpse.","Boom, boom, boom! One after another, Earth Dragons appeared, but they were also blasted apart by Yi Taishu.","At this moment, Yi Taishu was only 30 meters away from Ling Han.","“Die!” He moved. Boom, a massive palm appeared out of thin air, and struck out at Ling Han. Three Seven Star Regulations floated.","His limit was eight flashes, but if it was suppressing a Sect Master, wouldn’t three flashes be enough?","Ling Han smiled, “Rise! Rise! Rise!”","Boom, this time, eighty Earth Dragons directly appeared.","Just how powerful and perfect was his Spiritual Power?","The heaven and earth had already given him no further prizes, so it could be said that Ling Han had already reached the pinnacle of this cultivation level.","Thus, he summoned 80 Earth Dragons in one go, each of which had the strength of a peak stage Nine Star Sect Master.","‘Holy f*ck!’","A muscle involuntarily twitched in Yi Taishu’s cheek. Why were there so many Earth Dragons?","Even if there were 10, 20, or even 30 of them, he would be able to easily defeat them, but 80?","This was really a little too much.","It was not that he was no match, but rather that he needed to exert some effort.","This... was a mere Sect Master so difficult to kill?"]},{"number":4550,"title":"Chapter 4550: Unsolvable","paragraphs":["Chapter 4550: Unsolvable","Editor: Henyee Translations","It was really difficult to kill him!","Yi Taishu unleashed his full power, launching a total of 11 attacks. Only then did he manage to eliminate all 80 Earth Dragons. However, with another wave of Ling Han’s hand, another 80 Earth Dragons appeared.","This... how was he supposed to play?","Yi Taishu attacked again, and the Earth Dragons rapidly decreased in number. However, it could not be helped that he was working very hard, but the moment Ling Han raised his hand, the Earth Dragons would regenerate, and it was really too easy for Ling Han.","The Venerate Tier-level power surged, causing massive damage to Xuanwu Planet. Even with Imperial Son Ming and the others protecting the area with all their might, this valley was soon razed to the ground.","It should be known that a Venerate Tier-level battle could destroy planets. If it was not for the fact that this place had been prepared beforehand, how could it have withstood such torment?","...","“70 portions of Celestial Qi, 80 portions of Celestial Qi.” Ling Han was still counting. His appearance was enough to make one vomit blood in fury.","F***!","Yi Taishu was extremely speechless.","Speaking of true battle prowess, he was a Venerate, so wouldn’t it be easy for him to kill a Sect Master?","However, it just so happened that Ling Han was actually a formations grandmaster, and his spiritual power was astonishingly strong. He could actually summon 80 Earth Dragons in one go, and even he had to expend some effort to kill them.","If this continued, how was he going to kill the enemy?","He had no choice but to consider a problem, and that was what if he really could not kill Ling Han?","Hiss, then how much Celestial Qi would he have to sacrifice? And it was Eight Star Celestial Qi at that!","This, even if it was only the number number, was enough to make the Blood Flame Imperial Clan go bankrupt, all right?","With this in mind, his attacks naturally became even more rapid. He wanted to defeat all the Earth Dragons as soon as possible, and deliver a fatal blow to Ling Han. However, when his attacks became faster, it was equivalent to speeding up the speed of delivering Celestial Qi to Ling Han.","“100 portions, 150 portions... Thank you, thank you.” Ling Han wore a sincere expression.","He was truly sincere. Who would be so insincere as to thank someone who had gifted them with over a hundred servings of Eight Star Celestial Qi?","There was none!","Yi Taishu roared loudly. His only chance of winning now was to exhaust Ling Han’s Spiritual Power, but looking at how Ling Han was moving with ease, it was very likely that his power would be exhausted first.","Formation Masters were pitifully few in number in the world, but once one had cultivated to Grandmaster-level, or even Saint-level, their battle prowess would also be astonishingly terrifying. One person was an army.","“Stop, stop, stop!” Ling Han shouted.","“The victor hasn’t been decided yet, so why did you call a halt?” Yi Taishu shouted. His expression was no longer as calm as before, and he was only flustered and exasperated.","Ling Han retorted, “Don’t you have any idea how many portions of Eight Star Celestial Qi you can take out?”","This!","Yi Taishu felt as if his chest had been ruthlessly stabbed. It hurt.","If this were a normal battle, it wouldn’t matter. They would just fight to the death. However, they still had a wager on this battle. Every time Ling Han blocked a move from him, he would have to pay a portion of Eight Star Celestial Qi as compensation.","If he counted the number now... it caused even his face to turn pale.","“You don’t dare to fight anymore?” Yi Taishu shouted.","Ling Han wagged his finger, “If you want a battle, fine, but please settle the tab first. My shop is small, so I can’t afford credit.”","Everyone’s expressions were strange. Did you f****** open a shop?","“I don’t have that much Celestial Qi!” Yi Taishu shouted.","To say nothing of him, even the whole Blood Flame Imperial Clan did not. In fact, even all the Imperial Clans added together didn’t.","Over a hundred portions of Eight Star Celestial Qi, not over a hundred portions of Celestial Qi.","Ling Han sighed and said, “If you’re poor, then don’t gamble. Why are you pretending to be rich?”","You!","Pu! Yi Taishu spluttered out a mouthful of blood. He had been angered to the point of spluttering.","“Brother-in-law is too awesome!” Chi Mengshan exclaimed excitedly, as she danced around.","Right, she was immediately suppressed again.","Chi Menghan, meanwhile, showed a smile. This was the man that she had her eye on!","“Ling Han, you’re relying on formations, so what ability do you have?” a Golden Generation shouted.","No one responded.","When facing an enemy, as long as they could win, what method could they not use? Was formations something to be ashamed of?","Of course not!","Thus, this was only him trying to twist the facts and cover up for the Golden Generation.","“Let me fight you!” A Venerate jumped out, but it was not a Golden Generation. In fact, he was not an Imperial Son, but rather a Dao Child that had just advanced into this level not too long ago.","Of course, he was much older, and had already exceeded 10,000 years old. However, among those at Venerate Tier, he could still be considered young.","Ling Han shook his head.","“What is it? Are you afraid?” This Venerate said. His name was Ma Bangye, and he was only a One Star Venerate.","Yi, though they were both One Star Venerates, how much stronger was the Golden Generation compared to the Dao Child?","Even Yi Taishu couldn’t deal with Ling Han, so what right did Ma Bangye have to jump out and challenge him?","“I’m only an ordinary One Star Venerate. What is it? You don’t even dare to battle me?” he said.","This was clearly belittling himself, and being able to make a Venerate do this, it was obvious that Ma Bangye was trying his best to curry the favor of the Imperial Clans.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “I already said that the shop is small, so I can’t afford credit. So, please pay off your debts first.”","F***, how could it possibly be cleared?","Over a hundred portions of Eight Star Celestial Qi!","But Ling Han looked like he wouldn’t start a fight unless the tab was settled, which made the Imperial Sons feel exasperated.","They had already announced to the whole world that as long as Ling Han dared to come, they would definitely give Ling Han a chance for a fair battle.","How could they go back on their word?","If they really broke their word, then the Imperial Clans would be completely humiliated. In fact, they would even be abandoned by the fortune of heaven and earth, and not a single Imperial Son would be able to become Emperor.","This was definitely not allowed.","But who asked them to be tricked by Ling Han? They were trapped in this kind of stalemate.","The Imperial Sons discussed for a while, and decided to collect funds together, gathering Celestial Qi for Ling Han.","With their command, a great many Imperial Clans channelled their power.","The members of the Golden Generation had all advanced to the Venerate Tier, and they were becoming more and more important in the clan. They were completely capable of making the clan work for them.","In just three days, a large amount of Celestial Qi was transported over.","“There are only 72 portions of Eight Star Celestial Qi. As for the rest, we’lll use the other grades of Celestial Qi to make up for it,” Imperial Son Ming said in a baleful voice.","It didn’t matter. Now, they would just have to let Ling Han feel proud. In any case, they would kill him when he returned, and they could still take back the Celestial Qi.","However, they couldn’t fall for this guy’s trick anymore. They couldn’t gamble with him anymore.","“Sure,” Ling Han said with a smile. He was extremely satisfied.","He had not expected that the trap that he had dug for Yi Taishu would actually allow him to reap such great rewards.","Not bad, not bad.","After collecting a large amount of Celestial Qi, Ling Han coughed, and said to Ma Bangye, “Now, you want to fight me?”","Everyone’s expressions were strange. Had Ling Han gotten addicted to swindling Celestial Qi? He still wanted to gamble?","Yet Ma Bangye smiled, “Sure.”","“Do you have Celestial Qi?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","Ma Bangye shook his head, “We won’t bet Celestial Qi... we bet our lives!”","They were betting their lives!","“If you win, my life will be yours. If you lose, your life will be mine!” Ma Bangye said balefully.","Everyone knew that Ma Bangye must have jumped out to curry the favour of the Imperial Clans, but the problem here was that you are only a One Star Venerate, so what right do you have to settle something that even Yi Taishu could not?","Ling Han smiled and said, “You’re a Venerate, yet you’re betting your life against a Sect Master like me?”","Was this fair?","This was practically a joke. The Venerate Tier could crush the Sect Master—of course, Ling Han was different. He was a Formations Grandmaster, and with the simultaneous appearance of 80 Earth Dragons, even Yi Taishu, who was a Golden Generation, couldn’t help but feel exasperated."]},{"number":4551,"title":"Chapter 4551: Shameless method","paragraphs":["Chapter 4551: Shameless method","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Though I am a Venerate, I am only an ordinary One Star, and you are a formations grandmaster. Furthermore, you are also the strongest Sect Master in history.” Ma Bangye deprecated himself, and praised Ling Han madly, “How about it? If you beat me, you can create history.”","Sect Master defeating Venerate Tier, something that had never happened in all of history!","Ling Han shook his head, and said with a smile, “Since you want to die, I’ll oblige you.”","“How truly arrogant!” Ma Bangye stood up and flew into the air.","That’s right!","Everyone instantly understood why Ma Bangye was so confident.","...","Fighting in midair, or even battling in space, would Ling Han still be able to extract Earth Qi?","Even if he could, how many times would it be weakened?","F***, a Venerate Tier was battling a Sect Master, and he still had to be so shameless?","Thus, none of the Imperial Sons made a move. Instead, they mobilized this Ma Bangye.","The label of shamelessness was naturally going to fall on his shoulders.","—The Imperial Sons needed a shameless person, and Ma Bangye wanted to depend on the Imperial Clans, so the two sides naturally hit it off.","Not good, Ling Han was going to be in big trouble!","Ling Han smiled and flew into the sky as well, arriving at the same level as Ma Bangye.","The people in the surroundings also arrived in the air, wanting to watch the battle from a close distance. However, they didn’t dare to come too close. After all, this was a battle between elites of Venerate Tier. If one’s cultivation level was slightly lower, even being swept by the aftermath would be fatal.","“When I became famous, who knows where you were!” Ma Bangye said, his face bearing a strong disdain, as well as an indescribable jealousy.","Just look at Ling Han. Perhaps he wasn’t even 200 years old, but his cultivation level was already at this level?","Nine Star Sect Master, only a line’s breadth away from him!","In fact, it could be said that if it was not for the jealousy of the heaven and earth, Ling Han would definitely be like Ding Shu, Origin and the others by now, long since surpassed the threshold of Venerate Tier, and reached Two Stars or Three Stars, surpassing him.","F***, he had worked hard for over 10,000 years to finally attain this kind of accomplishment, and Ling Han had attained it in just 200 years?","‘You’re not an Imperial Son!’","Ma Bangye was jealous, and glared hatefully at this opponent who was who knew how many times younger than him.","Ling Han merely smiled faintly. When he had been in Genesis World, he had also risen up strongly, causing who knew how many old monsters to be dumbfounded.","He had seen this kind of gaze many times.","“Come on.” He had no interest in speaking nonsense with this person, and crooked a finger at Ma Bangye.","“Die!” Ma Bangye roared loudly, and threw a punch. Boom, it turned into a black fist the size of a mountain, with three Seven Star Regulations entwined around it.","The might of this kind of attack was far inferior to Yi Taishu, but the crux of the matter was that Ma Bangye was shameless enough. He had more or less reached the borders of Xuanwu Planet. In this place, could Ling Han still extract Earth Qi?","Ling Han gave it a try, and discovered that his control over the ley lines was many times weaker. He could only summon three Earth Dragons, and they would need time to fly up from the ground. It was impossible for him to block this attack in time.","Everyone could see this clearly, and they all shook their heads.","True enough, this move had a firm hold on Ling Han’s weakness.","There was nothing else he could do.","Now, it was truly Sect Master versus Venerate Tier, and in terms of personal battle prowess, how could Ling Han compare to Venerate Tier?","“Ling Han is done for this time!”","“It can’t be helped. Who asked him not to quit while he was ahead? The Imperial Clans have already announced that they would not take the initiative to make a move on him at the banquet. If he insists on accepting the challenge, there is no one to blame.”","“Sigh, the former number one prodigy is about to die just like that!”","Everyone felt rueful.","Ling Han didn’t have the title of number one prodigy before. Compared to Yang Yihuan, Ding Shu, and the others, it was uncertain who was stronger. However, he was now envied by the heavens, and was actually locked at the level of Sect Master. It was because of this that he became publicly acknowledged as number one.","But now, the legend was about to come to an end.","Boom! Ma Bangye’s colossal fist shot over with crushing force.","What could he do?","Everyone was watching, their minds filled with thoughts.","Chi Menghan couldn’t help but clench her fists tightly, appearing extremely nervous.","“Sister, Brother-in-law will definitely be fine!” Chi Mengshan, on the other hand, was even more confident in Ling Han. For some reason, she was certain that nothing could stop Ling Han.","Chi Menghan didn’t say anything, and simply nodded.","Among these people, only the large black dog, the little azure dragon, and the perverted pig were confident. They really weren’t anxious at all.","Just how freakish was Ling Han?","Even the little azure dragon couldn’t beat him, all right?","This was a f****** Twelve Star Sect Master!","You guys should also experience the shock they had experienced in the past.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and tapped out a finger, greeting the massive fist that was flying towards him.","‘You... are you joking?’","Oh, he clearly knew that he was no match, so he had given up on himself?","It must be. Otherwise, no matter what, he would have struggled for a while.","Xiu, a ray of light shot out from Ling Han’s fingertip, and there were 30 flashes of Regulations entwined around it.","Of course, it was Six Star Regulations.","This streak of light landed on the gigantic fist, and immediately sank in.","However, the attack of the giant fist was not stopped, and landed solidly on Ling Han.","He was done for!","Sigh!","Everyone shook their heads. Though this was within everyone’s expectations, seeing a legend die with their own eyes still filled their hearts with feelings that they did not know how to describe.","Chi Menghan even stood up, her face ashen.","Boom! The colossal fist struck, yet it suddenly shattered into pieces.","What!","Everyone was once again incredibly stunned, because after the punch, Ling Han was still standing proudly in space.","Not the slightest bit of injury!","How was this possible?","Everyone felt their scalps go numb. Some of them were even trembling.","A Venerate had punched a Sect Master, and the Sect Master had taken it head-on. Yet, he was completely unscathed?","Heavens! Heavens! Heavens!","“Good job, brother-in-law!” Chi Mengshan immediately cheered, appearing extremely excited.","Chi Menghan also breathed a long sigh of relief. She slowly sat down, yet discovered that her back was completely drenched in sweat.","The Imperial Sons were all dumbfounded. Even Ding Shu and the others were surprised, appearing to be in disbelief.","The higher the cultivation level, the stronger the barrier to the cultivation level would be.","The difficulty level of battling above one’s cultivation level at Sect Master-level was 100 times, 1000 times more difficult than battling against a Core Formation Tier in the Cauldron Forging Tier!","It could be said that there has never been a Sect Master that could match a Venerate in history.","None! Definitely none!","But now, it seemed like Ling Han was going to rewrite history.","Ling Han was actually this powerful?","‘How the f*ck did you cultivate?’","F***, if you weren’t bound by the heaven and earth, just how freakish would you be?","Ma Bangye also couldn’t accept it at all. He exclaimed in shock, “How could you possibly take a blow from me?”","This attack had condensed the Seven Star Regulations, a single streak of which could crush any Six Star Regulations, so how could it possibly be blocked?","Ling Han smiled and said, “This is strength, right?”","Strength your sister!","There were so many Sect Masters in the world, so how could you be the only one capable of matching the strike of a Venerate?","“I don’t believe it!” Ma Bangye was flustered and exasperated. Although he said that Ling Han would be able to leave his name for eternity as long as he defeated him, that was only a teasing line. He had absolutely no intention of making himself a background to showcase Ling Han’s brilliance.","“Die!” He launched another attack. He delivered a palm strike, which turned into a piercingly cold light that slashed towards Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled, and tapped out another finger.","Peng, the cold light was instantly destroyed."]},{"number":4552,"title":"Chapter 4552: Attack","paragraphs":["Chapter 4552: Attack","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone could see this attack clearly.","Ling Han didn’t use any tricks. He simply and decisively blocked the attack.","However, it was also because of this that everyone was even more stunned, exclaiming in disbelief.","Ma Bangye’s attack had unleashed three flashes of Seven Star Regulations, and with the Seven Star Regulations as the blade, that was practically indestructible.","How could it possibly be dispersed by Six Star Regulations?","“You guys, did you guys see clearly? How many Six Star Regulations has Ling Han used?” someone suddenly asked in a trembling voice. He discovered that it was not just the fact that a Sect Master had dispersed the attack of a Venerate.","...","“That’s right, that number is terrifyingly great!”","“Thirty!”","Pu!","Everyone was once again numb with shock.","For a Sect Master, unleashing twenty Six Star Regulations with a single strike should be the upper limit, but what about Ling Han?","30 flashes!","F***, this was too terrifying.","No wonder he was bound by the heaven and earth. Otherwise, this guy would really defy the heavens.","“However, even if there are 30 Six Star Regulations, they shouldn’t be able to match the Seven Star Regulations!” someone said.","This gained the approval of the Venerates.","Because it was indeed impossible for Sect Master and above to deliver 30 Six Star Regulations with a single strike — of course, Ling Han was an exception — but Venerates could, and it was not like they had not done experiments before.","If the Six Star Regulations wanted to block the Seven Star Regulations, they would need a hundred times the number.","Only 100 Six Star Regulations could block one Seven Star Regulations.","“That’s right. To block three Seven Star Regulations, as many as three hundred Six Star Regulations are needed.”","“How could it be resolved with 30 flashes?”","When they thought of this, everyone was even more confused, and even more stunned.","Ma Bangye gritted his teeth. F*ck, he really wouldn’t become the first Venerate to be defeated by a Sect Master, right?","If that was the case, he would really be infamous for ten thousand years.","“You must have used some kind of secret technique. It is definitely impossible for you to maintain this state forever!” he shouted loudly, and once again launched a mad barrage of attacks at Ling Han.","Ling Han moved casually, interweaving Regulations extremely easily.","To say nothing of the fact that Ma Bangye could only unleash three Seven Star Regulations with a single strike, even someone as powerful as the little azure dragon was still blocked by Ling Han.","He was also trying to find out the reason why he could match Venerate Tier.","Of course, it was because the Six Star Regulations were intertwined with some kind of rhythm, but the question was why would this cause a qualitative change.","This had to be found in the midst of battle.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ma Bangye attacked fiercely, but no matter what he did, Ling Han was always able to easily block his attacks, and it was as if he still had some power left.","How was this possible?","You, a Sect Master, are battling against a Venerate, and you actually still have spare energy?","“This!”","“The number one freak in the world!”","“He really lives up to his name!”","“If anyone tells me otherwise, I’ll cut off my own head and hand it over to them.”","“Too bad, such a prodigy is actually stuck at the level of Sect Master. Otherwise, he really could have become a Great Emperor, invincible in the world.”","Hearing the discussions of the masses, the Imperial Sons, including Ding Shu and the others, all had slightly ugly expressions.","To become a Great Emperor, one needed not only talent, but also power.","Now that he had gained the upper hand, success would naturally follow.","The will of the people was a great support.","When everyone thought that you could do it, it would naturally produce a kind of power of will that would be boosted on your body. Whatever you do, it would be half the work and double the effect.","Another example was the Saint needed the power of belief. Not only could it ignite the holy flame, but it could also increase one’s battle prowess.","This was the will of the people, and also a kind of great support.","Why did the various great forces like to expand their territory? Wasn’t this all because of the will of the people?","In fact, Ling Han didn’t even need to expand his territory. He could easily do so. How many people in the universe admired him to the extreme?","Such a cripple!","The Imperial Sons all gritted their teeth. Previously, they had looked down on Ling Han as much as possible, because Ling Han had not occupied any territory, and could not reap any faith. Thus, no matter how freakish Ling Han was, he was still grassroots and had no background, and could not be compared to them.","But now... the people that Ling Han conquered were not just one city or one town, but the whole world.","This was the bearing of a true Great Emperor.","Go and take a look at history. Which Great Emperor hadn’t been renowned throughout the world when they were young, and won the admiration of the whole world, successfully completing the final leap?","—If these Imperial Sons knew that Ling Han still had a Genesis World in his body, with countless citizens, and the power of belief was practically endless, who knew what kind of expressions they would have.","Would they still feel superior?","To say nothing of them, Ma Bangye was really about to go crazy.","Why couldn’t Ling Han be killed?","With every additional strike, he felt as if someone had slapped his face, causing him great pain.","A dignified Venerate was actually unable to do anything against a Sect Master?","How could he endure this?","This was practically a great humiliation!","Why was Ling Han’s secret technique still channeling? Why hadn’t it stopped yet?","To be able to make a Sect Master so powerful, this secret technique should have expended an extremely great amount of energy. Why could it last for such a long time?","Ling Han laughed in spite of himself, “Don’t live in your own world, and be a frog at the bottom of a well.”","Hearing these words, everyone shook their heads.","There has only been one such freak like you in history, all right?","“I will definitely kill you!” Ma Bangye had already lost his composure, his eyes bloodshot.","“Humph, there is no animosity between you and I. In order to curry the favor of the Imperial Clans, you provoked me into battle, wanting to kill me.” Ling Han’s smile also disappeared, and his voice turned cold, “I have always distinguished between kindness and hatred. If others do not trifle with me, then no matter how weak they are, I will not make a move.”","“But whoever wants to bully me, then no matter how strong they are, I will still throw a punch!”","Boom!","He roared loudly, and no longer defended passively. Instead, it was his first time taking the initiative to attack.","As he threw a punch, 35 flashes of Regulations intertwined!","Gods!","Everyone was collectively petrified again. 35 flashes! F***, what had they seen?","Even though there were only five additional Regulations, the 35 Regulations intertwined with some kind of rhythm, unleashing a terrifying might.","Boom!","This attack could move heaven and earth.","How could Ma Bangye possibly retreat? He gritted his teeth, and also greeted Ling Han with a punch of his own.","Peng!","Light exploded from both their fists. That was Regulations, as well as power.","However, with a collision, Ma Bangye’s attack immediately crumbled. Ling Han controlled his fist, and like a hot knife through butter, arrived in front of Ma Bangye.","What!","Ma Bangye’s jaw dropped, and his pupils contracted, silently expressing his shock.","As it turned out, Ling Han was really at ease, and really still had spare energy.","He was done for.","He had not even finished this thought, when Ling Han’s fist had already ruthlessly smashed down, landing on Ma Bangye’s face.","Peng! Ma Bangye’s head was instantly obliterated.","His mind was shattered, and even gods couldn’t save him.","In space, Ling Han retracted his fist and stood proudly. Though the blood around him was pouring like rain, he was not touched in the slightest.","A Sect Master had killed a Venerate!","Everyone could only look up in admiration. This kind of magnificent feat would be recorded in the annals of history, and the extent of its terror was not inferior even to becoming a Great Emperor.","After all, a Great Emperor would appear once every era, but the feat of a Sect Master kiling a Venerate?","Throughout history, this was the first time."]},{"number":4553,"title":"Chapter 4553: Battle prowess fully unleashed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4553: Battle prowess fully unleashed","Editor: Henyee Translations","At this moment, the space was extremely silent.","Aside from shock, everyone’s minds were in a mess, completely blank.","Something unprecedented had actually happened right in front of their eyes.","The number one freak in the world, no, the number one freak in history.","“Ling Han!” an Imperial Son murmured. There was shock, fury, and an indescribable fear.","Compared to him, the Imperial Son was like a chicken.","...","Then, with a boom, the space was filled with madness.","A great many people had activated their connection devices, and were broadcasting live on Galaxy Network. The number of people watching was constantly soaring.","And when the scene of Ling Han killing Ma Bangye with a single punch appeared in practically every corner of the universe in real time, it also welcomed the greatest climax. It could be said that 99% of those who had a connection device cast their eyes over, but they were scattered in different livestream rooms.","“Heavens, how could there be such a freak?”","“He killed a Venerate, and it was an insta-kill at that!”","“Did you guys see that? He can unleash 35 Six Star Regulations with a single strike.”","“That’s right. Merely this fact is enough to go down in history.”","“Too bad!”","“Sigh, what a pity!”","“The more powerful he appears, the more of a pity it is.”","“He is eternally frozen at the level of Master. So what if he can defeat a low-level Venerate? Against a high-level Venerate, he’ll still be done for! Worse come to worst, even if he’s not inferior to a top-level Venerate, so what? When a Saint moves, he’ll be done for, right?”","“In this lifetime, there is no hope for me to possess Saint-level battle prowess, what more becoming a Great Emperor.”","“It can’t be helped. He’s too powerful, and the heavens envy him.”","The Galaxy Network was flooded with discussions about Ling Han.","By now, there was no doubt that Ling Han was freakishly strong, but at the same time, he was also envied by the heavens. The fact that he was envied by the heavens, and eternally stuck at Sect Master-level was also something that everyone knew, causing others to sigh with emotion and pity.","Otherwise, would there still be anyone in the world that could contend for the throne with Ling Han?","Who was worthy?","“Ling Han!” A Golden Generation cultivator suddenly shouted, “Your attacks are truly vicious. It’s only a sparring match, and you actually put someone to death!”","“For someone like you, the heaven and earth would not tolerate you!”","Boom, he immediately charged over, and shot out a palm strike. Shockingly, ten Seven Star Regulations shone brilliantly.","The Red Lotus Imperial Clan’s Tao Yu, a three-star Venerate!","Ling Han smirked coldly, “Now you guys don’t even want your face anymore?”","He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to dodge this attack.","“Die!” Since Tao Yu had moved, he would naturally throw caution to the wind, determined to get rid of Ling Han.","Though Ling Han had already eternally trapped at the level of Sect Master, the Imperial Sons had suffered too many losses at his hands. They definitely had to kill him to vent their anger.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Tao Yu was an Imperial Son, and was also a Golden Generation. His battle prowess was not something that Ma Bangye could match at all.","Ten streaks of Regulations surged, and even the Void was trembling, as if it was terrified.","Everyone shook their heads.","Ling Han was indeed freakish, but the fact that a Sect Master could use 35 Six Star Regulations was definitely his limit. Thus, how could he possibly match Tao Yu?","Although everyone didn’t quite understand, from the battle between Ling Han and Ma Bangye, they could roughly judge that Ling Han’s ten Six Star Regulations were capable of matching a Seven Star Regulations.","In that case, 35 Six Star Regulations would only be able to match four Seven Star Regulations, at most.","Right now, Tao Yu was unleashing 10 Seven Star Regulations with a single strike. This was naturally a crushing attack. It was no wonder that Ling Han didn’t dare to face this attack head-on.","“Ling Han, you’ve been trapped at the level of Sect Master forever. To you, this is endless torture. Why don’t you let me free you!” As Tao Yu attacked aggressively, he continued to attack Ling Han spiritually.","No matter how freakish you are, so what? You are already crippled.","Ling Han humphed, and shot out a punch, sending out a flash of fist light to greet Tao Yu’s attack.","Peng, this attack was naturally easily dispersed. However, everyone exploded in shock again.","What had they seen?","40 Regulations!","Heavens, 35 flashes of Regulations was actually still not Ling Han’s limit?","Just what kind of freak was this!","“That’s right. He is stuck eternally at Sect Master-level. How could the other Sect Masters in the world endure that?”","“En, in future, there should be an additional cultivation level added between Sect Master and Venerate Tier, and that would be Ling Han’s cultivation level.”","“Hiss, do you guys think that forty flashes of Regulations would still not be Ling Han’s limit?”","“Er, you’re overthinking things, aren’t you? 40 flashes, that’s already more than double the limit!”","“That’s right, but I still think...”","Whether it was those on the spot, or those watching through the Galaxy Network, everyone couldn’t help but think, was 40 flashes of Six Star Regulations Ling Han’s limit?","“You!” Tao Yu was so shocked that his eyes were fixed on Ling Han. He clearly knew that Ling Han would be eternally trapped at the level of the Sect Master, so what if Ling Han was freakish?","However, there were 40 six-star Regulations, so who wouldn’t be stunned for a long while at that?","“Again!” Ling Han said with a smile. He took the initiative to attack. This time... there were 50 Six Star Regulations.","‘Holy f*ck!’","The entire Galaxy Network instantly fell silent. At this moment, words could no longer express their shock.","There was only silence, and then reverence.","Tao Yu shot out an attack, and easily dispersed this punch from Ling Han. However, there was not the slightest bit of pride in his heart. In fact, there was a faint feeling of fear.","Was fifty the limit?","No!","Ling Han threw another punch, and this time, there were another ten Regulations.","Peng!","Just like before, this attack was easily dispersed, but next, Ling Han unleashed 70 Regulations.","Everyone had already gone blank with shock. At this moment, they should have been shouting and exclaiming to express their surprise, but no one could make a sound.","“Again!”","Eighty flashes!","Boom, in this clash, though Tao Yu had still dispersed Ling Han’s attack, it could be seen that the gap between the two of them was no longer as wide as the gap between heaven and earth.","Ling Han released a battle cry, and unleashed his ultimate battle prowess.","90 flashes!","This time, Ling Han didn’t launch any more long-distance attacks. Instead, he charged forward with his fists.","Peng, in the exchange of blows, Ling Han was instantly sent flying, but Tao Yu’s feet also hovered, and he took a few steps back.","‘Holy f*ck!’","They had almost come to a tie.","“No, no, no. At most, Ling Han’s attacks are only equivalent to nine Seven Star Regulations. He’s still inferior to Tao Yu.”","“However, this is too terrifying!”","Everyone regained the ability to speak, and were filled with anticipation. Would Ling Han be able to advance further, and blast out a hundred Six Star Regulations? In this way, he would definitely be able to truly stand against Tao Yu.","However, unleashing 90 Six Star Regulations in a single strike was indeed Ling Han’s limit. Next, though he attacked repeatedly, he was no longer able to increase the number of Regulations.","“Ninety.”","“It should be the limit.”","“For ordinary Sect Masters, Nine Stars would only allow them to grasp nine Regulations.”","“He has 90 flashes!”","“Heavens!”","This was definitely an achievement that had never been achieved before, and it was possible that it would never happen again.","Though it was already publicly acknowledged that Ling Han was the number one prodigy in history, and the strongest Sect Master, Ling Han himself had pushed this height to a few more levels, so that no one could even think of surpassing him.","The Imperial Sons, Ding Shu and the others were all astounded, especially Ding Shu and the others. They were all Lords of the Genesis World, and although there had been some gap between them before, how could there have been such a large gap?","Have you taken alchemical pills or cheated?"]},{"number":4554,"title":"Chapter 4554: Stronger and Stronger with Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 4554: Stronger and Stronger with Battle","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and attacked continuously.","Though he was indeed behind by “one star” in terms of Regulations, his physique was tough enough, and added with the high speed of Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he was completely qualified to fight Tao Yu.","Power was not the only factor that determined battle prowess, nor was Regulations.","However, it could not be denied that Tao Yu had the advantage of “one star” in terms of Regulations, so he did indeed have the advantage on the field.","After all, he was the Three Star Venerate, Golden Generation.","He had finally restrained Ling Han. Furthermore, it seemed like Ling Han could no longer increase the number of Regulations he possessed. This caused the other Imperial Sons to heave a sigh of relief.","...","Alright, this freakish performance had finally come to an end.","However, a Three Star Venerate of the Golden Generation was actually unable to take down a Sect Master, even after a long time. With every move that the battle dragged out for, the Imperial Sons would lose a bit of face.","This was really a slap to the face.","To Ling Han, this was already a supreme honour. Being able to do this as a Sect Master, that was enough to be proud of.","However, with how competitive Ling Han was, how could he be satisfied with just this?","He wanted to win!","However, in terms of Regulations, he was indeed “one star” weaker, and his power was also suppressed. His only advantage was his speed, but if he wanted to defeat a Golden Generation with mere speed?","Ling Han was extremely calm. He was looking for a solution on his own.","The reason why he could stand against a Venerate Tier was because the Regulations he had grasped were intertwined with some kind of rhythm, and he had been studying the reason since he had exchanged blows with the little azure dragon.","Why was it that when Regulations intertwined, their might could increase so greatly?","Now that the battle was so arduous, Ling Han had also pushed himself to his limits. The circulation of his brain had increased tenfold, or even a hundredfold, compared to its normal state.","“The reason why the might of my Regulations can be so strong, and even be comparable to Seven Stars when ten Regulations intertwine together, is because the Regulations are stimulating each other, causing their might to increase greatly.”","“Then, if I can further increase this kind of activation effect, would my battle prowess be able to increase further?”","Ling Han hadn’t intertwined the Regulations on his own volition. Instead, he had naturally become like this after breaking through to Ten Stars.","Now, he began to make changes.","However, with this change, his battle prowess instantly dropped drastically.","Peng!","Tao Yu’s attack sent Ling Han flying. The Regulations transformed into a sharp blade that ruthlessly slashed into his chest.","‘Ow, ow, ow!’","Ling Han bared his teeth, and when he lowered his head to look, a deep wound had appeared on his chest. Even his bones had a shallow wound.","It could not be helped. He had made a mistake in “activation”, and after slight adjustment, not only did the power of Regulations not improve, it had instead decreased considerably, causing him to be completely unable to block a single blow from Tao Yu, and his chest had almost been forcefully torn open.","No, he couldn’t make such attempts blindly. The intertwining of Regulations was extremely complex. If he could casually try it out, what Sect Master or Venerate would not do the same?","He channelled the Ten Cultivation Technique to control his injuries and heal them. On the other side, he continued to maintain the intertwining of Regulations as he exchanged blows with Tao Yu.","However, in his mind, he was presently performing a high-speed deduction, analyzing the profound secrets of the present intertwining Regulations. Using this as a blueprint, he would activate it again.","It was impossible for others to try it out, because Regulations itself was changing, so there was no limit to the number of times they could try it out. It was impossible to complete it just by copying.","However, Ling Han was different, because he had grasped the method of interweaving Regulations, so he could completely study it.","This was his greatest advantage.","Perhaps, this was the only intertwining technique, and it was impossible to increase its might further, but if he did not give it a try, with Ling Han’s personality, how could he give up?","The battle continued.","One day, two days, three days, and the two elites showed no signs of stopping the battle.","One did not want to lose, while the other was determined to win. Thus, the battle was naturally in a stalemate.","No one was impatient. Under normal circumstances, how could they have the chance to witness such a battle?","This was a Venerate Tier-level battle, and below Saint Tier, that was the strongest.","As long as one could fathom a sliver of the profound secrets, and gain the slightest bit of appreciation, that would be incredibly beneficial.","Even the Imperial Sons, Ding Shu and the others were observing Ling Han, investigating the secret of his intertwining Regulations.","—With their intelligence, how could it be that after such a long time, they still could not tell that the problem lay in Ling Han’s interweaving Regulations?","However, merely interweaving Regulations could actually increase battle prowess to such a terrifying extent. Who wouldn’t be tempted by this, wanting to investigate the profound secrets within, and turn it for their own use?","Thus, everyone hoped that the battle could continue until they could grasp the profound secrets.","Except for one person—Tao Yu.","As Ling Han’s opponent, he naturally wanted to deal with Ling Han as soon as possible. The longer this dragged on, the more humiliated he would be — though it was already very embarrassing.","“Die!”","He deliberately slowed down the rhythm of the battle. This naturally was not going easy on him, but rather he was accumulating Regulations.","Boom!","He launched another attack, and twelve Regulations appeared at the same time.","Xiu, Ling Han channeled the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight and easily dodged this attack.","Trying to trick him? Hehe.","A light suddenly flashed in Ling Han’s eyes.","He finally had appreciation.","‘Come!’","He threw a punch, and it was still ninety streaks of Regulations, but there was a slight change in the order in which they intertwined.","Peng!","In an exchange of blows, Ling Han was still sent flying, but Tao Yu’s expression changed drastically in shock.","That was because he had sensitively discovered that Ling Han’s battle prowess had actually increased by a sliver.","Though it was only a sliver, they had already gone all out, and the might of his ultimate battle prowess had still been increased by a sliver. Just how difficult was that?","However, because the extent of this increase was really too small, only an opponent like Tao Yu discovered it. In the eyes of others, this scene was very normal. Hadn’t Ling Han been sent flying again?","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. His efforts had not been in vain.","Again!","The more Regulations there were, the more intertwining changes there would be. Thus, there was also more room for improvement in battle prowess.","Ling Han had already found some clues. He threw punch after punch, and his battle prowess was steadily increasing.","Half a day passed, and everyone shockingly discovered that in terms of Regulations, Ling Han was no longer inferior to Tao Yu.","Right now, the only advantage that Tao Yu had was his power.","However, from the True Self Tier onwards, the effects of power would gradually decrease. Unless one was overwhelmingly powerful, the effects on one’s battle prowess would be very, very small.","Thus, this slight advantage was no longer enough for Tao Yu to gain the upper hand.","The two of them... fought to a tie.","Heavens!","Everyone stared at Ling Han as if they were looking at a monster. This was really... indescribable.","Ling Han threw a flurry of punches. He felt that he still had room for improvement. He still hadn’t unleashed the full might of the interweaving Regulations.","‘Come, let’s battle again. This battle is a good opportunity to become my whetstone.’","After battling for another day, Ling Han’s battle prowess had indeed increased another notch, and he now had an extremely slight advantage.","“Stop!” Imperial Son Ming spoke up, and moved directly, stopping the battle.","They couldn’t continue fighting, or Ling Han would become stronger and stronger.","This was a freak, and could not be judged with common sense."]},{"number":4555,"title":"Chapter 4555: Challenging the Peak","paragraphs":["Chapter 4555: Challenging the Peak","Editor: Henyee Translations","Even if everyone knew that Ling Han would be eternally trapped at the level of Sect Master, Imperial Son Ming still didn’t want Ling Han to become even stronger.","—The purpose of this banquet was to humiliate Ling Han, and not for him to show off his might.","Tao Yu stepped back angrily, his expression shifting continuously.","This was too humiliating. A dignified Three Star Venerate was actually unable to suppress a Sect Master. He was destined to become a joke for all eternity.","If Ling Han could become Emperor in the future, then he would at least feel slightly better. After all, he had lost to the future Great Emperor.","But the problem here was that Ling Han would be eternally trapped at the level of Sect Master, and that was the real fatal thing.","...","This was a great humiliation.","Ling Han stood with his hands clasped behind his back, and looked towards Imperial Son Ming, “What is it? Are you also going to ask for some guidance from me?”","Imperial Son Ming scoffed, “You are not worthy!”","He was a Seven Star Venerate, and judging by the battle prowess that Ling Han had displayed just now, he did have a crushing advantage. Thus, his words could not be considered an exaggeration.","Imperial Son Tian also spoke up, saying, “It’s about time. The martial arts feast this time should also come to an end.”","‘Yi, it ended just like that?","Hadn’t they agreed to humiliate Ling Han? Now? On the other hand, it was the Imperial Clans that had been severely humiliated by Ling Han.","The proud Imperial Sons were actually able to tolerate this?","This was practically... unimaginable!","Imperial Son Ming continued, “Didn’t the Donglin Imperial Clan say that they wanted to find a good partner for Fairy Chi? There are so many prodigies here, so there should be a few that can gain the attention of the Donglin Imperial Clan, right?”","Yi!","Why was this suddenly brought up?","That’s right!","Many people immediately nodded in agreement. Ling Han’s freakishness was far too terrifying. Even a Three Star Venerate of the Golden Generation was unable to suppress Ling Han. If they sent out a more powerful Golden Generation... so what if they won?","Everyone in the world could see it clearly through the Galaxy Network. That would only be a humiliation to the Imperial Clans.","However, back to the problem of Chi Menghan.","Could the Donglin Imperial Clan betroth the Imperial Daughter to Ling Han?","This was absolutely impossible!","So what if Ling Han was freakish? He was eternally trapped at the level of Sect Master, and even if you could match a Venerate, so what?","All the Golden Generation had the aptitude to even become a Saint. No matter how awesome Ling Han was, could he challenge a Saint?","Furthermore, Chi Menghan’s natural talent was astonishingly high. The husband she was looking for would definitely have a chance of breaking through to the imperial throne.","Thus, this had even less to do with Ling Han.","Hehe, to watch helplessly as his girlfriend was betrothed to another as his wife, what kind of blow was that?","This kind of face-slapping was the most painful.","“Hehe, just what I wanted.” An old Venerate from the Donglin Imperial Clan spoke up. He was the Imperial Son from the last era, and had long since cultivated to the level of nine stars. However, he could not advance any further, and had no chance of becoming a Saint.","His eyes swept over the gathered masses, then said calmly, “I am representing the Donglin Imperial Clan, and I hereby announce that the husband chosen for Chi Menghan is—”","“Brother-in-law!” Chi Mengshan immediately interjected. However, she was immediately suppressed again.","“Baili Tian!” the old Venerate from the Donglin Imperial Clan called out loudly. Even in the empty and silent universe, his voice still spread out in all directions under the influence of his power.","As expected!","Everyone nodded. Donglin Imperial Clan definitely wouldn’t choose Ling Han as their son-in-law. Ling Han was just a cripple, so even if he was the strongest Sect Master in history, what benefits could he bring to the Imperial Clan?","They had already produced a Great Emperor before, so would they still care about the title of the strongest Sect Master in history?","Shua, all of a sudden, everyone’s eyes turned towards Ling Han.","How would Ling Han... react?","If he didn’t move, then his woman would be snatched, and he still didn’t dare to make a sound. How big a blow would this be to his image? And if he exploded, hoho, wasn’t challenging Baili Tian akin to courting death?","No matter how they looked at it, this was a dilemma. It would either be an embarrassment or a loss of life.","From the moment Ling Han appeared, he had already fallen into a trap. He was destined to be stuck in a dilemma.","The difference lay in the fact that the Imperial Sons had wanted to defeat Ling Han previously, causing him to suffer a series of blows.","Everyone looked at Ling Han. This time, it was really difficult to deal with.","Would you show that you are a man now?","Meanwhile, Chi Menghan clenched her fists and shouted in her mind, “Don’t be rash! Don’t be rash!”","Her cultivation level had been sealed by the Saints of her clan, and she couldn’t even speak.","Under the expectant gazes of countless people, Ling Han smiled and said calmly, “You guys are all hoping for me to make a move, so I will satisfy your wishes! Baili Tian, you will know that even if you are a Seven Star Venerate, you still can’t do anything to me!”","Baili Tian humphed lowly, appearing extremely displeased.","The alliance with the Donglin Imperial Clan had actually been decided long ago, and had only been announced now. Thus, he was naturally not the slightest bit surprised.","However, being challenged by a Sect Master, even if it was part of the plan, he was still displeased.","“I, grant you death,” he stated calmly.","“Come!” Ling Han let out a battle cry, and took the initiative to charge out. Phoenix Wings Divine Flight unfolded, and his two flaming wings stretched out as long as thirty thousand meters.","Xiu, with just a flap, he had appeared in front of Baili Tian, and shot out a punch.","“You’re courting death!” Baili Tian casually blocked his attack. However, he was a Seven Star Venerate, and with a casual strike, fourteen Seven Star Regulations appeared.","Peng, Ling Han’s attack was undoubtedly dispersed.","Baili Tian took advantage of the opening to counterattack. He delivered a palm strike, possessing the power to destroy the heavens and earth.","He wasn’t far from igniting the holy flame, so his battle prowess was naturally boundlessly terrifying.","Ling Han didn’t face this attack head-on. This wasn’t Tao Yu, and there was a gulf of “five stars” between them. This was an absolute domination.","With a light flap of his flaming wings, he could come and go as he pleased.","Baili Tian’s attack missed, but he didn’t take it to heart. He simply said calmly, “Ling Han, since you’re challenging me, why do you still dodge and evade? How are you going to defeat me like this?”","Ling Han didn’t say anything. He simply leaped forward and threw a punch.","He had been tricked!","Everyone shook their heads. This was obviously provocation. Why had Ling Han fallen for it so easily?","Baili Tian bared his teeth in a grin, and also threw a punch.","Weng!","His punch arrived, yet a tower suddenly appeared in front of Ling Han, completely enshrouding him.","Thus, this punch naturally landed on the body of the tower. Instantly, he felt like an ordinary person that had punched an iron plate, and a sharp pain came from his fist.","F***, what was this?","He had not even finished this thought, when he saw that the tower had already disappeared. Though Ling Han had been sent backwards several hundred meters, this little distance was nothing to him. He threw another punch.","In a rush, Baili Tian could only just barely manage to parry, and set up nine Seven Star Regulations.","Peng!","Ling Han threw a punch, but it only broke through the defenses of Baili Tian, and his attack was also powerless to continue.","After all, the gap between their cultivation levels was far too large.","Even so, everyone was still stunned. Ling Han was just a tiny bit away from threatening Baili Tian.","“Origin Gold!” Baili Tian’s eyes swept over it, and he already understood.","Only the Saintly Material and the Origin Gold could cause him to feel as if his bones were about to break from the force of the punch. Moreover, it wasn’t as if he hadn’t seen the Imperial Weapon before, so he naturally recognized it immediately."]},{"number":4556,"title":"Chapter 4556: Saint Tool appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4556: Saint Tool appears","Editor: Henyee Translations","What, Origin Gold!","Everyone’s eyes were focused on Ling Han. The tower that had flashed past just now was forged from Origin Gold?","No wonder he could block Baili Tian’s attack.","Hiss, was this guy really the Son of Destiny?","What Great Emperor hadn’t obtained the Origin Gold after achieving Dao and forged it into an Imperial Weapon? However, what about Ling Han? He had actually obtained it when he was only a Sect Master.","Too bad, too bad. If it was not for the fact that this guy was too outstanding, and was envied by the heavens, who would be able to compete with him for the throne?","...","—His battle prowess at the same cultivation level was unparalleled, and he also had a Pseudo-Imperial Weapon in hand. If he didn’t become Emperor, who would be qualified to become Emperor!","“Do you think that just because you have a Pseudo-Imperial Weapon, you can stop me?” Baili Tian asked calmly, but there was a sliver of heat in his eyes.","Ling Han had even taken out the Pseudo-Imperial Weapon, which meant that he really had used all his trump cards, and his battle prowess had already reached peak stage.","Since he now knew Ling Han’s true limits, wouldn’t it be easy to deal with him?","And after killing Ling Han, the Origin Gold would naturally belong to him.","This was destiny!","Ling Han also smiled faintly, “Go ahead and try!”","His words were filled with confidence.","Many people’s emotions were instantly ignited, and they actually felt an urge to roar in excitement.","“Die!” Baili Tian was extremely calm. With a leap, he charged towards Ling Han and delivered a palm strike. Fourteen Seven Star Regulations dazzled, turning into a God Tool that slashed towards Ling Han.","Kuang!","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower appeared in time to block this attack.","So what if it was the Seven Star Regulations? Could it hurt Origin Gold in the slightest?","However, Baili Tian still had an advantage in power, after all. Although the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower blocked the attack, it was also sent flying.","At this moment, Ling Han put away the Origin Gold, and replied with a punch of his own.","“I was just waiting for you!” Baili Tian sneered, and delivered another palm strike. Shua, fourteen Seven Star Regulations flashed again.","After having attacked so suddenly, he still wanted to trick him?","Who did they think the Golden Generation was?","Ling Han chuckled, and the power of his fist burst forth, turning into a ball of blazing light that continued to blast towards Baili Tian.","Peng!","Their attacks collided head-on, and there was a temporary stalemate. Then, Ling Han’s Regulations began to break. After all, the gap between them was too wide.","However, Baili Tian’s Regulations were actually melting as well!","When Ling Han’s attack was easily destroyed, Baili Tian’s attack was also shattered. Its might declined by who knew how many times, and when it hit Ling Han, it was completely insufficient to pose a threat.","This!","Everyone was numb with shock. In this blow, Ling Han did not rely on the Pseudo-Imperial Weapon, but rather a display of his own strength.","That black light!","There was no shortage of smart people here. They immediately recalled that when Ling Han had delivered that attack, the Regulations were still wrapped in a layer of black light, like flames, but darker than darkness itself.","Was it this thing that had corroded Baili Tian’s Regulations?","If that was not the case, what else could it be?","However, what light was so terrifying that it could melt even Seven Star Regulations?","Ding Shu, Heaven Crushing, Jing Haoran, and the others all wore solemn expressions. They had all mastered the Destructive Energy, but they knew very well that the destructive power of Destructive Energy that they had unleashed was far from being as powerful as this.","“Complete form!”","They exchanged a glance, and saw the same message in each other’s eyes.","Ling Han had actually grasped the complete power of Destructive Energy. No wonder it was so powerful.","They couldn’t help but be filled with anticipation. The unique trait of Destructive Energy was its terrifying destructive ability. Theoretically speaking, it could destroy anything. In fact, it even allowed Ling Han to compensate for the gap of a whole “five stars”.","If they could also obtain the full Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy, they would naturally be as powerful as well, and their battle prowess would soar to another level.","Baili Tian was extremely shocked. As the person involved, he knew better than anyone else just how terrifying Destructive Energy was.","That was practically unreasonable destruction. So what if he had the advantage in Regulations? Seven Star Regulations was still easily destroyed.","He had a feeling that this was still because Ling Han’s cultivation level was too low. If Ling Han was also a Venerate Tier, it was very likely that his attack would strike over and destroy him as well.","No wonder he was envied by the heaven and earth, that they had eternally imprisoned him at Sect Master-level!","The existence of this kind of person had completely broken the balance.","“Die!” His expression was cold, and he charged out again, but it was unknown how many times more careful he was.","That black energy possessed the ability to wound or even kill him — it should be known that after advancing into Venerate Tier, the Substitution Seal was no longer effective.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them exchanged blows. Whether it was Regulations or power, Ling Han was at a far disadvantage, but with Destructive Energy being capable of destroying anything and everything, he forcibly withstood it.","This caused everyone to have no choice but to bow in admiration.","It should be known that Baili Tian was already a Seven Star Venerate Tier elite, and was also a Golden Generation. Thus, his battle prowess practically represented the peak stage of Venerate Tier, but Ling Han, as a Sect Master, was actually capable of matching him!","This was really a huge gap of a whole major tier in cultivation level.","The greatest miracle in history.","Even the old Venerate from the Donglin Imperial Clan felt that it was a pity. If Ling Han hadn’t been crippled, he would definitely have been the only option for the Donglin Imperial Clan.","Unfortunately, even if you could defeat Venerate Tier elites, you would never be able to step into Saint-level battle prowess in this lifetime, and have no hope of becoming Emperor. Then, there was nothing that could be done. You would not be qualified to marry Chi Menghan.","Of course, if Ling Han was willing to marry into the Donglin Imperial Clan, the Donglin Imperial Clan would still be willing to choose one of their clan members to be betrothed to Ling Han. After all, Ling Han’s descendants would have the effect of perfecting the Chi Clan’s bloodline.","Boom!","As his thoughts flew, Ling Han and Baili Tian exchanged several dozen moves. The shockwaves from the battle swept out, forcing even the Sect Masters to retreat, not daring to be touched even once.","Whether it was the Seven Star Regulations or the Destructive Energy, their destructive power was too great. Insta-killing a Sect Master was no issue.","As time passed, Baili Tian couldn’t maintain his composure any longer.","He, a dignified seven-star Venerate Tier elite, was practically standing at the peak stage of Venerate Tier, and furthermore, he was a Golden Generation elite. After so long, he was actually still unable to do anything to a Sect Master?","Moreover, this was being broadcast live by Galaxy Network!","He humphed, and also took out the Spirit Tool.","Before this, he disdained from doing this at all, thinking that it was demeaning himself, but now, he couldn’t care less.","Defeating Ling Han was his top priority!","This was a saber, and not a replica of the Ziwei Imperial Clan’s Imperial Weapon. However, the saber’s blade was as red as blood, yet it exuded a terrifying aura that would cause one’s heart to palpitate.","It was as if heaven and earth would be split into two if the saber moved.","This was... a Saint Tool!","F***, Baili Tian actually had a Saint Tool on him?","Upon further thought, he was already a Venerate Tier, and was only a step away from becoming a Saint by igniting the holy flame. Furthermore, the Golden Generation had already surpassed ordinary people in the first place. Thus, even if the Saint Tool couldn’t unleash its full might in his hands, one percent should be enough, right?","When the Saint moved, he only had to release a tiny bit of his aura, and it would be enough to completely destroy the soul and body of a Venerate Tier.","In an instant, everyone hurriedly turned around and fled. Once the Saint Tool unleashed its might, those at close range would all become cannon fodder.","Who wanted to die?","Ling Han also tensed at this. This was a Saint Tool! This was a little difficult to deal with."]},{"number":4557,"title":"Chapter 4557: I Have a Beast Pet","paragraphs":["Chapter 4557: I Have a Beast Pet","Editor: Henyee Translations","Who would have thought that dealing with a Sect Master like Ling Han would not only require a Venerate Tier, but also a Saint Tool?","Merely with this accomplishment, Ling Han could look down on all past and present.","However, how was he going to pass this test?","Baili Tian humphed, his right hand holding onto the hilt of the saber. As his aura surged, hong, the whole bloody saber was glowing, its bright red colour seeming to turn into blood that was about to drip from it.","The Saint Tool was about to be unleashed.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “Since you’ve even mobilized the Saint Tool, I’m also going to summon my pet beast to help.”","...","Yi, Ling Han was actually a beast tamer?","Everyone was surprised. They had never heard of it.","Ling Han took out the Great Emperor Horn and blew it, instantly reducing his spiritual power by a significant amount. Meanwhile, those near and far were all howling uncontrollably at the sky—except for the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters. Xiu! A shadow streaked over from the distance.","This was... the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan’s Golden Generation, Di Qingyun.","Yi, why had he come out?","Just when everyone was at a loss and confused, they saw that Di Qingyun had actually returned to his original form.","—A silver wolf that was as tall as nine meters.","He was standing right next to Ling Han’s feet, rubbing his head against Ling Han’s ankle, looking completely like a pet dog.","“Sigh, how embarrassing for a dog!” In the distance, the large black dog deliberately said. However, he couldn’t hide his mischievous grin.","F***!","Who could have imagined that this would happen?","Everyone only felt that this was extremely bizarre, their eyes wide, not knowing what kind of reaction they should have.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Come!”","“Ao!” Di Qingyun also howled at Baili Tian, his ferocious nature on full display.","Baili Tian instantly felt a headache coming on.","What was going on here? Why was Di Qingyun helping Ling Han? This was completely illogical. Moreover, if he wanted to help, so be it. Why did he have to take the form of a wolf? Did he really think of himself as a pet beast?","At this moment, Baili Tian’s heart was filled with complaints, and he didn’t know where to start complaining.","“Go!” Ling Han pointed a finger, and Di Qingyun immediately pounced out.","“Brother Di!” Baili Tian leaped out to dodge. His strength was superior to Di Qingyun, so he could easily defend and not attack. “Do you have some weakness in that brat’s hands?”","How could he have possibly imagined that there would be something as amazing as the Great Emperor’s horn in this world? Furthermore, Imperial Sons like them all had treasures that had been forged by the Great Emperor, which could block all negative effects.","How could it be that when it came to the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan, it would no longer be effective?","Thus, Di Qingyun must have had some kind of weakness in Ling Han’s hands, and was forced to participate in the battle. Just look, he had appeared in the form of a wolf, because he really had no face to see others.","Di Qingyun was also very depressed. He could not control himself at all, all right?","“Ao! Ao! Ao!” He pounced and bit continuously, looking completely like a wolf.","Baili Tian decided to ignore Di Qingyun and directly target Ling Han instead.","As long as he killed Ling Han, everything would be resolved.","He focused, and once again activated the Saint Tool.","Xiu, at this moment, Di Qingyun suddenly stood in front of Ling Han.","F***, how could he be so shameless?","Baili Tian definitely couldn’t deliver this strike. If he killed Di Qingyun, then no matter what the reason was, the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan and Ziwei Imperial Clan would definitely become mortal enemies.","At present, the Netherworld was invading. At such a crucial time, if the two great Imperial Clans fell out... hoho, the consequences would be unthinkable.","Thus, Ling Han was far too despicable and shameless.","He was actually using Di Qingyun as a shield!","“One can’t be too shameless!” Baili Tian said through gritted teeth.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, saying, “You’re a seven-star Venerate Tier elite with a Saint Tool in hand, and you’re talking about shamelessness to me? Tsk, tsk!”","Who was the shameless one?","Baili Tian was instantly rendered speechless. In this battle, he had already taken full advantage of Ling Han, so what right did he have to say that Ling Han was shameless?","If anyone was truly shameless, it was him, all right?","But the problem was, how were they supposed to fight like this?","Ling Han cracked a smile, “You’re not going to fight anymore, right? All right then, it can be considered a tie!”","A tie?","Everyone thought for a moment. Indeed, putting aside the Saint Tool and Pseudo-Imperial Weapon, Ling had indeed not been at a disadvantage at all when Ling Han had previously clashed with Baili Tian. Thus, calling it a tie was not a boast at all.","Baili Tian didn’t say anything. Di Qingyun’s sudden “betrayal” caught him off guard, and he was completely flustered.","“Menghan!” Ling Han looked in Chi Menghan’s direction, and suddenly called out loudly, “Wait for me. It won’t be long before I go to the Donglin Imperial Clan to pick you up!”","Chi Menghan couldn’t speak, yet she kept nodding, excitement on her pretty face.","“Brother-in-law is so handsome!” Chi Mengshan’s eyes were dazed, her arms crossed over her chest, looking like a fangirl.","This scene made everyone feel rueful. They kept feeling that there was suddenly something green and lush above Baili Tian’s head1.","Baili Tian’s hands were also tightly clenched. This was a kind of betrayal!","“You all—” Ling Han swept an eye over the Imperial Sons, “Just you wait as well. Not too long after, I will return, and hang you all up for a beating!”","After saying this, he directly tore a rip into space and left.","All the Imperial Sons were furious. You, a cripple, actually dare to be so arrogant?","But in full public, it would not be proper for them to pursue.","Previously, the Imperial Clans had already announced that as long as Ling Han dared to come, it was guaranteed that they would not make a move on him. If they pursued him now, would the Imperial Clans still have any face?","Especially at a time when Yin souls were invading, how damaging would that be to morale?","However, Ling Han was already a cripple anyway, so it was impossible for him to break through to the Fourth Extreme. Thus, they decided to let him be smug for a while longer.","Afterwards, Ling Han could only watch helplessly as the Imperial Sons became Saints, one after another, and could only watch as the woman he loved was married to another.","Ling Han could only forcefully swallow this kind of bitterness.","Thus, it was better to let him live.","The Imperial Sons could only console themselves like this.","To the others, however, this was a good show of how the Imperial Sons had been humiliated.","Striking at Ling Han?","Haha, it had only fulfilled the fame of being the strongest Sect Master in history. Even if Ling Han was really stuck at Sect Master-level forever, he could still leave a mark in history that would last for a hundred lifetimes, and the legend would not be destroyed.","And as for the Imperial Sons?","Without becoming Emperor, one would ultimately be annihilated in the long passage of history.","Just ask, with so many Saints originating from the Imperial Clans, just how many people could actually remember who they were?","Without becoming Emperor, it would ultimately be all for naught.","Once Ling Han left, the large black dog, little azure dragon and pervert pig naturally tore a rip into space and left as well.","A dozen over days later, Ling Han and the others had returned home.","Ling Han immediately began to concoct alchemical pills. Having obtained so much Celestial Qi, what kind of gain was this?","He was rich!","He hadn’t refined all of the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pills; he had also concoted a portion of Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pills. He had distributed some to the large black dog and the others, as well as some for Brother Monkey.","Sigh, so even though there were many Celestial Qi, including those around him, it was actually... still not enough.","Good steel naturally had to be used on the cutting edge. Thus, as much as possible, the Celestial Qi would be used on Ling Han and Brother Monkey. They represented the strongest battle prowess of Ling Han’s faction, and as long as Ling Han or Brother Monkey became Emperor, they would naturally have as much Celestial Qi as they could want.","—The Imperial Clans were already able to extract Celestial Qi, what more the Great Emperor."]},{"number":4558,"title":"Chapter 4558: Meat-Devouring Xianzhi","paragraphs":["Chapter 4558: Meat-Devouring Xianzhi","Editor: Henyee Translations","As Ling Han concocted alchemical pills, he also took some time to ingest and refine them.","Three months later, he had also refined a large amount of Celestial Qi, pushing his cultivation level to the peak stage of Twelve Stars.","Break through!","This was completely no problem for Ling Han. Not too long after, he had advanced into Thirteen Stars.","After breaking through, Ling Han actually had no intention of trying to rip open the black chains at all. By this time, his mindset had already changed.","He saw these black chains as an opportunity. He wanted to see how many stars he could reach.","...","Fifteen? Or twenty?","In short, he would charge as high as he could, because this was truly improving his battle prowess.","If he became a Venerate, what Venerate Tier would be able to match him?","If he became a Saint, what Saint would not bow their head in submission?","If he became Emperor, through the ages, what Great Emperor could compare to him?","If he was going to do it, he was going to be the strongest!","Ling Han continued to concoct alchemical pills, and continued to ingest alchemical pills, pushing his cultivation level up.","However, after arriving at Thirteen Stars, it was as if he had also advanced into Four Star Venerate Tier. The amount of Celestial Qi needed for every step forward was really too much.","Six months had passed, and he had actually still not cultivated to the peak stage of Thirteen Stars. He was like a bottomless pit.","At this time, Brother Monkey returned.","“Brother Monkey, you’re injured?” Ling Han hurriedly rushed out to receive him. The large black dog and the others also came over.","There were obvious wounds on Brother Monkey’s body. Although he wasn’t bleeding, the wounds were very deep and a little shocking.","“It’s fine,” Brother Monkey said calmly.","He took out something and handed it over to Ling Han. It looked like a piece of meat jelly, and was completely grey in colour. It was only the size of a fist, and was extremely elastic.","“Unfortunately, I didn’t find any top-grade Great Herb,” Brother Monkey said. “There’s only this.”","“What is this?” Ling Han asked.","“Amongst Celestial medicines, it can be considered quite peculiar,” Brother Monkey said. “This is Meat-Devouring Xianzhi. Though it does not increase one’s cultivation level, it can increase one’s power of masculinity. Furthermore, after ingesting it for a year, no matter how high one’s cultivation level is, one would definitely be able to have children.”","F***, there was such a strange Celestial medicine?","Instantly, the eyes of the large black dog, the little azure dragon, and the pervert pig all lit up.","It had to be said that though this Celestial medicine was strange, it was guaranteed that even Saints would want it.","Why?","It guaranteed that one could have children.","It should be known that the higher one’s cultivation level was, the more difficult it would be for them to bear offspring, as if they had been cursed by the heaven and earth.","This was especially the case for Saints. Perhaps they had given birth to descendants when they were young, but how long could Saints live for? As long as they had lived for hundreds of thousands of years, their son, and possibly great-great-grandson, would have already died.","Though it was possible that they would have descendants, they were definitely incomparable to his own son and daughter.","Thus, how tempting would it be to have another son in old age?","“It’s better to give it to Grandpa Dog.” The large black dog was completely shameless, and stretched out a paw, “It’s about time that Grandpa Dog left behind a child.”","“Forget about it. Your descendant would definitely be shameless and extremely despicable, so it’s best not to harm others.” The little azure dragon immediately said, “You should give it to Grandpa Dragon. The lineage of the True Dragon is only left with Grandpa Dragon.”","“Get lost, you are just a little brat!” The large black dog immediately undermined him.","“Give this old pig!” It was rare for the perverted pig to speak human language. He stretched out his hoof, “Enhance masculinity! Enhance masculinity!”","It didn’t care whether it could definitely have children or not, but felt that the aphrodisiac-strengthening function was too useful.","“It’s to increase one’s power of masculinity. Who told you that it could boost one’s masculinity?” the large black dog and the little azure dragon rebuked at the same time.","“Enhancing masculinity and increasing the power of masculinity, isn’t it the same?” The pervert pig spread out his hooves.","“Get lost, perverted pig!” The large black dog shot out a leg and kicked the perverted pig away.","Meanwhile, the perverted pig sighed, “Everyone wants to do the same thing, but why does it become lecherous when this old pig says it?”","It was very confused.","Meanwhile, Ling Han stuffed the Meat-Devouring Xianzhi into Brother Monkey’s hands, and said, “Brother Monkey, I have long since had a large number of children and grandchildren, but you still have no children. You had best hurry up and give me a nephew.”","Brother Monkey shook his head, “Old Sun only has battle in my heart!”","Having children or whatnot was simply a waste of time.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “If Brother Monkey meets the right person one day, you won’t think like this.”","He thought for a moment, then said, “I’ll take care of this Meat-Devouring Xianzhi first. When Brother Monkey needs it, I’ll give it to you.”","The large black dog and the others all shook their heads upon seeing Ling Han put away the Meat-Devouring Xianzhi. They clearly needed it.","“Enhance masculinity!” the pervert pig said from the sidelines.","“Scram!” Everyone shot out a kick, and sent it flying into space, instantly turning into a little star.","Ling Han continued to cultivate, mulling over his own path of cultivation. At the same time, he continued to concoct alchemical pills. There was still a large amount of Celestial Qi that he hadn’t refined yet. They were all below eight stars.","On the Galaxy Network, there was a wave of fervent discussions about Ling Han.","—He could unleash 90 Six Star Regulations with a single strike.","—With the cultivation level of Sect Master, he clashed against a Seven Star Venerate of the Golden Generation.","—A Pseudo-Imperial Weapon.","Every single one of them was shocking enough, what more when they were all concentrated on one person.","However, no matter how shocking these matters were, they would still be gradually forgotten with time.","Ling Han was indeed freakish. However, his cultivation level was eternally restricted to the level of Sect Master, and he would never hope to reach the level of Venerate Tier. No matter what, there would be a limit to his battle prowess.","Hence, that was all he would amount to be.","Right now, there was still more discussions about the Golden Generation on the Galaxy Network. Of course, there was also mention of such rising stars like Ding Shu, Origin and the others. As for Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling and the like, it was as if they had vanished into thin air, and there was no more news about them.","After the Yin souls delayed their attack for a while, it began to launch fierce attacks again, causing the battle line to become anxious again.","Ling Han, the large black dog and the others once again rushed to the front lines.","This time, the battle lines had become extremely long. Hence, in the vast universe, Yin souls could be resisted anywhere.","This was a good opportunity to reap the rewards of heaven and earth!","The Imperial Clan Alliance was still present, and one could still use their battle merits to redeem treasures. However, this time, Ling Han was no longer wearing that thing.","That was because the Imperial Clans had only arranged for a single redemption point on Ma Lang Planet, and there was a Saint standing guard.","If Ling Han wanted to redeem, the possibility of his identity being exposed was extremely high.","Moreover, the possibility that the scoring device had been tampered with was also very high. What if this caused trouble?","In any case, exchanging treasures with the Imperial Clans was only adding icing on the cake. The rewards from the heaven and earth were the largest.","Ling Han and the others entered into battle, taking advantage of this opportunity to rapidly increase their cultivation level.","After killing for three months, Ling Han had reached the peak stage of Thirteen Stars.","He began to attempt breaking through to Fourteen Stars. However, this time, it was incredibly difficult.","It was as if he had already reached the end, and taking another step forwards would be filled with difficulties. Though he had still succeeded in the end, his life force had been weakened slightly.","“Hiss!”","He gritted his teeth. If every time he broke through the next star level in the future, he would be struck like this, then he would not dare to take a few more hits. Furthermore, if the difficulty level was slightly higher, he really would not be able to cross over.","Human power was limited at times, and it was not something that could be done with determination. Objective facts would not disappear just because of subjective effort.","Fight again!","Another month later, the Yin souls suddenly pulled back the battle line.","Yi, what was going on?"]},{"number":4559,"title":"Chapter 4559: Skeleton Saint Tool","paragraphs":["Chapter 4559: Skeleton Saint Tool","Editor: Henyee Translations","What was surprising was that the Yin souls did not launch another attack for a long time, as if they were resting.","No one felt relaxed. This was definitely not because Yin souls had given up just like that. Instead, they must be preparing a powerful offensive.","Day after day passed, and a month later, the Yin souls that had not moved for a long time finally launched a new round of attacks.","They didn’t attack from all directions. Instead, they targeted a single direction and launched a series of attacks.","Unfortunately, Ling Han and the others just happened to be on this path.","‘Hmm?’","...","Ling Han and Brother Monkey raised their heads at the same time. Fear rose up in their hearts, as if they had a premonition that something terrifying was about to happen.","Afterward, only then did the large black dog, the little azure dragon and the perverted pig sense something, and they too looked up at the sky.","“Let’s go take a look.”","Ling Han and Brother Monkey used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight at the same time, and flew towards space.","They stretched out their vision as far as they could, looking towards the planet occupied by the Yin souls. Then, amidst the darkness, they saw an army that was rapidly approaching. The vanguard was shockingly twelve massive skeletons.","Each skeleton was 30,000 meters tall. Their bodies were made of pitch-black metal, and even at such a far distance, they still emitted a terrifying aura, making people feel fear that came from the depths of their souls.","“Saintly Material!”","Ling Han, Brother Monkey, and the little azure dragon called out at practically the same time.","Gods, these skeletons were actually completely made up of Saintly Material.","Which also meant that these twelve skeletons were equivalent to twelve Saint Tools!","“It’s not just that!” Brother Monkey muttered, his expression considerably serious.","It was very rare to see Brother Monkey reveal such a serious expression, which clearly showed the seriousness of the matter.","Ling Han nodded and said, “Although Saintly Material can be enlarged, shrunk, and transformed according to one’s will, look at these skeletons... They’re made up of different Saintly Material!”","What kind of concept was this?","A Saintly Material could forge a Saint Tool, then, with a different Saintly Materials forming a body, just how terrifying would this skeleton “Spirit Tool” be?","How many Saints had joined forces to launch this attack?","However, was this possible?","If might could be boosted with the layering of Saintly Material, then the Imperial Clans would completely be able to build the number one Saint Tool in the world.","No way!","The might of the Saintly Material couldn’t be stacked, so it would be better to use one piece of Saintly Material to forge a Saint Tool instead of two. The might would instead be greater, so as to avoid the might of different Saintly Material clashing, and weakening the power instead.","However, both Ling Han and Brother Monkey could sense that these skeletal Spirit Tools were all exuding a world-shaking aura. The different Saintly Materials were perfectly combined, and did not conflict with each other. Instead, they magnified each other’s might.","If this kind of Spirit Tool unleashed its might, what Saint would be able to block it?","After such a long time, the Yin souls finally released a powerful move, and this powerful move... was too terrifying.","“Let’s go!”","Ling Han said at the first instant. Seeing that Brother Monkey was still a little eager to give it a try, he hurriedly grabbed Brother Monkey and pulled him forcefully towards the ground.","Brother Monkey was bellicose, and it was as if he wanted to charge up and fight. However, as a Venerate, there was a high chance that he would never return if he charged into such a lineup.","—With how few members of the Battle Saint Emperor’s line there were, did they all just ignore everything else and charge forward with their staff when their saw an enemy?","Ling Han couldn’t help but complain.","Brother Monkey had also woken up. After returning to the ground, they hurriedly retreated.","To say nothing of them, even Saints would have to retreat if they came across such an army of Yin souls.","They tore a rip into space and left. At the same time, they also sent out a call for help, giving a simple explanation.","Not long after, several Saints arrived.","A Saint immediately moved, blasting towards the Yin souls.","A Skeleton Saint Tool suddenly lashed out, unleashing a palm strike that was radiating with a myriad of colors. It then unleashed a burst of supreme Sword Rays, slicing the Saint into two.","Thankfully, the vitality of a Saint was incredibly tenacious. He immediately pieced the two halves of his body back together, and fled back in an extremely sorry state.","This was too terrifying. A Saint had been killed with a single strike.","“This is no ordinary Tool. It can completely be viewed as a Saint Tool, and can actively attack!”","“Heavens, the combination of Saintly Materials actually amplifies each other’s might!”","“The might of this strike is at least seven stars and above!”","The Saints did not dare to oppose this either. Immediately, they retreated, and then voiced out their opinion.","The Yin soul army penetrated deeply, invincible.","All of a sudden, the Galaxy Network was filled with discussions about this newly appeared Skeleton Saint Tool.","“Putting aside how we can ensure that different Saintly Materials do not conflict with each other, and can compound their power, just the Netherworld is only a land of nothingness. How could there possibly be so many Saintly Materials?”","“That’s right. The Netherworld doesn’t produce anything at all, so how could there possibly be Saintly Materials? And there are so many of them at that?”","However, discussion was discussion, but this could not stop the advance of the Yin soul army.","Right until the Imperial Clan brought the Imperial Weapon over.","The might of the Imperial Weapon finally stopped the advance of this army. However, what was terrifying was the fact that even the Imperial Weapon was unable to annihilate this army.","When the Imperial Weapon unleashed its might, the 12 skeletal Saint Tools combined together to form a bone shield that actually blocked the Imperial Weapon’s attacks—although they were forced into continuous retreat.","However, the Imperial Weapon couldn’t unleash its might forever, so when the Imperial Weapon stopped, the Skeleton Saint Tool took advantage of the opening to counterattack. It quickly recovered its lost territory and charged in.","When the news spread out, the whole world was shocked.","The Imperial Weapon was the final line of defense for all the members of the Imperial Clans, as well as everyone else.","In everyone’s eyes, no matter how powerful the enemy was, even if the a Pseudo-Emperor made a move, they would have to retreat when faced with the Imperial Weapon, but now?","The Imperial Weapon was actually blocked!","It wasn’t that the Imperial Weapon wasn’t awesome enough, but that no one could continuously activate the Imperial Weapon. Otherwise, with the offensive ability of the Imperial Weapon, no matter how hard your bone shield was, after a few hundred or a few thousand slashes, there was no way it couldn’t be dealt with.","More Saints rushed over with their Imperial Weapons. The dozen or so Imperial Weapons unleashed their might one after another, and only then did they manage to block the Skeleton Saint Tools.","However, the Netherworld sent out another army, and twelve Skeleton Saint Tools were also the commanders-in-chief, sweeping aside all opposition.","The Imperial Clans hurriedly split up again, bringing the Imperial Weapons to suppress the enemy troops.","Their path was also blocked, but bad news came again. The Netherworld had mobilized a third army, and it was still 12 Skeleton Saint Tools that were leading the vanguard.","This was blocked again, but the Imperial Weapons were almost used up.","Every army needed over a dozen Imperial Weapons to suppress, and the third army had already expended close to forty Imperial Weapons. If the Netherworld could still mobilize another army, and still had the Skeleton Saint Tools as the vanguard, how would they be able to block this attack?","This worry... very quickly became a reality.","Sure enough, the Netherworld mobilized a fourth army, with 12 Skeleton Saint Tools leading the vanguard.","This time, the army on this path was unstoppable.","The Yin souls penetrated deeply, like a hot knife through butter.","The only good news was that the invasion of the Yin souls was not very fast, because they had to wait for the Yin Qi to spread out, so that the environment could be transformed. Only then would the territory be truly conquered, or it would be a waste of effort.","With how big the universe was, it would be impossible to completely transform the environment of the Living Realm into the Netherworld without tens of thousands of years or even longer."]},{"number":4560,"title":"Chapter 4560: Embracing River Planet","paragraphs":["Chapter 4560: Embracing River Planet","Editor: Henyee Translations","At present, the Netherworld was very powerful, and the Living Realm could not stop them.","Everyone was scrambling their brains to think of a way to stand against the Skeleton Saint Tools.","There was always a way, wasn’t there?","Actually, as long as Buddha Doga appeared, with his cultivation level as a Pseudo-Emperor, he should be able to resist the Skeleton Saint Tools.","However, the Netherworld army continued to advance, and Buddha Doga still didn’t appear.","A great many people were complaining both in the open and secretly, accusing Buddha Doga of being selfish. At such a critical moment, he actually stayed out of it, but even more intelligent people had guessed that the Netherworldhad not sent out the Lord of the Blood Sea and the others.","...","They were most likely on the same level as Buddha Doga, so they were hindering each other.","Buddha Doga didn’t appear, and neither did the Lord of the Blood Sea and the others.","“Could the skeletal Saint Tools have been created by those from the Blood Sea and Yin River?” Ling Han guessed.","After all, the Netherworld was too barren. It was impossible to find even a single Saintly Material, what more for them to be forged into close to fifty Skeleton Saint Tools.","However, the rulers of the Blood Sea and Yin River had always been in the Living Realm. Moreover, how many Saints were buried inside? Since there were Saints, why didn’t they have Saint Tools?","After refining the Saint Tools for a while, wouldn’t it return to its original form?","“Gasp! Going by that logic, this situation... is far too terrifying!” the large black dog inhaled sharply.","The little azure dragon also nodded in agreement. The Yin River and Blood Sea had most likely existed for an extremely long time. Thus, from such an early age, the Netherworld had already begun to set up the Living Realm?","“Sigh, why did Grandpa Dragon have to be born in this era? Otherwise, Grandpa Dragon could have easily become Emperor!” he exclaimed.","Ling Han frowned. He had never minded the strength of his enemies, and firmly believed that he would be able to surpass them one day. However, at his level, the Celestial Qi that he needed amounted to a bottomless pit, but it just so happened that it was not easy to obtain it now.","—Every battle line had Skeleton Saint Tools standing guard, so how was he supposed to kill Yin souls?","Without the rewards of heaven and earth, he could only depend on the Celestial Qi, but just how difficult would it be to capture the Celestial Qi?","Thus, normally speaking, it was very normal for a Sect Master to spend 20,000 to 30,000 years of hard cultivation to advance into the Venerate Tier. Celestial Qi was too hard to capture.","How could Ling Han have so much time?","“If there is an Imperial Weapon, and there is the aura of the Great Emperor within, it would be able to easily attract the Celestial Qi,” Brother Monkey said. After all, he was a descendant of the Saint Emperor, so he should know some secrets.","Thus, the Imperial Clans didn’t need to worry about not being able to obtain Celestial Qi.","Ling Han’s eyes lit up, “I don’t believe that the bet I made with Yi Taishu really made the Imperial Clans take out all the Celestial Qi.”","Just how deep was the wealth of the Imperial Clans!","The large black dog knew Ling Han best, and he immediately said, “Right now, the various Imperial Clans are all using the Imperial Weapons to fight against the Skeleton Saint Tools. We can seize this opportunity to plunder their home base!”","“Tsk, isn’t that a bit inappropriate?” the little azure dragon said with slight embarrassment. However, his hands that were rubbing together in excitement betrayed him.","“Let’s go!” Brother Monkey was the most decisive, and slung the staff over his shoulder.","“Brother Monkey, don’t be rash. We have to plan which Imperial Clan we should go to. Furthermore, we have to know where it is, right?” Ling Han hurriedly said.","The location of the Imperial Clan had all been created by the Great Emperor in the past. Thus, if it was normal, it would be on a planet, but if it was abnormal, it could possibly be in space, or even in the sun.","“Then, where do we go first?” the little azure dragon asked. As for whether this was being appropriate or not, he had completely forgotten about it.","“The Ziwei Imperial Clan!” Ling Han immediately said without any hesitation.","The Baili Clan had gone too far. Furthermore, they even wanted to marry his future wife. How could he tolerate that?","“All right!” Everyone nodded.","The next problem was... where was the Ziwei Imperial Clan?","Everyone set off to gather information.","Thankfully, the location of the Ziwei Imperial Clan was no secret.","They were an Imperial Clan, one of the most powerful forces in the universe. Was there any need for them to hide the location of their ancestral grounds?","Just ask, who would dare cause trouble?","Without waiting for the Imperial Weapon to show its might, the Imperial Formation would be able to kill them first.","“Now we know where the Ziwei Imperial Clan is, but how do we pass through the imperial formation?” the large black dog said.","This was a huge dilemma. Once the imperial formation was activated, even Saints could only die immediately.","They had not managed to steal the Celestial Qi, and had instead lost their lives.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then said, “I think that the monarch formation should be in a dormant state usually, and would only be truly activated when it encounters an attack.”","For example, if a supreme elite delivered an attack, the great formation would definitely be immediately activated, and block this attack.","But if it was maintained in active mode, how long would this Great Emperor killing formation be able to last?","To be able to kill a Saint, just how terrifying was its might? It was naturally very exhausting.","“So, as long as we don’t cause any damage, we should be able to sneak inside,” Ling Han said in a low voice.","The little azure dragon and the large black dog both bared their teeth. That was because Ling Han had used uncertain words like ‘possible’, ‘should’, or ‘maybe’. Just hearing this was enough to make their b@lls hurt. If they were careless, they would definitely die.","“Brother Monkey, I’ll go with you to investigate the situation first,” Ling Han said.","“All right.” Brother Monkey nodded. He feared nothing in this world. So what if there was a Great Emperor killing formation?","—It was not without reason that the line of the Battle Saint Emperor had few people.","Ling Han sighed. Was he going to complain that he was going further and further on this path of no return?","The two of them set off first, heading towards the Embracing River Planet. This was where the Ziwei Imperial Clan was located.","This was the ancestral grounds of the Imperial Clan, so it was naturally extraordinary.","Looking down from space, this planet was exuding a purple light, as if it was destined to be great.","If one wanted to go to Embracing River Planet, he had to first apply.","This was the core area of the Ziwei Imperial Clan, so how could others come here so easily?","However, there were too many members of the Imperial Clan, so there was no lack of entertainment. Hence, there was also an endless stream of merchants from all over the universe, delivering large amounts of treasures, ingredients, and Celestial medicines over.","Ling Han and Brother Monkey pretended to be intergalactic merchants. They passed the inspection, and rode the Transfer Formation from an adjacent planet. Very soon, they arrived at the Embracing River Planet.","The moment he exited the Transfer Formation, Ling Han immediately sensed the astonishing power of heaven and earth.","As expected of the ancestral grounds of the Imperial Clan. If one cultivated here, it would definitely be half the work and double the results.","Of course, this kind of environment was no longer of any help to Ling Han.","The two brothers first pretended to sell something, but the price was too high so naturally, there would be people asking around, but no one made a move, so the two of them could use this as a cover to continue pretending to be doing business, but actually planning a robbery.","No one noticed that Ling Han and Brother Monkey had already quietly circled around the Embracing River Planet.","Ling Han had once attempted to communicate with the ley lines here, but he discovered that the ley lines here were firmly controlled by an even stronger power, and could not possibly be used by him.","Was this the Great Emperor killing formation?","Ling Han didn’t try to forcefully seize control of the ley lines. Firstly, he couldn’t win, and secondly, he couldn’t alert the enemy.","After ten days, they had already gained a basic understanding of this place.","No matter how many members of an Imperial Clan there were, they could not possibly occupy the entire planet. Thus, in truth, the true ancestral grounds of the Baili Clan was located within a great mountain.","Firmament Mountain.","This was a large mountain, so tall that it could reach the clouds. It was the tallest mountain on the Embracing River Planet. It was constantly enshrouded in celestial mist, and outsiders were not allowed to enter."]},{"number":4561,"title":"Chapter 4561: Technique to enter the formation","paragraphs":["Chapter 4561: Technique to enter the formation","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han and Brother Monkey arrived at the foot of the Firmament Mountain.","In this place, Ling Han immediately felt as if the ley lines of the entire planet had been gathered here, and a slight change could affect the whole planet.","He was astonished. This was because even though the power of the planet was terrifying, it was only on par with the strike of a Saint, at most. Thus, how could it support a Great Emperor killing formation?","This was something that could kill Saints!","Brother Monkey looked ahead, then shook his head, “The killing intent ahead is densely covered. Don’t act rashly.”","Ling Han also channeled his eye technique, and saw a field of incredibly terrifying killing intent.","...","This was the Great Emperor killing formation!","F***, he had initially thought that maintaining the Great Emperor killing formation would expend an innumerable amount of energy, so it would definitely not be activated under normal circumstances. It would only be activated when the Imperial Clan encountered danger, but from the look of things now, that was not the case.","Strange, to maintain the activation of the Imperial Formation continuously, just how exhausting would that have to be? Why was the Imperial Clan able to afford it?","Was this the so-called background of the Imperial Clan?","If they rashly forged ahead, the Great Emperor killing formation would definitely be activated, and then he and Brother Monkey would die a tragic death.","Brother Monkey was fond of battle, but he wasn’t stupid at all. How could he step forward when he knew that he would definitely die?","He was of the line of the Battle Saint Emperor, so shouldn’t he ignore all dangers and shout a slogan before charging forward every single time?","Ling Han mocked internally, then sighed. Oh no, oh no, why did he like to mock so much recently?","“Let’s retreat first.”","Ling Han and Brother Monkey returned. Don’t even think about barging into the Great Emperor killing formation, and don’t even think about finding any weak points. If the Great Emperor killing formation still had weak points, how could the Great Emperor have such a high status?","“We can’t force our way in.”","“We can only get through with our wits.”","The problem was, how were they supposed to outsmart them?","“The Ziwei Imperial Clan will definitely be able to freely enter and exit the imperial formation. Thus, we can capture one of them and interrogate him.”","They stood guard, and it wasn’t long before they saw a person descend from the Firmament Mountain.","Brother Monkey moved and captured that person.","—If a Venerate Tier elite made a move, wouldn’t it be a piece of cake?","Ling Han searched through this person’s memories.","His name was Baili Aoyun, and though his name was a bit cocky, in truth, he was an unremarkable clansman of the Ziwei Clan1.","However, no matter what, the bloodline of the Imperial Clan flowed in his veins. Thus, he was naturally able to freely enter and exit the core area of the Ziwei Imperial Clan.","And there was only one way to safely pass through the imperial formation, and that was to possess the mark of the Ziwei Imperial Clan.","This mark... from the day that Baili Aoyun was born, it was branded in his blood by his clan and resonated with his bloodline. Thus, outsiders could not possibly steal this mark.","Then what could they do?","There was another way, and that was for the person who had the mark to bring others through the imperial formation.","Threatening Baili Aoyun to bring them in?","No, as long as he entered into the imperial formation, Baili Aoyun would be able to communicate with the formation, and silently issue a must-kill order, killing Ling Han and Brother Monkey.","Then what could they do?","“Erase his memories from this period of time.”","“This person is extremely fond of beauties, so we can make a move on him from this aspect.”","Ling Han and Brother Monkey exchanged a glance. The corners of their mouths twitched, and a mocking expression appeared on their faces.","Brother Monkey moved, and lightly wiped Baili Aoyun’s head, erasing his memories from when he came out of the imperial formation. Then, with a leap, the two of them disappeared without a trace.","‘Hmm?’","Baili Aoyun suddenly straightened his upper body, and looked dumbly at his surroundings, his eyes very vacant.","‘Why am I here? And why am I lying on the ground?’","He got to his feet, and carefully examined his body. He discovered that he was completely fine from head to toe, and did not suffer the slightest injury.","Strange, too strange.","After being stunned for a while, he finally continued to advance. However, there were still doubts in his mind.","However, he was here to do something, so he quickly put aside his confusion and went to settle the matter first. Then, he began to wander around, acting all arrogant and haughty.","In the ancestral grounds, he was only an insignificant clansman. He would have to bow and nod respectfully no matter who he met, and even if he endured countless more years until his beard had turned white, he was still only a minor character of the Ziwei Imperial Clan.","There was nothing that could be done. He was only a Core Formation Tier cultivator, and had already been stuck for a very, very long time. This should be the strongest he could attain in this lifetime.","However, after leaving the ancestral grounds, he was now a mighty figure who bore the halo of the Ziwei Imperial Clan. Anyone who saw him would have to respectfully address him as Lord Yun.","Thus, he was very fond of going out. Firstly, he could enjoy the glory of being valued and respected by others, and secondly, he was a person who especially liked women. After he came out, he naturally could seek pleasure.","On his way here, he had been called Lord Yun who knew how many times, causing him to be enraptured, completely forgetting his previous confusion.","Yi?","His eyes suddenly lit up, and he stared ahead.","He saw two graceful and extremely beautiful women walking towards him. Even if he had seen many beauties, he still couldn’t help but feel his heart beat faster.","They were stunningly beautiful.","He could not hold back the restlessness in his heart, and immediately walked forwards, striking up a conversation, “Two beauties, this must be the first time you have come to the Embracing River Planet, right? Otherwise, with your outstanding beauty, I would definitely remember!”","This ingratiation was a little over the top. With how big the Embracing River Planet was, how many people could you have seen? Furthermore, could you remember clearly all the people you had seen?","But when it came to compliments, who would take it too seriously, or care too much?","However, these two beauties were extremely cold and aloof, and ignored him completely.","Baili Aoyun did not take it to heart at all, because he still had a trump card that he had yet to use.","“I am Baili Aoyun,” he said, a strong pride in his tone.","The Imperial Clan was born to stand proudly above all other clans.","One of the two beauties was dressed in a long blue dress, while the other was dressed in a purple palace dress. At this moment, the woman in the long blue dress said, “So it is a noble descendant of the Imperial Clan!”","It was unclear whether these words were a compliment about his background, or a mockery that he would only use his background to scare others.","Baili Aoyun also hesitated for a moment, then said, “Two Young Misses, how should I address you?”","“Han Ling.”","“Sun Hou.”","“Good name!” Baili Aoyun immediately praised. Since they had struck up a conversation, he began to spout nonsense. In short, he would try his best to curry the favor of these two beauties, and then exaggerate his position in the Imperial Clan Clan.","In this way, these two beauties that had initially been indifferent towards him finally changed their attitudes, and agreed to his invitation to tour the ancestral grounds.","“Please! Please!” He set out with the two beauties, and soon arrived in front of the imperial formation.","“Two beauties, the Great Emperor killing formation is right in front of us. It can even kill Saints,” he said with a hint of arrogance. “Inside this great formation, I have the power to decide life and death. Everyone’s life and death would be decided with a single thought from me.”","This successfully drew the exclamations of surprise from the two beauties, and also made him feel very pleased with himself.","“After entering into the formation, you both have to follow me closely. You must not leave the range of three meters from me, and you must not walk around randomly either, or your lives would be in danger!” Baili Aoyun said seriously."]},{"number":4562,"title":"Chapter 4562: Move separately","paragraphs":["Chapter 4562: Move separately","Editor: Henyee Translations","The three of them entered into the Great Emperor formation. Baili Aoyun walked in front, and deliberately pretended to be very careful, causing the two beauties to follow closely behind him, making him feel both pleased and proud.","He also walked very slowly. This made the two supreme beauties think of him as their backbone, and the feeling of them completely obeying him was really too wonderful.","However, no matter how large the Great Emperor Formation was, the area it covered was still limited. Very quickly, they had “entered” the great formation.","The Great Emperor Formation was actually a spherical shape that enshrouded the ancestral grounds of the Imperial Clan in all directions. However, this “sphere” was hollow, and the solid part was the formation area, while the hollow part was the ancestral grounds of the Ziwei Imperial Clan.","“Come, follow me.” Baili Aoyun brought the two beauties to his quarters.","Though his status in the clan was not very high, as a member of the Imperial Clan, his living conditions were still quite good. He had a very large courtyard, but it was located in the periphery of the formation, and not in the centre.","...","—The central area was naturally where the mighty figures of the clan stayed, such as the Saints, Venerates, as well as Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters.","“The two of you must be tired. Hurry up and take a rest.” Baili Aoyun called out, “I have a good hot spring pool here. The two of you can take a bath and wash away the dust on your bodies. Furthermore, it is also extremely beneficial for nourishing the body.”","These two beauties smiled slightly, then changed their appearances at the same time.","Baili Aoyun’s mouth instantly gaped open, revealing an expression of absolute shock.","F***, these were actually two men! It was one thing for them to be men, but one of them was a fur-faced monkey!","Heavens!","Baili Aoyun instantly crumbled. To think that he had wanted to make love with these two beauties before, but now? He was so scared that he directly shrank back, all right?","Not good, he had fallen into a trap!","Although Baili Aoyun’s cultivation level was low, he wasn’t stupid.","He immediately associated it with how he had been lying on the ground for some reason and lost his memories for a period of time. Though it was pitifully short, when he associated it with these two beauties that had suddenly become men, the answer was obvious.","He had been used to help others smuggle themselves in.","Thinking of this, he couldn’t help but tremble all over. If these two people were involved in a conspiracy, wouldn’t he become an accomplice?","In this way, he would definitely be implicated!","No, he had to report it immediately.","However, before he could make any sound, he suddenly felt his vision darken, and he had already been knocked unconscious.","“Brother Monkey, let’s go.” Ling Han removed his female attire and changed into his normal attire.","Brother Monkey nodded, and similarly took off his female clothing.","With their strength, how could Baili Aoyun see through their feminine disguise?","Who asked this guy to be so lecherous?","Ling Han covered himself and Brother Monkey with the Void Beast hide. Then, they began to walk around the ancestral grounds of the Imperial Clan.","This ancestral grounds looked heavily guarded on the outside, but security was relaxed on the inside.","They were already under the protection of the Great Emperor formation, so what was there to be afraid of?","The two of them searched once, and had basically gotten a rough idea of this place.","“There’s a Medicinal Garden in the southeast corner.”","“The treasure chamber is to the west.”","“There’s a cave in the north that’s heavily guarded. It’s probably some Spiritual Spring.”","Originally, it would have been impossible for the Firmament Mountain to have so many natural treasures, but this was something that had been personally created by the Great Emperor. Then, with the abilities of the Great Emperor, how difficult would it be for him to transport some natural treasures?","“There’s a place in the northwest corner that vaguely exudes a terrifying aura.”","“It is highly possible that there is a Saint slumbering within, and cannot be disturbed.”","“Let’s move separately.”","Ling Han and Brother Monkey went their separate ways. Ling Han was responsible for robbing the Medicinal Garden, while Brother Monkey headed to the treasure chamber.","They had to be careful and definitely not alert anyone, because after they were done, they still had to leave quietly with the help of Baili Aoyun.","Otherwise, it would have been impossible for him to tear a rip into space and leave after being enveloped by the Great Emperor Formation.","The two of them split up. Ling Han handed the Void Beast hide to Brother Monkey, while he cast the Strange Shadow Steps. With his current accomplishments, as long as he wasn’t facing a Saint directly, he wouldn’t be discovered at all.","Not long after, the Medicinal Garden was right in front of his eyes.","This place was naturally heavily guarded.","Don’t think that because everyone’s surname was Baili, they were united.","Indeed, when faced with external enemies, they were a united force. However, there would definitely be internal strife within great clans, and it was inevitable that they would be fighting for power and profit. Even the Imperial Clan was no exception to this rule.","Thus, it was very understandable that the treasure chamber and Medicinal Garden were heavily guarded.","It was as if Ling Han had become one with the Void, and he quietly passed under the eyes of the seven guards.","“Yi?” A guard suddenly shivered, “Why do I suddenly feel like my hair is standing on end?”","“Is it because you’ve been sleepong around too much recently that you’re feeling weak?” The other guards beside him immediately laughed at him.","“That’s right. I heard that you have taken another concubine recently?”","“Which number is this? Eleventh?”","“Get lost, I’m as strong as a Primordial Barbaric Bull. To say nothing of thirteen, it is no problem for me to have thirty women in one night!” the guard who had previously shivered declared loudly. Men would definitely not cower in this aspect.","“Hahaha!” This caused the others to laugh loudly.","Ling Han also smiled, and continued onwards.","After entering the Medicinal Garden, it would be a smooth journey.","There were only farmers here, and there were no more guards. Furthermore, there were not many farmers at this time.","Ling Han walked quietly. His eyes were too sharp. Ordinary Celestial medicines were completely beneath his notice.","If he wanted to steal, he would have to steal a top-grade Great Herb, or at least, a Venerate Tier-level Great Herb. It would be best if it was a Saint Herb.","He searched around, and not long after, he saw masses of Venerate Tier-level Great Herbs.","“F*ck! These are all mother tree-level treasures!”","Ling Han was stunned. What was the mother tree? A planet could only nurture one, and was the source of all the Celestial medicines on this planet.","However, in this place, there were many mother trees.","This was completely illogical!","“This involves the Great Emperor, so even if it doesn’t make sense, it does make sense now,” Ling Han said with a sigh. This was definitely the Great Emperor’s doing. It was definitely because of this that he had managed to plant so many mother trees in the same area.","He sensed for a while, and couldn’t help but feel even more stunned.","“Underneath each mother tree is a portion of the planet’s Source Power!”","Ling Han finally understood. The Great Emperor’s power was truly incredible. While transplanting the mother tree, he had also extracted a portion of the corresponding life force of the planet. Thus, theoretically speaking, he could complete the transplant of the mother tree.","Of course, if a Saint did such a thing, even if they could extract a portion of the planet’s Source Power, it would definitely be unable to support the mother tree.","—Otherwise, there would not be just one mother tree in the Nine Suns Holy Land.","Transplantation was one matter, and raising them was another matter altogether. For the moment, this was something that only the Great Emperor could do.","Ling Han faltered upon this. It was as if he suddenly understood.","Why were they not afraid that the Great Emperor killing formation would expend energy excessively? Was it supported by an endless supply of Source Power?","With the abilities of the Great Emperor, he was completely capable of refining planets, shrinking them into a small ball, and becoming the source of energy for the imperial formation.","Planets were a body of their own, and they could extract energy from the universe. Unless the planet died of old age, they would never have to worry about running out of energy."]},{"number":4563,"title":"Chapter 4563: Great Sweep","paragraphs":["Chapter 4563: Great Sweep","Editor: Henyee Translations","That should be the case.","Ling Han nodded. However, even if he understood this kind of thing — even if anyone knew about it, they would not be qualified to imitate it, because refining a planet was something that only the Great Emperor could do.","No matter how awesome a Saint was, they would only be able to shatter a planet.","But why don’t you try having a Saint destroy a sun?","Impossible!","It was not that the Saint did not have this kind of ability, but rather that when the sun crumbled, the shockwave of energy created by that terrifying explosion was similarly capable of killing the Saint.","...","This was just like how Venerates could destroy planets, yet didn’t dare to.","Destroying it was one matter, and keeping himself out of it at the same time was another matter.","“I’ll take them all!”","Ling Han’s eyes shone. There were a great many Great Herbs here that were incredibly valuable, and could revive the dead or regrow severed limbs. Of course, there were also some that contained Celestial Qi, and they were seven or eight stars at that.","He quickly made his move. Not only did he pluck the ripened celestial fruits and Celestial medicines, even if they weren’t mature enough, he also dug them out along with the life force of the planet.","If he could grow them, then he would. If he couldn’t, then he couldn’t allow them to benefit the Ziwei Imperial Clan.","In a short while, all the Venerate Tier-level Great Herbs were swept clean by him.","He set up another illusion-type formation. As long as one did not touch it, what others saw was a scene of prosperity. There was definitely not a single Great Herb that had disappeared.","Then, he continued onwards.","The Venerate Tier-level Great Herbsswept clean, and it was now the Saintly medicine’s turn.","After walking for a while longer, he arrived at the Saintly medicine zone.","Compared to the masses of Venerate Tier Great Herbs, there were pitifully few Saintly medicines. At most, there were only nine.","Some were low-rise fruit trees that bore vermillion fruits, some were as large as dragon’s eyes, and some were as small as grains of rice; some were lotus flowers that bloomed with a refreshing fragrance; there were also old purple-red vines that bore a small bunch of grapes...","I’m rich! I’m rich!","Ling Han rubbed his hands together, unable to conceal his excitement.","He reached over and plucked all of the Saint Fruits, regardless of whether they were ripe or not. If there were no fruits, he would pluck the flowers that had bloomed. Swallowing them raw should have some effects, though it would be slightly inferior.","However, it was a shame that he didn’t dare to excavate the Saintly medicine. The Source Power of the planet was far too terrifying, so it would definitely cause a huge commotion once it was removed.","Before he left, this naturally could not be allowed.","Forget it. He could always come back in the future.","He set up a formation to restore the appearance of this place.","Just as he finished, he sensed three people approach.","Ling Han hurriedly used the Strange Shadow Steps and fled into the Void.","The three people who had come were all very young. They were two men and one woman respectively.","They arrived at the Saintly medicine area, and immediately sat down in a cross-legged position, as if they were cultivating.","Realization dawned on Ling Han. As the Saintly medicine grew, not only would it exude a little bit of medicinal power, it would be greatly nutritious for cultivators. Furthermore, it would also extract the Regulations of heaven and earth as nutrients. In this process, it was very possible to glimpse the essence of Regulations.","Thus, there were great benefits to cultivating beside the Saintly medicine.","From this, it could be seen that these three people should be well-known figures among the rising stars of the Baili Clan. Otherwise, they would not be qualified to cultivate here.","However...","“Yi, don’t you guys feel that the energy you absorbed today is a little weak?” Among the three of them, the man in purple suddenly spoke up.","“I thought I was mistaken. So you have also sensed it?” The red-clothed woman nodded, showing an expression of surprise.","“Me too.” Finally, the man in green nodded as well.","The three of them were all at a loss. What was going on? The cultivation area near the Saintly medicine Pill was rich in energy, and it was also very easy to sense the Regulations. It was the best place to cultivate, so why had its effects suddenly declined sharply?","Since Baili Che was crippled, and Baili Yun was killed, there was still Baili Tian, a Golden Generation, to hold up the fort. However, the Ziwei Imperial Clan had a severe lapse in their Imperial Sons, and there was an urgent need to select new young clansmen to replace them.","Everyone wanted to become the Imperial Son or Imperial Daughter. Once they were chosen, the benefits they would receive were practically unimaginable!","—How fortunate would it be to be nurtured with the full efforts of the clan?","Thus, the competition was far too intense.","“It must be that the person who cultivated here last time was too ruthless. In fact, he even used some secret technique and absorbed the power of the Saintly medicine, causing the Saintly medicine to be damaged. That’s why this situation happened,” the purple-robed man said.","“That’s right. No wonder Baili Mo has suddenly become so much stronger. It must be him!” The man in green clapped his hands.","The purple-robed man and red-clothed woman rolled their eyes. Even if you can’t beat Baili Mo, why don’t you look for the reason behind your own weakness first?","However, it was true that the quality of the environment had declined a little too much.","“Let’s first use up all the time we have to cultivate, then go and report the situation!”","A smile tugged at the corners of Ling Han’s lips. If he had a negative energy system, he would definitely be making a fortune now.","Fine, you guys go ahead and discuss slowly.","Ling Han left quietly. He needed to hurry up. After these three people returned to make their report, there would definitely be people investigating the situation. Then, the matter of the Saintly medicine being stolen would immediately be exposed. If he and Brother Monkey wanted to leave again, that would be very, very difficult.","He planned to take another look. There were still a few corners that he had yet to check out. Since he was already here, he definitely had to take a closer look.","Moreover, these three people were still cultivating, so it would take at least a day or so.","There was no need to be too anxious.","Ling Han continued to search around. After searching for a while, he was only left with the last corner.","But when he arrived here, he discovered that there was actually someone standing guard.","Furthermore, this was actually a Venerate!","‘What?’","Ling Han was astonished. A Venerate Tier had deliberately stood guard here?","Previously, where the Venerate Tier-level Great Herbs and Saintly medicines, it was completely out in the open and unguarded, and others could still be allowed to cultivate in their proximity and absorb some benefits. Why was it in this place, a Venerate Tier was standing guard?","Ling Han carefully observed for a while. Though this Venerate’s aura was reserved, under his eye technique, the depth of his cultivation level could not be hidden.","A Nine Star Venerate Tier!","Having reached this kind of cultivation level, there was already no meaning to cultivate diligently. Instead, he had to study the Heavenly Dao to light up the holy flame.","There were only two ways to ignite the holy flame. The first was to gather enough power of belief, and the second was to have an absolute grasp of the Heavenly Dao and forcibly ignite it.","Yi?","He couldn’t help but think back to how the Ziwei Imperial Clan had sent the old Venerate Tier of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire to recover lost territory. Their purpose was to harvest the power of belief, because they had an old Venerate that was about to break through.","It couldn’t be this person, right?","Was the power of belief not enough?","But if it wasn’t enough, what are you staying in the Medicinal Garden for? Shouldn’t you manifest miracles everywhere to strengthen the faith of your citizens, or open up new territory and conquer more believers?","Could it be that... sitting here could strengthen the appreciation of Heavenly Dao?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel a jolt in his heart. What kind of Celestial medicine had been planted in this last corner? They actually had to send a Venerate to stand guard?","He definitely had to go in and take a look.","Ling Han quietly walked forwards. Under the effects of the Strange Shadow Steps, he did not arouse the slightest ripple of Regulations.","“En?” That Venerate suddenly opened his eyes, and looked towards where Ling Han was."]},{"number":4564,"title":"Chapter 4564: Weed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4564: Weed","Editor: Henyee Translations","This Venerate was called Baili Chuixue.","Being able to become a Venerate, even in the Imperial Clan, was extremely impressive, and required astonishing natural talent in cultivation.","Furthermore, Baili Chuixue had already glimpsed the hope of becoming a Saint, but he was still a little bit away from reaching that level. He would either have to improve further in his appreciation of the Heavenly Dao, or have a little more power of belief, and he would be able to light up the holy flame.","In truth, the power of belief was already more or less enough. The reason why he had not begun to attempt breaking through to Saint Tier was because if he used his own power to light up the holy flame, the Saint that he would become would be even stronger.","This was already the last step, so he naturally couldn’t be too rash. He had to pursue greater strength.","—To him, this was definitely the last step. Becoming Emperor? Heh, that was impossible.","...","As a nine-star Venerate, and as someone who was actually close to having one foot into Saint Tier, he was extremely sensitive to auras.","He looked at where Ling Han was, and a suspicious expression appeared on his face.","Instinct told him that there was something off about where he was looking, but as far as his eyes could see, and as far as his divine sense could sense, everything told him that there was absolutely no problem.","What was going on here?","He did not understand.","“Could it be that I have a misconception because I want to break through too much?” Baili Chuixue frowned, and found a reason for himself.","He closed his eyes again, but right at this moment, he stretched out his hand at the same time, grabbing out at the place that he had previously been looking at.","There was nothing!","Only then did Baili Chuixue confirm that he had been mistaken. He began to close his eyes and sense again.","Ling Han pursed his lips. Just now, he had changed his position at the first instant, and just happened to dodge this blow from Baili Chuixue.","He had almost been pierced through!","As expected of someone who was about to step into Saint Tier. This intuition was really frightening.","He had to leave.","Ling Han circled around Baili Chuixue from afar, and entered into the last area of the Medicinal Garden.","However... this place was far too ordinary.","Ling Han was surprised. This was just an ordinary piece of soil, and there was no Celestial medicine planted at all. The majority of the place was empty, and only a weed grew at the extreme corners.","F***, what need was there to guard this place? Furthermore, a Venerate Tier elite had been mobilized!","Ling Han was just about to leave, but he immediately faltered.","This was the Medicinal Garden, and with the rich nature of the Imperial Clan, plants that were qualified to be planted here were Celestial medicines that were at least Four Stars and above.","Why waste a piece of land?","Furthermore, how could there possibly be weeds here?","With a thought from Ling Han, he headed towards that weed.","This really was a weed. It was very ordinary, and there was nothing unusual about it at all.","Had the Imperial Clan been careless, and allowed a weed to grow out of this place?","However, the Medicinal Garden was an important place, and there had always been farmers there to take care of it. How could there be any that slipped through the net? Moreover, there was still a Venerate Tier standing guard here.","Ling Han carefully observed this weed again, and not long after, his expression gradually became solemn.","At present, this blade of grass only had two leaves, but what surprised Ling Han was that these two leaves were actually exactly the same.","Every detail, including the veined pattern!","How was this possible?","There were definitely no two identical flowers, two identical people, or two identical leaves in this world.","Strange.","The veined patterns on these leaves were actually very simple. A main vein ran from the stem of the leaf all the way to the tip of the leaf, and nine more branches grew from the main vein, as if they were tributaries.","But as he watched, Ling Han felt as if he had suddenly seen Heavenly Dao.","That’s right, it was the Heavenly Dao.","It was the main vein of that leaf, and the Heavenly Dao manifested, gaining all kinds of Regulations.","Of course, this leaf only had nine branches now, and was far from being as abundant as the number of Regulations in real life.","In his shock, he hurriedly regained his senses, because he discovered that this leaf was incredibly captivating to his soul. It was as if he could look at it forever, disregarding time, right until his death.","No wonder that Venerate Tier merely stood guard outside and didn’t come in. He was probably afraid that under his full concentration, his soul would be lost forever.","Ling Han was astonished. Just how powerful and perfect was his divine sense? Yet, he was actually engrossed?","This blade of grass... was Saint Tier?","No, if it was Saint Grade, why wasn’t it planted together with the Saintly medicines from before?","But if it was not the Saintly medicine, could it be that it was a Great Emperor-level medicine?","Was there something like an Emperor-level medicine?","This was a Spirit Herb that had been nurtured by heaven and earth. At its peak, it was Saint Grade, but there was no Imperial Herb.","There were indeed treasured medicines that could extend the lifespan of a Great Emperor. In fact, there were even those that could allow one to live a second life. However, those were the peak grade medicines among Saintly medicines. Furthermore, the fact that they could allow one to live a second life was not entirely due to the effects of the treasured medicines. Part of the reason was also because of the Great Emperor’s own heaven-defying strength.","F***, then what exactly was this?","Should he dig it out?","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Who cares what grade it was? He would just dig it up and take it away.","‘F*ck!’","He was just about to put it into action. However, just as his hand touched the dirt, he immediately sensed a terrifyingly powerful aura, causing him to feel powerless and unable to continue.","Hiss!","That feeling was as if he had touched the body of a Great Emperor.","Imperial Weapon?","No, the Great Emperor killing formation.","The core of the Great Emperor killing formation was here?","Ling Han suddenly had a guess. In truth, he had not walked out of the Great Emperor killing formation, but had rather walked in. Thus, it was naturally nothing strange for the core of the Great Emperor killing formation to appear here.","He couldn’t move. Otherwise, the Great Emperor killing formation would activate and easily kill him.","Ling Han retreated, and quickly left.","Just as he was about to leave, he turned around to take a look, committing the appearance of this mysterious herb to memory. Then, he left resolutely.","He returned to Baili Aoyun’s quarters, and after waiting for a while, Brother Monkey also returned.","“How’s your harvest?” Ling Han asked.","Brother Monkey bared his teeth in a grin, “As expected of Ziwei Imperial Clan. My gains are astonishing.”","“I have also harvested a great many Celestial medicines. Furthermore, I have also discovered a stalk of mysterious herb.” Ling Han said. Then, he related the matter of that Venerate Tier guarding the mysterious herb.","Brother Monkey was also extremely surprised. Being guarded by a Venerate Tier, and being able to make people be completely enraptured, how could it possibly be an ordinary weed?","However, there was not much time left, and it was not enough for him to observe as well.","“It’s time to leave.”","The two of them changed their appearance again, and changed into women’s clothing, then woke Baili Aoyun up.","Of course, another part of his memory had been erased.","“Yi, when did I sleep on the bed?” Baili Aoyun was very confused. He didn’t remember such a thing happening.","Moreover, he had brought two beauties back, so shouldn’t he be enjoying himself? Why did he have to lie on the bed alone? What a waste.","However, the two beauties were extremely anxious, and said that they had something important to attend to.","There was nothing else that could be done. He could only escort them out first. In any case, there was still a lot of time. With his identity as a member of the Imperial Clan, how could it be that it would be too difficult for him to tempt them into bed?","The three of them set out, and soon exited the imperial formation.","Peng, Baili Aoyun once again fell onto the ground without a doubt.","“Let’s go!”","Brother Monkey directly tore a rip into space, and left with Ling Han.","Since they had left, they naturally did not care. So what if they were discovered? They could come chase after them, if they could.","However, this slight fluctuation was too small, and did not draw the attention of the Ziwei Imperial Clan at all.","Ling Han and Brother Monkey successfully returned."]},{"number":4565,"title":"Chapter 4565: Wedding date","paragraphs":["Chapter 4565: Wedding date","Editor: Henyee Translations","After returning, it was naturally time to go through their spoils.","The resources of the Imperial Clan were indeed astonishing. Though the Ziwei Imperial Clan definitely had treasure chambers in other places, where they stored some treasures, as well as Medicinal Gardens, they definitely couldn’t compare to the ancestral grounds of the Imperial Clan.","Even if all of them were added together, they would probably be inferior by more than a little.","Thus, Ling Han and Brother Monkey had really profited greatly this time. Who knew how many generations the Ziwei Imperial Clan had accumulated these treasures.","Unfortunately, he did not manage to obtain the Imperial Scroll from the Baili Clan.","Otherwise, if Ling Han and Brother Monkey had the chance to control the Ziwei Imperial Clan’s Imperial Weapon, then the Ziwei Imperial Clan would be in big trouble.","...","One after another, alchemical pills were concocted. Brother Monkey’s strength rapidly increased, and soon reached Nine Star Venerate Tier. Next, Brother Monkey no longer needed Celestial Qi, but rather appreciation of the Heavenly Dao.","To ignite the holy flame and become a Saint!","Ling Han believed that Brother Monkey didn’t need the power of belief to complete this step. However, how much time it would take would depend on Brother Monkey’s good fortune.","It could be one or two years, or it could be hundreds or thousands of years. In fact, it wouldn’t be strange even if it took tens of thousands of years.","Ling Han was also furiously ingesting Celestial pills, but his body was like a bottomless pit. No matter how much Celestial Qi entered his body, he would still absorb it all. There was no sign that he would not be able to absorb it.","When all the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pills had been consumed, Ling Han had just barely reached the end of Fourteen Stars.","He began to break through to Fifteen Stars.","This time, he almost died.","He charged towards Fifteen Stars, but did not manage to charge through. The terrifying power was rebounded back, almost shattering his mind.","Ling Han rested for half a year before finally recovering.","And in this period of time, the news of the Ziwei Imperial Clan being visited by a mysterious thief and their entire chamber of treasures being robbed was not concealed, and quietly spread out.","The Galaxy Network shuddered.","Who would be so outrageously bold to actually dare to steal treasures from the Ziwei Imperial Clan? Moreover, they had succeeded.","Could it be that it was a Saint?","No, no, no. Even Saints would die if they entered the Great Emperor killing formation.","Then was it a Pseudo-Emperor?","If Buddha Doga moved, there was still a chance that he could block the Great Emperor killing formation... right?","However, the Ziwei Imperial Clan had not been invaded. Instead, they had been robbed by thieves!","That definitely wasn’t Buddha Doga. For someone as powerful as the Pseudo-Emperor, was there any need to act in such a sneaky manner?","Thus, the people on the Galaxy Network were all speculating about just how awesome it was to actually steal from the Imperial Clan.","Very soon, the large black dog stepped out, and spoke on the Galaxy Network, “Grandpa Dog hereby announces that I am responsible for the theft of the Ziwei Imperial Clan.”","Instantly, this caused a heated discussion on the Galaxy Network.","The large black dog had an incredibly close relationship with Ling Han. Thus, with the large black dog’s words, it was equivalent to leading the clues to Ling Han.","Was it Ling Han’s doing?","Hiss, this guy was really not afraid of trouble.","You see, Baili Tian had just said that he wanted to marry Chi Menghan as his wife, and in the end? Ling Han had first fought with Baili Tian, and as a Sect Master, he was able to withstand a Golden Generation that was on the level of Seven Star Venerate Tier. Then, he made a public declaration, expressing that he would take Chi Menghan away from the Donglin Imperial Clan.","This kind of provocation practically caused Baili Tian to lose all face, all right?","Not only that, but they had even directly robbed the ancestral grounds of Baili Tian.","Impressive!","Thus, everyone could only admit that they were impressed.","Indeed, now that the Netherworld had invaded, the interior of the Imperial Clans were empty. However, no matter how empty it was, there would definitely be one or two Saints left behind to keep watch. Added with the Great Emperor killing formation, it was practically impregnable.","How could someone sneak in and practically ransack the entire residence?","Hehe.","The Ziwei Imperial Clan instantly became a huge joke. A great many people began to wonder if this Imperial Clan was not living up to its name?","Immediately, some people who were blind went to provoke them, and the result was naturally incredibly tragic.","After a great many people died, everyone was certain that the Ziwei Imperial Clan was still the Ziwei Imperial Clan, one of the most powerful forces in the world. It was completely because Ling Han was too powerful that the Ziwei Imperial Clan was humiliated.","Originally, Ling Han had already gradually disappeared without a trace. After all, he was eternally trapped at Sect Master-level, so he could not possibly attract the constant attention of others. Only those who could become Emperor like the Golden Generation, Yang Yihuan, Ding Shu and the others could endlessly create topics of conversation, and engender discussion.","But what was the result?","Ling Han would usually silent, but would shake the world abruptly with a single feat.","Robbing an Imperial Clan clean, was there a second person that could do it?","Meanwhile, the Ziwei Imperial Clan, who had become the butt of jokes, appeared extremely silent. They actually didn’t say anything crazy, such as telling Ling Han to bring the stolen treasures and plead guilty, or saying anything about killing Ling Han’s entire family.","They remained silent, as if nothing had happened.","This made everyone feel strange. This kind of reaction was completely not the style of the Ziwei Imperial Clan.","How domineering was the Imperial Clan? They thought they were the number one in the world, and it had only ever been them bullying others. How could they keep quiet after suffering a loss?","How strange.","However, only a month had passed, and the Ziwei Imperial Clan suddenly released news that Baili Tian would marry Chi Menghan after a hundred years.","When this news spread out, the whole world was shocked.","The Ziwei Imperial Clan’s counterattack arrived.","Wasn’t Ling Han very capable? But look, your woman is about to marry and become someone else’s wife.","If you have the ability, then come and make a fuss at the wedding.","As a mere Sect Master, if he dared to appear in public, what else could it be but courting death?","Why a hundred years later?","There was subsequent news that Baili Tian had already cultivated to Nine Star Venerate Tier, and was about to ignite the holy flame and advance into Saint Tier.","At that time, Baili Tian would become a Saint, and in his strongest state, he would kill Ling Han, who had come to cause trouble. Wouldn’t that be the best way to vent his anger?","He himself had died, and the woman he loved had married his enemy. Even if he became a ghost, he would not be able to live in peace.","Thus, this was the ultimate move of revenge that the Ziwei Imperial Clan had been preparing for a long time.","In reality, even if the Ziwei Imperial Clan wanted to kill Ling Han to vent their anger, could they do so? Where would they find him?","However, no matter how freakish Baili Tian was, it was still extremely difficult for him to become a Saint.","It may take fifty years, or it may take eighty years, but that was really uncertain.","Thus, what if Baili Tian was still unable to become a Saint if he boasted that he would become a Saint in 50 years? Wouldn’t that be slapping himself in the face?","If it was a hundred years, this time should be enough.","“A hundred years!”","Ling Han murmured to himself as he gazed into the distance. A smile slowly tugged at the corners of his lips.","In 100 years, even if he didn’t become a Saint, he would at least be able to cultivate to the level of Nine Star Venerate Tier. Moreover, with his freakish talent, Baili Tian wouldn’t necessarily be a match for him even if he became a Saint.","Ling Han tried to tear open the black chains on the fruit of cultivation, but discovered that he still lacked a little more strength.","“Thus, the key is whether or not I can break through to Fifteen Stars.”","“Once I break through to Fifteen Stars, I will be able to break through the restrictions of this heaven and earth, and this, I am sure, is also the pinnacle of Sect Master-level. It is impossible that there would be Sixteen Stars after that.”","Ling Han pulled himself together, and once again charged towards Fifteen Stars.","However, he still ended in failure, as if this was an impossible feat.","In truth, to say nothing of Fifteen Stars, above Nine Stars, which cultivation level had ever been reached before?","Fifteen Stars was as difficult as ascending the heavens!"]},{"number":4566,"title":"Chapter 4566: Fifteen Stars!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4566: Fifteen Stars!","Editor: Henyee Translations","After Ling Han recovered from his injuries, he continued to charge towards Fifteen Stars.","Once, twice, thrice... he kept failing, and every time he failed, not only would it be an incredibly painful experience, it would also damage his life force.","This was fatal. If it accumulated to a certain extent, to say nothing of breaking through, he would lose his life.","However, this was the only path that he could take.","Without breaking through to Fifteen Stars, he would not be able to tear off the shackles of the fruit of cultivation, and thus break through to Venerate Tier.","If he was eternally trapped at Sect Master-level, then there was naturally no need to mention anything else.","...","So what if he was the strongest Sect Master in history, how could this be something that Ling Han wanted to pursue?","If he didn’t succeed, he would die trying.","Ling Han wasn’t rash. Instead, he forged on slowly and steadily. Before every breakthrough, he would summarize his experience of failing last time. He couldn’t fail twice in the same ditch.","However, he was still failing, and the damage to his life force was becoming more and more serious.","Pu! Ling Han spat out a mouthful of blood. He had failed again.","“The remaining life force... is only enough for another attempt.”","“If I fail again, then I’m done for.”","“As expected of the shackle of heaven and earth.”","“I have been forced into desperate straits.”","Ling Han murmured under his breath. Although he was saying that he was going to die, his eyes were extremely bright.","After so many failures, he finally had some confidence.","“Next time, there is a fifty-fifty chance. There’s a fifty-fifty chance of ascending to the heavens, and a fifty-fifty chance of going to hell.”","Ling Han began to recuperate, and this time, he used a whole three years’ time.","Aside from the fact that his life force had been severely damaged, he had already adjusted his condition to his strongest state.","“Come!”","He was resolute, and began the final attempt to break through to Fifteen Stars.","If he failed this time, he would forever lose the chance to attempt breaking through to Fifteen Stars. In fact, he would very quickly die due to the severe wilting of his life force.","However, he didn’t care.","If he didn’t become Emperor, what difference would he be from a commoner? What difference would living for tens of thousands of years be from a salted fish1?","He sat upright. Boom, the power in his body surged rapidly, right until it was boiling. A tsunami-like change also began to take place in his mind.","Fifteen Stars, break!","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He charged wave after wave. However, the black chain was imprisoning the fruit of cultivation, and its length was limited. Furthermore, the fruit of cultivation was continuously growing, and had already stretched the black chain to its limit. No matter what, it could not advance any further.","As the saying went, Fifteen Stars, so an additional golden pattern on the fruit of cultivation was only a symbol. The true change was still the fruit of cultivation itself. Its size directly determined how many Regulations Ling Han could deliver with a single strike.","Thus, the fruit of cultivation being suppressed and unable to grow, firmly trapped Ling Han at the peak stage of Fourteen Stars.","A vein popped on Ling Han’s forehead. He was accumulating power; he was going to unleash an explosive power.","After so many failures, he discovered that though this black chain was incredibly sturdy, it was not as sturdy as iron plates. Instead, there were a few places that were relatively weaker, and this was his breakthrough point.","‘Open!’","Ling Han roared loudly. Pu, all the pores on his body were spurting out blood, and boiling energy also surged into his mind, helping him take that last step.","Kuang!","A crisp sound rang out, and a segment of the black chain snapped.","“Haha!” Ling Han laughed loudly, an indescribable heroism surging up in his heart. So what if it was the shackle of heaven and earth? It would not be able to stop him!","Just like how he wanted to become Emperor, heaven and earth couldn’t stop him!","“Open! Open! Open!”","He roared loudly. There was no need for his divine sense to take human form to break the chain. The fruit of cultivation rapidly expanded, continuously breaking the black chain.","It was as easy as crushing dry weeds and crushing rotten wood.","It was as if the fruit of cultivation had been trapped by the black chain for too long, and had also suffocated enough. At this moment, it finally exploded.","“Pu!” Ling Han opened his mouth, and spat out a mouthful of blood.","However, this mouthful of blood was black, and there was an indescribable darkness about it.","He did not have the time to take note, when he felt the energy in his body boil, and his mind move like a tide.","He was in the process of breaking through, so how could he be distracted?","Ling Han hurriedly composed himself and continued on his path of breakthrough.","However, the black shackle had already been broken, and he had also unlocked the shackle of Fifteen Stars. Wasn’t the next step simple?","Only two days later, Ling Han had truly set foot on the level of Fifteen Stars.","He opened his eyes, and with a sweep, discovered that the mouthful of blood he had spat out had disappeared.","Yi?","He frowned, but at this moment, the joy of breaking through to Fifteen Stars surpassed all else. Very quickly, a smile appeared on his face.","“Now, how strong would I be?”","Ling Han snapped his fingers, and instantly, 99 Regulations appeared at the same time.","Only 99 flashes?","It should be known that when he was at Twelve Stars, he could deliver 90 flashes of Regulations with a single strike, but when he charged up from Twelve Stars to Fifteen Stars, he actually only gained an additional nine flashes of Regulations?","It was not as simple as that.","This was because after reaching the 90th Regulation, the might of each additional Regulation would be equivalent to 10 Regulations from before!","Why?","The larger the base number of Regulations, the more intertwined Regulations would be created with the new addition, which further magnified its might.","“Now, even if I don’t use Destructive Energy, it would be enough to fight Baili Tian.”","This was really too terrifying. He was only Sect Master-level, and he was already capable of contending against him, or even defeating the strongest Golden Generation, Venerate Tier-level!","But upon further thought, his Fifteen Stars was completely equivalent to a six-star Venerate. Then, Ling Han, who was a six-star Venerate... would he still not be able to sweep aside all oppostion of Fourth Extreme?","Speaking of which, Ling Han was at a disadvantage because he couldn’t use the Seven Star Regulations. Otherwise, he wouldn’t just be able to “battle” Baili Tian, but would be able to suppress him.","“However... the loss of life force is really too great.”","Ling Han sighed. Previously, his life force had been too severely damaged. Though this would not affect his battle prowess, when he broke through to Venerate Tier or Saint Tier in future, he could only have one chance in which he must succeed.","If he failed once, his life force would be damaged again, and he would be able to say goodbye to cultivation. In fact, he might even be able to say goodbye to his life.","“There are pitifully few Great Herbs that can heal life force. Last time, even after raiding the Ziwei Imperial Clan, I still couldn’t find a single one.”","“Yi, there is none in the Baili Clan. I can go and take a look elsewhere.”","Ling Han broke into a grin. Though he had charged up to Fifteen Stars, if he wanted to reach the peak stage of Fifteen Stars, who knew how much Celestial Qi he would need.","Thus, if he could plunder a few more Imperial Clans, he should be able to quickly send his cultivation level to the end of the level of Sect Master, and then break through to Venerate Tier.","“The fourth pinnacle level... How much later am I than the others?”","Now that the Yin souls had invaded, it was as if the younger generation had all developed cheat codes. The speed of their cultivation was frighteningly fast. For example, quite a number of Silver Generation elites had already advanced into Venerate Tier, surpassing Ling Han’s cultivation level.","Of course, cultivation level was cultivation level, and battle prowess was battle prowess, so they didn’t completely match.","Ling Han came out of seclusion. When they heard the news, everyone was overjoyed.","This was a double blessing. Firstly, Ling Han had successfully broken through again, and secondly, this was also the most significant, Ling Han had finally broken through the shackle of heaven and earth.","Once he broke through, there would be no further barriers in his path of advancement.","After celebrating with everyone, Ling Han called out Brother Monkey.","“Should we go and do another job?” he asked.","“Alright, Grandpa Dog will go too!” The large black dog immediately approached."]},{"number":4567,"title":"Chapter 4567: Holy Flames","paragraphs":["Chapter 4567: Holy Flames","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Which clan should we rob?” The little azure dragon also approached. He and the large black dog were the type to want nothing more than for the world to be in chaos.","Ling Han sighed, “The two of you have come to cause trouble again?”","“What do you mean by causing trouble? With our abilities, we can be called elites no matter where we go,” the little azure dragon said defiantly.","“That’s right. Our cultivation level is higher than even you, brat,” the large black dog said.","One of them was a three-star Venerate, while the other was a four-star Venerate. Their abilities were truly impressive, and there were already not many people in the world that could surpass them.","“Sure, let’s move separately. Brother Monkey and I will be in one group, and the two of you will be in another,” Ling Han said with a smile.","...","“No way!” The large black dog and the little azure dragon shook their heads at the same time. F***, without Brother Monkey’s protection, or Ling Han’s large pile of rare treasures, they didn’t have much confidence.","After all, this was a trip to loot the Imperial Clans.","Ling Han shrugged, “Then you guys had best just obediently stay here.”","“Take us with you.”","“We promise not to cause trouble!”","The large black dog and little azure dragon looked at Ling Han with eager eyes. They even tried their best to widen their eyes to increase their sincerity.","“... All right then.”","They soon set out, their target being the Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan.","However, after learning the lesson from the Ziwei Clan, whichever Imperial Clan it was now, they had greatly increased their protection of the ancestral grounds.","Previously, as long as there was a member of their clan leading them, they would be able to freely enter and exit the imperial formation. Now? As long as there were outsiders who entered, they would all be killed.","In this way, Ling Han and the others’ hopes were directly cut off.","It wouldn’t work.","“Why don’t we shrink down and hide in the body of some member of the Shi Clan? This imperial formation can’t kill us along with that person, right?” the large black dog suggested.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “If the Great Emperor Formation is truly activated, it’ll definitely discover our presence. Even if the imperial formation doesn’t unleash any killing intent, we’ll definitely suffer once the Saint from the Shi Clan appears.”","“That’s right. Old Black is really unreliable, coming up with all kinds of bad ideas,” the little azure dragon took the chance to complain.","“If you’re so capable, why don’t you come up with an idea?” the large black dog rolled his eyes.","The little azure dragon naturally refused; how could there possibly be a solution?","Unless they had the strength of a Pseudo-Emperor and could forcefully break through the formation.","But that was only a guess. It was still unknown whether the Pseudo-Emperor could hold up to the Great Emperor killing formation.","“Let’s go.” Ling Han shook his head.","“We’re just going to return with our tails between our legs like this?” The large black dog was dissatisfied.","“Yeah, that’s too embarrassing,” the little azure dragon also said.","Ling Han smiled, “Then Brother Monkey and I will go back first, and wait for good news from the two of you.”","“No, no, no.” The large black dog immediately shook his head, and said, “Grandpa Dog performed a divination just now. Our luck hasn’t been good these past few days, so we’re more suited to a peaceful life at home.”","Of course, Ling Han was only teasing. The four of them had no choice but to return.","They went to a few other Imperial Clans, but without exception, all of them increased their defenses.","Moreover, there were even more Imperial Clans hidden in the depths of the universe, such as the Buddhist Race in the 33 Heavens, and so on. Who knew what kind of place that was or where it was.","Not long after returning, the Nine Mountains Saint suddenly arrived.","The Nine Mountains Saint couldn’t help but frown upon seeing Ling Han. “And you’re still at the Sect Master-level? I’ve received news that you’ve been restricted by the Heavenly Dao and are unable to break through to the fourth pinnacle level. At first, I thought this was only a rumor, but I didn’t expect it to be true!”","Otherwise, if even the Silver Generation elites were beginning to advance into the Venerate Tier, there was no reason that Ling Han was still stuck at the level of Sect Master.","The Nine Mountains Saint looked up at the sky, and said, “Damn heavens, you’re far too ruthless!” Kuang! However, a bolt of lightning suddenly materialized in the air and struck down at him.","The Nine Mountains Saint reached over to block this attack, yet a scorch mark appeared on his palm.","Gasp! A Saint had been wounded?","This was a punishment from the heaven and earth, because the Nine Mountains Saint had insulted the Heavenly Dao.","Why was it that no matter how others cursed heaven and earth, it was fine, but Saints could not?","This was because the Saint could accomodate the Regulations of heaven and earth after igniting the holy flame. Thus, they could be viewed as the representative of the Heavenly Dao.","Thus, Saints naturally couldn’t insult heaven and earth.","Without waiting for Ling Han to speak, the Nine Mountains Saint immediately said, “I’ll use the holy flame to help you break out of this situation!”","Ling Han got a scare. The old man was going all out.","The holy flame was the foundation of a Saint. Once it was extinguished, not only would one fall from the position of Saint, it would also signify that their life had come to an end.","And the growth of the holy flame was extraordinarily difficult. Thus, after a great many Saints had advanced into Saint Tier, they would be stuck at the level of One Star all their lives, and would not be able to take another step further.","The old man was using the holy flame to help him. That was practically risking his position as a Saint and his life.","Ling Han was touched, and he hurriedly said, “Old man, I’ve already broken through the seal of heaven and earth. Now, as long as I have enough Celestial Qi, I can break through to the fourth pinnacle level.”","The Nine Mountains Saint faltered upon hearing this. “Really?”","“Of course it’s real,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Hahahaha!” The Nine Mountains Saint laughed loudly. He had been fortunate enough to break through to become a Saint, but his potential had practically been exhausted. There was no hope for him to become a Two Star Saint in this lifetime.","Thus, his hopes were all on Ling Han.","This incredibly young disciple could become Emperor.","Ling Han displayed his strength, causing the Nine Mountains Saint to remain silent for a long time.","Previously, he had seen Ling Han’s performance through the Galaxy Network. He had not been at a disadvantage even when battling a seven-star Venerate like Baili Tian. The freakish nature of Ling Han was indescribable, but from the look of things now, Ling Han’s strength had increased explosively again.","“If you battle Baili Tian again now, you will definitely be able to kill him within ten moves,” the old man concluded.","Ling Han nodded. That was indeed the case. Of course, the prerequisite was Baili Tian was still a Seven Star Venerate.","However, Baili Tian had already become a nine-star Venerate a few years ago, and was beginning to break through to Saint Tier. It was naturally impossible that his battle prowess would still remain at the level of seven-star Venerate Tier.","The Nine Mountains Saint and had a burden lifted off his heart, so he was naturally in a good mood. Thus, he started to ask Ling Han about his experiences in the past few years.","Ling Han highlighted the key points, then with a thought, he took out the broken sword, and said, “Old man, please take a look.”","“Yi!” The Nine Mountains Saint caught the broken sword, and his brows immediately twitched.","“Found something?”","“This is a Saint Tool, but it’s already damaged, so it can’t unleash its full might,” the Nine Mountains Saint said. “However, there’s actually a wisp of the holy flame within!”","The holy flame!","To Saints, the holy flame was the most valuable item. It could help boost their cultivation level and extend their lifespan.","In theory, when a Saint dies, the holy flame would be extinguished.","There was actually a sliver of the holy flame in this broken sword?","The Nine Mountains Saint handed the broken sword back to Ling Han, saying, “When you advance to the Saint Tier, you can absorb the holy flame inside this sword to help you stabilize and elevate your cultivation level.”","Ling Han didn’t put the broken sword away. Instead, he said, “Old man, why don’t you refine this? You’re a Saint, so it’ll be more useful to you than to me. Moreover, this holy flame is definitely gradually weakening, so it’s best not to waste it.”","However, the Nine Mountains Saint was unwilling to accept it. “I’ve just advanced to the Saint Tier, so my lifespan is extremely long. There’s no need for that.”","They kept pushing the broken sword to one another, and both of them wanted to give this sliver of holy flame to the other."]},{"number":4568,"title":"Chapter 4568: Saint Tomb","paragraphs":["Chapter 4568: Saint Tomb","Editor: Henyee Translations","If outsiders saw this, they would definitely exclaim in disbelief.","This was the holy flame! Even Saints would be envious of it, yet these two people were actually pushing to to each other?","You guys don’t want it, but we do.","In the end, it was still the Nine Mountains Saint that accepted the broken sword. Just as Ling Han had said, this holy flame was constantly weakening. Who knows, when Ling Han became a Saint, it would have completely extinguished. That would really be too much of a waste.","The old man was very rueful. The reason why he had been able to advance into Saint Tier was because of the Imperial Scroll that Ling Han had given him, and now he had also taken his disciple’s holy flame, which made him, as a senior, feel very apologetic. Why did he keep accepting things from this disciple?","For others, it was the seniors who would be bestowing things on their juniors.","...","However, the Nine Mountains Saint hadn’t come just to see Ling Han. There was another matter—an extremely important matter.","The Saint Tomb had opened.","“The Saint Tomb?” Ling Han was surprised. He had never heard of such a place.","What was going on? Were Saints all buried there after their deaths?","That was impossible.","“The Saint Tomb is an extremely mysterious place in the universe,” the Nine Mountains Saint said. “From some unknown era onwards, more and more elderly Saints started to venture there. They wanted to make a final gamble and see if they could obtain the holy flame and extend their lifespan.”","“As time passed, more and more Saints went there.”","“And indeed, there is the holy flame there. A Saint managed to obtain it successfully, extending his lifespan and increasing his abilities.”","“Thus, every time it opened, not only would the old Saints go, but there would also be a great many new Saints. After all, the holy flame is not something as simple as extending their lifespan.”","“Because there are innumerable Saints buried there, and under the nourishment of innumerable Saint-level substances, that place is also rich in Great Herbs.”","Realization dawned on Ling Han. No wonder the Nine Mountains Saint had come. That was because it was not just the Saints. The others could also benefit from the Saint Tomb.","According to the old man’s original plans, he wanted to use the holy flame to help him, and then bring him to the Saint Tomb.","—The old man could use that holy flame to repair himself, and in his case, he could also search for opportunities there, and take another step further.","“Has the Saint Tomb already opened?” Ling Han asked.","“It hasn’t completely opened yet. There are only signs,” the Nine Mountains Saint said. “It’ll probably take half a month, at most, and no more than a month.”","Ling Han nodded. Where there was Saintly medicine, there would definitely be Celestial Qi. Thus, if he was lucky, when he came out of the Saint Tomb, he would be a Venerate Tier.","He called Brother Monkey, the large black dog, and the others over. Everyone prepared themselves, and then set out.","There were not many people going this time, and they were at least Venerate Tier-level, or those with Venerate Tier-level battle prowess. Those like the empress and the others stayed back. Even if they went, they would not be of much help.","In the Saint Tomb, the main force would definitely be the Saint.","Ling Han and the others had to be careful. They didn’t want to be killed by someone in a moment of carelessness.","The Saint Tomb was about to open, and a large amount of saintly power surged through the universe. Every Saint would sense this, so there was no need for anyone to inform them. Every Saint was aware of this matter.","When Ling Han and the others arrived, they saw that a hole had cracked open in space. Hurricanes blew out, turning into a terrifying energy storm that swept through the universe.","There were a great many Saints here.","Even though the Netherworld beings were invading, and this was a critical period of the war, a large number of Saints still arrived.","There were a lot of important things in this world, but nothing was naturally as important as one’s own life. Moreover, if he could obtain the holy flame, and increase his battle prowess, wouldn’t he be able to better defend against the invasion of the Netherworld?","Ling Han and the others were all very low-key, and even concealed their appearance to avoid being recognized.","After all, the Nine Mountains Saint was only a One Star Saint. Without the might of the Imperial Weapon, the Nine Mountains Saint’s battle prowess was the lowest level among Saints.","Of course, he still had the Saint Tool. It was forged by the Nine Suns Saint, so its might was astonishing. If they really fought to the death, there were not many Saints that could defeat the old man.","However, they had come to search for great opportunities. If they fought, what else would they have time to find?","Right now, the Saint Tomb was still yet to open. Thus, they all waited in silence.","These were all Saints, and any one of them could shake the universe with a single stomp of their feet. All of them exuded an air of pride.","Ling Han could see very clearly. As expected, the majority of Saints had brought their juniors with them. To everyone, this was a great opportunity.","As time passed, more and more Saints came. A great many of them came from the Imperial Clans.","Some Saints were so old that their teeth had fallen out of their mouths. Their entire bodies were exuding an aura of decay.","It should be known that Saints could regrow severed limbs, yet now, even their teeth had fallen out completely. It was clear just how badly the life force had lost. The holy flame was already like a candle in the wind, and could be extinguished at any moment.","This kind of Saint was naturally here to make a final gamble. As long as he could find a large amount of holy flame, so that the holy flame in his body could once again burn fiercely, he would be able to return to his prime.","Quite a number of Golden Generations had come.","Ling Han swept an eye over them. It could be said that aside from Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian, all the Golden Generations had arrived, and they were basically either eight or nine stars in cultivation level. They were already not far from lighting up the holy flame.","In the case of the Silver Generation, most of them had already advanced into the Venerate Tier, and only a small number were still stuck at the level of Sect Master. In the case of the ordinary Imperial Sons, there was temporarily no one that had advanced into the Venerate Tier.","Ding Shu was here, Origin was here, Jing Haoran was here, and so on. These masters of the Genesis World were all here, but Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling and other ancient prodigies were nowhere to be seen.","Yi, why could they be seen in some places, but not in other places?","This was the Saint Tomb; weren’t the opportunities here great enough?","Ling Han was only curious for a moment, but did not take it to heart. This had nothing to do with him.","Another few days later, that crack in space became larger and larger, and the energy storm that swept out became stronger and stronger. Even the Saints were unwilling to face it directly, and they all dodged.","The Saint Tomb was about to open.","Ling Han saw the old Saint from the Donglin Imperial Clan. He had brought a few juniors with him, and one of them was Chi Dao. However, their strongest clan member, Chi Menghan, was not among them.","This supreme prodigy that was comparable to the Golden Generation actually didn’t come?","Although Chi Menghan’s natural talent was astonishing, it definitely hadn’t reached the point where she could attempt to break through to the Saint Tier.","Thus, she had most likely been grounded by the Donglin Imperial Clan, so there was no way she could leave.","Otherwise, if Chi Menghan ran off with Ling Han, wouldn’t the Donglin Imperial Clan be utterly humiliated?","Moreover, they would also become enemies with the Ziwei Imperial Clan because of this.","Another two days later, that fissure opened up to the size of a planet, and madly poured out the energy storm, which lasted for half a day’s time. Then, the energy storm withdrew, and finally, it became completely peaceful.","The Saint Tomb had opened.","“Let’s go!”","One after another, Saints flew out, bringing their juniors with them, and rushed into that massive crevice.","“Let’s go too,” the Nine Mountains Saint said. He grabbed the others, and with a step, he had already stepped into the large crack."]},{"number":4569,"title":"Chapter 4569: Broken Planet","paragraphs":["Chapter 4569: Broken Planet","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was a dark world, just like the cold universe outside. It was empty.","But now, multiple Saints were exuding light, like torches in the darkness.","Ling Han saw a flame burning inside the Nine Mountains Saint’s body.","That was the holy flame!","Strange, if it was in this place, the holy flame would actually appear automatically.","It could be seen that the color of the holy flame was different.","...","Some were purple, some were red, some were white, and their sizes were also different. Some were only the size of a fist, some were the size of a human head, and some were even like a furnace.","Strange, it was clearly inside the body, and the body was only normal in size, but the size of the holy flame far exceeded that.","“There are nine levels in Saint Tier, and the color of the holy flame corresponding to each minor level is different,” the Nine Mountains Saint explained to Ling Han and the others. “For example, I’m only a One Star Saint, and the color of the holy flame is white.”","“Further up, two stars would be red, three stars would be orange, four stars would be yellow, five stars would be green, six stars would be green, seven stars would be blue, eight stars would be purple, and nine stars would be black.”","With these words, it was very easy to distinguish the cultivation level of the Saint.","Ling Han swept his gaze over the surroundings again, and discovered that the majority of the people here were Five Star Saints. There were more low-level Saints, and those above Five Stars were pitifully few.","The Saint with the highest cultivation level was an eight-star Saint. However, his entire body was enshrouded in black mist, and it was impossible to distinguish his appearance at all.","—If it was not for the fact that this place would automatically manifest the holy flame, it was probable that everyone would have overlooked him. How could they have possibly imagined that he was actually an eight-star Saint here!","In the first place, there were not many Saints in the world, and there were even pitifully few Eight Star Saints.","Everyone was guessing the origins of this person. Though cultivation level couldn’t absolutely represent battle prowess, being able to cultivate to eight stars, how could he not be strong?","Moreover, he could already cultivate to Saint Tier, and mediocre people would have long since died off completely.","After advancing for a while, they saw that a floating continent had actually appeared ahead of them.","This continent had been forcefully dug out from a planet. It was flat on top, and protruding on the bottom. It itself was like a mountain that had been turned upside down.","Was this the Saint Tomb?","Ahead of them, a great number of Saints had already stopped, and landed on that continent.","The Nine Mountains Saint, Ling Han, and the others also descended. This was a desolate world. Although it was covered with forests, every single tree had already died, leaving behind only bare tree trunks.","The ground was also black, like black iron.","The Nine Mountains Saint set down the four of them. They all possessed battle prowess on the level of Venerate Tier, so they were completely capable of walking freely in this place.","This continent wasn’t large, and they quickly circled around. However, they didn’t discover anything.","This was an ordinary continent. There was no Celestial medicine, nor was there any Saintly corpse.","Saint Tomb?","Without a Saint’s corpse, how could this be called Saint Tomb?","When they reached the end of the continent, they saw that a great many Saints had already set out with their juniors, continuing onwards.","The Nine Mountains Saint also set off with Ling Han and the others, heading towards their next destination.","Another half a day passed, and another floating continent appeared ahead of them.","After searching for a while, they found nothing.","However, this continent was slightly larger than the previous one.","Next, they saw a great many floating continents, scattered here and there in this pitch-black space. There was nothing on them, but their size was getting larger and larger.","Finally, after travelling for another three days, they saw a massive planet.","Upon a closer look, everyone was stunned.","That was because this planet had actually been destroyed, leaving behind only a core.","Gasp! Had the floating continents all originated from this planet?","Everyone tried to reconstruct this planet in their minds, and couldn’t help but hiss sharply.","It was huge, astonishingly huge.","When this planet was in its complete form, its size was incredibly shocking. At present, there was not a single planet in the universe that could compare to it.","Going by that theory, this was the heart of this place, and also the end?","The Saints all descended, arriving at the core of this planet.","In truth, though this was the inner core of a planet, it was still astonishingly huge. It was not inferior to any great planet of today.","“Yi?”","As soon as they landed, the Saints all exclaimed in shock. That was because in this place, their holy flames were suddenly suppressed, and their abilities were greatly restricted.","Of course, no matter how restricted they were, their strength was still far superior to the Venerate Tier. However, if the gap in strength between a One Star Saint and a Three Star Saint had been ten times, it had now shrunk to three times, or even smaller.","In this way, the Saints with lower cultivation levels were much more relaxed, because even if they encountered a Nine-Star Saint, they would not be overwhelmed. Though they were still outmatched, they had gained quite a bit of initiative.","They began a search, looking for any clues.","After circling around, this planet was still very empty. However, in the extreme south, there was a massive cave.","Was this the key to this place?","Without much hesitation, the Saints all entered.","After walking for another half a day, a fork in the path appeared in the cave.","Ling Han and the others tried to take the left tunnel, but before they could enter, they immediately felt a terrifying pressure assault them, forcing them to hurriedly retreat.","If they were to face this head-on, they would definitely be crushed into dust.","Only the Nine Mountains Saint could enter.","This was saintly might.","Trying out the other path, though the pressure was not small either, a Venerate was completely capable of coming and going as he pleased.","“Old man, the true Saint Tomb should be on this path on the left,” Ling Han said. “Then, we’ll go our separate ways here.”","The Nine Mountains Saint thought for a moment, then nodded.","Now that they were here, it was impossible for the younger generation to take the left path. They could only choose the right path. Then, with the strength of Ling Han and the others, they would not be afraid of anyone.","And would a Saint walk the path on the right?","Saints weren’t babysitters, so they definitely had to search for their own opportunities. Thus, how could they leave the holy flame alone and not search for it, but choose to stand guard over their juniors?","There was no Emperor in the world, and Saints were the strongest. What kind of status did they have?","Even if 100 juniors all advanced one step further, none of these improvements were as significant as raising the Saint’s cultivation level by one star or increasing his lifespan by a few hundred years.","Thus, Ling Han and the others should also be facing a competition of peers, and even if they encountered a nine-star Venerate, what need was there for Ling Han and the others to be afraid?","The Nine Mountains Saint set off without worry, while Ling Han and the others entered the other path.","After walking for a long time, the path ahead suddenly opened up, and an extremely long canyon appeared.","At the entrance to the canyon, there was a large number of young people standing. They did not rashly enter into the canyon.","This was the Saint Tomb. Even if there was no pressure from a Saint here, how could they act rashly?","Right now, many people were trying to form good relations with each other. Since they couldn’t rely on the Saint from their respective forces anymore, and since they weren’t powerful enough, they could only rely on each other. Although this would decrease their profits, it was still better than having no profits at all. In fact, it would be better than losing their lives, right?","Thus, small teams quickly formed one after another.","“The four of you, go, scout ahead!”","Just as Ling Han and the others were observing the situation, someone suddenly shouted at them."]},{"number":4570,"title":"Chapter 4570: Command","paragraphs":["Chapter 4570: Command","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han knew that they were all people who were born with a halo of trouble. Wherever they went, they would cause trouble.","However, they had just arrived, and trouble had already befallen on them. This still made him grit his teeth.","This was too disrespectful, wasn’t it?","Ling Han and the others exchanged looks, and all of them smiled.","“You guys... are you sure you want to do this?” Ling Han asked.","There were a total of seven of them, and they were all Sect Masters. Furthermore, they were all high-level Sect Masters. Although they looked young, each of them had lived for about ten thousand years.","...","Thus, these seven people were most likely the Dao Child of some Holy Land, who had been brought here by the Saint of their forces.","They gathered together for warmth, but still felt that this canyon was dangerous and unpredictable, and wanted others to take the lead.","However, they were really too jumpy.","Didn’t they see that the Imperial Sons here were also watching, and did not make any rash moves? What were they trying to do?","Could it be that they wanted to use this to show their goodwill to the Imperial Sons?","Hehe, if they were planning this, then they would really be making a huge mistake.","“What is it? Are we still unable to command you?” A man in white robes asked proudly.","Ling Han and the others all shook their heads. In order to keep a low profile, they not only changed their appearance, but also suppressed their cultivation level, exuding the aura of Sect Master. Of course, Ling Han didn’t need to do anything extra. He was already a Sect Master, in the first place.","However, the disadvantage of being too low-key was that one would be easily bullied.","“Scram!” Brother Monkey rebuked harshly, and his face appeared and disappeared in a flash. Meanwhile, the aura of a Venerate Tier also fluctuated vaguely.","Pa, pa, pa! The seven Sect Masters all collapsed to the ground, cold sweat pouring down their bodies. They had really been scared out of their wits.","Gods, it was as if they had seen an ancient Demonic Monkey that could split open the skies and shatter the earth, making them wet their pants in fright.","They didn’t dare to say a word as they hurriedly scrambled to their feet and fled.","At this moment, they were all on the verge of a mental breakdown. Why had they simply picked a random few people to bully, and discovered that they had kicked an iron plate","Thankfully, Ling Han and the others had not killed all of them. Otherwise, how could they have escaped so easily?","“Yo, the four of you are pretending to be pigs to eat tigers!” A young man was waving a paper fan. He was dressed in snow-white robes, and looked to have an elegant and peerless bearing.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel awkward, but his expression was strange, because this young man was one of the three cultivators that he had seen in the Medicinal Garden in Ziwei Imperial Clan. At the time, those three people had gotten permission to cultivate beside the Saintly medicine, but in the end, because the mature Saintly medicine had been harvested by Ling Han, it caused them to be suspicious for a long time.","This was a member of the Baili Clan. Hehe, Ling Han revealed a smile, and said, “In the dark of night, you’re waving a paper fan. The smell of showing off has already floated very far.”","“Haha!” The large black dog and little azure dragon laughed loudly. Brother Monkey, on the other hand, was unconcerned. He used the Fiery Golden Eyes, and carefully surveyed this valley.","Brother Monkey’s Fiery Golden Eyes were not inferior to Ling Han’s eye technique. Thus, Ling Han was also very relaxed, and could spare some time to play around.","“How dare you!” The white-robed young man’s expression became stern, “Do you know who I am?”","“Sigh!” The large black dog sighed, and said, “Can’t you villains be a little more creative? Don’t ask ‘do you know who I am’ every time! F*ck! How does Grandpa Dog know who you are?”","The white-robed young man almost exploded in fury. He was a member of the Imperial Clan. Furthermore, after one of the two Imperial Sons had been crippled, and the other had been killed, he had already been promoted to become a Pseudo Imperial Son.","As long as he performed well this time, and obtained a great opportunity in the Saint Tomb, he would be able to become a genuine Imperial Son.","Thus, he was naturally proud. Furthermore, precisely because he was not yet the Imperial Son, he was far prouder than the real Imperial Son. After all, his pride was weaker, and he had not developed strong self-confidence yet.","“I am Baili Yunhe!” he called out loudly, “The newly promoted Pseudo-Imperial Son of the Ziwei Imperial Clan!”","“Che, only a Pseudo-Imperial Son.” The large black dog waved his paw.","“Grandpa Dragon has even killed a few Imperial Sons,” the little azure dragon also boasted.","Baili Yunhe scoffed. What a joke; how many Imperial Sons have you killed? Why don’t you just ascend to the heavens while you are at it?","“You people are pretending to be pigs to eat tigers. Aren’t you afraid of encountering the True Dragon, who would turn around and devour you?” Baili Yunhe said balefully1.","“You’re asking for a beating!” The little azure dragon was enraged, and it threw a punch.","Peng!","Baili Yunhe was instantly sent flying. How could he withstand a single blow?","“Grandpa Dragon hates it the most when people like you pretend to be the the descendant of the True Dragon!” the little azure dragon said in displeasure.","Now, there was only one pure Dragon Race in the world, and that was him.","This punch caused those in the vicinity to turn their eyes towards him. A considerable number of Imperial Sons even looked suspicious.","Why did these four people give them a familiar feeling?","Baili Yunhe got to his feet. His eyes were fixed on the little azure dragon, and he revealed an expression of fury.","As a member of the Imperial Clan, he had actually been sent flying in public?","This was a great humiliation!","“Tell me your name!” he said proudly. He was clearly outmatched, but his attitude became even more arrogant.","The little azure dragon looked towards Ling Han. Ling Han pondered for a moment, then nodded.","They were already here, so there was no need for them to hide their identities any longer.","Ling Han opened his mouth, and said, “Little He, have you forgotten that when you were in the Medicinal Garden, the power of heaven and earth suddenly exhausted, and Regulations did not appear?”","Pu!","A considerable number spluttered. Little He, to think that this guy could actually utter such words.","Furthermore, what did this guy mean?","Others didn’t know, and were puzzled, but Baili Yunhe’s heart was suddenly hammered heavily.","Ling Han!","Though the whole world knew that the Ziwei Clan had been ransacked, the details were only limited to the core members of the Baili Clan, and those who knew that he had been cultivating in the Medicinal Garden... could only be the people involved.","Heavens, at that time, Ling Han was actually in the Medicinal Garden, and actually was right next to him?","Baili Yunhe instantly started to shiver. Who didn’t know that Ling Han was the Imperial Son Killer? He had killed members of Imperial Clans without batting an eyelid!","He was just lucky.","Yi, could it be that he was not Imperial Son, and that was why Ling Han did not kill him... not good, then he was nowa Pseudo-Imperial Son. Then wouldn’t he be on Ling Han’s kill list?","If it was anyone else, Baili Yunhe wouldn’t be afraid at all, but Ling Han was different.","This was the publicly acknowledged Imperial Son Killer. Who knew how many Imperial Sons had died at his hands? Now when his name was spoken in the Imperial Clans, it was enough to stop children from crying.","All of a sudden, Baili Yunhe’s forehead was covered with cold sweat. He felt that his legs were trembling so much that he could collapse at any moment.","Yi, what was going on here?","Everyone was astounded. Ling Han had only said something without rhyme or reason, so why had Baili Yunhe become like this?","What kind of magic did these words carry?","“Have your dog’s eyes been blinded? You don’t even recognize your Grandpa Dragon?” The little azure dragon also revealed itself at the right time.","Though a great many years had passed, his body had not grown too much. He was still like a four-legged snake. At most, he had only grown a foot.","He was far from reaching the age of a young dragon. No matter how high his cultivation level was, he was still a young dragon.","“F*ck off! What do you mean by ‘dog’s eyes blinded’?” The large black dog immediately flared up in anger. Wasn’t this insulting a baldy right in front of a monk?","“I’ll bite you to death!” The large black dog also returned to its original form, biting at the little azure dragon."]},{"number":4571,"title":"Chapter 4571: Strength!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4571: Strength!","Editor: Henyee Translations","Woof, woof, woof! Howl, howl, howl!","The little azure dragon and the large black dog were embroiled in a fierce battle.","This wasn’t the first time that this pair of jokers had caused such a ruckus. Ling Han didn’t even cast a second look at them. At most, he would only give them a kick when they were about to bite him.","“Four-Legged Snake!”","“Despicable dog!”","At this moment, everyone cried out one after another, all of them in disbelief.","This pair of jokers was only secondary. The main thing was now that they had appeared, how far could Ling Han be?","“You, you, you, you, you, you are... Ling Han!” Baili Yunhe finally could speak. He pointed at Ling Han, his voice trembling, his pupils contracting.","The Imperial Son Killer, a supreme demon king!","Ling Han smiled faintly. His appearance changed, and he returned to his original appearance.","“Ling Han!”","“It really is Ling Han!”","Everyone exclaimed one after another. Though everyone knew that Ling Han was trapped at the level of Sect Master forever, the battle prowess of this Sect Master was really too strong. In the past, he could even battle a seven-star Venerate, Baili Tian. That had really stunned the world.","Though very few people were discussing Ling Han now, but when they saw this legendary figure with their own eyes, who wouldn’t sigh with emotion?","—If it was not for the restrictions of heaven and earth, this guy could possibly become the strongest Venerate in history, the strongest Saint in history or even actually ascend the throne.","“Hehe, Brother Ling, long time no see!” Ding Shu greeted Ling Han.","Ling Han looked over, and said with a smile, “What is it? Do you think you can defeat me now, so you don’t even call me Master anymore?”","Ding Shu’s expression instantly became gloomy. If he had known this earlier, why would he have greeted him?","“You’re already frozen at the Sect Master level, so why is your mouth still so unforgiving?” he sighed.","“What a pity. I had initially wanted to spar with you.” Shui Qingchang, meanwhile, felt it was a pity. She was already a seven-star Venerate. Though she had reached the same level as Baili Tian in the past, just how powerful was the battle prowess of the Genesis World’s master?","Furthermore, Ling Han could stand against Baili Tian because he had mastered Destructive Energy, but it should be known that Shui Qingchang had also mastered Destructive Energy, though she had not reached its complete form yet.","Thus, while both was a Seven Star Venerate battling against a Sect Master, she was naturally confident that she could defeat Ling Han. In fact, she could even insta-kill Ling Han.","Since that was the case, was there still any need to battle?","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Then please protect me, Big Sister Shui.”","Shui Qingchang instantly rolled her eyes. “Who’s your sister? Am I that old?”","Among the Genesis World’s rulers, which one of them wasn’t an old monster who had lived for countless years?","But no matter what, Shui Qingchang was still a woman, and as long as she was a woman, there wasn’t one that didn’t care about age.","“Ling Han!” At this moment, an Imperial Son spoke up, interrupting the reminiscence between Ling Han and his “old friends”.","“Are you seeking death?” Ling Han turned around to look. This was Jade Drop Imperial Clan’s Han Yun, so he naturally didn’t need to give him any face.","However, Han Yun was already a nine-star Venerate now. He had entered the Saint Tomb this time to strengthen Saint-level experiences, so that he could catch up to Baili Tian, Yan Dongming, or even surpass them in terms of cultivation level.","The battle to become Emperor had already reached a crucial point.","Thus, he naturally looked down on Ling Han.","—No matter how powerful Ling Han was, he could only manage a tie with Baili Tian, who was a seven-star Venerate. However, they were both Golden Generations, and he was already a nine-star Venerate, and what about Ling Han?","He was eternally stuck at Sect Master-level, so it was already impossible for his abilities to improve any further.","There was a great disparity in battle prowess, so was there any need to go into more detail?","Han Yun looked at Ling Han proudly, and said calmly, “You are already a cripple. Logically speaking, you should hide in some corner of the universe, and watch the changes of the era from the sidelines. In that way, you would still be able to live out your retirement in peace.”","“Yet you insist on jumping around. How preposterous!”","“Grandpa Dragon will go and kill him!” The little azure dragon jumped out.","Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, “You are no match for him.”","The little azure dragon was at a disadvantage in terms of cultivation level. It was only at seven stars, and could at most rival Han Yun, who was at eight stars. After all, the latter was a Golden Generation, and this wasn’t just empty boasting.","Although it was displeased, the little azure dragon still stepped back.","“At least you know your own limitations,” Han Yun said calmly.","Ling Han smiled, “Does the Han Clan still have a reserve Imperial Son?”","What was the meaning of this?","“I’ve already killed Han Di. If I kill you this time, will the Han Clan have a temporary deficit in manpower?” Ling Han added.","This!","Just how confident are you?","He had clearly been trapped forever at Sect Master-level, so why did he still feel like he was the number one prodigy in the world?","“Hehe, since you are so determined to seek death, then I will oblige you!” Han Yun strode forwards, heading towards Ling Han. Boom, multiple ribbons of iridescent light surged out of his body, turning into long rivers.","This was a nine-star Venerate, and furthermore, he was a Golden Generation at that. It was really unreasonable that he was so strong. Only Saints could suppress him.","Ling Han stood, arms crossed behind his back, as if he had no intention of fighting at all.","“Die!” Han Yun pointed a finger at Ling Han, and instantly, a long river surged out, slashing towards Ling Han.","In the long river, the manifestations of Regulations appeared faintly.","Seven Star Regulations, sixteen flashes!","Han Yun didn’t overestimate himself. He knew that Ling Han was freakish, and with the help of that mysterious black energy, he could even resist fourteen Seven Star Regulations. Thus, he went all out from the very beginning.","Boom, the long river surged over. Every drop of river water contained the Seven Star Regulations, and its destructive power was incredibly terrifying.","How was Ling Han supposed to block this?","Everyone was curious. It should be known that Han Yun was much stronger than Baili Tian from many years ago. After this trip, he should be able to break through to Saint Tier.","How many Saints had there been in history that were 200 to 300 years old?","This era was really too expansive and grand. Unfortunately, Ling Han was destined to only be able to watch from the sidelines, and could not personally participate.","Sigh, he was probably unwilling to accept this, and that was why he insisted on challenging Han Yun.","The problem was, even if you didn’t die this time, so what? Would you be able to become a Venerate? Would you be able to become a Saint?","Thus, you would ultimately be abandoned by time.","Right in front of everyone’s eyes, Ling Han also stretched out a finger to greet that long river.","The 95 Regulations were faintly discernible, intertwining into one piece, exuding an indescribable brilliance.","Peng!","With a tap of his finger, the long river instantly crumbled, but fourteen Seven Star Regulations appeared, turning into a Divine Sword that continued to slash down.","However, the Regulations that Ling Han shot out formed into a fist that blocked the Divine Sword.","Ka, ka, ka, ka!","Cracks appeared on the Divine Sword and fist at the same time, and in the end, they both crumbled.","W-what!","This scene caused everyone’s eyes to pop out of their heads.","He had blocked it, and it was done so carelessly at that, so easily and casually.","This guy had become a Venerate?","No, no, no. This aura was clearly at the level of Sect Master. Furthermore, everyone could clearly see that the Regulations that the other had used were clearly Six Stars.","Heavens, heavens!","In other words, although Ling Han was trapped at the level of Sect Master, his strength was constantly improving. From the time when he could just barely match Baili Tian, to now when he could easily block Han Yun, just how much had his abilities improved?","It should be known that he had not used that black-coloured energy yet!","Everyone felt their scalps go numb. Even Ding Shu and the others inhaled sharply, and looked solemn."]},{"number":4572,"title":"Chapter 4572: Battling the Imperial Sons","paragraphs":["Chapter 4572: Battling the Imperial Sons","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone knew that the higher one’s cultivation level, the harder it was to battle above one’s cultivation level.","When one’s cultivation level was low, there were indeed people who could defeat their opponent with a disadvantage of a major tier, and as one’s cultivation level increased, the range of tier surpassing battle prowess would become smaller and smaller.","And when it came to Venerate Tier, only the Golden Generation could battle with a gap of around seven stars.","But what about Ling Han?","Not only did he manage to surpass a major tier, but he even managed to surpass a series of minor levels.","What kind of monster are you?","Han Yun hadn’t expected this either. After being stunned for a moment, he moved again. Boom, boom, boom! This time, the seven rivers surged at the same time, charging towards Ling Han.","Ling Han casually moved, completely dispersing the attack that came towards him, appearing to be extremely relaxed.","At this moment, everyone had to admit that Ling Han indeed possessed the strength to match a nine-star Venerate . Moreover, this nine-star Venerate was a Golden Generation elite.","It could be said that Ling Han was already capable of sweeping aside the entire level of Venerate Tier.","This was practically a freak.","Throughout the ages, who could do this?","“Don’t tell me that though Ling Han’s cultivation level has been trapped forever at Sect Master-level, his abilities can be endlessly improved. In fact, he can even reach the power of a Saint!”","“Hehe, impossible! Absolutely impossible!”","“Are you sure? You have to know that if someone had told you before that a Sect Master was capable of matching a Venerate Tier, would you believe it? Moreover, it isn’t a One Star or Two Star Venerate, but a Nine Star Venerate, and a Golden Generation at that?”","“However, surpassing two major tiers... Moreover, just how powerful is a Saint? After igniting the holy flame, one has truly transcended the level of elites. Instead, he would be a supreme great elite!”","Everyone was stunned by Ling Han’s strength, but they still did not think that Ling Han would be able to grow endlessly, to even be capable of matching a Saint.","This was something that they had guessed. Fifteen Stars was the end of Ling Han’s line. He could not take another step further, and charge up to Sixteen Stars.","Han Yun did not make another move. When one had reached a height like he had, the depth of his opponent would be known with a slight probe, and he was certain that Ling Han had definitely not relied on external factors to be a match for him, but had truly possessed this kind of battle prowess.","He couldn’t figure it out. How could a mere Sect Master be as strong as this?","Ling Han was always able to break through his limits time and time again, breaking everyone’s understanding, creating miracles that others didn’t even dare to think about.","But now that things had come to this, was there any way out for him?","Even a nine-star Venerate couldn’t kill a Sect Master, and this would become an internal demon that he couldn’t erase. Would he still be able to break through to Saint Tier?","“Die!” He charged out once more, “Drop the Jade Drop into the Underworld, and the Heavenly River will be destroyed for ten thousand miles!”","Boom, streams of river water descended from the skies, like waterfalls, but also like sharp blades.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and leaped out, greeting Han Yun’s attack.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The two of them battled fiercely, but it could be clearly seen that Ling Han was obviously much more relaxed. At times, he would only use his left hand, at times, his right hand, and at times, he would place his hands behind his back, completely relying on the movement of his feet to dodge.","Han Yun, on the other hand, was going all out. His expression was twisted, and his mentality was about to collapse.","“Ling, Han!” Han Yun roared loudly. Boom! There was actually a sliver of saintly might circulating in his body.","He was getting serious.","Ling Han used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to dodge this attack.","The current Golden Generation had Saintly bones implanted into their bodies. This could both increase their battle prowess, and could also help them advance into Saint-level faster.","Though Ling Han was freakish, at present, he was definitely unable to contend against Saint-level power. Thus, he could not face it head-on, or he would only be seeking his own suffering, or even seeking his own death.","When Han Yun saw that he had suppressed Ling Han, he couldn’t help but laugh loudly. He increased the intensity of his offensive, and every blow that he delivered contained a sliver of saintly might, allowing his battle prowess to have a qualitative improvement.","After parrying more than a dozen moves, Ling Han was also irritated.","Did he really think that he had no more tricks up his sleeve?","Ling Han shouted lightly, and finally used Destructive Energy.","Boom, he threw a punch, and the black-coloured energy turned into a streak of light. Its speed was indescribable, as it rapidly blasted towards Han Yun.","Han Yun hurriedly parried, forming a spherical shield in front of him.","However, under the effects of Destructive Energy, what effect could this kind of defense have?","The shield immediately melted, and the power of the punch penetrated deeply.","However, this still bought Han Yun some time, allowing him to retreat.","Ling Han took advantage of the victory to follow up on his attack. He swung his fists again. Xiu, xiu, xiu! Destructive Energy was blasted out, turning into meteors that filled the skies.","Han Yun counterattacked as he dodged. He was naturally relying on his saintly power, and there was a sliver of it in every strike. At present, this was something that Ling Han was definitely no match for.","Thus, the two of them had a powerful weapon that could intimidate the other. What was originally a close-quarters battle had become a long-distance exchange of blows and pursuit.","“Sigh!” Everyone exclaimed in shock.","Though it was still a tie at the moment, it was clear who was stronger at a glance.","—Ling Han was relying completely on his own abilities, and as for Han Yun? The reason why he could use saintly might was because a Saintly bone had been implanted into his body.","How could they compare?","But in this world, only the result mattered, and no one asked for the reason.","Han Yun had not lost, and that was enough. Furthermore, when he advanced into Saint Tier in future, what about Ling Han?","He was an eternal Sect Master.","“Let’s attack together, and eliminate this scourge!” Another Imperial Son declared. That was Yi Taishu. Previously, he had made a bet with Ling Han, and lost over a hundred Eight Star Celestial Qi. Just thinking about it made him feel suffocated.","By now, he was already an eight-star Venerate, and also had Saintly bones in his body. His battle prowess was only slightly inferior to Han Yun.","Xiu, with a leap, he joined the battle.","“You people are too despicable!” the little azure dragon shouted, about to join the battle.","“No need to come!” Ling Han laughed loudly, appearing extremely heroic, “Today, I will defeat these weaklings!”","‘What?’","He actually dared to compare the Golden Generation to weaklings?","The remaining Golden Generations were all enraged. Furthermore, the feeling that Ling Han gave them was really too dangerous. It was clear that he should be eternally stuck at Sect Master-level, but his abilities were still continuously improving, which made them feel uneasy.","Kill, only by killing him would they be able to let go of the weight in their hearts.","One after another, the Golden Generations joined the battle. Aside from a limited few members of the Imperial Clans that remained neutral, the other members of the Golden Generation all took the field.","And in this kind of battle, the Venerate Tier-level Silver Generations weren’t even qualified to participate in the battle. What was the point of Venerates below five stars fighting? They would be completely insta-killed by Ling Han.","Ling Han laughed loudly, his heroic spirit like an ocean.","Come on then!","Boom, he finally unleashed his full battle prowess. 99 Six Star Regulations appeared, intertwining to form a staff that he held in his hand, sweeping out in all directions.","His spirit was too strong. Though there was an end to the number of Regulations, with the boost of his divine sense, this staff of Regulations had enlarged to about three thousand meters in size. With a wave of the staff, the Imperial Sons could only flee in disarray.","If they came into contact with it, they would definitely die.","Everyone was dumbfounded. How could this be?","In their one-on-one battle just then, Ling Han and Han Yun had only been equally matched. Now, however, he was actually able to rival so many Imperial Sons without falling into a disadvantage?","Heavens!"]},{"number":4573,"title":"Chapter 4573: Showing off his might","paragraphs":["Chapter 4573: Showing off his might","Editor: Henyee Translations","Previously, Ling Han had deliberately reserved some strength, and only used the 95 Regulations, but now, those who should make a move had all made their move, so he was no longer hiding his abilities.","Boom, the staff that was formed from the 99 flashes of Regulations was too terrifying. With a single strike, the Imperial Sons were all running here and there, dodging in a sorry state.","However, the Imperial Sons were not to be trifled with either.","When Ling Han’s staff swept past, they immediately took advantage of the opening to attack.","Weng! A tower of lightning materialized above Ling Han’s head, radiating with Primal Chaos Qi and blocking all of the attacks.","Hong long long, though the tower trembled, it still gave Ling Han some rebounding power, but what was this slight tremor worth to Ling Han’s powerful physique?","“Bunch of trash!” Ling Han charged out, his staff of Regulations sweeping out, displaying an invincible stance.","“Come, let’s work together!” Han Yun shouted loudly.","To be attacked so tragically by a Sect Master, they were really too embarrassed.","“Do you really think that we are no match for you?” All the Imperial Sons smirked coldly.","Boom, they joined forces, and wrapped the saintly power around their hands. Then, they all blasted towards the staff of Regulations.","Peng!","After all, it was a dozen or so Golden Generations, and they were all using saintly might. With their combined efforts, the staff of Regulations was finally blocked, and it was gripped tightly at that.","At this time, the remaining three Golden Generations took advantage of the opening to charge towards Ling Han.","How was he supposed to defend?","Ling Han smiled, and very decisively let go, “If you guys like it, just take it.”","He shook his hands again, and a sword of Regulations appeared in each of his hands. He charged towards the Golden Generations that were attacking.","F***!","The expressions of the three Golden Generations changed drastically, and they hurriedly retreated.","They were too deceived by their inherent beliefs. They thought that as long as they could grab hold of Ling Han’s weapon, Ling Han’s battle prowess would naturally be greatly destroyed.","This was a f****** manifestation of Regulations. Ling Han just had to regather Regulations as he liked.","He aggressively pursued the three Golden Generations, and the other Golden Generations hurriedly chased after him. They couldn’t give Ling Han a chance to defeat them one by one.","However, in terms of speed, how could they compare to Phoenix Wings Divine Flight?","Ling Han flapped his flaming wings, and in just a few moves, he had already caught up to the three Golden Generations.","As the Sword of Regulations slashed out, it was also entwined with Destructive Energy.","This was even more terrifying, and this was Ling Han’s true killing move.","The three Golden Generations could no longer retreat. They all roared loudly, and used their saintly power to counterattack Ling Han.","At this moment, there was no time for them to retreat. Otherwise, they would definitely die.","Peng!","The three of them joined forces, and blasted onto the Sword of Regulations.","“Ah!” They all screamed in agony. The might of the sword of Regulations and the Destructive Energy was too terrifying. It had directly penetrated their defenses, and caused great damage to their physical bodies.","However, Ling Han wasn’t having a good time either.","Under the backlash from the Saint-level power, he was also throwing up blood madly. He felt that there were three different powers surging in his body. Though they were not very strong, in terms of quality, they were too terrifying, and possessed the ability to crush him.","Hence, these three streaks of power were like three needles. Though the wound that they had pierced was not very big, they were all causing damage inside his body, and for the moment, he could not pacify them.","This was the power of a Saint.","Even if it was only a Saintly bone, and furthermore, it was fused into the body of a Venerate Tier, so it could only unleash a little bit of its might.","Taking advantage of this opportunity, the Imperial Sons quickly charged over from behind.","Ling Han channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique, and temporarily suppressed the foreign power in his body. Then, he used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight and charged out of the encirclement.","In this exchange, Ling Han was slightly injured, but the three Imperial Sons were severely injured. If it was not for the fact that they still had the defense of Saintly Bones inside their bodies, it was not impossible that they would be insta-killed.","All the Imperial Sons were astounded. When one had reached the level of Venerate Tier, the Substitution Seal was no longer effective. If one was killed, that would be absolute death, and there would be no second chance.","“Charge!” They were all furious. They wanted to take advantage of the chance when Ling Han was injured to take down this strongest opponent.","Boom!","They had all used the unique ability of Venerate Tier. The Four Extremes manifested, connecting heaven and earth, as if it was an omnipotent giant.","Ling Han merely dodged and did not attack. He was presently using Ten Cultivation Technique to refine the foreign power in his body. This was saintly power, and though it was pitifully little, it was like a thin needle stabbing into his body, stabbing him at all times, making him feel extremely uncomfortable.","In this way, he was naturally at a disadvantage.","The Imperial Sons took advantage of the victory to press their advantage. The Fourth Extreme connected the heaven and earth, and was their weapons and eyes and ears. Wherever Ling Han went, he would be attacked harshly.","Thankfully, Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was kickass enough, allowing Ling Han to move unhindered.","Very quickly, Ling Han forced out the saintly power in his body.","This time, his battle prowess was fully recovered, and he had nothing to worry about.","Boom, he brandished the staff of Regulations again, incredibly domineering.","“Good one!” The little azure dragon and the large black dog were both cheering him on, while Brother Monkey was completely unconcerned. He was only observing the area ahead of him.","That was because he had absolute trust in Ling Han.","So what if the Fourth Extreme held up the heavens and connected the earth? Under the sweep of the staff of Regulations, it was still destroyed completely, because there was still Destructive Energy on the staff of Regulations. This destructive power far surpassed the level of Venerate Tier.","“Brother!” At this moment, Brother Monkey suddenly called out, “Follow Old Sun!”","With the Fiery Golden Eyes, he could see through everything.","“All right!” Ling Han laughed loudly, and withdrew his attack. With a leap, he landed beside Brother Monkey.","The Imperial Sons only chased for two steps before stopping.","One Ling Han was already very difficult to deal with, and now there was Brother Monkey?","It should be known that Brother Monkey was the first of the younger generation to break through to Venerate Tier, much earlier than Imperial Son Tian and the others. At that time, he had even fought against three of them all by himself, and forced Imperial Son Tian and the others to flee in disarray.","He added with Ling Han, with the two of them working together, their battle prowess was naturally even stronger.","“Let’s go.” Brother Monkey slung the metal rod over his shoulder and strode forward, completely ignoring those Imperial Sons.","This kind of indifference was too destructive, causing the Golden Generation’s members to feel extremely stifled.","Ling Han followed Brother Monkey. He wasn’t walking randomly, but rather following a certain pattern.","“B@stards, come at me if you have the guts!”","The large black dog and little azure dragon both gave the Imperial Sons the middle finger, then followed Ling Han.","This infuriated the Imperial Sons. However, the valley was extremely dangerous, and it was completely unsuitable for them to gang up on Ling Han here. Thus, if they rashly pursued him, it was extremely likely that Ling Han would defeat them one by one, or use the killing intent in the valley to kill them.","They exchanged looks. If Baili Tian and Yan Dongming didn’t appear, was there no one who could deal with Ling Han and the others?","Ahead of them, Brother Monkey took the lead.","With the help of the Fiery Golden Eyes, he saw through the killing intent in this canyon. Every step was very particular, and he couldn’t make a mistake.","After walking for a long time, they finally arrived at the end of the canyon. However, they shockingly discovered that there was a mountain wall at the end, and there was a clear palm print engraved on it.","“Yi, could it be that it was this palm that pushed out this canyon?” Ling Han and the others all guessed.","The person who had attacked was definitely incredibly powerful."]},{"number":4574,"title":"Chapter 4574: Saintly medicine and severed arm","paragraphs":["Chapter 4574: Saintly medicine and severed arm","Editor: Henyee Translations","Previously, when Ling Han had exchanged blows with the Imperial Sons, his battle prowess was on full throttle, and he did not hold back in the slightest.","However, this canyon was unscathed. Only a few pieces of rubble had been shaken off, which was proof enough of its sturdiness.","However, this palm strike had blasted the canyon over a few hundred kilometers, so how terrifying was its might?","Thus, the strength of this person definitely far surpassed Venerate Tier.","“This is the doing of a Saint.”","This was the Saint Tomb. Throughout history, there had been far too many Saints who hadme here to search for the holy flame. Some hadme here to strengthen their abilities, while others hadme here to extend their lifespan. Thus, it was only natural that the doings of a Saint would appear here.","“Yi, there is the fragrance of herbs!”","“Saintly medicine?”","The four of them took a deep breath at the same time. That was because theyuld smell the fragrance of herbs, causing all the pores on their bodies to open up, which was incrediblymfortable.","It was as if Heavenly Dao was right in front of their eyes, within reach.","Only the Saintly medicineuld do this. Furthermore, it was a fully mature Saintly medicine, whichntained the power of stars, the light of time, and shards of Regulations.","The four of them hurriedly searched, and soon found a plant that was no more than a foot tall at the foot of the mountain. It just happened to bear four fruits.","“Saintly medicine!” Their eyes lit up.","They were all Venerates or possessed Venerate Tier-level battle prowess. If they directly ingested the Saintly medicine, the powerful medicinal effects would cause their bodies to explode and they would die.","However, Ling Han was also an alchemist, and the Alchemy Emperor at that!","Hence, as long as he moved, andcted the Saintly medicine into an alchemical pill, heuldmpletely degrade it to bensumed by a Venerate.","After all, he had obtained the true inheritance of an Alchemy Saint.","However, they did not act rashly.","That was because this Saintly medicine was actually exuding saintly might. If one forcibly stepped forwards to pluck it, they would only be shattered into pieces.","Strange.","The four of them were allnfused. No matter what kind of Celestial medicine it was, ituld not possibly have any destructive power by itself. At most, it would only have a little poison, or have spikes thatuld ignore the defense of one’s physique, and so on.","But to release pressure like a Saint, this was too inceivable.","“Strange,” they all said.","Ling Han and Brother Monkey used their eye technique and Fiery Golden Eyes respectively to look ahead. After a while, they both nodded.","“The problem is not above this Saintly medicine, but rather beneath it, there is an object that has been enveloped by light,” Ling Han said. His eye technique was also unable to penetrate that light, and see through to its essence.","Brother Monkey nodded. He had also seen the same thing.","“Then what do we do?” the large black dog asked anxiously, as he rubbed his paws together. The Saintly medicine was right in front of him, yetuld not be harvested. He was really about to die of anxiety.","Ling Han and Brother Monkeyntinued to observe. If thingsuldn’t be done, they would resolutely give up. No matter how good Saintly medicine was,uld theympare to their lives?","“It’s possible.” After a while, the two of them looked at each other at the same time, and both nodded.","“Brother Monkey,operate with me,” Ling Han said.","“Alright,” Brother Monkey nodded.","The two of them separated slightly, then took a step forwards at the same time.","“Yi?” The little azure dragon and the large black dog both let out surprised exclamations, because Ling Han and Brother Monkey were both perfectly fine, and had not suffered any injury.","One had to realize that the saintly might would permeate the surroundings if they advanced one step further. Even if they weren’t shattered into pieces, they would at least be able to cause blood vessels to explode and skin to bleed.","Yet Ling Han and Brother Monkey were actually unscathed!","“That’s right.” The little azure dragon clapped its hands, and analyzed, “If the front ismpared to a formation, then the two of them would be stepping on the nodes within respectively. Furthermore, they would be nodes thatuld resonate, which would be just enough to affect the formation, and minimize its might.”","Only Ling Han and Brother Monkeyuld do this, because they had both awakened a vision-type Mystical Power.","Ofurse, in the case of others, Ding Shu and the Genesis World rulersuld do the same. Imperial Son Ming also had the Void Eye Technique, so heuld do the same. However, Ding Shu and the others hadn’t arrived yet, and Imperial Son Ming hadn’tme at all.","As the large black dog listened, realization spread across his face. However, after the little azure dragon finished speaking, he immediately became angry and embarrassed, and said, “What doesn’t Grandpa Dog understand? Do I need a little kid like you to give me pointers?”","“Despicable dog, if Grandpa Dragon didn’t teach you, what would you know!” the little azure dragon immediately retorted.","“See if I don’t bite you to death, you four-legged snake!”","“I’ll beat you up, you old black dog!”","“Woof!”","“Ao!”","The two of them started fighting again.","Ling Han and Brother Monkey moved in unison. You take one step, and I will also take a step. The two of them were like formation eyes, always stepping on the most crucial point, so that the saintly might would not be able to permeate onto them.","After carefully walking for a dozen over steps, they finally arrived in front of that Saintly medicine.","Ling Han moved, and gently plucked the fruits from the Saintly medicine.","“Look down?” he asked.","Brother Monkey nodded, an expectant look in his eyes.","Looks like Brother Monkey was not only bellse, but also a curious person.","Ling Han and Brother Monkey dug up the dirt, and not long after, they divered that ball of light, and looking at it with the naked eye, that ball of light was actually not that blazing. Theyuld clearly see what was inside the ball of light.","In truth, it should be said that something was glowing.","A hand, a severed hand.","This was a hand that had been forcefully torn off. Its fingers were slender and long, its skin snow-white and delicate. At a glance, it was obvious that it was a female hand. It had been forcefully torn off at the wrist, and oneuld see its snow-white bones, which were still dripping with blood.","“Wu!”","Ling Han and Brother Monkey both felt a terrible pain in their eyes, anduldn’t help but shed tears of blood.","The two of them hurriedly turned around and buried the dirt back in. Then, they quickly retreated.","“What did you guys see?” the large black dog and little azure dragon hurriedly asked.","“A broken arm,” Ling Han said. He wiped away the tears of blood. Thankfully, his eyes had not been injured, “It should be the hand of a Saint. In fact, it may have been the hand of a Saint that had delivered a palm strike at this canyon.”","Thus, the saintly might of this place diffused, anduld not be approached, and under the nourishment of the Saintly Blood, it actually nurtured a Saintly medicine","“This Saint must be very strong!”","“En, in the case of an ordinary Saint, even if there were eight to ten of them minced into pulp and planted into the ground, they may not be able to mature a Saintly medicine.”","“And now, a severed hand has nurtured a Saintly medicine. This Saint... is probably above seven stars in cultivation level.”","“Unfortunately, she still euntered a powerful enemy, and one of her hands was actually severed.”","This severed hand must have been torn off from that Saint when she was still alive. Otherwise, if the hand had been severed after death, the Saintly Blood would not have that kind of vitality, anduld not have possibly nurtured Saintly medicine.","Only a living oneuld provide such thriving vitality.","“The Saint... Heh, is this the tomb of Saints after death, or the tomb of Saints buried alive!”","The four of them felt rueful. This place was really a little strange.","“I hope the old man can leave safely.”","“Let’s go.”","Since the Saintly medicine had already been harvested, what was the point of staying here any longer?","The four of themntinued onwards. After climbing over this mountain wall, there was a massive dark forest ahead of them, but there was an extremely wide path in the middle that extended into the distance. The enduld not be seen."]},{"number":4575,"title":"Chapter 4575: Blood-coloured Worm","paragraphs":["Chapter 4575: Bloodloured Worm","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was a vast black forest. What was shocking was that these trees actually did not die, and were still exuding slivers of vitality.","There was only one type of tree in the black forest. The tallest was close to three hundred meters tall, but the leaves were all the size of cattail leaf fans, as smooth as iron plates.","Though there was life in this place, it still gave off a feeling of desolation.","Ling Han and Brother Monkey both looked at it with their eye techniques, then nodded.","It was fine, theyuld go through it.","The four of them moved out, and walked into the forest.","“Strange!”","After walking for a while, Ling Han finally spoke.","“En, strange!” The large black dog also said.","“What’s strange about it?” the little azure dragon asked.","“Four-Legged Snake, you’re really too inexperienced!” The large black dog took the opportunity to teach the little dragon a lesson. “Look, there are trees here, but there’s not a single leaf on the ground. Isn’t this strange?”","“This...” The little azure dragon pondered for a moment. “Perhaps they were blown away by the strong winds?”","“Why didn’t it sweep you away?” the large black dog sneered, “Even if the strong windsntinue, you should still be able to see the leaves fluttering in the wind, and when the winds stop, there would definitely be fallen leaves on the ground.”","“Now, do you see any leaves in the air, or fallen leaves on the ground?”","The little azure dragon was instantly rendered speechless.","In terms of battle prowess at the same cultivation level, the little azure dragon was definitely stronger than the large black dog. However, in terms of experience, the little azure dragonuldn’tmpare to the large black dog.","In the Genesis World, how long had the large black dog been alive for?","All the Saints in history added together may not have lived as long as the large black dog.","Thus, Ling Han and the large black dog’s reactions in some details far surpassed that of the little azure dragon and Brother Monkey. This was somethingming from the fact that they had experienced enough, anduld not be helped.","“Then tell me, what’s going on?” the little azure dragon asked.","Ling Han had also been thinking about this problem this entire time, and he said, “Firstly, these leaves will never wilt, and sndly, some kind of living creatures are living underground. They specialize in eating fallen leaves, and will be eaten the moment they fall.”","However, the snd possibility was too small.","The falling of leaves should have happened at all times. After all, this forest was so big, but as far as theyuld see,uld they possibly see any leaves falling?","“Won’t we know if we pluck a leaf and take a look?” Brother Monkey said.","Instead of analyzing for such a long time here, they might as well make a move and give it a try!","This was Brother Monkey’s train of thought. He would always use the simplest method to deal with problems, regardless of whether this method was dangerous or not.","...There were few members of the line of the Battle Saint Emperor... Er, heuldn’tmplain anymore.","Ling Han warned himself that he had to change.","Brother Monkey walked to the side of a large tree, and stretched out a hand to grab at a leaf.","There was a gap of about nine meters between him and this tree leaf, but with his strength, to say nothing of a gap of nine meters, even if there was a gap of 90,000 meters, it would still be a piece of cake for him.","However, they divered that under this move from Brother Monkey, the tree leaf did not move at all.","Yi?","Although Brother Monkey definitely wouldn’t waste much power on a leaf, a nine-star Venerate actuallyuldn’t even pluck a single leaf. This was strange.","What was going on?","Brother Monkey was also stunned for a moment. If this was Ling Han, he would definitely activate his eye technique to take a closer look. No matter what, he would have to study it. However, Brother Monkey’s thoughts were not so roundabout. He directly increased the power of his movement.","Pa, a leaf was forcibly torn off by him.","However, the entire tree was trembling, as if it was a living creature.","Ling Han and the others were all stunned. This tree was far too strange.","He had not even finished the thought, when he saw that where the leaf stem had been severed, a bloodloured insect that was three feet long had crawled out. There were streaks of yellowish-yellow lines on its body, and it had many small legs. It was squirming, which was incredibly disgusting.","This insect stared at Ling Han and the others, its small eyes exuding killing intent.","Xiu, this insect arched its body, and charged towards Ling Han.","F***!","Ling Hanuldn’t help but grit his teeth in pain. It wasn’t him who had done it, so why was it targeting him?","‘Do you think I’m easy to bully just because my cultivation level is low?’","“Haha!” The large black dog and little azure dragon immediately laughed.","Ling Han shook his head, and pressed down with his hand. This insect was under hisntrol, and it hovered in midair.","“Sect Master-level!”","“Hiss, as a little insect, this is very awesome.”","The large black dog and little azure dragon said one after another.","Ferocious beasts wouldn’t cultivate, so theyuld naturally grow to therresponding cultivation level. Generally speaking, however, ferocious beasts thatuld reach a higher cultivation level were all famous breeds such as Primordial Demonic Elephant, Green Patterned Black Python, and so on.","This insect that was obviously parasitizing on a tree branchuld actually reach the level of Sect Master. This was very illogical.","It should be known that though wild beasts would be able to reach therresponding cultivation level after they matured, they still had to have enough “nourishment”.","Just think, a Sect Master was already powerful enough to be regarded as a great elite. How much energy would one need to expend to raise such a ferocious beast?","This great treeuld actually raise it?","Furthermore... there might not be just one.","“Let’s try again.”","They plucked a leaf again, and sure enough, a snd bloodlored insect appeared. However, after plucking the third leaf, no insect appeared, but after the fourth leaf, it came again.","After plucking a hundred leaves in a row, they came to a roughnclusion. This tree was indeed infested with a large number of insects. For every ten leaves, there were about seven parasitic insects.","This was an astounding number. Just how large was this forest?","They were all Sect Master-level insects?","Hiss!","Now, the dozens of insects were all squirming, wanting to break free from Ling Han’sntrol, and attack him.","Ling Han snapped his fingers, and pa, pa, pa, these insects all turned into bloody foam.","Mere Sect Masters actually dared to be impudent in front of him? He was someone whould insta-kill the majority of nine-star Venerates.","“These insects are much weaker than normal Sect Masters,” he added.","“However, an abundance of ants can bite an elephant to death. If all the insects in this forest were really provoked, no one would be able to bear it,” the large black dog bared his teeth and said.","Meanwhile, the little azure dragon was curious. “Could it be that theseare all Celestial Trees? Otherwise, howuld they have nurtured so many Sect Master-level Blood Insects?”","With these words, the four of them were slightly excited.","One black treeuld nurture several hundred Blood Insects; how nutritious would that be? And this kind of tree... there was a whole forest of them.","“Come, try cutting one,” they all said.","In any case, there were so many trees, so theyuld use one to test it out. Even if it was damaged, it would be bearable.","They had not made their move, when they felt a wave of auraming from behind them.","The four of them turned around, only to see Origin, Ding Shu, Myriad Dao and the others rapidly approaching.","Aside from them, the Imperial Sons also followed behind, and the Dao Childs were even further behind.","“Wait first,” Ling Han said.","How fast was the speed of a Venerate? Xiu, xiu, xiu! Origin and the others descended one after another.","“Yi, there are so many insectrpses here,” Myriad Dao immediately said.","“The aura of Sect Master-level.” Origin also said.","“So smelly!” Shui Qingchang waved her delicate hand in front of her nose.","They were all curious. Why were there so many insects all over the ground?"]},{"number":4576,"title":"Chapter 4576: Sea of insects","paragraphs":["Chapter 4576: Sea of insects","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone was curious. Howuld there be so many insects here?","They looked at the passageway in the black forest, and all of them began to hesitate.","Just how many unknown dangers lay ahead of them?","They hadme to search for great opportunities, not to seek death.","Ling Han and the others didn’t say anything. These trees might be Great Herbs, but it was best to keep this secret in their hearts.","“There’s something strange about this forest!” Origin suddenly said.","“En, there are no fallen leaves,” Heaven Crushing also said.","With their reminder, everyone came to a sudden realization.","This was indeed very strange.","Meanwhile, Ling Han sighed. Others might have been careless, but as the Genesis World’s rulers, howuld it be that Origin and the others didn’t have enough experience?","Some rashly went to pluck the leaves, and when they divered that they actuallyuldn’t pluck it easily, they were all extremely curious.","However, no matter what, howuld mere tree leaves be difficult for these Venerates and Sect Masters?","Very quickly, large swathes of leaves were torn off, but multiple bloodloured worms also crawled out from where the leaves had been severed. Xiu, xiu, xiu, they arched their bodies and charged towards the masses.","“Humph, merely Sect Master-level!” Someone smirkedldly, and delivered a palm strike. Pa, pa, pa! Instantly, large swathes of the bloodloured worms died.","“So what if it is Sect Master-level?” Ling Han glared at him.","That was a Venerate, and he was already a Four-Star Venerate. However, with Ling Han’s glare, he didn’t dare to say a word.","F***, though this lord was also a Sect Master, his abilities had far surpassed a Nine Star Venerate.","In a moment of carelessness, he had also struck a blow on Ling Han. Naturally, he was asking for his own humiliation.","There were far too many Venerates here, so theyuld easily kill all of the bloodlored insects with a casual wave of their hand.","“Yi, are these insects absorbing the nutrients in the tree sap?” someone immediately asked.","“Hiss, absorbing tree sap can actually help them to grow to the level of Sect Master. These trees...”","Everyone inhaled sharply. This was an indescribable treasure trove.","There was no need for anyone to remind them. Everyone dispersed, and began to cut down the black trees.","Treasure, treasure!","“Sigh.” Ling Han shook his head, appearing very regretful.","However, this forest was too big, and the four of themuldn’t harvest itmpletely. It was impossible to monopolize it.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The weakest person here had also reached the level of Sect Master. How easy would it be to cut down a tree?","—Though it was indeed somewhat difficult.","But very soon, one after another, the great treesllapsed, releasing loud bangs.","More bloodlored worms crawled out from the tree trunks, launching attacks at everyone.","It was not just that. Someone had dug out a great tree by the roots. This was like turning over a hornet’s nest. A large number of bloodlored worms surged out from the ground. The scene of them densely packed together caused one’s heart to palpitate, and was incredibly gross.","Ling Han also casually severed a large tree. His eyes swept over it, yet he was surprised.","Because the tree trunk was hollow, when it was severed, a fountain of liquid spluttered out, emitting a putrid and disgusting smell.","This was Celestial medicine?","Ling Han shook his head. There was indeed astonishing energyntained within, but it was filled with poison, and wasmpletely unsuitable for a cultivator to refine. If he forcibly refined it, that would only kill him, and his lifespan would rapidly shrink.","No wonder these bloodloured worms were so weak. They were all a morbid kind of Sect Master-level fierce beasts.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","As more and more great trees fell, the number of bloodloured worms also increased further, numbering in the tens of thousands, or even in the hundreds of thousands.","Even if their strength was very weak, they were still Sect Master-level, after all. When their numbers reached a certain extent, they were still boundlessly terrifying.","Pu, pu, pu! They spat out liquid, which turned into multiple arrows that shot towards everyone.","This liquid arrow was filled with a fishy stench that would make anyone want to vomit.","Some people were already beginning to vomit. Moreover, it was useless even if they held their breaths. This stenchuld directly spread through their skin, causing them to feel nauseous and lose all ability to fight.","“Is this what it means by ‘I can’t defeat you, but can disgust you to death’?” the large black dog mumbled. He was a Venerate, and he had used Regulations to form a shield. It was impossible for the liquid arrow to penetrate his defenses.","However, after several dozen to several hundred strikes, this shield was also slowly melting.","This was truly a case of ants biting an elephant to death.","Someone was hit, and the liquid arrow had landed on him. That patch of skin immediately began to rot. Furthermore, it was stillntinuously expanding, and very soon, a large hole had been torn into their body.","This was also very terrifying.","At present, the Venerates were still able to move with ease, but the Sect Masters were struggling. There were really too many bloodloured worms.","“Let’s go, let’s go.”","The surviving people all shouted loudly, and hurriedly soared into the sky, heading towards the depths of the forest.","What Celestial Tree was this? It was practically a rotten tree.","No one had any more greed, and left, one after another.","However, it was as if the bloodlored worms had also been angered. They similarly soared into the sky, andntinued to attack.","“Humph, do you really think I’m afraid of you guys?” This enraged a great many Venerates. They weren’t going to get serious, and you guys are still being overbearing?","Shua, shua, shua! The Venerates moved, and the Seven Star Regulations surged. The Fourth Extreme held up the skies, and instantly, masses of bloodloured worms died.","Previously, the Venerates had also joined the retreating troops. It was not that the Venerates were no match for them, but rather that there was no need.","Theyuldn’t reap any benefits, so what was the point of fighting?","However, the bloodlored wormsntinued to press down on them, and this naturally angered the Venerates.","Ling Han and the others didn’t attack. They simply stood in the air, and onlyunterattacked when insects attacked them.","“There’s movement,” Ling Han suddenly said, looking into the distance.","Brother Monkey and the others also looked over. With a bang, the ground split open, and a huge insect crawled out. It was as long as 30 meters. Its body was round, especially its stomach, which was bulging largely.","This giant insect aimed its behind at the people in the skies, and then began to squirm rhythmically. Peng, peng, peng! Instantly, multiple balls of light shot towards the people in the skies.","Pa, someone didn’t manage to dodge in time and was hit by the ball of light. The ball of light exploded, and it was actually a ball of liquid. The liquid inside splattered, and what was emitting light was precisely the liquid inside.","“Ah!” The person that had been hit released a terrible scream, and fell from the skies. He had not even landed on the ground, when his whole person had already melted to the point that not even a single bone was left behind.","‘Such terrifying power!’","Though that person was only a Sect Master, being insta-killed with a single strike still caused everyone to be greatly vigilant.","“This is a Venerate Tier-level insect,” the large black dog said. “Even its fart is so powerful!”","No wonder therrosive ability was so strong.","Pu, pu, pu! The giant insect attackedntinuously, and the balls of light swept towards everyone like a cannonball.","“Humph!” A Venerate moved, launching a strike. Peng, the ball of light instantly exploded in midair,rrosive light liquid spraying out. Its might was not the slightest bit inferior to exploding after hitting its target.","This caused everyone’s expressions to change drastically. This was a little troublesome.","“To take down the masses, capture the ringleader.” Heaven Crushing humphed, and directly charged down.","However, the bloodlored worms tried their best to block them. Though they died in droves, more and more worms pounced forwards."]},{"number":4577,"title":"Chapter 4577: Annihilated","paragraphs":["Chapter 4577: Annihilated","Editor: Henyee Translations","Heaven Crushing was a Seven Star Venerate, and just how powerful was the Genesis World’s Master?","Under the barrage of the murderous aura, he didn’t even need to make a move. The blood-colored insects in the surroundings collapsed one after another.","He had already charged over. With a slash of his sword, his sword shattered the ground and pierced the heavens.","Pu!","Without a doubt, the large insect was instantly killed. Sparkling liquid splattered, as if an underground spring had suddenly exploded.","Everyone cheered. This strike was really too handsome.","As expected of Heaven Crushing, powerful.","However, everyone’s cheers had not ended, when the ground trembled, and more giant insects shot out of the ground, and this time, it was not just one, but six of them had appeared at the same time!","F***!","Everyone thought that the giant insect that had been killed previously was an insect queen, and that was why the blood-coloured worms were protecting it with all their might. Then, as long as the insect queen was killed, the remaining insects would be nothing.","But the truth was not so. There were actually still a great many such giant insects. Furthermore, it was highly possible that these six were not the final number.","“Charge!”","Everyone stopped running. Though there was no benefit to be gained, these insects were still entangled with them. If they were not killed completely, they would probably continue to pursue them relentlessly.","Since that was the case, everyone was naturally prepared.","Originally, these people did things their own way. In fact, they were enemies with each other, but now, they had let go of their animosity and joined forces to destroy the swarm of bugs.","In fact, they weren’t allied with each other. It was just that they hadn’t attacked each other yet.","Ling Han and the others also joined the battle. They were all elites with battle prowess on the level of Venerate Tier, so their abilities were naturally powerful. With a single strike, they could cause a large number of insects to collapse.","However, there were really too many ordinary blood-coloured worms. There was absolutely no end to them. After one had fallen, even more would appear.","Ling Han set his eyes on the six giant insects. He leaped out, and charged towards one of them.","Brother Monkey also targeted one, and similarly charged over.","On the other side, Origin, Myriad Dao and the others also charged towards the giant insects.","Though there were few of these insects, the threat they posed was extremely great. They had to be dealt with at the first instant.","Similarly, countless blood-coloured worms moved to block them, preventing them from easily succeeding.","Weng!","Ling Han, Origin, Myriad Dao nd the others all unleashed murderous aura attacks. This was the best method to deal with a group attack. They didn’t even need to attack, and swarms of insects would fall.","These people were like a hot knife through butter, directly charging in front of the giant insect.","Peng, peng, peng!","They all used their respective techniques. With a single strike, the giant insects exploded, and large amounts of liquid light splattered. However, it could not splash into their defensive shields at all, and they walked out completely unscathed.","The army of insects seemed to have fixated on them, and another ten giant insects shot out of the ground.","Since that was the case, they would continue to kill!","Everyone went on a killing spree. The insects were annihilated at an astonishing speed, and it was not that the side of the cultivators did not suffer any losses either. There were also a great many Sect Masters that had been turned into mush, and some had broken arms and legs, and were severely injured.","The easiest thing to despair about was that this was a sea of insects, and there seemed to be no end to their numbers. After killing one batch, another came.","This was too demoralizing.","Once their fighting spirit was extinguished, it would be very easy for them to make a mistake and be hit, and if they were touched by the corrosive liquid, they would definitely be severely injured.","More and more cultivators retreated from the battle, either dead or severely wounded. However, most of them were at Sect Master-level. The Venerates were far too powerful, and this kind of intense battle wasn’t powerful enough to wound them.","Three days later, everyone felt the pressure lighten.","They discovered that the number of the sea of insects was decreasing.","Though there were still insects charging out of the ground, both their numbers and speed had decreased considerably.","This caused their spirits to be greatly revived. In a single go, they wiped out the sea of insects.","At this point, no more insects charged out.","Everyone breathed a sigh of relief. They all descended, and began to adjust.","Ling Han’s mystical power was endless, and there was no need for him to rest at all. He gazed into the distance. In this battle, at least over three hundred cultivators had died.","Their losses could be considered heavy.","Those who had come here were all of the younger generation, and they all had hopes of breaking through to a higher cultivation level. Thus, though the ones who had died were Sect Masters, they could possibly be future Venerates, or even Saints.","Ling Han looked at the ground, and said, “I’m more curious about where these insects come from now.”","“Then, we’ll turn this forest upside down!” Brother Monkey said with a smile. With a wave of the staff in his hand, he blasted it heavily towards the ground.","Peng!","Under the heavy impact, the entire ground trembled madly, causing those who were resting to jump up.","“What are you doing?” Many people glared at Brother Monkey.","Brother Monkey leaned on his staff, slanted his head, and said, “Want to fight? Old Sun will keep you company.”","Instantly, everyone fell silent.","Brother Monkey’s strength was on the level of the Golden Generation, and he was already a nine-star Venerate. How many people in the world could compare to him?","Ling Han helped, causing great damage to the ground.","When Origin, Ding Shu and the others saw this, they also joined their team.","These people all had incredibly curious personalities. The sea of insects could not have appeared for no reason. Furthermore, the insect queen had not been killed yet.","Yi?","Ling Han was astounded. This was because the ground didn’t seem like real land. Instead, it was slightly elastic and filled with decay, emitting an indescribable stench.","Dig, dig, dig. Pu, all of a sudden, a fountain of blood spluttered out, soaring over thirty meters into the air. Then, it descended again, blood gushing out. However, there was a white turbid substance contained in this blood, which had an incredibly fishy smell.","Everyone was surprised. What was going on here?","Blood would be spewing out from the ground?","A thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind. A guess appeared in his mind, but he did not say it out loud.","He continued to dig, and there was more and more blood, turning into a lake of blood. And what was floating in the blood was something turbid white. It looked a little like meat, but also a little like oil, and was very hard to distinguish.","The female cultivators involuntarily covered their noses and retreated far away.","This smell was really too pungent, and could not be tolerated at all.","Boom!","All of a sudden, the entire ground trembled. This was much more powerful than the strike that Brother Monkey had delivered previously.","And what was going on here?","There was clearly no one blasting the ground.","Peng!","The ground trembled again, and this time, the undulations were even more intense.","“Let’s go,” Ling Han shouted lightly, and his figure was already flying.","Brother Monkey and the others naturally trusted Ling Han unconditionally. When they heard this, they all flew up.","They all stood in midair, having a panoramic view of their surroundings.","They were shocked to discover that the ground was squirming, as if something terrifying was about to rush out from below.","Insect queen?","Ding Shu and the others all reacted extremely quickly. They too leaped into the air, but there were still some who, perhaps because they were too confident or something else, were still walking on the ground, and were even attacking.","Boom! All of a sudden, the ground rose up at an astonishing speed.","Those who were still on the ground were instantly sent flying, and there were even a few that were directly turned into a foam of blood.","What was going on?","“F***!”","“What is this thing?”","“Heavens!”","Everyone exclaimed one after another."]},{"number":4578,"title":"Chapter 4578: Holy Beast","paragraphs":["Chapter 4578: Holy Beast","Editor: Henyee Translations","What had appeared in front of Ling Han and the others?","A colossal beast!","It was shaped like a bull, and there were multiple sharp spikes growing from its back, while its tail was the tail of a scorpion, which had long, sharp spikes.","What earth, what forest!","They were not.","Just now, everyone had been standing on its back. That so-called black forest was actually its fur.","Now, it could still be clearly seen that there was a very large wound on its back. That was caused by everyone, but compared to its colossal size, this was negligible.","“Saint Tier!” Everyone exclaimed in shock.","However, this was a great beast that was on the verge of death. Though there was still life fluctuating in it, it was incredibly weak.","Going by that theory, those blood-coloured worms were the parasites in its body?","Heavens, the parasites were all Sect Master-level, and there were even some giant insects that had reached Venerate Tier. Just how terrifying was this Holy Beast?","Seven-star Saint? Or perhaps even eight or nine stars?","However, regardless of how many stars it was, its lifespan was already nearing its end. It was because of this that its body had started to deteriorate. In fact, parasites had even started to appear in its body. Otherwise, the body of a Saint would naturally be as pure and flawless as could be. How could it have produced insects?","At this moment, everyone was extremely nervous, not daring to make the slightest movement.","This was a Holy Beast! Regardless of whether they were the Genesis World’s ruler or the Golden Generation, they were completely negligible in front of such a being.","“Thank you!” A thought rose up, and entered into everyone’s minds.","This was the Holy Beast’s divine sense transmission.","Boom!","The Holy Beast collapsed again, transforming back into a forest.","It was really about to die, so even if countless parasites grew out of its body, it could do nothing. Only when a large hole was dug into its back did it move, expressing its gratitude to everyone.","It was very easy to connect the dots. Thus, everyone felt incredibly rueful.","This was a Holy Beast that was at least seven stars, but now? It could only struggle at death’s door here. In fact, it could only helplessly allow the parasites in its body to overflow.","Furthermore, as long as the insect queen did not die, it would not take too long for it to continue breeding offspring, and continue to wreak havoc on it.","It was truly vexing for a Saint to fall into such a state.","“Little Han, if Grandpa Dog also falls to this extent one day, you can resolutely give Grandpa Dog a palm strike,” the large black dog sighed.","“All right.” Ling Han nodded.","The large black dog immediately jumped up, “What do you mean? Do you hope to see Grandpa Dog experience such a day?”","F***, wasn’t that what you said yourself?","“The correct answer is: even if Grandpa Dog has fallen to this extent, you have to try your best to save me!” the large black dog said.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. This dog was still as despicable as always.","“Get lost!”","Everyone had initially thought that there would be some great fortune here. They had not thought that their battle would have been for nothing, and they had instead lost a great many lives.","They had to leave.","Everyone set out one after another. The Saint Tomb was definitely not as small as what they had seen. There should still be opportunities in other places. If they could get some Saintly medicine and the like, this trip would not be in vain.","However, Ling Han didn’t move. Instead, he said, “Since we have already started, let’s just do it to the end. Why don’t we go and kill that insect queen as well?”","“All right.” Brother Monkey immediately nodded. If he had started something, he definitely could not give up halfway.","Though the large black dog and little azure dragon didn’t want to meddle in other people’s business, since Ling Han and Brother Monkey had already said so, they could only nod.","Ling Han released his divine sense, and expressed his intention to kill the insect queen to that Holy Beast, to prevent this Holy Beast from mistakenly thinking that they had malicious intentions, and risk death to bring them down with him.","—Even if a Saint was close to death, they definitely could not underestimate him.","After a very long time, the Holy Beast finally sent out a weak wave, expressing its agreement.","“Let’s go.”","The four of them leaped into the lake of blood that they had previously dug out. By now, they naturally understood that this was the blood vessel of the Holy Beast.","This Holy Beast was extraordinarily huge, its veins as wide as a small river, completely allowing the four of them to move freely.","However, this Holy Beast was already nearing the end of its lifespan. The blood, muscles, and bones in its body had already decayed, exuding an endless air of age and decay. Furthermore, this kind of aura had destructive power, assimilating all life that entered its body.","Ling Han and the others all set up a shield of Regulations to block this aura, but under the constant corrosion of this aura, the shield would not be able to last for too long.","This required them to replenish the energy expenditure of the Regulations shield from time to time, and the Regulations shield needed Spiritual Power to be mobilized. In other words, if they walked here, they would endlessly expend the power of their spirit.","Furthermore, this speed was very fast.","“Remember this place. When your Spiritual Power is exhausted, you must return.”","“M-hm.”","The four of them moved separately to find that insect queen.","However, the Holy Beast was far too large, and the veins in its body were also far too numerous. Added together, they were long enough to wrap around a great planet several times over.","They would be restricted here again, and after a while, they would have to go out to recover their Spiritual Power. The efficiency of searching for the insect queen was incredibly low.","After two days, none of them discovered the insect queen. Instead, the blood-colored worms appeared again.","The insect queen began to lay eggs again.","If this continued, how long would this drag out for?","Ling Han communicated with the Holy Beast, wanting the Holy Beast to provide the location of the insect queen. In this way, wouldn’t it be easy to charge over directly?","However, this Holy Beast was already on the verge of death, so its consciousness wasn’t always awake.","However, the time before death for ordinary people was only a few minutes, at most a day or half a day, but the lifespan of Saints was really too long. The time before death would also be as long as a few hundred or a few thousand years.","After a very long time, Ling Han finally received a divine sense signal, pointing out a location.","Ling Han immediately set off, heading in that direction.","After arriving, he discovered that this was the heart of the Holy Beast.","He entered through the blood vessels, only to see a gigantic insect sticking to the wall of the heart, madly absorbing the essence substance in the blood. At the same time, it also swallowed a great many turbid substances.","Pu, pu, pu! Its behind kept moving, laying egg after egg.","Ling Han humphed, and immediately charged over.","Several hundred blood-colored worms intercepted him, but what use was that? They were all wiped out by Ling Han’s murderous aura.","Shua, he raised his right hand, and the Regulations turned into a divine light that slashed towards the insect queen.","This insect queen was also a Venerate, but in front of Ling Han, what was an ordinary Venerate worth?","The divine light slashed past, and the insect queen also died instantly.","Ling Han then wiped out all the insect eggs. Now, even if there were some that slipped through the net, they would not be much of a threat.","He left, and exited the body of the Holy Beast.","“Let’s go,” he said.","“Yi, we’ve worked hard for two days, and we’re leaving just like that?” The large black dog bared his teeth, “Wouldn’t that be a terrible loss?”","Ling Han smiled, “When we do things, we only want our conscience to be clear. It is not everything that needs repayment.”","“Haha, these words match Old Sun’s intentions!” Brother Monkey clapped his hands and laughed loudly.","“Alright, as long as you guys are happy.” The large black dog spread out his paws.","“Wait a moment.” Just as the four of them were about to leave, a sliver of divine sense transmitted into their minds."]},{"number":4579,"title":"Chapter 4579: Seed of Regulations","paragraphs":["Chapter 4579: Seed of Regulations","Editor: Henyee Translations","It was that old Holy Beast.","Ling Han and the others all stopped as instructed. Could it be that this old Holy Beast wanted to give them some kind of treasure to thank them?","The large black dog rubbed his paws together, and said, “How can I accept this?” However, the look of anticipation on his face betrayed him very honestly.","“This is the seed of Regulations that I have condensed, and I present it to you. This is also the only thing that I can take out now.” The divine sense of the old Holy Beast continued to ring out in their minds.","Then, four balls of light floated in the air.","Seed of Regulations!","Ling Han and the others all looked overjoyed.","To become a Saint, the prerequisite was to ignite the holy flame, and what was the essence of igniting the holy flame?","That was his grasp of the Regulations of heaven and earth.","Using one’s own power to ignite the holy flame meant that one had an absolute understanding of the Regulations of heaven and earth. Thus, one could easily ignite the holy flame. And in the case of the power of belief, it could also be considered as a type of Regulations, a special Regulation formed by the power of belief of living beings.","As for the seed of Regulations... that was to turn his understanding of Regulations into a seed, and slowly fuse it into himself in a smooth and soundless manner. Naturally, his grasp of Regulations would be imperceptibly influenced.","However, the seed of Regulations could only be refined by Saints, and they were refined at the cost of sacrificing one’s own strength. Thus, which Saint would be willing to sacrifice themselves for the benefit of others?","The reason why the old Holy Beast was so generous was firstly, because Ling Han and the others had indeed solved a huge problem for him.","The feeling of only enduring helplessly when parasites swallowed its own flesh and blood was incomparably painful, yet there was nothing it could do. What kind of torture was this?","Now, Ling Han and the others had given him the peace that he had always dreamed of. This was naturally a great kindness.","On the other hand, though the old Holy Beast was still alive, it was indeed on its deathbed. So what if it sacrificed some of its cultivation level?","Ling Han and the others put away the seeds of Regulations, and placed them into their minds.","Then, they set out to leave.","Neither of them asked about the origins of the old Holy Beast. This was obviously something that the old Holy Beast was unwilling to mention. Otherwise, the old Holy Beast would definitely have taken the initiative to tell them.","“Such a powerful Holy Beast must have been an earth-shattering existence in the past,” the little azure dragon said.","“M-hm.”","Ling Han and the others all agreed. When they returned, they only had to make some enquiries, and it should not be too difficult for them to find out the identity of the old Holy Beast.","“Brother Monkey, here.” Ling Han retrieved his seed of Regulations from his mind and handed it over to Brother Monkey.","“What’s this for?” Brother Monkey asked.","“My path does not allow the Regulations of others,” Ling Han said smilingly, “And with two seeds of Regulations, Brother Monkey should be able to break through in a short period of time, and become a Saint!”","They did not have enough resources, and did not have the countless years of accumulation of an Imperial Clan. Thus, if they did not give Brother Monkey some special treatment, it would be very easy for Baili Tian and Yan Dongming to surpass him.","Although Ling Han’s battle prowess at the same cultivation level was unparalleled, his cultivation level was still too low, after all. No matter what, he still needed Brother Monkey to act as his front.","Brother Monkey thought for a moment, then did not stand on ceremony. The path that Ling Han had taken had indeed always been different from the rest.","Moreover, was there any need for him to be polite with Ling Han?","As the four of them advanced, Brother Monkey had already begun to refine the seeds of Regulations.","Previously, he had already begun to make preparations for breaking through to Saint Tier. Thus, he could completely refine the seeds of Regulations directly, and there was no need for him to be like the little azure dragon and the large black dog, having the seeds slowly bloom.","After they had travelled for a day, Brother Monkey suddenly spoke up, and said, “Old Sun is confident that I can light up the holy flame within two years!”","Hearing these words, Ling Han and the others were all incredibly pleasantly surprised.","If Brother Monkey could become a Saint within two years, he would definitely be the first among the younger generation to become a Saint.","Of course, being the first to become a Saint did not mean that one would be far ahead, because after advancing into Saint Tier, every step forwards would be much, much too difficult. It was very normal that one would not be able to take a step even after tens of thousands of years.","Thus, even though there was a gap of a few hundred, a few thousand, or even tens of thousands of years of cultivation time, when they advanced into Saint Tier, they had actually more or less reached the same starting line.","But no matter what, being the first of the younger generation to become a Saint still had great significance.","After walking for another three days, a mass grave suddenly appeared ahead of them!","It really was a mass grave. A large number of corpses were laid out there, lying or sitting. There were even some that were still standing upright, but they had all lost their vitality.","However, even if these people were already dead, there was still a terrifying pressure, as if it was going to tear their skin apart.","The corpses of Saints!","Ling Han and the others immediately thought. Only the Saint and the Great Emperor would be able to suppress Venerates or those with battle prowess on the level of Venerate Tier like them. Meanwhile, it was obviously impossible that these were Great Emperors.","Yi, they had actually arrived at the true Saint Tomb. Then, where had the Nine Mountains Saint and the others run off to?","Was there a second graveyard?","The saintly might of this place permeated the air, and Ling Han and the others couldn’t release their divine sense at all. Otherwise, it would be equivalent to opposing the saintly might of this place, and it would be very easy for them to be wounded — unless the strength of their divine sense had reached Saint Tier.","Furthermore, there were a great many Saint corpses that were enshrouded in dense mist, which turned into pillars of light that shot into the skies, which also greatly affected their vision.","Thus, in this place, Ling Han and the others’ grasp over the environment could be said to have fallen to rock bottom.","“Be careful of ambush,” Brother Monkey said.","This place greatly restricted their divine sense and vision. Thus, if someone hid in the shadows and suddenly launched an attack when they passed, that would really be a little troublesome.","At present, those Golden Generations had all stepped into Venerate Tier, and some were only a step away from breaking through to Saint Tier. Thus, a great many people had Saint Tools on them, and if they secretly revived them and suddenly attacked, that would be very fatal.","—In other places, the commotion caused by reviving the Saint Tool would be too great, and could be sensed and seen from afar, but here, er, sorry, saintly might was spreading out everywhere, and it was not easy to distinguish it at all.","Ling Han and the others were all very careful. No matter how freakish and strong they were, they still had to be careful when they needed to be careful.","They entered into the tomb of Saints, and began their search.","Was this the Saint Tomb? It was practically a mass grave of Saints!","Ling Han looked at the corpses that had collapsed one after another, and couldn’t help but sigh internally.","These corpses had all been Saints when they had been alive, and each of them was all-powerful and renowned throughout the universe. But now? Hadn’t they all returned to dust?","They had all come for the sake of increasing their strength, or extending their lifespans, but in the end, they were all buried here. Their dreams had come to nothing.","Just how miserable and desolate was this?","They didn’t even have the chance to let their descendants mourn them.","Ling Han was even more determined to become Emperor. Though it was inevitable that the Great Emperor would die, his soul would fuse with the heaven and earth after his death. The corpse of an Emperor could be buried in the Void, and no one would ever be able to see it. It was better than this kind of desolation.","“Saintly medicine, Saintly medicine, Saintly medicine.” The large black dog mumbled as it walked, its eyes bright.","However, the saintly might here was too strong. Though it no longer had any destructive power, it greatly affected their search.","Moreover, Saint corpses couldn’t be casually tossed around. Although they had already been dead for countless years, they were still like God Tools that had been unsheathed. They would be wounded upon contact."]},{"number":4580,"title":"Chapter 4580: Female assassin","paragraphs":["Chapter 4580: Female assassin","Editor: Henyee Translations","It could not be helped. They could only search slowly.","Ling Han and the others discussed for a while, and decided to move separately.","With the four of them together, the efficiency of searching was too low. Furthermore, the little azure dragon and the large black dog were already Seven Star Venerates. Even if they were no match for the strongest Golden Generation, Phoenix Wings Divine Flight would still allow them to escape safely.","Moreover, there were only a dozen or so nine-star Venerate Golden Generations. In such a place, the chances of encountering one were actually very small.","There was even less need to mention Brother Monkey and Ling Han. When others saw them, they should have fled, all right?","The four of them agreed to meet at the entrance of the mass grave one month later to decide whether they should continue their search or go to the next place.","Ling Han walked with his hands clasped behind his back, sensing the saintly might.","Actually, this was also beneficial for cultivation.","When a Saint died, the Regulations that were contained in their bodies would slowly disperse into heaven and earth. This process was very long. Furthermore, in the process of dispersing, the Regulations would occasionally manifest, allowing one to comprehend them.","This was a little similar to the effects of the Saintly medicine, but the Saintly medicine was absorbing the Regulations as nutrients while it was growing, and that was why the Regulations would occasionally appear.","Similarly, it had the word “Saint”, but when it showed the same effect, one was alive while the other was dead.","Life and death, death or life.","Ling Han was suddenly moved, as if he had caught hold of something. However, when he stretched out his hand to touch it, it was completely empty, which made him feel very uncomfortable.","He wracked his brains, yet he couldn’t recall anything no matter how hard he tried. This made him feel terrible, and he was even driven mad.","Shua!","Right at this moment, a flash of sword light suddenly appeared behind him, slashing fiercely towards him.","This strike was too sudden. Furthermore, it was too close to Ling Han, so close that he did not even have the space to dodge.","Assassin!","Ling Han humphed, and countered with a punch. With a qiang, he had blocked the sword that had slashed down.","The assassin appeared, but his whole body was enshrouded in a black mist. A shocked expression appeared on his face that no one could see.","In this kind of situation, Ling Han actually managed to parry in time. This reaction speed, the speed of his punches were practically freakish.","Ling Han turned around and said calmly, “You’re a good assassin, grasping the right moment just right. I was indeed distracted just now.”","No matter how careful he was, he suddenly felt appreciation. This was something that no one could have foreseen.","Unfortunately, he did not manage to grasp this sudden enlightenment.","The assassin didn’t say anything, and the mist on his body fluctuated as if to express something.","“You Battle God Palace people are truly pests!” Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Unfortunately, the more you people chase me, the stronger I become.”","The assassin still didn’t speak. It was unknown whether it was because he didn’t want to speak or because he was at a loss for words.","Because indeed, Ling Han was already the number one Sect Master in history, and could even sweep aside the majority of Venerates. Only Saints could firmly suppress him.","After achieving such accomplishments, Ling Han could boast as much as he liked.","“Not talking?” Ling Han smiled faintly, “It’s all right. I don’t want to get anything out of you either.”","He moved, grabbing out at the assassin.","However, Regulations appeared, turning into a bright giant hand that moved loudly.","With a ‘hu’, the fog on the assassin’s body dispersed, revealing a snow-white naked body. Her pretty face had a beauty that could overturn the world, and her raven-black hair hung straight down to her waist.","This was actually a female assassin!","However, merely the female assassin alone was not enough to distract Ling Han. Yet, she was actually still naked. This really made Ling Han feel slightly surprised.","—When anyone was fighting, if their opponent suddenly burst open their clothes, they would be slightly shocked, right?","Moreover, this was an exquisite beauty.","Xiu! Taking advantage of Ling Han’s moment of shock, the assassin rapidly retreated.","If this was the outside world, then it didn’t matter. Ling Han could use Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and could still capture her accurately.","However, this was the Saint Tomb. Saintly might spread out, and holy light soared into the skies.","In that moment of distraction, the assassin had already disappeared into the distance.","How was he supposed to catch up?","Ling Han couldn’t help but rub his chin in shock, “This mistake, how should I find an excuse?”","The enemy was too cunning and too shameless, greeting him with a naked body, causing him to be unable to look directly at them?","“After fighting for so many years, this should be the first time that my opponent directly stripped naked and fled.”","“Thus, it can be considered to be understandable.”","This wasn’t because Ling Han was lustful, but because he really hadn’t expected to encounter such a situation.","“Hopefully, Old Black and Four-Legged Snake won’t fall for it,” Ling Han murmured. This female assassin’s strength was really not bad. Her cultivation level had reached Seven Star Venerate Tier, and her battle prowess was also comparable to the Silver Generation.","In this place, the efficiency of the assassin’s ambush could be maximized, so Ling Han was a little worried.","“However, they can already stand alone, so I don’t have to worry too much.”","Ling Han nodded. The large black dog had already been a Celestial King before him, so what scene had he not witnessed? Though the little azure dragon was still young, it was still a descendant of the True Dragon.","Brother Monkey naturally didn’t need him to worry about him. He was about to become a Saint, so if the assassin targeted Brother Monkey, she would only be courting death.","Ling Han continued to search while feeling curious.","The power of the Battle God Palace... had far exceeded his expectations.","This female assassin was a Seven Star Venerate. Moreover, from that glimpse, her flame of life had not been burning for too long, and was definitely under a thousand years old.","To be able to nurture out such a young Seven Star Venerate, just what kind of astonishing resources did the Battle God Palace possess?","The profession of assassin was indeed very profitable, but no one dared to trifle with the Imperial Clans, so they naturally would not have any enemies either. Thus, the business of the Imperial Clans could not be done, so how could the Battle God Palace rival the wealth of the Imperial Clans?","Additionally, Wu Yue had also appeared previously. Whether it was natural talent or battle prowess, he was not inferior to the Golden Generation.","How was the Battle God Palace so powerful?","“I’ve been to the Battle God Palace’s lair, and it’s definitely impossible to nurture Wu Yue or that female assassin just now.”","“It’s said that even the Imperial Clan is unwilling to trifle with the Battle God Palace... could it be that this Battle God Palace has a more powerful background?”","“Perhaps the Battle God Palace that I went to isn’t their true lair?”","Ling Han’s thoughts wandered. Long after the battle with Wu Yue, he had already developed a strong suspicion, and now, it was even stronger.","“Who cares? As long as I have enough strength, I can sweep aside everything, regardless of how deep your waters are!”","Ling Han let go of his doubts about the Battle God Palace. He had an invincible heart, so who cares how powerful your enemies are?","“Yi, there is a medicinal fragrance.” Ling Han’s nose twitched, and a smile appeared on his face.","He was the Alchemy Emperor, so his ability to sense Celestial medicines was naturally very strong as well. Immediately, he could distinguish Celestial medicines from the intense aura of Saints.","He circled around in the surroundings, and discovered that there was a Celestial medicine on the arm of a Saint that had collapsed on its side.","“Seven Stars Celestial medicine, it contains a sliver of Celestial Qi!”","“Haha, this is practically tailor-made for me.”","Ling Han picked it up carefully. Though the saintly might here was already very faint, and would not hinder him from walking here, if one wanted to approach the Saint corpse, or even touch the Saint corpse in reality, their killing intent would still spread out in all directions, and he had to be careful.","—"]},{"number":4581,"title":"Chapter 4581: Killed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4581: Killed","Editor: Henyee Translations","Extremely careful, Ling Han plucked that Seven Star Great Herb.","However, bright red blood was still dripping from the back of his hand.","The saintly might was like a supreme Divine Sword. So what if his physique was tough? He was merely scraped lightly, and his flesh was split open.","This was the might of a Saint. No matter how strong a Venerate was, they were nothing in front of a Saint.","Thus, all those below the level of Saint were mere ants. These words were not just empty words.","There was even less need to mention the Great Emperor. Only one could appear in each era, and he could blot out the skies with a single hand, suppressing an era.","“Put down the Celestial—”","A voice suddenly rang out from behind Ling Han, and as he spoke, Ling Han was also turning around. When the person behind saw Ling Han’s face, the remaining words were immediately swallowed back into his throat.","F***, Ling Han!","The person who had spoken was Tao Yu. He was presently wearing an awkward expression, as if he had been forcefully fed a fly.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “What do you want me to put down?”","Without another word, Tao Yu directly turned around and fled.","Fighting with Ling Han?","It was even more likely that he would be killed.","Moreover, he was someone who could become a Saint in the near future, so what need was there for him to battle against someone who was an eternal Sect Master and risk his life?","As long as he became a Saint, killing Ling Han would be a piece of cake.","Thus, why take the risk?","Xiu, Ling Han’s figure flashed, and he had already appeared in front of Tao Yu.","“We’ve finally met, so isn’t it inappropriate for you to leave without a word?” Ling Han said with a smile. “Moreover, you haven’t answered my question yet.”","Tao Yu humphed, and said, “Ling Han, don’t be so overbearing. Saintly might is everywhere here, and once we start fighting, it’s extremely likely that we’ll die together.”","Half of this was to scare Ling Han, and the other half was the truth.","“I already said, you still haven’t answered my question!” Ling Han raised his voice, then threw a punch.","Peng!","Tao Yu immediately dodged. This punch missed, and blasted towards a Saintly corpse, but before it had even landed, it exploded from the saintly might, turning into a wave of energy that spread out in all directions.","Instantly, the saintly might of the nearby Saintly corpses was all activated, and rolled out madly with a rumble, turning this place into an energy storm.","This was too terrifying. The energy storm was wrapped in saintly might, and that was fatal.","Tao Yu hurriedly dodged, but as his figure moved, he saw that Ling Han had already stepped in front of him, and shot out a punch.","He had no choice but to parry. Peng, this punch was blocked, but his figure also slid back, entering into the energy storm.","“Ah!” He released a terrible scream. Venerate Tier-level defense was completely useless against the saintly might, and innumerable wounds were instantly left on his back, blood gushing madly.","He couldn’t care less about his shock and anger, and hurriedly fled. Otherwise, under the crushing power of the energy storm, he would soon become a shattered corpse.","He naturally had to avoid Ling Han. However, just as he leaped out of the energy storm, he saw Ling Han block in front of him again, sending out a flying kick.","“No!” He was both furious and shocked, yet he couldn’t block it at all. He was kicked back into the energy storm again.","“Ah!” He continued to scream in pain, while his heart was filled with shock. If Ling Han continued to force him into the energy storm like this, he would soon be killed by the energy storm.","In a very easy and relaxed manner.","“Damn it, I’ll fight you to the death!” Tao Yu roared loudly, and saintly might instantly seeped out of his body, charging towards Ling Han.","He stimulated the Saintly bone in his body, and burst out with his strongest battle prowess.","“Get back!” Ling Han replied with a punch. Destructive Energy exploded in full power.","Boom!","In front of Destructive Energy, so what if there was a sliver of saintly power?","With a single punch, Tao Yu was immediately sent back into the energy storm again, and in Ling Han’s case, blood was seeping from his fist.","It could not be helped. Saintly power was still Saintly power. Even if Destructive Energy had melted part of it, there was still a sliver of it that could penetrate through, and cause damage to Ling Han.","Thankfully, it only caused his skin to split, and did not hurt his bones.","“You!” Tao Yu’s expression was filled with terror. If this continued, he would die, and he had never dreamed that he would die in such a way.","This would be such a worthless death..","“Ling Han, let’s go out and fight to the death!” he shouted loudly.","“Are you worthy?” Ling Han sneered, and delivered a palm strike. Peng, Tao Yu fell back into the energy storm.","When Tao Yu charged out again, his whole body was covered with blood, and he had also lost his left arm, as well as an ear. He looked extremely miserable.","He was even more sullen. A dignified Golden Generation was actually going to be killed by an energy storm?","Even if he became a ghost, he wouldn’t be able to rest in peace!","However, Ling Han sent out another palm strike, forcing him to have no choice but to parry. Then, he was blasted back into the energy storm.","After a dozen or so exchanges, Tao Yu’s life force started to rapidly decline. He had been damaged by the saintly might, so it was already extremely impressive that he could withstand it for so many exchanges. This was a clear sign of just how powerful he was.","Of course, this naturally was also thanks to the Saintly bone in his body.","He charged out again, his body swaying dangerously. His eyes were fixed on Ling Han, exuding endless hatred.","Peng!","So what? Ling Han delivered another palm strike, and Tao Yu was sent flying into the energy storm, and this time... he did not manage to escape.","He was dead.","A majestic Imperial Son, Golden Generation, Eight Star Venerate had died just like that.","“That’s why it’s said that those who don’t become Saints are ultimately ants. If they don’t become Emperor, the passage of time can erase all traces,” Ling Han murmured. “In fact, so what if they become Emperor? They can only prosper for an era. In history, it’s definitely not just these Great Emperors. However, haven’t the legends of many Great Emperors been annihilated in the passage of time?”","Without eternal life, it was impossible for there to be eternal legends.","Ling Han withdrew his sigh. This was a matter for the future. The present him only had to focus on his path of martial arts.","He walked far away. As long as he didn’t stoke the flames, the energy storm would slowly calm down.","Continuing to roam around, Ling Han occasionally gained something.","Though there were Saintly corpses all over this place, the lifespans of most of the Saints that had come here were close to drying up. There was a limited number of Saintly Particles, so how could all of them possibly nurture Saintly medicine after death?","Moreover, even a One Star or Two Star Saint did not have that kind of qualification. Only a Five Star Saint and above would have enough Saintly Particles to nurture a Saintly medicine.","The various levels of Saint Tier were too difficult to reach. How many Saints were above five stars?","Thus, it was already good enough that he could reap some benefits here, and he was still hoping for a lot?","A month later, Ling Han had more or less completed a tour of this place. Then, he returned to the exit, and met up with Brother Monkey and the others.","It wasn’t long before the four of them appeared, one after another.","However, there were signs of battle on everyone’s body. After all, this was searching for treasures in a Mystery Realm, so it would be strange if they hadn’t experienced battle.","They all talked about their experiences in the past month, and when Ling Han talked about the female assassin, both the large black dog and little azure dragon felt a little apprehensive. If it was them, it was very possible that they would be severely injured.","After sighing, they began to show off their gains. They had all gained a lot, which made the four of them very pleased.","“Let’s go. Perhaps there’s a second graveyard.”"]},{"number":4582,"title":"Chapter 4582: Corpse Tower","paragraphs":["Chapter 4582: Corpse Tower","Editor: Henyee Translations","They didn’t come across the Nine Mountains Saint here, and they didn’t come across any other Saints either.","Thus, it was extremely likely that there was more than one mass grave here.","They passed through this Saint Tomb, and continued onwards.","After walking for four days, as expected, another mass grave appeared ahead of them.","What surprised them was that in the center of the mass grave, there was a pile of corpses that towered high. It was like a steeple, and could be seen from afar.","Yi, who did this?","The four of them exchanged looks, all of them curious.","They refused to believe that it was the Saints themselves who had sat there and laid on them before their death.","How was this possible? To have deliberately chosen such a grave?","But if it was said that they had been thrown onto the pile after the Saints died... who could have done it?","After a Saint’s death, the saintly might would permeate the surroundings. This would not differentiate between allies and enemies. As long as someone approached or touched it, it would be activated, and it was guaranteed that killing a Venerate would be as easy as turning his palm over.","Thus, if one wanted to move the Saintly corpse, it could only be a Saint.","Just ask which Saint had nothing better to do than to pile up corpses for fun?","No matter what, they should first go in to find the Celestial medicine.","The four of them still moved separately, and still had the same agreement to meet back at their original location a month later.","Within a month, Ling Han encountered a few more Imperial Sons, but this time, their luck was not too bad. They fled very quickly, and did not give Ling Han the chance to catch them, which made him feel regretful.","In truth, these Imperial Sons should be complaining, all right?","—A dignified Venerate was actually being hunted down by a Sect Master Just what was going on here?","Ling Han deliberately came to the towering “Saintly Corpse Tower”, wanting to observe the situation from a close distance. However, there were really too many Saintly corpses here. The saintly might stacked on top of each other, forming a terrifying pressure, and there was no way to approach at all.","He used his eye technique and carefully scanned the surroundings.","He found nothing.","He couldn’t see the pattern of these Saintly corpses being piled up, and it was even more impossible for him to see through them to see if there was anything buried inside.","After stopping here for a few days, Ling Han finally left.","When the deadline was up, Ling Han went out to meet up with Brother Monkey and the others.","They had all mentioned the Saintly corpse tower, but they could not approach it, nor could they see through it. Naturally, they still did not have the slightest idea.","Let’s go.","They set out, and continued onwards. Another two days later, they saw the third Saint graveyard, and from afar, they could see the towering corpse tower of Saints.","Yi, was it only the first graveyard that did not have this?","This time, they decided to meet again in a month’s time at the foot of the Saintly Corpse Tower.","Find Celestial medicines.","Ling Han roamed around for a few days, but did not find anything. However, he did not take it to heart either. How could a Seven Star Great Herb, or even a Saintly medicine, be so easily obtained?","To be able to gain something in a few days was already incredibly shocking.","‘Hmm?’","He faltered upon this. He heard some voices talking and the volume of their voices was extremely high.","He walked over, but did not make the slightest movement.","“... We’ve already given you the Fourth Extreme Grass, so why aren’t you letting us leave?” someone shouted.","Ling Han had already arrived, and stretched out his head to take a look.","In front of them, there were two opposing sides. One side had five people, while the other side only had one person, but the one who had the upper hand was that loner.","Golden Generation, Cheng Feng.","The five people on the other side were only the Dao Childs of Holy Lands. Outside, they were naturally mighty, but in front of the Golden Generation, their cultivation level was inferior, and secondly, even if their cultivation levels were equal, it was impossible for them to be a match even if they joined forces.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Fourth Extreme Grass?","Becoming a Venerate was to evolve the fruit of cultivation in his body into the Fourth Extreme, and the so-called Fourth Extreme was the four ultimate pillars that supported his celestial body.","Thus, the higher the grade of the four ultimate pillars, the stronger the battle prowess of the Venerate would naturally be.","These pinnacle pillars were naturally formed by Regulations, and they were all Seven Star Regulations, so there was no difference in superiority. Thus, the pinnacle pillars formed by Venerates were actually more or less the same.","However, there were Celestial medicines in this world that could increase the grade of the pinnacle pillars, and that was the Fourth Extreme Grass.","No wonder Cheng Feng wanted to rob these four people. The Fourth Extreme Grass could help him form higher grade pillars, so it would also be much easier to light up the holy flame.","Faced with the questioning of these four people, Cheng Feng merely crossed his arms behind his back, an expression of pride on his face, and said calmly, “There is no reason, because I suddenly want to kill you all.”","‘You suddenly showed killing intent, and we have to die?’","What kind of logic was this?","Those four Dao Childs were all incredibly furious, but so what if they were furious? Could the resources of the Holy Lands compare to the Imperial Clan? Could the Dao Child compare to the Imperial Son?","“Cheng Feng, saintly might permeates the air here. If you make a move, we will also counterattack with our lives on the line. At that time, even you would not be able to escape death!” A Dao Child threatened.","“Do you guys have such an opportunity?” Cheng Feng showed a smile, but it was incredibly bloodthirsty.","With a swipe of his hand, shua, the Seven Star Regulations transformed into a divine light that slashed towards the five people.","With his strength as a nine-star Venerate, it was naturally a piece of cake for him to kill five Sect Masters.","However, the expected scene of heads flying did not appear.","“En?” Cheng Feng was surprised. Someone had moved, and dispersed his attack.","“Who is it?” He looked towards where Ling Han was.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and strode out.","“Ling Han!” Cheng Feng’s expression involuntarily tensed. This was the enemy that he least wanted to face. In fact, he was even more terrifying than Brother Monkey.","After all, Brother Monkey only had the aptitude of the Golden Generation. Although he had a staff forged from Saintly Material in his hand, it wasn’t like he didn’t have a Saint Tool himself.","But Ling Han... had too many tricks up his sleeve. Furthermore, that black-coloured energy was really too terrifying, that even the saintly power could be dispelled by it.","“Put down the Fourth Extreme Grass,” Ling Han said calmly, as if issuing a command to a servant.","Cheng Feng’s expression changed drastically. This was the tone in which he had issued commands to those five Dao Childs.","In his eyes, this was only natural. He was the Imperial Son, so what was wrong with commanding others to do something?","However, he was extremely displeased now that someone was using the same tone to reprimand him.","He was displeased, while the five Dao Childs were numb with excitement. In fact, they even wanted to cry.","In front of Cheng Feng, they were like dogs, without any dignity at all. He could plunder whatever he wanted, and the only thing they could do was beg for their lives.","And now, Cheng Feng had also suffered the same humiliation that they had suffered. How could they not feel that their anger had been vented?","Ling Han, good job!","Cheng Feng’s eyes focused on Ling Han, his expression baleful.","He really wanted to slap Ling Han’s face. However, when the great Imperial Sons had ganged up on Ling Han just then, who didn’t know just how powerful this Imperial Son Killer was?","If he exchanged blows with Ling Han, it was more likely that he would be outmatched.","He frowned, and said, “Saintly might permeates through this place. If you and I fight, neither of us would be able to gain an advantage.”","When the five Dao Childs heard this, they naturally felt even more of their anger had been vented.","This was their response just now, and it was also the voice of those who were at a disadvantage and felt helpless.","No matter how awesome you are,","“I told you to put down the Fourth Extreme Grass, didn’t you hear me?” Ling Han said, completely ignoring Cheng Feng’s threat.","After much consideration, Cheng Feng still waved his hand and tossed out the Fourth Extreme Grass.","Then, he humphed heavily, and turned around to leave.","“Did I allow you to leave?” Ling Han asked calmly."]},{"number":4583,"title":"Chapter 4583: Tower collapses","paragraphs":["Chapter 4583: Tower collapses","Editor: Henyee Translations","W-what?","Cheng Feng involuntarily stiffened.","“I’ve already given you the Fourth Extreme Grass. What else do you want?” he asked, suppressing his anger.","Ling Han smiled and said, “That’s strange. I only told you to put the Fourth Extreme Grass down. I didn’t say that you could leave after you put it down.”","This!","Cheng Feng immediately recalled that he had also previously commanded those five Dao Childs to do the same, yet now the favor was returned to him.","This retribution was too fast, wasn’t it?","He gritted his teeth, “Then let’s battle!”","Obviously, there was no way that Ling Han would spare him. Thus, there was no need for him to seek his own humiliation any longer.","He took the initiative to charge out. Weng, a battle drum appeared above his head, and with a tong, it actually sounded on its own.","“Wu!” The five Dao Childs felt a pain in their chests, and instantly spat out blood madly.","It was as if the battle drum had struck their hearts, almost causing them to explode.","And this was still because Cheng Feng’s main target was Ling Han. They had only suffered a slight shockwave from the aftermath. Otherwise, they would have long since died by now.","Saint Tool!","Ling Han constructed a defense of Regulations in front of him, blocking the soundwave attack. However, when the soundwave passed, this shield of Regulations immediately shattered.","That was an attack delivered by a Saint Tool, so how could its might be ordinary?","And at this time, Cheng Feng took the chance... to turn around and leave.","He clearly realized that he definitely wouldn’t be able to kill Ling Han. Thus, instead of taking risks, it would be better for him to withdraw and leave.","That was because he was about to advance into Saint Tier, and Ling Han was stuck at Sect Master-level forever. Thus, with how precious he was, why did he have to clash head-on with someone as fragile as a piece of porcelain like Ling Han?","Even if he could win, if he had to pay a huge price, he would still choose to give up.","This was also the reason why he was willing to hand over the Fourth Extreme Grass. As the saying goes, the barefooted people are not afraid of those who wear shoes1. He had no wish to fight Ling Han to the death.","Ling Han did not pursue him, because Cheng Feng was not much inferior to him, and this place was extremely suitable for an ambush. He too did not want to take too many risks.","Was it not enough to forcefully snatch the Fourth Extreme Grass from the other’s hands?","“Thank you!” the five Dao Childs all said to Ling Han.","Ling Han nodded in understanding before turning around to leave.","Afterward, he did not encounter Imperial Sons again. A month later, he met up with Brother Monkey and the others, and then headed to the next location.","They had not even walked far, when they saw the Saintly Corpse Tower towering into the skies. It was the best guide.","They arrived at this fourth mass grave, and similarly agreed to meet at the foot of the corpse tower in a month’s time.","Every day, they were searching for Celestial medicines. Time passed very quickly, and a month passed in the blink of an eye.","Ling Han arrived at the foot of the Saintly Corpse Tower. This time, he was the first to arrive. Brother Monkey and the others hadn’t arrived yet, because he had arrived a day earlier.","He sat down in a cross-legged position. He had been immersed in the saintly might these past few days, and no matter what, he would have some appreciation. He needed to sort it out.","After half a day, someone arrived.","At first, Ling Han thought that it was Brother Monkey and the others, but when he turned his head, he saw that it was Jing Haoran.","“Old friend, we meet again.” Jing Haoran waved his hand in a very cordial manner.","This, I don’t seem to be too familiar with you, right?","Ling Han sighed. This guy was the same as the large black dog, and belonged to the category of having a bad mouth. It would be very logical for him to be hacked to death one day because of his loose tongue.","A thought flashed in his mind, and he said, “Old Brother, there’s a very profitable business deal. Are you up for it?”","“What business deal?” Jing Haoran immediately asked.","“I’ll use high-level Celestial Qi to exchange for low-level Celestial Qi with you. One star inferior, and I’ll trade one for every five, how about it?” Ling Han suggested.","Hiss!","Jing Haoran sucked in a sharp breath, then immediately said, “Fine, Old Brother, you’ve actually mastered the technique to refine a low-level Celestial Qi into a high-level Celestial Qi! Come, come, come, sell this technique to me, all right?”","This guy was quite smart. He had guessed the truth with just this bit of clue.","As expected of the Genesis World’s master. He definitely couldn’t be underestimated just because he spoke without thinking.","“Do you know how to concoct alchemical pills?” Ling Han asked smilingly.","“He, are you underestimating me?” Jing Haoran bared his teeth in a grin.","As the rulers of the Genesis World, which of them hadn’t lived for several epochs? Whether it was alchemy, forging, or other unorthodox techniques, they had definitely learnt all of them.","Ling Han also smiled. This was one matter, but what standards he had reached was another matter.","As far as he knew, Ding Shu also knew how to concoct alchemical pills. However, he could only say that he knew how to concoct alchemical pills. He didn’t have any particularly astonishing natural talent.","“Sure, 10,000 portions of Eight Star Celestial Qi in exchange for it.” He made an exorbitant demand.","With so much Celestial Qi, it would be enough for him to advance into the Venerate Tier, and cultivate to the peak stage of Venerate Tier. Then, he would not need Celestial Qi anymore.","“Why don’t you go rob while you are at it!” Jing Haoran rolled his eyes madly. Wasn’t this just a joke?","To say nothing of the fact that he could not produce 10,000 portions of Eight Star Celestial Qi, even if all the Imperial Clans were willing to generously contribute, that was still far from enough.","“Then how many portions can you take out?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Twenty portions, at most,” Jing Haoran Haoran bargained.","“Hehe, why don’t you go and commit robbery yourself?” Ling Han rolled his eyes. Why was he even more shameless than him?","“Eight-star Celestial Qi is already rare, okay? Besides, how many have you tricked last time?” Jing Haoran paused for a moment, “If worse comes to worst, I’ll add some Seven Stars Celestial Qi, Six Stars Celestial Qi, and so on to make up a hundred portions.”","This guy was really very good at bargaining.","Ling Han was just about to speak, when he gave an “en”, and looked towards the corpse tower.","It was the same for Jing Haoran. He sensed an unusual movement.","“Hey, hey, hey, you’re not going to turn into zombies, are you?” he muttered.","Right at this moment, the arm of a Saintly corpse suddenly moved.","F***!","“You jinx!” Ling Han exclaimed.","Jing Haoran shrugged. ‘It’s my fault?’","He chuckled, “How bad could it be?”","Boom, the whole corpse tower trembled lightly, and one after another, corpses fell from the highest level. Instantly, it was as if a rain of Saintly corpses had fallen, filling the skies.","“If you say one more word, I’ll chop off your head!” Ling Han warned Jing Haoran. This guy definitely had the ability to have his words turn into reality, but it was all negative.","The Genesis World’s Lord was indeed a weirdo. He had a halo of trouble, while Jing Haoran could always predict the worst situation.","It was only an instant, and the whole corpse tower collapsed loudly. Saintly corpses rained down, covering the whole mass grave.","Those below hurriedly dodged. Though the Saintly corpses that had fallen had long since died, that was still a Saintly corpse, after all. Who would dare let it come into contact with them? If it really landed, that would be equivalent to being directly struck by the Saint Tool, and it was guaranteed that they would die completely.","And while dodging, everyone was also heading in the direction of the Saintly Corpse Tower, wanting to know what exactly was going on here.","One, two, three... More and more people arrived.","This corpse tower had not collapsed completely, leaving behind a “tower base”.","What had happened?","Everyone came over, all bearing this kind of confusion.","Boom! Right at this moment, the remaining foundations of the tower also started to crumble. When all of the corpses of the Saints had rolled to one side, a large bronze coffin actually appeared beneath them."]},{"number":4584,"title":"Chapter 4584: Bronze Coffin","paragraphs":["Chapter 4584: Bronze Coffin","Editor: Henyee Translations","Coffin?","Those who cultivated would naturally not believe the theory of ascending “coffin” and becoming rich, and would only link the coffin to death1.","Hence, when they suddenly saw a coffin, everyone felt a terrible premonition.","“Er, this is the Saint Tomb in the first place, so it would be normal for a coffin to appear here,” someone said.","“... Have you ever seen other Saints buried in caskets?” someone immediately retorted.","“That’s right. Could it be that when it was the Saint entered, he had already prepared his own coffin?” Even more people found this strange.","Actually, none of the Saints that had come here wanted to die.","They either wanted to extend their lifespan, or wanted to increase their strength. None of them really wanted to be buried here.","Hence, no matter how they thought about it, bringing his own casket was incredibly strange.","Furthermore, the Saintly corpses had even been piled up together. What was the meaning of this?","Was this very fun?","A muscle twitched in Ling Han’s cheek. Unconsciously, he began to complain again.","“None of the other Saints have caskets, so this Saint must be incredibly powerful,” an Imperial Son speculated.","“A nine-star Saint?”","“Or even... Pseudo-Emperor?”","When it came to Pseudo-Emperor, everyone’s hearts skipped a beat.","This was a Pseudo-Emperor! Although it had the word ‘Pseudo’, it also had the word ‘Emperor’. Suppressing any Saint would be as easy as the turn of a palm.","If there was no Emperor in the world, Pseudo-Emperor could also suppress an era.","If they could obtain the treasures left behind by the Pseudo-Emperor, what kind of astonishing opportunity would that be?","Everyone’s hearts beat faster. If they could become Pseudo-Emperor, that would be on the same level as Buddha Doga, the master of the sea of blood and the like, standing at the frontmost lines in the race for the position of Great Emepror.","Even if they couldn’t become Emperor, with Pseudo-Emperor’s strength, they could bury this lifetime, live a second life after a few years, and then compete for the throne.","Just like Buddha Doga.","Before they knew it, everyone was moving forwards, getting closer and closer to this casket.","Though Ling Han was also slightly tempted, what he felt more was wariness.","What if this place was also like the sea of blood and Yin River?","You see, those places were also covered with Saintly corpses, which were very similar to this place. The only difference was that this was a place that the Saints had taken the initiative to enter.","Thus, even if this was really a Pseudo-Emperor, what if they had not died?","Furthermore, there were so many Saintly corpse towers here. If there was a bronze casket underneath every one of them, how many Pseudo-Emperors would there be?","With this in mind, Ling Han didn’t think that there was a Pseudo-Emperor buried in the casket.","Though there was still some possibility.","He stood still, and merely watched from the sidelines.","Seeing Ling Han act like this, Brother Monkey, the little azure dragon, and the large black dog also stopped in their tracks. There was already enough trust and tacit understanding between them.","Standing here, it was still very easy to see the bronze casket clearly. It was covered with patterns, forming the image of a Divine Beast, a Celestial Bird, and there was even a sunflower soaring into the sky, making all living beings worship it.","“Yi?” Everyone turned to look at one person.","Tong Xiao, Black Sunflower Imperial Clan’s Silver Generation.","Demonic Sunflower was the symbol of the Black Sunflower Imperial Clan. In the past, the Black Sunflower Demon Emperor had been a Demonic Sunflower. He had gone from being unknown to cultivating a world-shaking Mystical Power, becoming the invincible Great Emperor.","But now, the pattern of a sunflower had actually appeared here, and it was obviously the main character, enjoying the worship of all living beings... could it be that the person in this coffin was actually related to the Black Sunflower Imperial Clan?","Tong Xiao was also very confused. He thought for a long time, then said, “I don’t remember any Saint of my clan being buried here.”","Furthermore, it was impossible for a Pseudo-Emperor. After a Great Emperor appeared in their line, the word ‘Emperor’ had no further relation to the Imperial Clan.","Everyone became even more curious. Was there a Pseudo-Emperor buried inside this casket, and what relation did it have with the Black Sunflower Imperial Clan?","“Don’t worry about it, open the casket!” someone with an impatient nature said.","This gained the agreement of many people. Instead of making wild guesses here, wouldn’t they know everything with a single glance when they opened the coffin?","However, there were also a great many cautious people that expressed their objection, and thought that they should wait and see.","In the end, even more elites thought that they should observe it more closely. After all, what if there really was a Pseudo-Emperor? Then if they rashly opened the coffin, that could probably cause a terrifying and fatal calamity.","Everyone began to study it, but there was really nothing much to study about this coffin. Its appearance was just like that, so what could be seen?","“Let’s open the casket.”","In the end, everyone reached a concensus. Only a limited number of people still insisted on looking further, but they could no longer influence the overall situation.","But who would open it?","What if the casket was opened, and a terrifying killing intent surged out, and they were killed?","Everyone wanted to take advantage of others, but it was dangerous. Hehe, it was better to let others take the blow.","At this moment, no one stepped forward.","Among those that could cultivate to the level of Sect Master and Venerate Tier, which one of them was an idiot?","“Humph, since no one has taken the initiative to step out, then I can only pick someone,” Yi Taishu said balefully.","The other Golden Generations also nodded in agreement. At such a time, they naturally advanced and retreated in unison.","The remaining Dao Childs couldn’t help but tremble slightly. Obviously, if the Imperial Son called out names, he would definitely not choose the other Imperial Sons, and as for Ling Han, Ding Shu, and the others, the Imperial Sons could not command them at all, nor did they dare to.","Thus, the unlucky ones could only be them.","“You, you, you, and you, go.” Yi Taishu began to call out names.","Sure enough, he chose four Dao Childs, causing their expressions to instantly turn green.","They were both furious and shocked, but... could they resist?","Ling Han smiled faintly. Should he speak up, and call out for the Imperial Sons to open the casket?","Peng!","However, right at this moment, a muffled sound was heard, as if a drum was being beaten.","What... was going on?","Everyone was numb with shock, because the source of this muffled sound... was precisely that bronze casket.","Gods, was he going to come back to life?","“I didn’t say anything!” Jing Haoran immediately defended himself. He couldn’t be blamed for jinxing things.","Er!","Ling Han shook his head. However, at this moment, he wasn’t in the mood to complain. He simply stared at the bronze casket.","Tong!","This time, it was clearly louder than the last time.","There was complete silence. They merely focused their gazes on that casket, and some people were already prepared to flee.","Once some terrifying monster crawled out of the casket, they would naturally flee without hesitation.","There were so many people here, so they should be able to buy them some time.","Tong! Tong! Tong!","After a few loud bangs, the bangs suddenly stopped.","Yi, why was it gone?","Everyone was at the most tense moment. They were both expectant and afraid that something would pop out of the casket, but now, this sound had suddenly stopped, and they did not know how to react.","“That’s all?”","“Why did it stop?”","“What on earth is going on?”","“You go and open the casket.”","“Get lost, I’m not going. If you want to go, go ahead.”","Everyone wanted to know the reason, but no one was willing to walk out. It was obvious that this was too dangerous.","“Squeak!”","Right at this moment, a sound was heard from the casket again. Under everyone’s stunned gazes, the lid of the casket was slowly raised."]},{"number":4585,"title":"Chapter 4585: Black Sunflower Race","paragraphs":["Chapter 4585: Black Sunflower Race","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Old Brother, you’re too awesome. You can still come back to life even after death; even the casket lid can’t hold you down!” Jing Haoran murmured to the side.","Though his voice was very low, the surroundings were now completely silent, and his voice had also reached everyone’s ears.","All of a sudden, everyone was glaring angrily at him.","Yi, why are you guys glaring at me?","Jing Haoran gave everyone a confused expression.","However, no one was in the mood to pay attention to him now.","The person in the coffin—no matter what it was—was about to come out.","Everyone’s eyes were focused on the casket, their hearts beating faster, nervous to the extreme.","Right at this moment, a hand suddenly stretched out and grabbed onto the edge of the coffin.","F***, had he really f****** come back to life?","The lid of the coffin was pushed open, and a man straightened his upper body. He was wearing a long black robe, exuding an air of dominance.","Though everyone was stunned, they immediately breathed a sigh of relief.","This man... was not as strong as they had imagined.","In everyone’s minds, the being buried under the Saintly corpse tower had to be a nine-star Saint, at least. In fact, it might even be a Pseudo-Emperor.","However, this man was only at the fourth pinnacle level.","Though Venerates were also incredibly strong, they were ultimately not as terrifying as one would imagine.","Moreover, there was no shortage of Venerates here. Furthermore, these were the nine-star Venerates of the Golden Generation. Thus, what was there to be afraid of?","“Who are you?” Han Yun called out loudly.","The man in the coffin’s eyes swept over them, and stopped on Han Yun. He slanted his head slightly, “A mere ant dares to command me?”","This... he actually referred to the Imperial Son as an ant?","“You really don’t know how to write the word ‘die’!” Han Yun sneered.","He was just about to make a move, yet was stopped by a Dao Child. He said with a smile, “There is no need to use waste too much effort on a weak character, so allow me to move on behalf of Imperial Son Yun.”","Han Yun thought for a moment, then nodded at this bootlicker, “Alright.”","He didn’t know the strength of the person in the coffin, so he could use someone else to test it out.","The Dao Child was overjoyed. He had successfully gotten the support of this powerful backer.","He turned around, and shouted at the man in the coffin, “Insolent madman, quickly kneel down and apologize to Imperial Son Yun!”","“Imperial Son Yun?” the man in the coffin murmured. A smile appeared on his face, and he said, “So he’s a descendant of the Imperial Clan. No wonder he’s so arrogant.”","“Madman!” The Dao Child shouted loudly, and immediately charged out.","The man in the coffin didn’t seem to have seen the attack of the Dao Child at all. However, just as the Dao Child arrived in front of him, he turned into a rain of blood with a bang, completely dead.","This!","Everyone was stunned, and couldn’t help but frown.","Though this Dao Child was a bootlicker, and his personality was something to be despised, he was still a genuine Venerate, yet he actually couldn’t even make a single move, and was directly crushed. This was still too shocking.","The man in the coffin was clearly only a Venerate.","The man in the coffin stretched lazily, but still looked laidback. He swept his gaze over the masses, and said with a smile, “Since I have risen, you all can welcome me with blood.”","He stood up. Boom! A powerful aura circulated, causing many people to involuntarily take a few steps back as if they had been blown by a hurricane.","“Sir, what boastful words!” An Imperial Son smirked coldly. He actually said that he wanted to use them as blood sacrifices; what a joke.","This place was filled with the king tiers of the younger generation!","“What relation do you have with the Black Sunflower Imperial Clan?” Tong Xiao asked. This was what he was most curious about.","The man in the coffin glanced at Tong Xiao and gave an ‘oh’, and said, “So it’s a descendant of our clan! Humph, having such a lowly bloodline is really an embarrassment to our Black Sunflower Race!”","What, he was actually also a member of the Black Sunflower Imperial Clan?","Everyone was stunned. Though they had all had this kind of deduction previously, hearing it confirmed from the other’s mouth still made them panic.","This... was an old monster that had been sleeping for how long.","Yet Ling Han’s heart jolted, as he thought of Di Wuji.","Di Wuji clearly belonged to the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan, but there was a difference between him and the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan, and his words were filled with slight disdain.","Moreover, the Great Emperor Horn couldn’t affect him.","Could the situation be the same for the man in the coffin?","The man in the coffin smiled faintly, “You little guys don’t have much strength, but your attitude is quite arrogant. I have nothing better to do, so I’ll let you know what a supreme prodigy is!”","He crooked a finger, “Can you block a single strike from me?”","The other was a Silver Generation elite, a Four-Star Venerate.","The Imperial Son couldn’t help but feel enraged. He was just about to speak, yet the man in the coffin had already moved. He casually flicked a finger, and a brilliant light surged over, shooting toward him.","The Imperial Son hurriedly parried, but though his hands were defending in front of him, they were completely useless.","Pu! Both of his palms were pierced through. The streak of light struck him, and his body was also blasted through.","Fortunately, the strike landed on the right side of the chest, avoiding the heart. Otherwise, the Venerate’s heart might not have been destroyed, but he would definitely have been severely injured.","“You!” The man in the coffin pointed at another person. This was a Golden Generation, an eight-star Venerate.","He still snapped his fingers, and a brilliant light surged over, piercing through the body of that Golden Generation.","In two moves, he had defeated two Imperial Sons. Furthermore, if it was not for the fact that he had not aimed for their heads, these two would definitely have died.","Everyone was stunned. Previously, it was one thing for a Four-Star Venerate to be insta-killed, but an Eight-Star Venerate was also insta-killed with a single move. This was too terrifying.","“You!” The man in the coffin pointed at Han Yun, and still snapped his fingers.","Peng!","Han Yun hurriedly parried, and his body was instantly sent sliding backwards. He only stopped after retreating a good few hundred meters. However, this blow was finally blocked, though there were traces of a charred smell exuding from his arm.","“Yo.” The man in the coffin revealed a hint of surprise, as if he was surprised that he had not defeated his opponent in a single strike, “You are not too bad, being able to block a single blow from me.”","As a dignified Golden Generation, he hadn’t been insta-killed, so was his abilities worthy of praise?","Was this a compliment?","Han Yun was enraged, but he did not rashly counterattack.","This opponent was very strong!","The man in the coffin’s eyes swept over them, and came to a stop on Ling Han and his group. His gaze stopped on Brother Monkey, “Yi, you are a descendant of the Battle Saint Emperor, right?”","Brother Monkey slung the staff over his shoulder, “It is your Grandpa Sun!”","“Hehe, the line of the Battle Saint Emperor all have such hot tempers. They speak without thinking, and that’s why there are so few of them,” the man in the coffin said. “Since I’ve encountered one, I’ll just kill another.”","He stood up and charged towards Brother Monkey.","How could Brother Monkey be afraid? With a harsh exclamation, he brandished his staff to greet the attack.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them battled fiercely, and as every attack swept past, a terrifying might would sweep over. To say nothing of Sect Masters, even Venerates would frown at this.","F***, this had already surpassed the level of Venerate Tier.","How could he possibly be so strong?","This didn’t make sense.","Yet Ling Han came to a realization.","Brother Monkey was so strong because he had been in the process of breaking through to Saint Tier in the first place. Afterwards, he had obtained the seed of Regulations, and his advancement speed had once again sped up. Now, even if he did not have one foot into Saint Tier, he would at least have half a foot, or slightlt less than half a foot.","Thus, his battle prowess was naturally strong.","And as for the man in the coffin... he was the same as Di Wuji!"]},{"number":4586,"title":"Chapter 4586: The son of the Demon Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 4586: The son of the Demon Emperor","Editor: Henyee Translations","In the previous battle between Ling Han and Di Wuji, though he was inferior to Di Wuji by a few minor levels, in terms of power, he had completely overwhelmed him.","That was because the Great Emperor had refined a few stars into Di Wuji’s body, allowing him to burst out with power on the level of Venerate Tier, and at that time, Ling Han had not broken through to the level of Ten Stars at all, so it was naturally impossible for him to be a match.","It was the same now.","Brother Monkey’s strength lay in his Regulations. He had already touched the territory of Saint Tier. Thus, every move he made carried a sliver of saintly might.","Though it was only a sliver, this was the comprehension that truly belonged to him, and not the saintly might that came from having a Saintly bone implanted in his body. The might could not be compared.","And the man in the coffin had the Planet Core, which allowed his power to far surpass the level that a Venerate should have.","Thus, this battle was actually a little similar to how Ling Han had battled against Di Wuji. One was more proficient in Regulations, while the other possessed an absolute advantage in terms of power.","Who exactly would emerge victorious?","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Brother Monkey and the man in the coffin battled fiercely. In a short period of time, it was really impossible to determine who was stronger. Even Ling Han could not tell.","When one had reached this level, changes in battle could happen in an instant. A moment of carelessness would mean eternal damnation. Thus, there were too many factors that would affect the outcome of the battle, and it was really not easy to judge.","The man in the coffin laughed loudly, “So you have already touched a sliver of the threshold to Saint Tier. No wonder you can contend against me!”","He wanted to stop the battle. There was no meaning to continue fighting like this.","But who was Brother Monkey?","If you want to fight, we fight and if you want to stop, we just stop?","No way!","Brother Monkey brandished the metal rod, bold and pronounced, fighting spirit soaring into the skies.","The man in the coffin couldn’t help but be rendered speechless. Why had he chosen Brother Monkey?","It wasn’t like he didn’t know that all the members of the Battle Saint Emperor’s line were battle maniacs, yet he insisted on fighting Brother Monkey.","It was also him who had miscalculated. He had not thought that Brother Monkey was actually already on the verge of breaking through to Saint Tier. Otherwise, even if he was a nine-star Venerate, so what? How could he possibly be a match for him?","Only now did everyone know that Brother Monkey was about to break through to Saint Tier.","Hiss!","This was the number one person of the younger generation.","Though Brother Monkey had been born two to three thousand years earlier than the Golden Generation, when one had reached the height of Venerate Tier, what was this little age worth? They could all be categorized as belonging to the same generation.","But what basis did the man in the coffin have?","He was also about to become a Saint?","Ling Han opened his mouth, and said slowly, “You should be the son of the Black Sunflower Demon Emperor, right?”","Peng!","The man in the coffin was clearly dazed for a moment, and was instantly sent flying by Brother Monkey’s staff.","However, this only sent him flying, and did not cause him any injury.","However, these words were shocking and earth-shattering.","He was the son of a Great Emperor!","Was that possible?","However, if Ling Han was only spouting nonsense, would the man in the coffin have been shocked and sent flying by Brother Monkey?","But... the son of a Great Emperor?","Everyone felt their scalps go numb.","Why was the son of a Great Emperor here? Moreover, how could the Black Sunflower Clan not know that their second-generation ancestor was buried here?","Brother Monkey did not pursue any further. The other was already distracted, so he disdained from taking advantage of this.","Meanwhile, the man in the coffin breathed a sigh of relief. Unless he could easily kill his opponent in a fight with the line of Battle Saint Emperor, every time they fought, even if he could win, he would still be severely wounded.","He turned his gaze to Ling Han, and a curious expression appeared on his face, “How did you guess?”","With this question, it was equivalent to admitting it.","F***, that really was the case.","Everyone was stunned. The son of a Great Emperor had suddenly appeared. Was the era about to be overturned?","Tong Xiao’s expression became even more awkward. He didn’t know if he should address the man as Second Ancestor.","Because this was only Ling Han’s question, and the man in the coffin had tacitly agreed, there was no substantial evidence. If he was to randomly acknowledge someone as ancestor, then the Black Sunflower Imperial Clan would be completely humiliated.","“I don’t know if you know someone called Di Wuji,” Ling Han said casually.","“Yi?” The man in the coffin couldn’t help but look surprised, “You met Di Wuji, and are actually still alive?”","Ling Han cracked a smile, spread out his hands, and said, “I am living very well.”","“Di Wuji actually spared your life?” the man in the coffin murmured, and suddenly stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han, “Then I would really like to see what is so special about you.”","Seeing this, everyone smirked coldly.","You are very arrogant, and very insufferable, right?","Just wait to be shocked.","The man in the coffin saw everyone’s reaction, and a strange expression involuntarily rose up on his face. Why were everyone’s expressions so strange?","However, wouldn’t dealing with a Sect Master be a piece of cake for him? Did he need to be concerned?","Ling Han raised his fist and threw a punch at the man in the coffin.","Peng!","The Regulations burst forth, and the large hand that the man in the coffin had stretched out immediately crumbled.","Yi?","The man in the coffin revealed an astounded expression. Against a Sect Master, it was naturally impossible for him to go all out. He had only used a sliver of the power of Venerate Tier, as he thought it would definitely be a piece of cake.","However, reality was so strange.","What kind of Sect Master was this?","“Interesting.” He nodded, and made another move, but this time, it was slightly more powerful.","Ling Han stepped forward to block this attack. Peng! He shattered this attack with a single punch, then launched a counterattack at the man in the coffin.","“F***!”","Even if the man in the coffin was experienced and knowledgeable, he was still severely shocked.","He hurriedly increased his battle prowess again, and began fighting with Ling Han.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them battled, and the man in the coffin finally gained the upper hand. However, it was only an upper hand.","In terms of Regulations, he was completely unable to suppress Ling Han. It was all because his power far surpassed the level of Venerate Tier, which was why he could suppress Ling Han to a limited extent.","“You!” The man in the coffin was really shocked. How could there be such a terrifying Sect Master?","Even if the Great Emperor came back to life, he would still have to kneel in front of this person in a battle of equal cultivation levels.","“What did you say just now?” Ling Han asked with a smile. “You want us to sacrifice ourselves to you?”","The man in the coffin was rendered speechless.","Originally, though he was a Venerate, he should have been absolutely invincible in this cultivation level. You see, even a nine-star Venerate Golden Generation was no match for him.","However, first, it was Brother Monkey, then Ling Han, and they both blocked him.","What shocked him the most was naturally Ling Han. Was this really a Sect Master?","He was practically doubting life itself.","Having slumbered for too long, this world was changing too quickly, wasn’t it?","“I refuse to believe this!” the man in the coffin said with a humph. Weng! Six stars materialized in his body.","These were genuine stars, and they had only shrunk to this extent after being refined by the Great Emperor with his supreme might.","Six?","Realization dawned on Ling Han. Even if he was the son of the Great Emperor, there were still differences in aptitude. The man in the coffin was obviously inferior to Di Wuji, who had seven stars.","“You are inferior to Di Wuji.” He did not give him any face, and directly pointed out.","The man in the coffin revealed an expression of fury. Indeed, he was inferior to Di Wuji, but being pointed out in public by Ling Han made him extremely angry and embarrassed.","“You’re going to pay the price for your rude words!” the man in the coffin roared. Boom! The six stars boosted him with power, yet he did not attack immediately.","This was accumulating power to deliver an absolutely powerful attack.","In a mere second, he had completed accumulation, and then shot out a punch.","Instantly, a streak of light shot over, its speed so fast that Ling Han had no time to dodge at all.","He could only parry."]},{"number":4587,"title":"Chapter 4587: Tong Ming","paragraphs":["Chapter 4587: Tong Ming","Editor: Henyee Translations","However, the problem was that this was equivalent to the furious barrage of attacks from a One-Star or even Two-Star Saint. It only lacked the level of Regulations, and its destructive power was still boundlessly terrifying.","How could Ling Han possibly block this?","If he faced it head-on, he would definitely be severely injured, and every single bone in his body would be crushed!","Peng, this attack had already arrived. Light exploded, incredibly dazzling.","Everyone’s expressions changed drastically. What kind of terrifying attack was this?","So what if it was a nine-star Venerate? He would probably be smashed into smithereens under this attack.","Was this the battle prowess of the son of a Great Emperor?","This was too shocking.","The Golden Generation elites were even more humiliated. They were all claimed to be close to the level of the Great Emperors in the past, and compared to the actual sons of Great Emperors, just how wide was the gap between them? And they still wanted to compare to the Great Emperors in the past? Pei!","“En?” A hint of surprise appeared on the man’s face.","The light dissipated, and Ling Han was still standing proudly in the air. However, a tower had appeared above his head, and Primal Chaos Qi was emanating from it. There was supreme lightning flickering.","“Imperial Weapon!” the man in the coffin said in a solemn voice. However, he immediately shook his head and said with a burning gaze, “Origin Gold! You actually obtained a piece of Origin Gold!”","Origin Gold was too rare. Who knew how many years it would take for the heaven and earth to nurture a piece. Thus, even if the Great Emperor was invincible in this world, they could only obtain one piece of Origin Gold, and forge an Imperial Weapon.","It could not be helped. With the lifespan of a Great Emperor, even if he lived a second life, he would not be able to wait until the appearance of a second piece of Origin Gold.","Thus, it was possible that there would only be one such Great Emperor that could encounter two pieces of Origin Gold in his lifetime.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “You have good insight. Old Black, deliver a reward.”","The large black dog immediately retrieved a bone and tossed it toward the man in the coffin.","‘Holy f*ck!’","You guys are really too despicable, aren’t you?","Everyone was dumbfounded. They had not thought that Ling Han would still be in the mood to make fun of others at this moment, and the large black dog actually had a bone with him.","—It really was a dog.","Meanwhile, the man in the coffin exploded in fury. Veins were popping on his forehead and neck, and he looked like he was about to commit murder and devour someone.","“Die!” He charged over, six stars surrounding him. This was completely a deadly weapon. As long as they was struck or touched, it was guaranteed that even Venerates would have their bones broken and their flesh shattered.","Ling Han humphed as he channeled the Destructive Energy and launched it at the man in the coffin.","What!","The man in the coffin instinctively felt a sense of danger, and hurriedly dodged.","Boom, the Destructive Energy struck, and blasted onto the ground, melting a large area of the ground soundlessly. Even the Saintly corpses would not be able to escape this fate, as a small corner had been scraped off.","Though it was only a small corner, that was a Saintly corpse! Theoretically speaking, it was equivalent to a Saintly Material!","Heavens!","The man in the coffin frowned. This kind of high-level energy... he seemed to have heard of it, but only vaguely.","“Who are you?” He did not attack again, but rather asked darkly.","Ling Han broke into a smile, “Before asking others, shouldn’t you tell them your name first? Don’t you understand this kind of rule?”","The man in the coffin wanted to flip out again, but after some thought, he forcibly suppressed the urge, and said, “I am Tong Ming!”","As expected!","Everyone gave an ‘oh’. The Black Sunflower Demon Emperor took the surname of Tong, and this surname... was too rare. It was so rare that only the Black Sunflower Clan still used it, and even if there were others with the surname of Tong, they would still change their surname to avoid any issues.","“Alright, tell me your name!” the man in the coffin, Tong Ming, said.","Ling Han smiled, and turned to look at the large black dog, “Old Black.”","“Your Grandpa Ling’s surname is naturally Ling, and his name is Han.” The large black dog was used to cooperating with Ling Han. Even if he angered someone to death, he would not care about it.","The corners of Tong Ming’s mouth twitched madly. At this moment, he really wanted to kill someone.","“You really think I can’t deal with you guys?” he said balefully. A black sunflower suddenly appeared behind him. Its roots were covered with complex veined patterns, and it was filled with demonic aura.","Tong Xiao instantly felt his body tremble. He wanted to kneel down and worship this Demonic Sunflower.","This was a suppression on his bloodline, and he no longer had the slightest doubt. Even if Tong Ming was not the son of the Great Emperor, he was still a descendant of his ancestor. His bloodline was far nobler and purer than his.","“En?” Right at this moment, a frightening aura surged out madly.","Tong Ming immediately stopped, and looked into the distance.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Multiple figures walked over from the sky.","Saints!","Finally, the Saints appeared.","Realization dawned on everyone. Actually, both paths could lead here, forming a circle.","“The son of a Great Emperor?” The Imperial Sons all reported the situation, which naturally caused the Saints to feel surprised. There was actually a son of a Great Emperor here?","Hiss, in terms of seniority, he was innumerable times superior to these Saints.","“Humph, you’re a fake, right?” A Saint immediately moved, grabbing out at Tong Ming.","Actually, he had already confirmed Tong Ming’s identity. However, the value of having the son of a Great Emperor was too great. To be able to “extract” secrets like the Imperial Scroll, they definitely had to directly deny it, and kill him directly to pluck out his soul.","“You dare?!” The Saint from the Black Sunflower Clan hurriedly tried to stop him, yet he was immediately blocked by another Saint.","“Humph!” Yet Tong Ming was unafraid.","Everyone was astonished upon hearing this. ‘Although you possess the power of a Saint, you’re only at One Star or Two Stars, at most. Moreover, you can’t draw on the Regulations, so what right do you have to challenge a genuine Saint?’","Boom, this large hand had already caught hold of him.","However, a strange scene appeared.","A Saintly corpse suddenly moved, and forcibly grabbed hold of the giant hand that was blasting towards him.","What!","Everyone couldn’t help but feel numb. A Saintly corpse would actually make a move?","When a person died, everything was over. This was a common truth that would never change. Why had it changed here?","“You want to capture me? How dare you!” Tong Ming smirked coldly. Boom, a Saintly corpse suddenly charged towards the Saint that had previously moved.","Boom!","The Saintly corpse attacked, completely unconcerned about whether it would be injured or not. Every move was ruthless and fatal.","This caused the Saint to be extremely passive, and he had no choice but to retreat continuously. He did not dare to face this attack head-on at all.","Ling Han frowned, and looked towards Brother Monkey, only to see that Brother Monkey was also frowning.","A Venerate... could actually control a Saintly corpse?","This was too inconceivable.","No wonder Tong Ming had been so confident just now. So that was the case.","Being able to control a Saintly corpse was naturally awesome.","Hold on!","Ling Han and the large black dog inhaled sharply at the same time. This guy could control “only” one Saintly corpse?","He had not even finished this thought, when he saw Tong Ming wave his hand again. Another two Saintly corpses stood up, and charged towards that Saint.","In a one-on-one battle, the Saint was naturally unafraid. After all, he was a true Saint, so how could a Saintly corpse compare?","Previously, he had been dodging because he did not want to fight head-on with the corpse. Even if he would only suffer a slight injury, it was not worth it.","However, with three Saintly corpses attacking him at the same time, the pressure on him instantly increased explosively.","“Three isn’t enough? Then let’s have some more,” Tong Ming said with a smile. Immediately, another five Saintly corpses crawled up from the ground and joined the battle.","This!","The Saint’s expression finally changed drastically. Even he wouldn’t be able to withstand a battle of eight against one.","Without another word, he directly turned around and fled.","Seeing this scene, everyone was speechless.","A dignified Saint was actually scared off by a Venerate.","Though this was not because Tong Ming’s own battle prowess was as strong as this, being able to control Saintly corpses was also a sign of strength."]},{"number":4588,"title":"Chapter 4588: Aftershock","paragraphs":["Chapter 4588: Aftershock","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Now, it’s your turn!” Tong Ming looked coldly at Ling Han and the others.","He was determined to obtain the Origin Gold.","Xiu! The Nine Mountains Saint immediately reached over and grabbed Ling Han and the others. He then leaped into the air to leave.","“Where do you think you’re going?!” Tong Ming snapped his fingers, and another 10 Saintly corpses instantly crawled up and started to chase after the Nine Mountains Saint.","Just how many Saintly corpses could this guy control at the same time?","Everyone was shocked. Could such a Venerate’s strength be measured in terms of Venerate Tier?","“Die!” Tong Ming roared in a baleful voice. Immediately, more and more Saintly corpses crawled up and started to attack them.","This caused everyone’s scalps to go numb with shock, and it was unbelievable to the extreme for them.","Human power was limited at times. No matter what, Tong Ming was only a Venerate, so how could he control so many Saintly corpses?","This was just like the Saint Tool. It did not mean that the more Saint Tools there were, the better. Instead, it was referring to how much might one could unleash.","Ordinarily speaking, activating one Saint Tool would be enough to occupy a Saint. Thus, very few Saints would use two Saint Tools at the same time — even if he did indeed have two Saint Tools.","Saintly corpses could be seen as Saint Tools. Thus, being able to control one was already extremely inconceivable, but now, there were thousands upon thousands of them. This was naturally too terrifying.","How was this possible?","However, though they were confused, and though they were stunned, everyone immediately began to flee under the protection of the Saints. To say nothing of the fact that there were so many Saintly corpses, even if they could win, what meaning was there to it?","The Saintly corpses were already deader than dead, and they weren’t afraid of getting injured, but what about the Saint?","Thus, this was an unequal battle. The Saints weren’t prepared to battle to the death either.","Tong Ming smirked coldly. With a leap, he had already sat on the body of a Saint-level tiger. Xiu, this Saintly tiger corpse immediately shot forwards at an astonishing speed.","He definitely had to obtain the Origin Gold.","...","The Nine Mountains Saint continued to charge forward. To his shock, he discovered that the corpses of the Saints in their path were actually starting to awaken. When he passed them, they all started to attack him.","“Old man, here.” Ling Han handed the control of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to the Nine Mountains Saint.","The old man took the Pseudo-Imperial Weapon and used this tower like a staff.","Because this wasn’t a genuine Imperial Weapon, it couldn’t unleash Imperial Might. However, if it was used as a staff... it could still unleash a terrifying might.","Origin Gold was indestructible by itself, and so what if it was a Saint?","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The Saintly corpses would not dodge. With a knock from the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, they were instantly smashed into smithereens.","The Nine Mountains Saint forcefully barged his way through, completely invincible.","However, this kind of battling while fleeing would ultimately affect his speed. Very quickly, the Saints behind them had already caught up, and slightly further behind them, Tong Ming was also riding on the corpse of the Saintly tiger, soaring in midair, staring coldly at them.","As a Venerate, being able to force the Saints to this extent was really worth it.","Was this the might of the son of the Great Emperor?","Everyone sighed ruefully, then continued to sprint madly.","The Imperial Weapons had all been left behind at the front lines to suppress the Skeleton Saint Tools. Thus, they were unable to suppress so many Saintly corpses at this moment. Apart from fleeing, what else could they do?","No one was prepared to fight to the death.","More and more Saintly corpses joined the pursuit, and they were also getting closer and closer.","Finally, a black forest appeared ahead of them.","This was where the old Holy Beast was. After leaving this place, they would soon be able to leave the Saint Tomb, and once they exited the Mystery Realm, the Saints would be able to tear a rip into space and leave. It would practically be impossible for them to pursue any further.","However, the Saintly corpses also caught up.","There were a few Saintly corpses of the bird race that were astonishingly fast. With a flap of their wings, they could actually temporarily tear a rip into space here, and dash forwards, forming a pincer attack from the front and back.","What could they do?","If they were blocked, they would be trapped in the ocean of Saintly corpses. No matter how strong they were, so what? They would eventually be exhausted to death.","Everyone was anxious, and even felt a kind of hopelessness.","Boom!","Right at this moment, the black forest in front of them suddenly moved. The old Holy Beast crawled up, and swatted out a paw, sending the corpses of those Saintly birds in front of it flying, “Come, I will buy you some time!”","“Old beast, you dare!” Tong Ming shouted harshly. Just when it looked like the Origin Gold was about to fall into his hands, he had failed on the verge of success, driving him crazy.","The old Holy Beast laughed loudly, “I don’t have much time left anyways, so I just want to disgust you guys a bit!”","He dodged to the side, allowing the Nine Mountains Saint and the other Saints to pass. Then, he suddenly collapsed. Boom! A large portion of the Saintly corpses were crushed into the ground.","However, being large didn’t mean that its strength was invincible. Pu, pu, pu! Its body was forcefully torn open, and blood spurted out. There was a white turbid substance exuding a fishy smell.","Countless Saintly corpses charged out, continuing their pursuit.","“Stop right there!” the old Holy Beast roared. Weng! A devastating shockwave rippled into the surroundings.","With this strike, all the Saintly corpses froze, as if time itself had stopped.","Tong Ming flew into a thunderous rage, “Old beast, you actually dare sever my connection with these Saintly corpses! You deserve death! You deserve death! Even if you die, I will make sure that you will never have a day of peace!”","“Hahahaha.” The old Holy Beast merely laughed loudly, “I have already had enough of living a life of torture. Death would be the best release.”","It showed an expression of pain, and those Saintly corpses that had been frozen were restless.","—It could no longer suppress them.","Peng!","One of its claws instantly exploded, and blood sprayed like rain. Yet it was completely unaware of this, and merely channelled the last of its power with all its might, continuing to sever Tong Ming’s connection with these Saintly corpses.","Pa, it exploded another claw, then another, right until all of them exploded. Then, its body also exploded, and finally, its head.","Boom, saintly might spread out, and the air was filled with a light feeling of relief.","The old Holy Beast had died, and returned to the heaven and earth.","To it, death was actually the best end. Otherwise, in this kind of period before death, it would only be suffering.","What was baffling was that after it severed the connection between the Saintly corspes and Tong Ming, it could have killed Tong Ming. After all, with its strength, wouldn’t it be easy for it to kill a Venerate?","However, it didn’t.","Why?","Ling Han turned around to look. Though he was very far away, he could still see the old Holy Beast desperately delaying the pursuit of the Saintly corpses. This made him feel admiration, touched, and at the same time, a little sad.","This old Holy Beast should be Nine Stars, and could be claimed to be one of the strongest in the world, but in its old age, it had fallen into such a miserable state. How could he not sigh in pity?","Xiu, the Nine Mountains Saint had already brought Ling Han and the others into the passageway, and returned the way they had come. Not long after, they had already rushed out of that massive crack in space.","The Nine Mountains Saint tore a rip into space at the first instant, and leaped in.","“Nine Mountains, don’t even think of fleeing!” Behind them, a great many Saints from the Imperial Clans all moved, wanting to stop the Nine Mountains Saint.","However, the Nine Mountains Saint had also mastered the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. Even if he hadn’t completely mastered it, his speed was still far above that of ordinary Saints.","He couldn’t be stopped."]},{"number":4589,"title":"Chapter 4589: Final Preparations","paragraphs":["Chapter 4589: Final Preparations","Editor: Henyee Translations","Led by the Nine Mountains Saint, Ling Han and the others successfully returned.","They asked about the Nine Mountains Saint’s gains, but they were extremely negligible.","How could the holy flame be so easily obtained?","The Saints that had entered were all here to snatch the holy flame. Thus, they would either become old, and have long since died there, or return empty-handed. The difficulty level of obtaining it was naturally much higher.","Moreover, when the conversation returned to Tong Ming, they were all frowning deeply.","“Grandpa Dog has a guess,” the large black dog said. “Grandpa Dog’s guess is that the so-called Lord of Yin River, Lord of Blood Sea, or this Tong Ming are all the sons of the Great Emperors. Furthermore, they have also been bestowed with Mystical Powers by the Great Emperors, allowing them to control corpses!”","After all, controlling the corpses was a fact. How many Saintly corpses were there in the Yin River and the sea of blood?","Even in the fog where Di Wuji was, just how many Saintly corpses were buried under the so-called safe zone?","Thus, even though these people were only at Venerable Tier, they could still cause boundless commotion.","“But the problem is, why does the Netherworld cooperate?” Ling Han asked.","If it was only the son of a Great Emperor, then no matter what, there was no way they could control the Yin Saints, right?","Did the Yin Saints need to give face to the Great Emperor?","When one had reached the height of a Saint, they could always flee. Even if they wielded the Imperial Weapon, they still wouldn’t be able to do anything to them.","“Er, could it be that the Great Emperors of the past had reached some kind of agreement with the Netherworld?” the large black dog guessed.","Ling Han’s mind whirred, and he said, “Take the Saint Tomb that we went to for example. There’s not just a single corpse tower there. So, what if there’s a bronze casket underneath each corpse tower?”","The little azure dragon inhaled sharply, “You’re saying that there are more children of Great Emperors?”","Ling Han nodded, “It is very possible that one or two of them are extremely outstanding, and have reached the level of Pseudo-Emperor.”","Only those with the talent of a Pseudo-Emperor could pose real threat to Saints. How many Saints had Buddha Doga killed in the past? This showed that when a Pseudo-Emperor wanted to kill Saints, Saints were not even qualified to flee.","That being the case, it was at least understandable that the Yin Saints would cooperate.","“If these deductions are all correct, then why would the sons of the Great Emperors do this?” the little azure dragon asked.","This was indeed an unsolved mystery.","In the past, the might of the Great Emperors had shaken the world, and they had been invincible for an era. As the sons of the Great Emperors, what else did they have to aspire for?","This was because the theoretical lifespan of the Great Emperor was 10 million years. If they lived another life, it would be a lifespan of 20 million years. They would definitely live a much, much longer time than their own childrenand grandchildren.","Thus, the Great Emperor’s children would always be enveloped by the strongest halo of glory, and there was no need for them to have any reservations.","What was there to pursue?","“First, become Emperor!” everyone concluded.","Only one Great Emperor could appear in an era. Thus, no matter how outstanding the child of a Great Emperor was, it was useless. The heaven and earth did not allow him to become Emperor.","Thus, if one wanted to become Emperor, they could only skip over this era.","However, there was another problem, and that was as long as there was no Emperor in this world, they could take this step. Why did they have to do it in this era?","“No, we’re taking it for granted! How can we be sure that they haven’t appeared repeatedly in history?” Ling Han immediately said. He thought of Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling, and the others. These people had set foot on Imperial Path quite a few times.","As long as it wasn’t a Great Emperor, they could be sealed by the Primordial Source Clay for a long time — a Great Emperor couldn’t. They were too powerful, and even the Primordial Source Clay couldn’t seal them away.","“So, they would appear every other era to fight for the chance to become Emperor?” The large black dog continued the conversation.","“Possibly,” Ling Han said with a nod. Right now, this was only a speculation.","“Then the second possibility is... immortality!”","Immortality was probably everyone’s ultimate goal.","It was because everyone feared death, and dreamed of attaining immortality.","Thus, the Battle Saint Emperor, the Canopy Demon Emperor, and Ancestral King Lingtian all went to the edge of the universe in search of a path to immortality.","However, this conjecture caused everyone to be clueless.","Even the Great Emperors hadn’t truly set foot on the path to immortality. Who could guess the truth?","“They are the children of the Great Emperors, and it’s possible that they obtained bits and pieces of information from the mouth of the Great Emperors at that time. It’s because of this that they have attempted to do this generation after generation.”","At this point in the discussion, they could only stop abruptly.","The Nine Mountains Saint left. He had other matters to attend to, and now that Ling Han and the others were getting closer and closer to Saint Tier, it was about time to reestablish the Nine Suns Holy Land.","This naturally required preparation.","Brother Monkey continued to cultivate in seclusion. He had half a foot into the Saint Tier, so he naturally had to attain it in one go.","Meanwhile, Ling Han concocted alchemical pills. This time, he had obtained a considerable amount of Celestial Qi.","As he concocted alchemical pills one after another, everyone’s strength was also rapidly improving.","Ling Han’s bottomless pit had swallowed countless Celestial Qi, but his improvement was astonishingly slow.","This was understandable, because he was too strong. This was the price that one had to pay for being strong.","Seven years later, he refined all the Celestial Qi, consuming them as he refined them.","Fifteen Stars ... he was finally halfway through.","Only halfway?","Ling Han almost wanted to cry. This was too slow, wasn’t it? Was it really so difficult to break through to Venerate Tier?","What could he do now?","Without a new Mystery Realm or ancient site opening, he could only rely on luck to capture Celestial Qi, so his advancement naturally would be overwhelmingly slow.","No, this was too slow.","Ling Han quickly made his decision. He was going to kill Yin souls.","At present, though the battle lines had stabilized, it did not mean that there was no war.","In truth, the Netherworld didn’t care about the “lives” of the Yin souls at all. They were attacking at all times, and every time the Saints became tired to the point of being unable to control the Imperial Weapons, the Skeleton Saint Tools would open the path and push the battle line outwards.","Thus, it had actually been the Netherworld being at the upper hand all this while. When they devoured the territory of the Living Realm, their speed was not the slightest bit slow either.","“All right, then let’s go and kill the Yin souls.”","This time, Ling Han didn’t call anyone over, and he acted alone.","He snuck into the territory of the Yin souls, and began a massacre.","What abilities did he have now?","An ordinary nine-star Venerate could only be insta-killed by him. Even if he really encountered the Yin Saint, it was not that he did not have the ability to flee when he used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. Furthermore, he had also grasped Destructive Energy, which had a very strong restraining effect on Yin souls.","Thus, he actually wasn’t too afraid of the Yin Saint.","However, it was a different story for the Skeleton Saint Tool. It was completely forged from Saintly Material, and could not be restrained by Destructive Energy. Faced with such an existence, Ling Han could only flee.","Die! Die! Die!","He killed in one location for three consecutive days, and even when he alerted the Yin Saint, he only retreated as he fought. It was only when a Skeleton Saint Tool came over, that he left after countering a single move.","But this move caused Ling Han extreme injury.","No wonder even Saints had to retreat. This Skeleton Saint Tool was really too terrifying. Even if he had already summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, two thirds of his bones had still been broken from the impact.","After spending two months to recover from his injuries, Ling Han continued to slaughter Yin souls.","This time, he was extremely careful. He didn’t give the Skeletal Saint Tool any chance to come near him.","There were more and more Yin souls that he had completely killed, and his cultivation level finally began to rapidly increase."]},{"number":4590,"title":"Chapter 4590: 4592: Encountering Di Wuji again","paragraphs":["Chapter 4590: 4592: Encountering Di Wuji again","Editor: Henyee Translations","The rewards from heaven and earth were very random.","Sometimes, it would increase Ling Han’s life force, and at other times, it would increase his cultivation level. This was not definite.","Thankfully, both were very useful to Ling Han.","When he was breaking through to Fifteen Stars, his life force was severely damaged, and he would practically be on the verge of death if he lost even a little bit more.","Now that the life force had recovered slightly, Ling Han felt much more at ease.","And just like that, he battled endlessly.","After killing in one place for a few days, he switched to another battlefield. He definitely could not allow the Skeleton Saint Tool to have the chance to surround him.","Even though he was only one person, his battle prowess was enough to overwhelm everyone below Saint Tier. The Destructive Energy was especially effective against Yin souls, and was even more effective at killing than Saints.","Because of him, the pressure on the various battle lines was slightly lightened.","This caused the people at the front lines to feel very curious. Why was it that there would be times when the Netherworld troops would be scattered all over the place? Aside from the twelve Skeleton Saint Tools, it was really unbearable to watch.","Unfortunately, they didn’t know that Ling Han was fighting on his own ahead of them.","10 years, 20 years, 30 years. This time, Ling Han fought longer and longer, but he still hadn’t reached the end of Fifteen Stars.","On this day, he was in the midst of a bloody battle, when he suddenly felt a frightening aura assault him.","He humphed. Boom, the phoenix wings spread out, as long as three hundred meters, and were entwined with Destructive Energy. With a single strike, the Yin souls in the vicinity collapsed one after another.","In the distance, the Yin souls did not immediately fill in, because a Yin Saint appeared, and took control of the Yin souls.","However, Ling Han did not look towards that Yin Saint, because the aura he sensed was not from Yin souls.","“Come out!” he said calmly. His voice was stimulated by a powerful force, and could be rapidly transmitted even in space.","“Hehe, Brother Ling’s senses are really sharp.” Amidst a long laugh, a man walked over in midair. He was tall and slender, and there were seven stars vaguely flickering behind him.","Di Wuji!","Ling Han’s expression became serious. Though he had already guessed that Di Wuji was very likely related to the Netherworld, guesses were guesses. Witnessing it with his own eyes was another matter.","“You collaborated with the Netherworld to destroy the Living Realm. Can you face the Wolf Emperor?” he said.","Di Wuji cracked a smile, “In front of the great undertaking of eternity, what are millions and millions of living creatures worth? Furthermore, what need is there to distinguish between the Netherworld and the Living Realm?”","“Bullsh*t!” Ling Han scoffed. Boom, the phoenix wings flapped, and he immediately charged towards Di Wuji.","“Ling Han, you are already eternally trapped at the level of Sect Master, so why don’t you find a peaceful place to live in peace?” Di Wuji brandished his palm in response. A massive wolf’s claw appeared, and struck out at Ling Han.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and Ling Han was immediately sent backwards. In terms of power, he was definitely no match for Di Wuji. Di Wuji’s body could accommodate seven stars, and this was the power of a Saint!","However, Destructive Energy and 99 Six Star Regulations swept past, and also left a wound on the palm of Di Wuji’s hand.","Right now, the gulf between Ling Han and him wasn’t as large as before.","Di Wuji revealed a shocked expression. He already had half a foot into Saint Tier, yet could only gain a slight upper hand. This Sect Master was truly heaven-defyingly strong, and could not be judged with common sense.","“Fortunately, you are eternally trapped at Sect Master-level. Otherwise, I would really be having a headache,” he said with a smile. It was unknown whether he was comforting himself, or deliberately provoking Ling Han.","But if it was the latter, then he was destined to be disappointed, because Ling Han would not suffer the slightest blow.","“Die!” Di Wuji charged over. Seven stars continuously boosted his power, allowing him to unleash a terrifying battle prowess.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Di Wuji used his ultimate moves frequently. As the son of a Great Emperor, he had a variety of techniques, and his proficiency in using the Imperial Technique was far from what the ordinary Imperial Son could compare to.","It could be said that even if he did not have the help of the power of stars, in a battle of equal cultivation levels, the Golden Generation would still be no match for him.","However, his opponent was Ling Han!","He had powerful moves, but did Ling Han not?","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was unleashed. He was practically unafraid of power attacks, unless the power was overwhelming enough that the shockwave would be able to kill him.","But Di Wuji’s greatest advantage was his power. In terms of power, he could not overwhelm Ling Han, so he naturally could do nothing against Ling Han.","The two of them exchanged blows. Though the battle was incredibly intense, it was difficult to decide who was stronger.","“Hehe, why didn’t you bring the Saintly corpses over?” Ling Han asked.","“To kill you?” Di Wuji shook his head, “No need.”","“Is that so?” Ling Han said with a smile. “Then I won’t play with you anymore.”","His goal was to kill Yin souls to obtain the rewards of heaven and earth. What was the point of tangling with Di Wuji?","This was a waste of time.","“Trying to escape!” The image of a silver wolf suddenly appeared behind Di Wuji. It was as large as a planet, and suddenly swooped down to swallow Ling Han.","This was too big, and its speed was also astonishingly fast, so Ling Han couldn’t dodge at all.","Weng, he felt his soul being attacked.","Hehe, competing with him in the strength of his soul?","Ling Han smiled faintly. “An”, he called out lightly, and instantly, peace returned to his mind.","“Yi, you have actually grasped the means of the Buddhist Race!” Di Wuji was slightly surprised.","Ling Han ignored him completely. With a flap of his phoenix wings, flames soared sky-high.","How could Yin souls block it?","As the fiery shadows flashed, the Yin souls were all burnt to ash.","“This person is really quite troublesome,” Di Wuji said. Then, he looked towards a corner, “What do you think?”","In the empty space, a person actually walked out. He was dressed in black, and carried a long sword on his back. Even his face was hidden under a black cloth.","However, judging by her shapely curves, this should be a woman.","“He is eternally trapped at Sect Master-level, so there’s no need to pay attention to him,” the black-robed person said. True enough, this was a woman.","“If you had moved just now, and we had attacked together, we should have been able to detain this brat,” Di Wuji said, but did not use a reprimanding tone.","The woman in black shook her head and said, “This person also mastered the Strange Shadow Steps. If I come a little closer, he’ll definitely discover me.”","Judging by her words, it was as if she belonged to the Battle God Palace.","Di Wuji laughed in spite of himself, “This brat is really knowledgeable. He has all kinds of techniques, and has learnt a little of all kinds of ultimate moves. Fine then, since he is eternally trapped at Sect Master-level, we will try our best to control him, to prevent him from killing too much, and delay our progress.”","The woman in black didn’t speak, and she simply disappeared into the darkness of the universe.","Speaking of Ling Han, after he broke free from Di Wuji’s grasp, he continued to sweep through the Yin souls.","However, he discovered that the number of Yin souls was rapidly decreasing.","In the past, wherever he killed, the nearby Yin souls would immediately surge over, determined to kill him, or seize his body.","But now?","Not only were there no nearby Yin souls coming over, but the Yin souls in this region were actually retreating, as if he was some bringer of misfortune.","In this way, Ling Han’s killing efficiency naturally dropped drastically.","His battle prowess was indeed incredibly awesome, but he still had to have Yin souls for him to kill.","What was the meaning of you guys hiding?","Ling Han could only widen the range of his attacks. Even so, the efficiency of him harvesting Yin souls was still incomparable to before.","“Di Wuji, this enmity is really great!”"]},{"number":4591,"title":"Chapter 4591: Breaking through to Fourth Extreme","paragraphs":["Chapter 4591: Breaking through to Fourth Extreme","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han ignored everything else, and merely continued to battle.","The deadline of a hundred years was getting closer and closer, yet he had not cultivated to the end of Fifteen Stars and be able to attempt breaking through to Venerate Tier, so it was inevitable that he would feel slightly anxious.","In the past, he had personally boasted that he would go to the Donglin Imperial Clan and take Chi Menghan away with him.","A promise from a gentleman would not change even if the heavens collapsed!","He killed, killed, killed, and killed until he completely forgot himself. Finally, water slowly pierced through stone, and he had reached the end of Fifteen Stars, and counting, there were only three years left until the deadline of a hundred years.","Ling Han did not return. Instead, he found a large planet nearby, and began to break through to the fourth pinnacle level.","His appreciation of cultivation level was already enough. It should be known that he had long since refined two slivers of Seven Star Regulations, but due to the limitation of his cultivation level, the Regulations could not strengthen further. Thus, now that he had reached the end of Fifteen Stars, it would not be difficult for him to break through to the fourth pinnacle level.","In truth, the hardest part was breaking through to Ten Stars, and the next hardest was accumulation. It was too time-consuming.","Boom!","In his mind, the fruit of cultivation broke open, forming four seeds that were exuding light.","These were the seeds of Fourth Extreme.","Ling Han planted them separately, and then with a thought.","Grow!","The four seeds immediately grew madly, and at the same time, Ling Han’s embodiment also turned into a massive whirlpool that madly devoured the power of heaven and earth and Regulations in the surroundings.","However, no matter how much he swallowed like a whale, there would always be a sliver of energy seeping out, causing the plants in the surroundings to grow madly. Very soon, they had surpassed him, and enveloped him completely.","The growth of the Fourth Extreme was a process, and could be long or short.","The shortest was only a few days, and the longest was a good few months. Thus, Ling Han was calm and unmoved, and merely absorbed the power of heaven and earth and Regulations with all his might, speeding up the growth of the Fourth Extreme.","However, several days passed, several months passed, and the growth of the Fourth Extreme still did not stop. It was as if this was only the beginning.","If this was known to others, they would definitely exclaim in disbelief.","Who would need so much time to break through to Fourth Extreme?","However, Ling Han was different. When he had been a Sect Master, he had reached Fifteen Stars. With such astonishing power, and with Regulations accumulating into nourishment for Fourth Extreme, how long could it last?","One year, two years!","Ling Han’s place of seclusion had already become a dense forest. Furthermore, because the heaven and earth energy here was dense, and added with the nourishment from the shards of Regulations, a great many Spiritual Herbs had actually appeared here.","Though it was not Celestial medicine, and had limited value, it had still attracted a great many herb harvesters.","On this day, three young people came, one man and two women respectively.","“Brother Tu Zi, why do you think so many Spiritual Herbs have suddenly appeared here?” the red-clothed woman asked curiously.","“That’s right. We have lived here for over a dozen years, and it has always been very ordinary. Why would there suddenly be Spiritual Herbs?” the woman in purple clothing also said.","The only man scratched his head, and said, “I don’t understand either, but it’s fine as long as there are herbs that can be traded for money.”","They walked around, but though the Spiritual Herbs here grew quickly, they could not hold up to being harvested every few days. Thus, they had gained nothing.","“Why don’t we search further inside?” Brother Tu Zi said.","Fear spread across the faces of the two women.","“Father said that it’s extremely likely that there’s a god inside, so it’s best that we don’t disturb him,” the purple-clothed woman said.","“But don’t you guys want to save Uncle Niu?” Brother Tu Zi said. “Without Spiritual Herbs, how can Uncle Niu’s illness be cured?”","The two women hesitated for a moment, then nodded.","Using the scythes in their hands to pave the way, they headed into the depths of the forest.","The trees here grew too closely together, as if they were walls made from the canopies of trees, and it was very difficult to advance.","After spending a long time, the three of them finally arrived at the depths of the forest.","“Wa, there are so many Spiritual Herbs here!” They were overjoyed. The Spiritual Herbs here were practically everywhere.","Thankfully, the other herb harvesters were all reverent and superstitious, believing that there were great beasts or whatnot in this forest, not daring to enter. Otherwise, the Spiritual Herbs would definitely have been harvested clean long ago.","“Yi, there—” The purple-clothed woman pointed ahead, and saw that under the intertwining of countless vines, a massive cage had been formed. There seemed to be something inside.","“Don’t worry about it. Let’s harvest the medicine first, and exchange it for money to treat Father’s illness,” the red-clothed woman said.","“M-hm.”","The three of them harvested herbs, and their gains were great. Very soon, they had gathered a bamboo basketful.","“Lord God, thank you!” The purple-clothed woman and red-clothed woman both said respectfully to the “cage” that was interwoven with vines, and even knelt down to kowtow three times.","Brother Tu Zi also clasped his hands together and bowed.","“Hehe, your gains are quite great!” At this moment, a voice suddenly rang out.","The three of them hurriedly turned their heads, and saw that from the entrance that they had broken open, there were presently two men blocking the way. They looked like hooligans, and one look was enough to tell that they were not good people.","“What business is it of yours!” the red-clothed woman immediately rebuked, her expression icy.","These two men were the rascals of the village. One was called Ma San, and the other was called Zhang Dong. Not only did they idle around all day, they also kept teasing women.","Zhang Dong snickered, “Tu Zi, your luck with women is quite good. One dragon and two phoenixes, huh? Have your legs gone weak? Come, let me share your burden.”","These words were too perverted. The two women couldn’t understand at all, but they still knew that the other party’s words were vulgar.","“Scram!” they chided. What was there to say to a pervert? It was best to just leave.","“Hehe!” The two rascals both laughed. “Eldest Niu, Second Niu, we’ve been thinking about you guys for quite some time1. It’s rare that we have such a good opportunity. If we don’t do you guys today, that would really be a waste of the chance that the heavens has given us.”","“This is the Forbidden Land. No one in the village dares to come in, yet you guys have come here on your own.”","“So, even if three people were buried here, who would know?”","Hearing the exchange of words from the two of them, the expressions of the purple-clothed woman and the others changed at the same time.","Though there were three of them, what battle prowess could two women have? Furthermore, Tu Zi usually only herded cows for others, and occasionally plucked medicine, so what battle prowess could he have?","Hence, even if it was a battle of three against two, they had absolutely no chance of winning.","What could they do?","These two ruffians must be harboring lewd thoughts. Even if they died, they would not die with their purity intact.","At this moment, their hearts were filled with anxiety, and the two rascals had already begun to approach them.","“I’ll fight you to the death!” Tu Zi charged up, but this weakling was immediately blasted onto the ground by Ma San, and directly passed out.","“Hehehe.”","“Hahaha.”","The two rascals both smiled lewdly. These two village flowers that they had coveted for a long time could finally be tasted today.","“Sigh!”","Right at this moment, a long sigh was heard.","“Who is it?” The two rascals were both shocked. There was actually a sixth person here?","However, after scanning the surroundings, they didn’t see anyone at the entrance.","Then what was going on?","The two women exclaimed. They actually dared to do something inappropriate in the land of gods, so how could they not anger the god?","Peng! Right at this moment, the cage of vines suddenly shattered."]},{"number":4592,"title":"Chapter 4592: Finally becoming a Venerate","paragraphs":["Chapter 4592: Finally becoming a Venerate","Editor: Henyee Translations","‘What?’","The two rascals were both dumbfounded, and felt their scalps go numb.","In these few years, it was rumored that there were great beasts in the forest, and that was why such a change had taken place. Now, they were naturally scared out of their wits.","Peng, the vines broke apart, and a young man was actually standing inside. He looked to be in his early twenties, at most.","They both calmed down. This didn’t look like a monster at all.","“Who do you think you are?” Zhang Dong shouted.","Ling Han broke into a smile. He had finally stepped onto the fourth pinnacle level. From today onwards, he was a Venerate!","“I was in a good mood at first, but you people insist on ruining things.” He shook his head, then snapped his fingers. Pa, pa, Zhang Dong and Ma San had directly disappeared without a trace.","They were dead, and there was not even a speck of dust left behind.","“Thank you, Lord God!” The two women hurriedly knelt down and kowtowed.","Ling Han waved his sleeve, tore a rip into space, and left.","The time limit of 100 years was close at hand. He had to directly go to the Donglin Imperial Clan.","Now that he had become a Venerate, just how powerful would his ability to transmigrate through the Void be?","It was comparable to a Saint!","In just three days, he arrived at Donglin Planet.","At this moment, there were still seven days until Chi Menghan’s wedding.","“The time is really tight,” Ling Han murmured. On a mountain peak, he began to examine his own strength.","He knew that after he advanced into Venerate Tier, his abilities would definitely increase greatly, but exactly how strong would he be?","With a wave of his hand, twenty Seven Star Regulations appeared.","‘Holy f*ck!’","If the other Venerates saw this, they would definitely wet themselves in fright.","That was because 20 Seven Star Regulations was the limit of Venerate Tier. Others could only be infinitely close, and could not possibly reach this limit.","But what about Ling Han?","He was only a One Star Venerate!","If he reached nine stars, then how many Regulations would he be able to deliver with a single strike?","It couldn’t be helped. After breaking through from Fifteen Stars of Sect Master-level, if Ling Han still couldn’t reach a freakish strength, what justice was there left in this world?","“Sweeping aside Venerates would definitely be no problem. More importantly, can I match Saints?”","Ling Han unleashed another attack. This time, though it was still 20 Regulations appearing at the same time, they were intertwined with each other.","“The interweaving of Regulations can further increase battle prowess.”","“Going by experience, twenty flashes of Seven Star Regulations should be able to match two flashes of Eight Star Regulations.”","Ling Han murmured to himself. In other words, he could battle ordinary Two Star Saints.","In truth, they had already become a Saint, so how could they be ordinary?","“Thus, I should only be able to match a One Star Saint.”","What was there to be dissatisfied about? He was only a One Star Venerate!","Ling Han nodded. If his deduction was correct, then in terms of Regulations, he really could match a Saint.","“As for power... this is a shortcoming.”","No matter what, even if he was still a Body Arts cultivator, he was ultimately unable to compensate for the gap of so many major tiers and minor levels in cultivation.","“However, I still have other methods.”","With a thought from Ling Han, an Earth Qi immediately rose up by his feet, turning into the same appearance as him.","Unfortunately, the strength had still not reached Saint Tier.","But it was all right, because... there were many of them.","One after another, “Ling Han” appeared beside him. There were a total of 99 of them!","“This seems to be the limit. I clearly still have some energy left, but I can’t summon any new Earth Qi.”","“Forget it.”","Ling Han smiled knowingly. This was another trump card of his.","He waved his hand again, and four stone pillars suddenly appeared, suppressing his surroundings.","This was his fourth pinnacle!","The Fourth Extreme was forged from Regulations, and they were all Seven Star Regulations, so there was naturally no difference in strength. Thus, the four pinnacle pillars looked more or less the same.","Occasionally, there would be Celestial medicine, which could increase the grade of the Fourth Extreme, and bestow some special effects on the Fourth Extreme, but it was pitifully little.","“My four pinnacle pillars are actually the same as the primitive Celestial Gate.","“However, what’s the use?”","Ling Han scratched his head. This could only be known during battle.","He observed his four pinnacle pillars. Each pinnacle pillar had a seal, but it was covered by the aura of Primal Chaos. He could only vaguely see its shape, and could not accurately recognize it.","“Yi?”","“Others’ four pinnacle pillars should have circles on them. One circle represents one star, and two circles represent two stars. Why don’t I have a circle, but a single seal?”","“A single seal... means that I am a One Star Venerate?”","Ling Han was slightly dumbfounded, but since he had cultivated to Fifteen Stars in Sect Master-level, now that he had become a Venerate, he was definitely different from the rest.","“Forget it. Who cares if it’s a circle or a seal? It’s fine as long as one’s abilities are strong enough.”","“There are still seven days.”","“I’ll get used to my battle prowess first, so that I won’t be too heavy-handed. If I kill him right from the start, it won’t be fun.”","Day after day passed, and the Donglin Planet also became livelier and livelier.","Within a few days, the Ziwei Imperial Clan would come to receive the bride, and the one getting married was the Imperial Daughter, Chi Menghan. Of course, they would hold an incredibly luxurious feast at the Donglin Imperial Clan.","The matrimonial union between two great Imperial Clans was a great matter in itself, what more when this implicated Ling Han.","At that time, Ling Han had made a grand promise, saying that he would personally come to the Donglin Imperial Clan and take Chi Menghan away with him.","That being the case, this deadline was already nearing its end. If Chi Menghan married into the Ziwei Imperial Clan, Ling Han would never be able to fulfill this promise.","Thus, everyone wanted to know whether Ling Han would come or not.","Judging by Ling Han’s usual behaviour, he would definitely come.","However, it was said that Baili Tian had already become a Saint, so what would Ling Han come here for?","Anyone below the level of Saint was nothing but an ant.","“Latest news, latest news, Baili Tian has not become a Saint, but a Pseudo-Saint!”","There would always be well-informed people who had found out some information that could still be considered a top secret at present, and spread it out on the Galaxy Network.","“A Pseudo-Saint, or rather a Half-Saint, already has one foor into Saint Tier, and can draw on a portion of Saintly power.”","“Hiss, Saint-level battle prowess overwhelms all. Even if he is only a Half-Saint, that would be enough to kill all Venerates.”","“It can’t be, right? A hundred years have already passed, and Baili Tian still hasn’t truly become a Saint?”","“F***, it’s easier said than done. Why don’t you think about it? In an era when there is no Emperor in the world, Saints are the most powerful power. They stand at the pinnacle of the universe, so just how difficult would it be to set foot on that level?”","“That’s right. To say nothing of a hundred years, even if he could become a Saint in ten thousand years, this would still be incredibly terrifying.”","“As expected of the strongest of the Golden Generation. Imperial Son Tian is only 300 years old, yet he’s already a Half-Saint. At most, he’ll be able to become a true Saint in another 100 years.”","“Throughout history, this kind of rate of advancement is definitely top-notch.”","“However, I’ve heard that the earlier one becomes a Saint, the better. In history, there have been a great many powerful Saints who could have become Saints long ago, yet deliberately settled down for a few thousand years, or even tens of thousands of years, just to cultivate their cultivation level to a more perfect level.”","“Thus, perhaps it is not that Imperial Son Tian is unable to truly become a Saint, but rather wants to pursue perfection.”","“En, that is very possible!”","On the Galaxy Network, everyone was discussing spiritedly. Some thought that Baili Tian had already tried his best, while others thought that he was holding back, and was deliberately pursuing perfection.","And amidst such discussions, the day finally arrived for Chi Menghan to get married."]},{"number":4593,"title":"Chapter 4593: The Wedding Banquet Begins","paragraphs":["Chapter 4593: The Wedding Banquet Begins","On this day, everyone was filled with anticipation.","A hundred years ago, the Ziwei Imperial Clan announced that their clansman was going to marry Chi Menghan today, and this was destined to be a marriage that would go down in history.","It was not uncommon for Imperial Clans to becomee in-laws, but this was the first time that the Imperial Son had married the Imperial Daughter.","This meant that the two Imperial Clans would be cooperating at a deeper level. This would break some traditions, and loosen some taboos.","From a certain aspect, this should be because the pressure from the invasion of Yin souls was too great, forcing the two great Imperial Clans to make such a decision.","It was not just these two Imperial Clans. The other Imperial Clans had also begun to form strong alliances among themselves. However, the Donglin and Zi Wei Clans were the first to make such a decision. Furthermore, it was also because Baili Tian and Chi Menghan were the most renowned.","“This is really benefiting Baili Tian.”","“That’s right. That guy is too lucky.”","“Not only is Chi Menghan’s aptitude comparable to the Golden Generation, but she’s also one of the most beautiful beauties in the universe!”","“If I can marry Chi Menghan, I’ll be satisfied even if I can only live another hundred years.”","“Pei, why don’t you take a piss and take a look at yourself? Are you even worthy?”","“I’m not qualified, so are you?”","The wedding banquet wasn’t held at the ancestral grounds of the Donglin Imperial Clan. In other words, it wasn’t held under the protection of the Imperial Formation. Instead, it was held outside.","There was naturally consideration for this arrangement.","—Was the theft of the Ziwei Imperial Clan not enough to alert them?","During the wedding, how many outsiders would come to watch the ceremony? They would definitely have to close the imperial formation. In that case, would they still be able to guard against Ling Han?","Thus, the wedding banquet had to be held outside to protect the treasures of the Donglin Imperial Clan.","Ling Han changed his appearance, and slowly walked forwards.","The Donglin Imperial Clan was rich and imposing, and prepared countless banquet tables. Anyone could come to attend and observe the ceremony and. Furthermore, guests could offer wedding gifts, or only come to eat and drink. There would definitely be no one chasing them away.","There were really too many people, and Ling Han practically didn’t recognize any of them.","He didn’t care. In any case, he was here to cause trouble.","He found a table and sat down. He sipped his wine and savored snacks unhurriedly, waiting for the wedding to officially begin.","A table could seat ten people. Though he found an empty table to sit at, it wasn’t long before people came and filled the whole table.","The other nine people were in a total of four groups. At first, they did not know each other, but as they ate and drank, they soon conversed.","“Do you guys think Ling Han will come?” Someone suddenly changed the topic to Ling Han.","“He probably will. This guy is unafraid of heaven and earth, and has even killed a considerable number of Imperial Sons. Now that Imperial Son Tian wants to snatch his woman, how could he not come?” Immediately, someone replied.","“That may not be the case,” a man in yellow robes said with a shake of his head. “Previously, Ling Han was no weaker than his opponent, and that’s why he appeared. However, it’s different this time. Imperial Son Tian has already become a Half-Saint, while he’s eternally trapped at Sect Master-level. If he appears, he’ll only be seeking death.”","“En, I don’t think he would come either.” His companion, a man in a tight-fitting green outfit, nodded in agreement.","Ling Han smiled, “I think he will come.”","“You?” The yellow-robed man couldn’t help but sneer, “What use do you think it is? Yi, you, a Core Formation Tier cultivator, can actually enter into the main venue?”","Although the Donglin Imperial Clan didn’t set any restrictions, the cultivation world itself was a strict hierarchy, with a strict hierarchy of seniority and inferiority.","Thus, those who could enter the main venue were either brought here by the “Lords” of their clans and sects, or had reached Spiritual Transformation Tier or above. If they were any other cultivation level, they could only stay in the secondary venue.","And in Ling Han’s case, he was clearly just one person, and there were no elites by his side, so how had a mere Core Formation Tier cultivator managed to sneak in?","Ling Han smiled, “Do you want to make a bet?”","“What are we betting on?” Though the yellow-robed man felt it was a little strange, he soon put it aside, and thought that Ling Han was only outrageously bold, and had snuck in secretly.","“When Ling Han comes later, just call me grandpa,” Ling Han said.","“Humph!” The yellow-robed man instantly looked displeased. In his eyes, this was completely a provocation.","He stared at Ling Han for a while, then nodded, “All right!”","In truth, if he knew that he was facing Ling Han, he would actually be very happy to call him grandpa.","Wasn’t that obtaining Ling Han as backer?","Though Ling Han was eternally trapped at Sect Master-level, he possessed the strength to sweep aside all Venerates, and could be claimed to be the strongest below Saints. Who would not want such a grandfather?","The others at the table were all laughing as they watched the excitement. How boring would it be just to attend a wedding?","Thus, they wanted nothing more than to have more of this kind of small interlude to pass the time. When they returned, they would naturally have more topics to talk about.","At noon, the members of the Ziwei Imperial Clan finally appeared.","Because Baili Yun had been killed, and Baili Che had been crippled, the Baili Clan naturally had to appoint another Imperial Son to replenish their resources, and form a ladder-shaped nurturing formation.","This time, two new Imperial Sons had come, and they had even mobilized a newly advanced Saint.","Baili Chuixue!","He had finally ignited the holy flame, and become a Saint.","This was not a Half-Saint or Pseudo-Saint, but a genuine Saint.","The newly promoted Saint had brought two Imperial Sons over to receive the bride; the Baili Clan had given them enough face.","The members of the Baili Clan also helped to receive guests at the main venue. After all, there were also a great many members of Imperial Clans here, so they naturally couldn’t treat them lightly.","The yellow-robed man left for a while, but very soon returned to his seat. Who knew what he had gone off to do.","Not long after, a person walked over, his eyes fixed on Ling Han.","“You!” He pointed, “Stand up.”","Yi?","Ling Han was drinking, and when he heard this, he merely looked coldly at that person, “Why should I listen to you?”","“Because I’m Baili Jian!” the man said in a solemn voice.","“Hehe.” Ling Han smiled faintly, and ignored him.","“Didn’t you say that you were very optimistic about Ling Han?” Baili Jian asked coldly, “What is it? You don’t dare to admit it now?”","Ling Han was surprised, and glanced at the yellow-robed man. As it turned out, this guy had left just now to tell on him.","Though he had not revealed his identity, wasn’t supporting Ling Han equivalent to going against the Baili Clan?","Ling Han cracked a smile, “That’s right. I have high hopes that Ling Han will slap your mouths!”","“How dare you!” Baili Jian flew into a thunderous rage, and pointed a finger at Ling Han, “Kneel down immediately and confess your guilt. Otherwise, I will make you die a tragic death.”","“This seems to be the territory of the Donglin Imperial Clan, right? Since when has it been your turn to make decisions?” Ling Han said calmly.","Baili Jian said proudly, “The Donglin Imperial Clan is now on the same side as our Baili Clan, so why can’t I make decisions?”","“Heh.” Ling Han chuckled, and said, “This wedding mightn’t necessarily be a success!”","“You actually dare to curse the wedding?” Baili Jian said angrily. This was too arrogant, “You’re seeking death!” He moved aggressively, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Ling Han did not move, and merely said calmly, “To commit a crime at the wedding venue, aren’t you afraid that it would be unlucky?”","Baili Jian instantly faltered. If he killed someone here, even if his initial intentions were good, it would still ruin the atmosphere of the wedding. Once Baili Tian knew, what kind of punishment would he suffer?","The present Baili Tianlong was already a Half-Saint, and would soon become the person with the highest status in the clan. How could he dare to offend him?"]},{"number":4594,"title":"Chapter 4594: I object","paragraphs":["Chapter 4594: I object","“Hehe, Brother Jian, forget it, forget it.” A person walked over, and advised Baili Jian.","This was a member of the Donglin Imperial Clan. Thus, Baili Jian naturally had to give the host some face. Coincidentally, he was also stuck in a dilemma, and this gave him a way out.","“Humph, for the sake of Brother Yuan, I’ll spare you for the moment!” Baili Jian said balefully. “When the wedding banquet ends, you’ll know what it means to speak inappropriately.”","Ling Han smiled, and murmured, “I wonder if you would dare to make a move by then.”","After finding out who he was, how many people in the world would dare to make a move?","Baili Jian strode off, but it was clear that he had already set his eyes on Ling Han. There was absolutely no way he would forget him.","Too bad.","Everyone shook their heads. They had not managed to watch the excitement that they had been anticipating, which made them feel slightly disappointed.","Thinking about it, it made sense. How many people were so outrageously bold that they would dare to cause trouble at such a grand gathering?","Thus, if they wanted to watch the excitement, they could only anticipate Ling Han’s appearance.","Ling Han, please don’t disappoint us.","The banquet continued. Everyone ate and drank in anticipation, and as time passed, everyone’s hearts began to beat faster.","Where was Ling Han? Why hadn’t he appeared yet?","Finally, the banquet reached its climax.","The grrom and bride were about to come out to pay respects to the heaven and earth.","Because the two Imperial Clans were really too far apart from each other, the wedding would be held once in the Donglin Imperial Clan. Then, it would be held once in the Ziwei Imperial Clan. Everything had to be done. After all, they were both Imperial Clans, so they could not afford to lose face.","Baili Tian was dressed in a bright red wedding attire, which set off his handsome face and slender figure, making him look even more dashing and out of the ordinary.","Moreover, he was already a Half-Saint now. Even if he had curbed his saintly might, he still possessed a terrifying might.","Chi Menghan was similarly dressed in a bright red wedding attire, with a red veil covering her head. There was a maid supporting her by her side. Her appearance was not obvious, and her figure only had occasional curves, making one’s heart itch just by looking at her.","“I’ve long heard that Chi Menghan is the third most beautiful woman in the universe, but I don’t know what kind of beauty she is.”","“Hehe, if you have the ability, you can go and take off her veil!”","“... Er, I don’t want to seek death!”","To remove Chi Menghan’s red veil... Was he trying to cuckold Baili Tian1?","What else could it be but courting death?","The ceremony progressed step by step, and they were about to be married.","Yi, why hadn’t Ling Han appeared yet?","“Er, why didn’t the master of ceremonies ask if anyone objected to this wedding?” At this moment, an extremely disharmonious voice suddenly sounded.","Shua, everyone’s eyes turned in that direction.","Was it Ling Han?","No.","Everyone could clearly see that this was a large, sturdy man. His skin was slightly tanned, and he looked like a hooligan.","Beside him, there was also an eleven or twelve-year-old boy, and there was another young man. However, he had a furred face, and his features could practically not be seen clearly.","Yi, what a strange combination.","Yet Ling Han immediately guessed that these were the large black dog, the little azure dragon, and Brother Monkey.","They had indeed come.","“Go, don’t cause trouble!” Immediately, someone from the Donglin Imperial Clan appeared to stop them.","The large black dog raised his hands, and said with a smile, “Fine, fine, fine. Grandpa Dog won’t say anything, right?! Don’t worry, Grandpa Dog has no plans to make a move today. I’m just here to watch the show.”","In a wedding, the last thing one wanted was to see bloodshed affect the atmosphere. Thus, since the large black dog had shut up, the Donglin Imperial Clan didn’t want to cause trouble with him for the time being either.","Of course, once the wedding ended, hehe, who would be so naive? Who would think that they could cause trouble at the Donglin Imperial Clan?","“Let’s continue.” A Saint personally hosted the wedding. It could be seen that the Donglin Imperial Clan placed great importance on this wedding. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have sent a Saint to host the wedding.","“The new couple will bow to heaven and earth!” A master of ceremonies called out in a majestic voice.","They was going to bow, they were going to bow to the heaven and earth, but where was Ling Han?","“I object!” Right at this moment, a voice rang out slowly.","Instantly, the rhythm of the wedding stopped again. Countless eyes swept over in unison.","This time, it was naturally Ling Han.","F***, what are you doing?","The expressions of the nine people at the same table changed drastically, as if they were sitting on pins and needles.","They could feel that a great many eyes were focused on them, and among them, there was no shortage of Sect Masters or even Venerates, which made them feel fear.","It wasn’t them who said it, so don’t look at them!","These nine people all shuffled back in their chairs, drawing a clear dividing line between themselves and Ling Han, to avoid others from mistakenly thinking that they were in the same group.","In this way, Ling Han, who was still leaning over the table and drinking wine, appeared very outstanding.","Faced with this kind of situation, Ling Han merely smiled faintly, “When that person asked just now, did anyone object? Hence, I will object.”","Are you crazy? Is this something that you can object to?","Who do you think you are!","The yellow-robed young man shook his head internally. Looks like he wouldn’t have the chance to complete the bet with Ling Han.","It was clear that the Imperial Clan definitely wouldn’t allow people to cause trouble time and time again. They would definitely make an example of them.","Ling Han stood up and clapped his hands, saying, “Alright, I’m almost done eating.”","He walked towards the centre of the banquet. There was a large empty space there, and the two newlyweds were bowing to the heaven and earth here.","“Brat, you really know how to seek death!” Baili Jian jumped out. He had already tolerated Ling Han for a long time, but previously, because he did not want to draw blood at the wedding, he had forcibly suppressed his killing intent.","But now, Ling Han was seeking death, so there was naturally no need for him to wait any longer.","He charged towards Ling Han and shouted, “You’re seeking death!”","Ling Han smiled, and casually delivered a palm strike.","Pa, Baili Jian’s face was actually slapped off forcefully, revealing a ghastly white skull, and his two eyeballs were directly hanging off.","Gods!","Seeing such a bloody scene all of a sudden, everyone felt their scalps go numb.","What was going on?","Ling Han actually dared to make a move, and it was a member of the Imperial Clan at that?","Though he had not killed anyone, you had slapped the face off the clan member of the groom at his wedding. What kind of provocation was that?","“Ah!” Baili Jian released a terrible scream. His face had been forcefully smacked away; just how painful was that?","Furthermore, this was really “humiliating” from any angle.","Baili Tian’s expression instantly darkened. At his own wedding, someone actually dared to cause trouble?","Was it Ling Han?","He stared at Ling Han, but could not be certain. After all, Ling Han had cultivated the Soul Forming Technique, and he himself had also advanced into the Fourth Extreme. Those who could see through his disguise would probably have to be top-notch Saints.","However, as the groom, he also had to take care of his own status. Furthermore, this was the territory of the Donglin Imperial Clan.","“Brat, you’ve had too much to drink!” A member of the Donglin Imperial Clan jumped out. With his cultivation level of True Self Tier, he immediately came over to pull Ling Han away.","They would first set this matter aside, and then it was up to them whether they wanted to kill or torture him.","In everyone’s eyes, Ling Han was only a Core Formation Tier. Thus, sending out a True Self Tier cultivator would naturally deal with him easily.","—Do you think that everyone was Ling Han, someone who could battle against someone with a higher cultivation level than him?"]},{"number":4595,"title":"Chapter 4595: I’m Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 4595: I’m Here","Sure enough, Ling Han didn’t resist at all, falling into the hands of the True Self Tier.","In everyone’s eyes, this was naturally a matter of course.","“Aren’t you coming with me?” the True Self Tier cultivator shouted. He pulled with all his might. Yi, he actually couldn’t move Ling Han.","This surprised him. What was going on?","He was a True Self Tier! With a gap of a major tier between them, shouldn’t he have an absolute advantage?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “I don’t like men tugging at me.”","“So what?” Although the True Self Tier found this strange, he didn’t take it to heart. After all, this was Donglin Planet. What did he need to be afraid of? What did he need to be wary of?","Ling Han cracked a smile, and with a shake of his hand, peng, the True Self Tier was sent flying.","It was incredibly easy.","Yi?","Everyone was astonished. This was far too surprising.","Was there such a powerful Core Formation Tier cultivator?","“Humph, suppressing your cultivation level, acting all mysterious!” Among the members of the Donglin Imperial Clan, a Spirit Transformation True Lord walked out. “Brat, if you want to become famous, you’ve got the wrong idea!”","He thought that Ling Han was some rising star, and wanted to use this opportunity to become famous.","But taking advantage of the Imperial Clan’s influence?","Hehe, how dare you, you must have gotten the wrong idea.","Ling Han picked his ear, and said, “Are you all from the Donglin Imperial Clan? I just heard from the Baili Clan that the two clans are on the same side, and are no different from a family. So, you guys can also send a few members of the Baili Clan for me to pummel.”","“Impudence!” The Spirit Transformation True Lord was enraged, and he reached over to grab Ling Han.","To be so insolent in the Imperial Clan, and still act so arrogant, who knew where he had gotten such courage from.","Ling Han smiled, and casually snapped his fingers. Peng! The Spirit Transformation True Lord was sent flying, directly disappearing into the air and becoming a tiny dot.","Yi!","The Spirit Transformation True Lord was also no match for him?","“Who are you?” A person walked out from the Baili Imperial Clan.","The newly promoted Imperial Son, Baili Heng, Sect Master!","This person was far too strange. His cultivation level had spiked from Core Formation Tier, and this was far too illogical.","Ling Han smiled, “I am who I am, the one and only me.”","‘Holy f*ck!’","Everyone felt a headache coming on. What kind of character was this, to be so mischievous?","“Who cares who you are? You have already made a great mistake!” Baili Heng moved. Boom, the Sect Master-level aura was boiling.","His expression was filled with arrogance. Previously, he had only been an ordinary clansman of the Baili Clan. Though he was a member of the Imperial Clan, how could he possibly compare to Baili Che and the other Imperial Sons?","But now, he had advanced to become the Imperial Son, so his status was completely different.","This was the Imperial Son, a person that the Imperial Clan had nurtured with their full efforts. His future prospects were limitless!","Now, he had moved practically under the eyes of the whole world, so he was naturally feeling extremely pleased.","Come, let’s see how mighty he can be.","He deliberately paused for three seconds, and only then did Baili Heng truly stretch out his hand.","Boom, a large hand stretched out, as if it could blot out the skies, as if it could blot out the sun.","Ling Han shook his head, and still snapped his fingers.","Pa, Baili Heng’s head immediately shattered, white-colored brain matter mixed with blood, possessing an indescribable poignant beauty.","Baili Heng crashed onto the ground, his life force instantly cut off.","He was dead.","‘F*ck! How did he die?’","Whether it was the spectators on the scene, or those watching the live broadcast through the Galaxy Network, they were all extremely confused.","This was the Imperial Son, so he definitely had a Substitution Seal on him. Furthermore, the level of Sect Master had not exceeded the scope of effect of the Substitution Seal, so why was it no longer effective?","Hiss, there was only one person who could ignore the Substitution Seal and commit murder!","“Ling Han!”","“This person is Ling Han!”","“F***, this guy really came!”","The venue and the Galaxy Network instantly became lively.","Ling Han really dared to come!","The corners of the yellow-robed young man’s mouth twitched. He wanted nothing more than for a crack to suddenly appear in the ground so that he could crawl in.","He actually made a bet with the main character, and the bet was whether the latter dared to come or not.","How hilarious. If Ling Han didn’t dare to come, how could he have made a bet with him?","Thus, he would definitely lose this bet.","Chi Menghan also became excited all of a sudden. Her slender body trembled slightly, and she suddenly lifted her red veil, revealing a breathtakingly beautiful face. Her radiance radiated in all directions, and everyone who saw her couldn’t help but look shocked.","She was too beautiful!","“Ling Han!” she called out, her tone extremely complicated. There was excitement, gratification, as well as reluctance.","Ling Han looked at her and said softly, “I said I would pick you up and leave. You’ve waited long, haven’t you?”","Chi Menghan instantly burst into tears. The hero in every woman’s heart was probably like this, right?","Just because of these words, this figure stood proudly in front of her, and all her longings had been reciprocated.","“I knew you would definitely come!” she called out loudly.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Now, I will take you away!”","“No!” Chi Menghan shook her head, and said, “That you were able to come, I already have no regrets!”","She turned to Baili Tian and said, “Let him leave peacefully, and I’ll marry you. Otherwise...” She brandished a dagger and radiated with a terrifying aura.","“A Saint Tool!” everyone exclaimed in shock.","F***, who would deliberately hide a Saint Tool at their wedding?","It was clear that she had made up her mind. Even if Ling Han didn’t come, she would still fight Baili Tian to the death.","However, for the sake of Ling Han, she was willing to sacrifice herself.","This!","Everyone shook their heads. Baili Tian was truly being cuckolded.","Furthermore, in full public, and even the Galaxy Network was broadcasting live, everyone in the whole universe could see clearly that Baili Tian’s had lost both his vanity and substance completely.","Even if he really became Emperor in future, that would be a joke that would last for eternity.","—The Great Emperor had been cuckolded? The cuckolded Emperor?","Baili Tian’s expression was dark, and he suddenly exploded, shouting, “Shut up!”","This woman!","She actually dared to humiliate him in public. There was no way he would spare her so easily. However, the first person he had to deal with now was naturally Ling Han.","He actually dared to make trouble at their wedding?","Hehe, you, a trash trapped forever at Sect Master-level, are not going to spend the rest of your life peacefully in some remote corner of the universe, but insist on coming to cause trouble. You are really tired of living.","“Ling Han, your courage impresses me. You actually dare to come here! However, today is also the day of your death!” he said balefully.","Right now... he was already a Half-Saint.","Just like how a Pseudo-Emperor with the word ‘Emperor’ could sweep aside all Saints, his label having the word ‘Saint’ naturally meant he was able to sweep aside all Venerates.","This was the true number one below Saint Tier!","No matter how strong Ling Han was, how could an eternal Sect Master be a match for him?","“Baili Tian!” Chi Menghan chided. She was resolute, and she had already activated her Saint Tool.","At first, she had planned to assassinate Baili Tian.","For a Venerate to use a Saint Tool to assassinate, even a Half-Saint would very likely be killed with a single strike. However, in order to save Ling Han, Chi Menghan naturally couldn’t care less.","This naturally infuriated Baili Tianu even more. However, there was no need for him to stop her. The Saint from the Donglin Imperial Clan naturally moved to restrain Chi Menghan.","“Menghan, stop messing around!” this Saint rebuked. It was precisely the Crystal Saint.","On the other side, Baili Tian was also striding towards Ling Han, his killing intent clear."]},{"number":4596,"title":"Chapter 4596: Ling Han has become a Venerate!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4596: Ling Han has become a Venerate!","“To touch Old Sun’s brother, have you asked the staff in Old Sun’s hand?”","Brother Monkey suddenly jumped out. Boom, the terrifying saintly might surged.","This was not the aura of a Half-Saint, but the true might of a Saint!","Though he had seen Ling Han appear, he was still worried that he would not be able to break through to the fourth pinnacle level. Thus, he naturally had to stand up for Ling Han.","“Monkey, stand aside!”","Boom, the newly advanced Saint of the Ziwei Imperial Clan, Baili Chuixue, also stepped out, his aura locking down on Brother Monkey.","In this way, Brother Monkey had to be prepared to parry an attack. Otherwise, if he was struck by a Saint, it was guaranteed that he would die completely.","Saint-level beings were already standing at the pinnacle of the world, so how could they be underestimated?","Ling Han turned around and smiled at Brother Monkey. “Don’t worry, Brother Monkey. I’m fine!”","With these words, Brother Monkey was naturally relieved.","Things were certain now.","He bared his teeth in a grin, his sharp teeth protruding, filled with violence, “Come, Old Sun will fight you for 300 rounds.”","With a leap, Brother Monkey had already appeared outside Donglin Planet.","The battle between Saints naturally had to be carried out in space. Otherwise, they would be able to destroy a planet in a few moves.","Baili Chuixue naturally wouldn’t back down. He also stepped forward and entered into space.","Boom!","Brilliant light instantly burst into the surroundings. The two Saints were already locked in an intense battle.","Hiss, Brother Monkey had become a Saint!","Everyone was stunned. They all thought that Baili Tian would be the first among the young king tiers to advance into Saint Tier. Though this did not mean that Baili Tian would definitely become Emperor in future, it still had great significance.","However... as it turned out, Brother Monkey was the first Saint of the younger generation.","Everyone couldn’t help but sigh. Naturally, it was another heated discussion.","Baili Tian’s expression became uglier and uglier.","Not only had someone caused trouble at his wedding, but the bride had even betrayed him in public. And now, it was even better. His title as the first Saint had also been removed.","All of a sudden, he was like a failure in life.","The main culprit behind all this was naturally Ling Han.","His eyes were baleful as he gazed at Ling Han, his killing intent boiling.","“You shouldn’t have come,” he said calmly.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Don’t show off. I’m here to pick up my wife, and this has nothing to do with you! However, killing you while I’m at it isn’t impossible.”","“Ha! Ha!” Baili Tian sneered. His expression became darker and darker, so dark that water could drip from it.","This day could be considered the most humiliating day of his life.","However, it didn’t matter. Those who humiliated him were destined to die.","“Ling Han, who gave you the courage?” He moved aggressively, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Instantly, the Regulations took form, turning into a giant hand. It carried the willpower of the heavens, and would definitely not allow disobedience.","A Saint was the manifestation of heaven and earth!","Even if Baili Tian hadn’t truly broken through yet, he already possessed a sliver of such might.","“In any case, it’s not from you.” Ling Han smiled, and flicked out a finger.","Pu!","The Saint’s giant hand was immediately pierced through, and then the Regulations dispersed, one after another. By the time they had reached Ling Han, they no longer had the slightest bit of might.","This... Everyone was numb with shock.","With just a snap of his fingers, the Half-Saint’s attack had disappeared without a trace?","Are you a f****** Saint?","Baili Tian was also shocked. Though this was only a casual move, as a Half-Saint, he could insta-kill a Venerate with a casual strike, so how could it be so easily resolved by a Sect Master?","“Little Han, good job!” the large black dog called out loudly, cheering Ling Han on.","“Snatch the bride! Snatch the bride!” The little azure dragon also shouted from the sidelines. Not only did he shout himself, but he also wanted to get the people around him to shout as well.","But aside from the few of them that were outrageously bold, who else would dare act wantonly in the Imperial Clan?","No one joined in, making the little azure dragon feel very depressed.","“Bunch of cowards!” He shook his head, then released his nine spiritual bodies and shouted at the same time.","‘You can do that?’","Everyone was speechless. As expected, those who were with Ling Han were all unreliable characters.","However, how could Ling Han be so powerful?","That was the attack of a Half-Saint!","Baili Tian frowned, but he immediately delivered another strike. This time, he had naturally increased his power slightly, and this large hand was even more majestic and vast.","Ling Han shook his head and said, “Baili Tian, you’ve truly disappointed me. A hundred years have passed, yet you still haven’t become a Saint!”","Just look at Brother Monkey!","Of course, the reason why Brother Monkey could completely advance into Saint Tier was actually because he could not do so without the help of the seed of Regulations. This was a gift from a Nine-Star Saint. If it was not for the fact that that old Holy Beast was about to die, who would be willing to give it away?","Hence, Brother Monkey had digested these two seeds of Regulations, and added with his own freakish talent, he had also begun to break through to Saint Tier before Baili Tian, so it was only natural that he would completely become a Saint.","However, Baili Tian didn’t know this, so he could only feel gloomy upon hearing this.","Indeed, he was no match for Brother Monkey.","So what?","He controlled this attack to blast towards Ling Han. ‘You are about to become a corpse.’","Ling Han smiled, and waved his hand in a slashing motion. The Regulations turned into a divine light that slashed towards that giant hand.","This divine light was like a supreme Divine Sword, effortlessly splitting the large hand into two.","Baili Tian’s second attack was also declared ineffective.","This time, everyone could no longer remain calm.","The first time, it could be said that Baili Tian had been careless, and had not gotten serious at all, but what about this attack?","Hiss, did Ling Han really have the power to match a Half-Saint?","Wasn’t this guy eternally trapped at Sect Master-level? Why was it that there was no limit to his battle prowess, and he could continue to charge upwards?","Baili Tian, meanwhile, looked stunned. “Fourth Extreme! Fourth Extreme! You actually became a Venerate!”","He could clearly see that Ling Han’s attack clearly contained Seven Star Regulations.","Being able to use the Seven Star Regulations, and not just a sliver, could only mean one thing.","Ling Han had become a Venerate!","What? Hearing these words, everyone was shocked.","How was this possible?","Wasn’t Ling Han eternally trapped at Sect Master-level? How could he become a Venerate?","This guy was envied by the heaven and earth. Heavens, he could even break through the restrictions of the heaven and earth. Then what other barriers in this world could imprison him?","If he did not become Emperor... who else would be worthy?","“How could you possibly break through!” Baili Tian said through gritted teeth.","When Ling Han was still at the Sect Master Tier, he could practically defeat all Venerates. Then, now that he had broken through to the Venerate Tier, what was so strange about him being able to match a Half-Saint?","However, Baili Tian couldn’t figure it out, and couldn’t accept it at all!","This kind of person was envied by the heavens, and was eternally trapped at the level of Sect Master. This would be a happy ending for everyone, so as to avoid affecting the balance. Why had this guy suddenly broken through?","In this way, who would still be able to compete with Ling Han for the throne?","Ling Han spread out his hands and said, “Who told you that I was eternally trapped at Sect Master-level? I was only perfecting the Minor Element Advanced Tier a bit, so I spent a little more time.”","Everyone was speechless. F***, how could there be such a forceful explanation?","The large black dog stood up, raised his hands, and said very sincerely, “It’s Grandpa Dog’s fault, Grandpa Dog’s fault. Everyone has misunderstood. Grandpa Dog hereby apologize to you!”","It pretended to bow.","‘Is this an apology? You’re clearly rubbing it in!’"]},{"number":4597,"title":"Chapter 4597: Battling a Half-Saint","paragraphs":["Chapter 4597: Battling a Half-Saint","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han had become a Venerate!","This news spread like lightning on the Galaxy Network, and soon, almost everyone in the universe knew.","Heavens!","When they found out, everyone’s scalps went numb.","Who was Ling Han?","The number one Sect Master in history, publicly acknowledged as the number one natural talent in cultivation!","As a result, he was envied by the heaven and earth, and eternally trapped at Sect Master-level.","But now?","He broke through the restrictions and advanced into the Venerate Tier.","In fact, he was already capable of standing against a Half-Saint.","Heavens, then when he reached the nine-star Venerate Tier, would even a four-star or five-star Saint be unable to suppress him?","The higher the cultivation level, the more difficult it would be to battle above one’s cultivation level. After all, which of them wasn’t a prodigy among prodigies?","Hence, even if it was the Golden Generation, being able to surpass one star, or two stars of battle prowess at Saint Tier was already an incredibly impressive feat.","But when it came to Ling Han, he was actually capable of standing against a middle level, or even a high level Saint while he himself was only a Venerate... was there still any f****** justice in this world?","This guy had broken through the shackles of heaven and earth. Who could still suppress him?","All the Imperial Sons’ expressions changed drastically, and thankfully, Ding Shu and the others had not come. Otherwise, they would definitely not be able to maintain their composure now.","—In some corner of the universe, they should have also received the news. It was just that Ling Han could not see their reaction.","“How could this be!” Baili Tian gritted his teeth. On one hand, he could not accept this, and on the other, he was filled with fury and regret.","If they had known this earlier, the Imperial Clans would definitely spare no expense to get rid of Ling Han!","That’s right, they had fallen into a trap.","In an instant, the Imperial Clan elites came to their senses. Ling Han’s side had deliberately released a smoke bomb to mislead them into thinking that Ling Han no longer had room for improvement. Thus, they naturally wouldn’t pay any more attention to him.","They would still kill him, but they could not possibly execute it at too great a price.","It was no wonder that they had fallen into his trap. That was because Ling Han’s previous performance was indeed in line with someone who had had his cultivation level restricted. Otherwise, this guy would have long since advanced into the fourth pinnacle level.","Now, Ling Han had already passed the most dangerous period, and his battle prowess was at least at the level of Half-Saint.","What other person or force in the world would dare to say that they could capture Ling Han?","With the word ‘Saint’, wouldn’t it be easy for him to escape?","Don’t forget, Ling Han had grasped the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. That was the Imperial Technique of the True Phoenix, the fastest and strongest movement technique in the world.","It could be said that even Saints may not be able to detain Ling Han.","Unless a Pseudo-Emperor made a move.","The problem was, where would the Imperial Clans get a Pseudo-Emperor from?","Hence, there was no solution to this.","At this time, Ling Han had truly taken hold of his own fate, and no longer needed to be threatened by anyone.","The higher-ups of the Donglin Imperial Clan all exchanged looks, revealing expressions of regret.","As it turned out, Ling Han hadn’t become a cripple!","F***, couldn’t you reveal some information to them?","Otherwise, they wouldn’t have betrothed Chi Menghan to Baili Tian.","As long as they weren’t idiots, they could clearly see who was stronger between Ling Han and Baili Tian.","Regret!","Aside from feeling regret, they naturally blamed Ling Han as well. He actually hid such a big piece of news from them, causing them to make the wrong decision.","In short, the Imperial Clan was definitely not wrong. The one who was wrong was definitely someone else.","Baili Tian took a deep breath to calm himself down.","Since things had already come to this, what was the point of being shocked?","He was a Half-Saint, and with the word ‘Saint’, that represented the strongest battle prowess in the current world.","“Very good, you have broken through. If I kill you now, it can make you feel even more hopeless,” he said balefully.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Please continue your performance.”","“Die!” Baili Tian roared as he unleashed his Saint Tool. With a slash, it was as if the heavens were about to be split into two.","Everyone was shocked. F***, a battle of Saint-level power was actually happening on a planet?","Wasn’t he afraid that innocents would be implicated?","The Crystal Saint hurriedly moved. At this time, only he could clean up the mess.","Ling Han leaped into the air. Peng!","He wasn’t thinking for the sake of the Donglin Imperial Clan. Rather, there were far too many innocent people here.","“Die!” Baili Tian gave chase. He brandished the saintly saber, and shua, shua, shua, the saber illuminated the skies.","With his current cultivation level as a Half-Saint, no matter what, he would be able to activate 30-40% of the might of this Saint Tool.","Was that still not enough?","Shua, saber light slashed out in waves, like a world-destroying God Tool.","Ling Han was filled with heroic spirit. He wanted to see just how strong his battle prowess was.","“Come!” he roared loudly, Seven Star Regulations entwined around his fists, and he took the initiative to parry the saber light.","Crazy, this was crazy!","Everyone exclaimed in shock. That was a Saint Tool, so the attack it delivered was naturally Saint-level as well, and no matter how strong Ling Han was, he was still only a Venerate, after all. How could he possibly match Saint Tier?","Fighting head-on... was he seeking death?","‘You’re far too confident.’","Peng!","Ling Han threw a punch, and a flash of saber light was instantly extinguished. As for him... he was completely unscathed.","‘Holy motherf*cker!’","Everyone was numb with shock, their eyes almost popping out of their heads.","‘He’s blocked it?!’","Ling Han had actually blocked the attack of a Saint Tool!","That was a genuine Saint-level attack.","Heavens!","A great many people were grabbing their heads, completely unable to believe this.","He was freakishly strong.","Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng!","Ling Han shot out punches continuously, destroying the saber light that was attacking him one after another. Furthermore, he was not just defending, but was also charging towards Baili Tian.","Defense has never been his habit.","Like a hot knife through butter, he aggressively advanced.","Everyone was rendered speechless. They could only feel admiration for Ling Han’s freakish strength.","He was actually able to contend against a Saint Tool with just his bare fists. How was his strength, as compared to Baili Tian?","He was clearly stronger.","Baili Tian gritted his teeth, feeling extremely humiliated.","On the day of the wedding, it was not enough if someone caused trouble, the bride betrayed him, and in fact, he was still unable to deal with this troublemaker.","How could he endure this?","What face would the number one elite of the Golden Generation have?","He roared loudly, and the Saintly bone in his body wasstimulated, continuously pouring Saintly Particles into him, increasing his battle prowess.","Instantly, his battle prowess rose to another level, truly reaching Saint Tier.","However, it was useless.","That was because Ling Han’s battle prowess was Saint Tier in the first place. So what if you have reached Saint Tier? At most, you would only be able to match him.","However, would he be able to resist?","Ling Han used all 20 Seven Star Regulations, intertwining them into pieces, allowing him to reach the level of being able to match two Eight Star Regulations.","As for Baili Tian?","He was only a Half-Saint, and he could only use a sliver of Eight Star Regulations. Even if he used the power of his Saintly bone, that would only reach the extent of a single sliver of Eight Star Regulations.","How could a single Eight Star Regulation be able to resist two Eight Star Regulations? Though Ling Han’s “two” Eight Star Regulations had been accumulated by Seven Star Regulations.","Boom!","The two of them exchanged blows. In terms of power, Baili Tian had the upper hand, but in terms of Regulations, he was too far behind.","However, at this level, power was becoming less and less important in terms of battle prowess, and Regulations was the true power!","Ling Han had the advantage in Regulations, so he naturally had the advantage in battle prowess.","Thus, everyone saw an interesting scene.","Ling Han was sent flying back and forth, and more and more wounds appeared on Baili Tian’s body."]},{"number":4598,"title":"Chapter 4598: Baili Tian was defeated","paragraphs":["Chapter 4598: Baili Tian was defeated","Baili Tian... was going to lose.","Anyone could see this clearly. Baili Tian had the advantage in power, but he was completely unable to wound Ling Han. Furthermore, he was too far behind in terms of Regulations. Every time they exchanged blows, he would only be adding another wound to himself.","At this rate, a minor injury would become a major injury, and a major injury would become a serious injury.","Furthermore, what was even more frightening?","Ling Han still hadn’t activated Destructive Energy!","By now, everyone knew that Ling Han had grasped a terrifying high-level energy, and its destructive power was extremely strong.","If he used this move again, would Baili Tian immediately be defeated?","The strongest member of the Golden Generation was actually going to end up in such a miserable state?","Baili Tian roared loudly, and continuously shot out Imperial Techniques.","After reaching the level of Half-Saint, the Imperial Techniques could be used almost endlessly, and its might was also terrifyingly great. However, in front of Ling Han, this was still completely ineffective.","“You can’t even withstand a single blow!” Ling Han shook his head, and with a sweep of his palm, Regulations turned into a flash of sword light that slashed out towards Baili Tian.","Baili Tian couldn’t dodge this strike, and his chest was instantly struck, causing his body to fall.","He was severely wounded.","Ling Han was just about to follow up with another attack, when he saw Baili Chuixue quickly rush over and grab hold of Baili Tian.","This newly advanced Saint looked at Ling Han coldly, as if he wanted to see through him.","Behind him, Brother Monkey had already caught up to him. However, he did not make a move. Instead, he retracted his staff and placed it on his shoulder, showing how unreasonable and domineering he was.","“You—” Baili Chuixue showed a hint of confusion, “I seem to have seen you somewhere!”","Tsk, this was the sensing ability of a Saint.","He had indeed “seen” Ling Han before. That was in the Medicinal Garden of the Ziwei Imperial Clan. However, at the time, he had only sensed a sliver of Ling Han’s aura, and had not personally seen him. Now, the feeling of familiarity that he had was also Ling Han’s aura.","“That’s right. That day, you entered our clan to steal!” Baili Chuixue also came to his senses. He revealed a baleful killing intent, “How dare you come to our clan to steal. Today, this Saint will take your wretched dog’s life.”","The large black dog felt a pain in his chest. He had been innocently attacked.","“Haha!” The little azure dragon laughed loudly.","“Old geezer, your opponent is Grandpa Sun!” Brother Monkey waved his staff, fighting spirit soaring sky-high.","Ling Han stopped him, and said, “Brother Monkey, let me give it a try.”","He wanted to spar with a true Saint. Baili Tian was really too weak.","“Alright.” Brother Monkey nodded and put away the staff.","A look of fury spread across Baili Chuixue’s face. He was a Saint, yet he was still being challenged by others?","This was a great disrespect!","“A mere Fourth Extreme!” Baili Chuixue smirked coldly, then stretched out a hand and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","Boom! A giant hand that was as large as a planet appeared, with Eight Star Regulations entwined around it. There were a total of... two!","Ling Han was unafraid, and shot out a punch.","Peng!","The fist landed on the giant hand, and the giant hand instantly crumbled. However, the fist also lost its might. It only blasted out for a short distance before crumbling.","It was a tie.","Hiss, on the Donglin Planet, those who could see all inhaled sharply, and there would always be busybodies who deliberately came into space as well. They activated their connecting devices and continued to broadcast live on the Galaxy Network.","Heavens, it was actually a tie.","Everyone was numb with shock. It should be known that this was not a Half-Saint like Baili Tian, but a real Saint.","However, Ling Han was still not inferior.","This was practically... enough to blow up the heavens.","However, the power of Saints was far too powerful. After being struck by the shockwaves, Ling Han was still sent flying hundreds of kilometers away. However, how could pure power wound him?","This wasn’t a crushing factor.","“This guy!”","“He has just broken through to Venerate Tier, and already possesses the battle prowess of a One Star Saint!”","“This is nature-defying!”","“The number one Venerate in history!”","Everyone sighed ruefully. Though Ling Han was only a One Star Venerate, he had definitely reserved the title of the strongest Venerate in history in advance.","Just ask, who could compare?","Baili Tian, who had been tossed aside by Baili Chuixue, could only sigh in admiration at this moment.","How could he compare to such battle prowess?","With the help of the Saint Tool, he could just barely match Ling Han. In terms of true battle prowess, he was far inferior to Ling Han.","However, Ling Han was only a One Star Venerate!","With such a comparison, he really did not have the slightest excuse.","The gap between them was huge, and not just by a little bit.","His hands were tightly clenched into fists, his heart filled with fury and defiance.","—At his wedding, Ling Han had forcefully appeared, and snatched away all his glory.","His newlywed wife, the glorious title of the strongest prodigy, was all gone.","All of this was because of Ling Han, which caused him to fall from the peak of his life to rock bottom all of a sudden.","No, he definitely could not accept this.","He was Baili Tian, the strongest Golden Generation. He would definitely become Emperor!","He stared fixedly at Ling Han, and a terrifying aura was spreading out from his body.","He wanted to become a true Saint as soon as possible. Then, he would battle Ling Han again and kill this opponent.","Only in this way would he be able to regain his lost confidence and pride.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han and Baili Chuixue were currently engaged in an intense battle. The two of them were equal in terms of Regulations, but in terms of power, Baili Chuixue naturally had the upper hand, and was suppressing Ling Han. However, this did not bring him any advantage.","It could only be said that Baili Chuixue was slightly on the upper hand now.","However, Ling Han still had many powerful moves that he had yet to use.","Let’s give it a try.","Ling Han shouted loudly, “Come!”","Boom, he waved his hand at Donglin Planet below, and a streak of Earth Qi immediately shot into the sky, turning into a human figure that stood beside him.","A smile appeared on his face. When he had been at the level of Sect Master, he had not been able to extract Earth Qi from such a far distance, but after advancing into Venerate Tier, he was finally able to do so.","“Humph, a mere Venerate Tier-level Earth Qi manifestation!” Baili Chuixue said disdainfully.","He had really underestimated him too much. Was Ling Han deluding himself into thinking that he could use this to stop him, or defeat him?","However, he had not even finished his words, when he saw Ling Han wave his hand again. Another streak of Earth Qi shot out, and took human form. Then, it was the third streak, the fourth streak, the fifth streak... it was increasing at an astonishing rate.","F***!","Baili Chuixue was dumbfounded. He naturally didn’t care about one Venerate, but how many were there now?","99!","Moreover, he was certain that every Earth Qi manifestation was at the level of Nine Star Venerate Tier. Although he would definitely be able to insta-kill them in a one-on-one battle, if so many of them attacked at the same time, even he would frown.","After all, he was only a One Star Saint.","And most importantly?","This was Earth Qi. Whether they were injured or killed, what was the loss? It was good as long as they could exhaust a little of his energy.","“Haha, come fight me!” Ling Han charged over, and the 99 Earth Qi doppelgangers also followed. Each of them had the battle prowess of the fourth pinnacle level.","In this way, Baili Chuixue also felt a headache coming on.","Merely Ling Han alone was more or less capable of fighting him to a tie, what more when there were 99 top tier Venerates assisting him?","That’s right. Those below Saint Tier were all ants, but it could not be helped that there were really too many ants here. Hadn’t they heard of the saying that an abundance of ants could bite an elephant to death?","“Damn it!” Baili Chuixue cursed softly, and had no choice but to use a powerful move.","Boom, a holy flame rose up!"]},{"number":4599,"title":"Chapter 4599: Four Extremes Support the Skies","paragraphs":["Chapter 4599: Four Extremes Support the Skies","The holy flame was the foundation of a Saint, and it was also the most powerful weapon of a Saint.","However, the holy flame was usually stored in one’s mind, and was used to illuminate Regulations. Once it was used, its might would be great, but it also had a fatal disadvantage, and that was it would cause the holy flame to be exhausted.","Thus, unless they encountered a powerful opponent, what Saint would be willing to use the holy flame?","Now that Baili Chuixue had used the holy flame, it was clear just how far Ling Han had forced him to!","It couldn’t be helped. If news spread that even a Saint was unable to deal with a Venerate head-on, he would definitely become the most cowardly Saint in history, and go down in the annals of history—of course, it would be a negative image.","Boom, his holy flame was only the size of a pinky. It was blazing white in colour, and was clearly like a dying candle in the wind, as if it would be extinguished at the slightest blow, yet gave off an incredibly terrifying pressure.","In essence, the holy flame was actually not a real flame, but rather a manifestation of energy and Regulations.","Thus, this holy flame didn’t exude any heat at all. Instead, it was ice-cold and baleful.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He was still unafraid, and continued to charge over with the 99 Earth Qi clones.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","After summoning the holy flame, Baili Chuixue’s destructive power increased exponentially. A sliver of his might could destroy a single Earth Qi embodiment. However, there were really too many embodiments of Earth Qi.","If you destroyed one, so be it. With a single thought, Ling Han could summon a new one.","This made Baili Chuixue too sullen.","He only had invincible battle prowess, but he couldn’t hit the main target at all. How could he not become more and more anxious as the battle progressed?","It should be known that every time the holy flame was used, a little bit would be used up. Though it was enough to support him in battle for a few years, how could he endure the fact that he had to expend the holy flame when he had just advanced into Saint Tier?","He was stuck in a dilemma. On the one hand, for the sake of his pride, he definitely had to kill Ling Han. At the very least, he had to defeat this opponent, but on the other hand, he did not want to expend too much of the holy flame. This was naturally a contradiction.","Everyone saw Baili Chuixue’s expression, and they all sighed in their hearts.","As a Saint, he had actually been forced into such an awkward situation.","Who else could do that in this world?","Only Ling Han could!","Ling Han could no longer be regarded as a Venerate. This was a Saint. Cultivation level was not applicable to him, and only his strength could be the main consideration.","With this in mind, it was understandable that Baili Chuixue couldn’t defeat Ling Han.","However, Baili Chuixue didn’t think so. He didn’t want to become Ling Han’s stepping stone.","Oh, you will go down in history with a single battle, and become the greatest glory of all eternity, while I will become a pitiful footnote?","No way!","Baili Chuixue shouted loudly, and the Regulations transformed into a long river that shot towards Ling Han.","However, the 99 Earth Qi manifestations could all act as Ling Han’s human shields. In any case, they were all top-notch Venerates, so if one of them couldn’t block a single strike from a Saint, then what about two or even ten?","No matter what Baili Chuixue did, he couldn’t suppress Ling Han at all.","Ling Han laughed loudly. Destructive Energy channelled, and he was also getting serious.","‘Come!’","He charged over, and the Destructive Energy surged around him. Whatever Regulations attacked the Destructive Energy would be melted.","After advancing into the Venerate Tier, the destructive power of Destructive Energy was further unleashed, becoming even more terrifying.","How could Ling Han block such an attack?","Baili Chuixue refused to give up, and clashed head-on with Ling Han.","Peng, though Ling Han was sent flying, a wound had also been left on Baili Chuixue’s hand, and it was still continuously widening.","Baili Chuixue channeled the power of Saint Tier, yet he couldn’t control his injury at all. He could only cut his losses and directly sever this wounded hand. Only then did his injury stop spreading.","He couldn’t help but feel shocked. How could there be such a terrifying high-level energy?","That kind of destructive power was completely unreasonable. His saintly power was completely ineffective against this kind of high-level energy.","This was too terrifying.","“The holy flame illuminates the world and freezes it!” Baili Chuixue shouted loudly. As the holy flame flickered, endless coldness spread out, and the already cold space instantly became even colder.","This was the might of the holy flame.","Ling Han felt as if his body had become stiff, and his blood had congealed. He couldn’t move a single muscle.","“Humph, this is the true ability of a Saint!” Baili Chuixue said balefully.","So what if you are even stronger than this?","This was the suppression of Regulations.","Ling Han could summon the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and he could also use the Destructive Energy to engulf this coldness. However, with a thought, four pillars of extreme power suddenly materialized around him.","Weng, on the extreme pillars, every seal lit up.","The chill instantly disappeared, and Ling Han regained his mobility.","“What!” Baili Chuixue almost threw up blood. It should be known that unleashing this move had caused him to expend an extremely large amount of the holy flame, yet it was actually easily resolved by Ling Han. This naturally made him extremely depressed.","However, the Four Extremes were actually capable of dispersing the might of the holy flame?","Wasn’t this a joke?","It should be known that this was a suppression of a whole level.","“That’s Ling Han’s Four Extremes!”","“Yi, why do they seem to be four stone pillars?”","“That’s right. Shouldn’t the Four Extremes be formed from Regulations? They should look like multiple pillars of light, though the color would be slightly different.”","“I’ve heard that some Celestial medicines can improve the quality of the Four Extremes, and bestow some special Mystical Powers on the Four Extremes. However, such pillars of Fourth Extreme are completely unheard of.”","“They look very ordinary, like four stone pillars, but why do they have an indescribably ancient aura?”","“Also, also, what do those four seals mean?”","“That’s right. There should be circles on the four pinnacle pillars, and the number of circles reflect the number of stars of Venerate Tier. What does this seal mean?”","“Could it be that his seals are equivalent to the circles of other Venerates?”","Everyone cried out one after another. Ling Han was indeed different from the rest. No wonder this guy was so freakish.","Meanwhile, Ling Han’s eyes were slightly closed, and he was currently experiencing it.","The Four Extremes spread out, forming an area that he had absolute control over.","Thus, so what if the might of the holy flame was powerful? It could not affect him at all!","This was too shocking. The Mystical Power formed by a Venerate was actually capable of standing against a Saint!","“Come fight me again!” Ling Han laughed loudly, and charged towards Baili Chuixue.","He tried to expand the Fourth Extreme to a greater extent, but he immediately reached his limit.","—It could only open up a space of thirty meters square.","There was nothing he could do about this. After all, he was facing a Saint. This was a suppression from a superior level.","This was enough.","Ling Han threw a flurry of punches. Without the threat of the holy flame, what did he have to fear from Baili Chuixue?","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Baili Chuixue clashed with Ling Han, but he couldn’t suppress Ling Han at all. Instead, he would be injured by Destructive Energy.","The longer they fought, the more serious his injuries became.","Saints could indeed regrow severed limbs, but did they not need to pay a price for doing so?","After so many times, even a Saint couldn’t bear it any longer.","“Ah!” This new Saint released a great roar towards the sky, and no longer hesitated. He stretched out a hand, and grabbed Baili Tian and the members of the Ziwei Imperial Clan. He tore a rip into space and left.","Since he was no match, he could only flee.","Ling Han didn’t give chase. He was only slightly stronger than Baili Chuixue, and didn’t have a crushing advantage.","Moreover, the Ziwei Imperial Clan wouldn’t disappear!"]},{"number":4600,"title":"Chapter 4600: Snatching the bride","paragraphs":["Chapter 4600: Snatching the bride","Ling Han stood proudly in space.","Beneath him, everyone could only look up at him.","At this moment, even a Saint would be moved and impressed.","As a Venerate, he had scared off a Saint!","Just ask the world, was there a second person that could do it?","There was definitely none.","This was unprecedented, and it was also possible that it would never happen again!","“Hahaha, come down and take a seat!” The Crystal Saint, laughed loudly, and waved his hand at Ling Han.","Ling Han and Brother Monkey both flew down, and stood beside the Crystal Saint.","They already had Saint-level battle prowess, so even though there were still differences in strength among Saints, it no longer affected their standing on the same level.","Without becoming a Saint, he would still be an ant in the end. Now, both Ling Han and Brother Monkey were qualified to stand above all life.","The Crystal Saint sighed internally. When they had first met, Ling Han hadn’t even been worthy of a second glance from him. However, only a few hundred years had passed, and Ling Han was already standing on the same level as him.","And it should be known that Ling Han was only a Venerate!","Was it easier for Venerates to advance by one star, or was it easier for Saints to advance by one star?","Of course, it was the former.","Thus, it was possible that before he had even advanced into five stars, Ling Han would already be a nine-star Venerate.","With how freakish Ling Han was, he would probably be able to compete with Four-Star or Five-Star Saints by then.","This was practically a legend.","The others were also rendered speechless. A great many female cultivators were so excited that they wanted to throw themselves into Ling Han’s arms.","At that time, Ling Han had said that he would personally come to the Donglin Imperial Clan to pick Chi Menghan up. At that time, most people had thought that this was a joke, an arrogant boast that came from overestimation of himself.","What right do you have?","Being eternally trapped at Sect Master-level, he was already a “cripple”, and even if Ling Han could advance into the Venerate Tier, with the wealth of the Donglin and Ziwei Imperial Clans, how could they allow Ling Han to act wantonly?","Unexpectedly, Ling Han managed to do so.","What woman wouldn’t be moved by such a heroic and affectionate person?","“Friends, please come to the ancestral grounds for a chat.” The Crystal Saint invited them earnestly. There were really too many outsiders here, so it was not appropriate for them to speak in too much detail.","Ling Han smiled, shook his head and said, “I just broke through, and still have a lot of matters to attend to, so it’s best that I don’t go in. Whatever Friend Crystal has to say, just say it.”","Friend Crystal!","This caused everyone’s hearts to tremble when they heard this. This was an address from an equal.","Even though they already knew that Ling Han possessed the battle prowess of a Saint, they still found it difficult to accept the fact that they had witnessed him chatting and laughing with a Saint with their own eyes.","Ling Han naturally refused. What a joke. If one wanted to enter into the ancestral grounds of the Donglin Imperial Clan, they would definitely have to enter into the Great Emperor Formation, and if they entered into the Great Emperor Formation, wouldn’t they still be on the chopping block?","Asking Ling Han to trust the Imperial Clan?","Hehe, he would rather believe that a sow would climb a tree!","In the eyes of the Imperial Clan, there was only profit.","Previously, he had been “crippled”, so the Donglin Imperial Clan had chosen Baili Tian without hesitation. When had they ever asked for his opinion and informed him? It was the same now. Seeing him rise up aggressively, they kicked Baili Tian aside again.","His fate naturally had to be grasped in his own hands.","Ling Han may one day enter into the ancestral grounds of the Donglin Imperial Clan, but at that time, he had to be able to stand against the Great Emperor formation.","He wasn’t a hot-blooded young man who would be easily provoked.","Meanwhile, Brother Monkey didn’t say anything. He wasn’t good at this, but if it was a fight, he would pick up his staff and fight.","“Hehe.” The Crystal Saint didn’t say anything else. After chatting for a while, he turned the topic of conversation to Chi Menghan.","“Friend Ling, after what you’ve done today, how will Menghan be able to face others in the future?” There was grief on his face, and he continued, “You have to bear this responsibility.”","Ling Han smiled, “No problem.”","The Crystal Saint nodded in satisfaction, and said, “Menghan is the most outstanding successor of our Donglin Imperial Clan. To have her marry out of the clan, I’m also reluctant. Thus, Friend Ling’s betrothal gift must be extremely sincere.”","F***, you are really realistic.","Ling Han asked, “What betrothal gift does the Donglin Imperial Clan want?”","The Crystal Saint made an exorbitant demand, saying, “First, an Imperial Scroll.”","He explained, “If Menghan marries you, it would be equivalent to marrying the Imperial Scroll of our Clan. Of course, you would have to bring out the corresponding amount.”","“Secondly, three Imperial Techniques, Technique, of which one must be Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.”","“Thirdly, the Spirit Diagram of the black high-level energy that you have grasped needs to be handed over to us.”","The Crystal Saint t made three requests, and this was still the majority. There were innumerable other requests like Celestial medicines and Saintly Material.","“Friend Ling, what do you think?”","Ling Han pondered for a moment, before saying, “I have a better betrothal gift.”","“Oh, what?” The Crystal Saint was slightly surprised. There was actually something more valuable than this?","Ling Han smiled and said, “I’ll gift you a son of a Great Emperor!”","The Crystal Saint faltered for a moment before flushing.","‘F*ck! You b*stard! You’re so stingy, yet you want to make Donglin Imperial Clan’s daughter pregnant?’","“Friend Ling, you’ve gone too far!” he said in displeasure.","Ling Han didn’t pay any more attention to the Crystal Saint. Instead, he looked at Chi Menghan and said, “I already said that I want to take you away from the Donglin Imperial Clan. However, I still haven’t asked you whether you’re willing or not.”","Chi Menghan immediately nodded, “I am!”","“All right, then I’ll continue to snatch the bride!” Ling Han laughed loudly, and charged out, rapidly rushing towards Chi Menghan.","“Brat, you dare?!” The Crystal Saint’s face instantly twisted in anger. This brat was far too audacious! He actually dared to snatch the bride right in front of him!","However, he had just moved, when he saw that Brother Monkey had already smashed his staff towards him.","They were both Saints, so the Crystal Saint didn’t dare to let his guard down.","He could only parry.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The two of them battled fiercely. Brother Monkey was only a One Star Saint. Even if his natural talent was astonishing, that would only be comparable to the battle prowess of a Two Star Saint, at most. However, the Crystal Saint was a Four Star Saint, and the gulf between them was not just a little bit.","It wasn’t long before Brother Monkey fell into a disadvantage. However, this was the Donglin Planet, so the Crystal Saint naturally had to be careful when he attacked. Thus, he couldn’t do anything to Brother Monkey at this moment.","Ling Han had already reached Chi Menghan. With another wave of his hand, he grabbed the large black dog and little azure dragon as well.","“Brother Monkey, let’s go.”","He tore a rip into space, and directly left.","Brother Monkey bared his teeth in a grin. With a wave of his staff, he too left.","If a Saint wanted to flee, there was practically no one in this world that could stop him, even if it was a one-star Saint against a nine-star Saint.","Thus, Saints enjoyed a transcendent status. No force would be willing to offend a Saint. After all, they couldn’t kill him and if they had to eep an eye on him all day long, any force would feel a headache coming on.","The Crystal Saint didn’t give chase. Instead, he used his divine sense to transmit a message, saying, “Ancestor Ming, why don’t you let me unleash my full strength? Moreover, if you attack, none of them will be able to escape!”","The so-called Ancestor Ming was another Saint of the Donglin Imperial Clan. He was also a true pillar of support.","A Nine-Star Saint, Chi Taiming.","Chi Taiming’s divine sense transmitted a message intohis mind, and said, “Heh, this brat is loyal and faithful. As long as Chi Menghan follows him, he’ll be inextricably linked to our clan.”"]}]);
